	('9bc65bb4-f139-4c4e-9940-b47b82bc598a',3,1442,'CORE - Cleveland, GA, US | Phil Gable',NULL,'weekly','','GA',NULL,'Cleveland','','US',-81.6943610,41.4993200,'Georgia',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:44',0,'men','2024-11-14 15:20:44','2024-11-17 15:20:44',NULL,'',32026,435057,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9798\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Cleveland\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"GA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"41.499320\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-81.694361\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Georgia\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/core-cleveland-ga-us-phil-gable-0',NULL,'2024-02-26 10:02:24','2024-04-10 15:20:44'),
	('9bc65bb5-0fab-4ce4-9cc5-db7e3d878664',2,1443,'WAH BASIC - Rockbridge, OH, US | Joshua Meyer',NULL,'weekly','20584 Buena Vista Rd','OH',NULL,'Rockbridge','43149','US',-82.6459330,39.5529510,'Ohio',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:44',0,'men','2024-11-07 15:20:44','2024-11-10 15:20:44',NULL,'',32063,397518,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9840\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"20584 Buena Vista Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Rockbridge\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"OH\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"43149\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"39.552951\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-82.645933\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Ohio\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-rockbridge-oh-us-joshua-meyer-2',NULL,'2024-03-10 12:03:42','2024-04-10 15:20:44'),
	('9bc65bb5-2b22-4cb0-bf74-6cb91a8c793b',2,1444,'WAH BASIC - Gaston, SC, US | Ray Schmidt',NULL,'weekly','','SC',NULL,'Gaston','29053','US',-81.1009290,33.8170970,'South Carolina',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:44',0,'men','2024-10-31 15:20:44','2024-11-03 15:20:44',NULL,'\"If then you are wise, you will show yourself rather as a reservoir than as a canal. A canal spreads abroad water as it receives it, but a reservoir waits until it is filled before overflowing, and thus without loss to itself [it shares] its superabundant water.\" - Bernard of Clairvaux Most of us spend the majority of our time working. Working to provide for our wives and families. Working to serve our churches. Working in our community. Working, working, working until we are burned out to a crackling crunch. Dry and parched in a land that just keeps demanding more. Are you thirsty? Could you use some refreshment? A double shot caramel mocha latte? Or maybe what you really need is just a deep draught of living water? If you are caring for others out of what is flowing through you instead of out of the overflow of God within you, BASIC is an opportunity for you to join other men and unplug from “The Matrix.” An opportunity for you to reconnect with God in the context of the most essential component of your identity … who you are as a man. BASIC is the Wild at Heart Boot Camp led by John Eldredge and his team via video followed by times alone with God by the lake or in the woods. There is also time set aside for you to fish, canoe, kayak, hike, or just chill. Whatever your heart needs. This is not a retreat about the “Seven things you ought to do to be a better man.” This event is a unique opportunity to begin a quest to recover your masculine soul, to reengage your passion, and remember who God called you to be. First as a man. Second as a husband and father. Third in the service of others.',31694,16584,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9399\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Gaston\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"SC\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"29053\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"33.817097\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-81.100929\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"South Carolina\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-gaston-sc-us-ray-schmidt',NULL,'2023-11-11 10:11:45','2024-04-10 15:20:44'),
	('9bc65bb5-46b8-4c85-a8fb-de4eeb8d1713',3,1445,'CORE - Canadensis, PA, US | Michelle Toburen',NULL,'weekly','Spruce Lake Retreat Center','PA',NULL,'Canadensis','18325','US',-75.2696300,41.2249680,'Pennsylvania',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:44',0,'men','2024-10-31 15:20:44','2024-11-03 15:20:44',NULL,'',31872,470908,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9613\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"Spruce Lake Retreat Center\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"5389 Route 447\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Canadensis\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"PA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"18325\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"41.224968\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-75.269630\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Pennsylvania\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/core-canadensis-pa-us-michelle-toburen',NULL,'2024-01-11 05:01:53','2024-04-10 15:20:44'),
	('9bc65bb5-627a-481a-87c6-2e5022e82bdb',2,1446,'WAH BASIC - Manson, IA, US | Doug Beer',NULL,'weekly','7718 Twin Lakes Road','IA',NULL,'Manson','50563','US',-94.6366810,42.4849320,'Iowa',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:44',0,'men','2024-10-31 15:20:44','2024-11-03 15:20:44',NULL,'We are so excited that you are considering joining us! We want you to know that in addition to the WAH Basic Course itself, there will be ample time for prayer, worship, introspection, fellowship, and a lot of fun! \r\n\r\nHere is some general info about this particular Basic: \r\nSleeping arrangements are 3-4 guys per room with private bathrooms and showers. Bed Linens are provided, however even in a climate controlled space, you might consider bringing a Pillow, Sleeping bag, or Extra Blanket to insure your comfort. Meals, snacks, and bottled water will be provided and we will try to accommodate all dietary restrictions to whatever extent possible. Activities will include some scheduled (but not required) and some generally available during breaks and free-time. With some being outdoor, indoor, physically demanding, etc. its a good idea to bring appropriate clothing, considering the time of year and weather. \r\n\r\nI want you to know that the goal in offering this WAH Basic in Iowa is to make it available and inviting to every man interested in and open to (re)discovering the Heart that was uniquely designed for him by our Creator. So with that in mind, if there is anything about this particular offering that seems prohibitive or discouraging to your attendance, please reach out and let me know how I can help. \r\n\r\n- Doug\r\n\r\nWhen you are ready please sign up using the link below:\r\n\r\nhttps://docs.google.com/forms/d/1vi5aQIQRJYnrrgRDo-g8rmAx_WfnYLv-l7BAzPnOS5I/edit',32010,462616,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9779\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"7718 Twin Lakes Road\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Manson\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"IA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"50563\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"42.484932\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-94.636681\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Iowa\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-manson-ia-us-doug-beer-0',NULL,'2024-02-23 09:02:27','2024-04-10 15:20:44'),
	('9bc65bb5-7f01-4da0-ae9f-b3541dae44b5',4,45,'BECOMING A KING RETREAT- Colchester , ESS, GB | Paul Boulton',NULL,'weekly','Vauxhall Farm',NULL,NULL,'Colchester ','CO7 6FJ','GB',0.8918740,51.8959270,'Essex',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:44',0,'men','2024-10-24 15:20:44','2024-10-27 15:20:44',NULL,'Cost is £125 - which includes all food, accommodation and course materials.\r\n(Should finance be a preventing issue please get in touch as we would like to enable as many men as possible to engage)\r\n\r\nAll dietary requirements can be catered for.\r\nParticipants will need to bring bedding and a towel.\r\nThere is a outdoor swimming pool, and games room available on site, plus country walks near by. Please bring suitable clothing for walking/recreation/swimming if desired!\r\n\r\nPlease just drop a note to p.j.t.boulton@gmail.com if you have any questions.',32069,408125,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9845\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"Vauxhall Farm\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"Great Wenham\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Colchester \\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"ESS\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"CO7 6FJ\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"gb\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"51.895927\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"0.891874\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Essex\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United Kingdom\\\"}\"','/becoming-king-retreat-colchester-ess-gb-paul-boulton-0',NULL,'2024-03-12 01:03:34','2024-04-10 15:20:44'),
	('9bc65bb5-9c2d-4751-98fb-b68490476126',3,1447,'CORE - Lowesville, VA, US | Cheryl Haymes',NULL,'weekly','2247 Little Piney Rd','VA',NULL,'Lowesville','22967','US',-79.1381160,37.7660720,'Virginia',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:44',0,'men','2024-10-17 15:20:44','2024-10-20 15:20:44',NULL,'Captivating Core is held in the beautiful mountains of Virginia. Dress is casual and you will have time during the day to walk along the creek, sit on the porch, or hike up the mountain to enjoy the glory of God’s handiwork.',31919,463196,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9673\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"2247 Little Piney Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Lowesville\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"VA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"22967\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"37.766072\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-79.138116\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Virginia\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/core-lowesville-va-us-cheryl-haymes-3',NULL,'2024-01-26 05:01:24','2024-04-10 15:20:44'),
