	('9bc65bb8-ef13-48c8-aab2-6bbaacbcf118',2,1463,'WAH BASIC - Summersville, WV, US | Nathan Palmer',NULL,'weekly','162 Old Vinton Farm Rd,','WV',NULL,'Summersville','26651','US',-80.9730430,38.2371730,'West Virginia',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:46',0,'men','2024-05-30 15:20:46','2024-06-02 15:20:46',NULL,'This Wild at Heart Basic will take place at Wild Ridge Young Life camp in New River Gorge National Park,  May 30th - June 2nd, 2024. The newly constructed lodge is located 25mins west of Summersville, WV, and sits on top of cliffs that overlook the Gauley River. The weekend will begin with dinner at 6 p.m. on Thursday evening and end around 1 p.m. on Sunday afternoon. The cost of the weekend ($295) includes lodging and food; however, you also have the opportunity to join a 1/2 day whitewater rafting adventure on the New River. This part of the retreat is optional, costs an additional $95, and must be registered for separately (details will be provided after registering for the retreat).',32086,398845,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9866\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"162 Old Vinton Farm Rd,\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Summersville\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"WV\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"26651\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"38.237173\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-80.973043\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"West Virginia\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-summersville-wv-us-nathan-palmer',NULL,'2024-03-17 01:03:38','2024-04-10 15:20:46'),
