	('9bc65bba-8038-4869-9691-22f8e4a4ce6b',3,1473,'CORE - Effie, MN, US | Amy Johnson',NULL,'weekly','65328 Co Rd 235','MN',NULL,'Effie','56639','US',-93.5290540,47.8314650,'Minnesota',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:47',0,'men','2024-05-09 15:20:47','2024-05-12 15:20:47',NULL,'What to Expect:\r\nThere will be several sessions each day, along with self-reflection questions for your personal time. There are no assigned group discussions throughout the weekend as this time is meant to be between you and Jesus! \r\nTo allow the opportunity for self-reflection, there will be several designated time periods of mandatory silence.\r\nThe weekend will have periods of free time for adventure, refreshment, camaraderie, or whatever your soul needs. (Hiking the property\'s beautiful trails, canoeing/kayaking the river, sauna, arts/crafts,  games.) Feel free to bring anything else that you may want.\r\nThis event is designed to be experienced off-grid and is strongly encouraged that you unplug from phones.',32128,432639,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9906\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"65328 Co Rd 235\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Effie\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MN\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"56639\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"47.831465\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-93.529054\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Minnesota\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/core-effie-mn-us-amy-johnson',NULL,'2024-03-29 09:03:17','2024-04-10 15:20:47'),
	('9bc65bba-9ddd-4c33-aded-ca7a0f895226',3,1474,'CORE - George, IA, US | Wanda Van Otterloo',NULL,'weekly','2445 Jackson Ave','IA',NULL,'George','51237','US',-96.0597670,43.2979240,'Iowa',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:47',0,'men','2024-05-09 15:20:47','2024-05-12 15:20:47',NULL,'This event will take place in rural Iowa on our small farm. There is a lot of open spaces to go for a hike, to watch the stars and to just slow down. Take along comfortable walking shoes and your swimsuit. There is a hot tub you can also enjoy! A fire pit to sit by and a hammock to relax in! All of the meals, towels and bedding will be supplied. Depending on the amount of attendees, you will have your own room to sleep in , but have to share a bathroom. The cost for this event is $185.00/person, which includes the  $50.00 deposit to hold your spot.  The nearest airport is Sioux Falls SD. , less than an hour away. Any questions  please reach out!',32057,438752,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9832\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"2445 Jackson Ave\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"George\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"IA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"51237\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"43.297924\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-96.059767\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Iowa\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/core-george-ia-us-wanda-van-otterloo-3',NULL,'2024-03-07 06:03:41','2024-04-10 15:20:47'),
