	('9bc65bbb-11f4-4569-b257-16e94aa6c364',2,1478,'WAH BASIC - Muskoka, ON, CA | Thom Mills',NULL,'weekly','','ON',NULL,'Muskoka','','CA',-79.5875200,45.1090670,'Ontario',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:48',0,'men','2024-05-02 15:20:48','2024-05-05 15:20:48',NULL,'What is Included – Accommodations at an incredible lake side and forested cottage large enough to host 22 guys, session material, food, a bed for you to sleep in.\r\n\r\nWhat you need to bring – Sleeping bag, pillow, and open and prayerful heart and mind.\r\n\r\nMore about the food – The food at these events is always great.  You can expect a group dinning experience with amazing quality and quantity of food.\r\n\r\nRegistration Dead-line – Thursday April 25, 2024.',32076,366993,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9853\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Muskoka\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"ON\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"ca\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"45.109067\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-79.587520\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Ontario\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"Canada\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-muskoka-ca-thom-mills-3',NULL,'2024-03-13 06:03:20','2024-04-10 15:20:48'),
