	('9bc65bbd-eae0-4922-bce0-52c201908ad2',2,1496,'WAH BASIC - Boerne, TX, US | Jim Abshire',NULL,'weekly','124 Skylight Trail','TX',NULL,'Boerne','78006','US',-98.6309190,29.8209500,'Texas',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:49',0,'men','2024-04-18 15:20:50','2024-04-21 15:20:50',NULL,'A HCMOF Boot Camp is closely modeled after the Wild at Heart Boot Camp in Colorado.  It is conducted live by the Hill Country Men on Fire team and is designed to lead to the restoration of a man’s God given heart. The weekends are hosted at the beautiful hill country Christian camp Knott Creek Falls and all of the meals are home cooked by like hearted men.\r\n\r\nAdditional Information for this Bootcamp:\r\n\r\nWhen: Thursday-Sunday, April 18th - 21st, 2024 (arrive between 4pm and 5pm Thursday, depart after Noon on Sunday)\r\n\r\nWhere: Knott Creek Falls\r\n2931 Fiedler Rd, Harper, TX 78631\r\nhttps://www.knottcreekfalls.com/\r\n\r\nAccommodations: Lodging will be bunk style (electricity, heating and air, indoor restrooms, showers, etc). You can request a roommate, otherwise roommates will be assigned.\r\n\r\nWho: Men ages 18 and older.\r\n\r\nCost: $350, includes lodging, all meals, camp activities and retreat content.\r\n\r\nFor more information, contact: Jim Abshire (jim@hcmof.com).\r\n\r\nIf you\'re ready to register, please visit our website at www.hcmof.com',31969,409637,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9735\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"124 Skylight Trail\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Boerne\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"TX\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"78006\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"29.820950\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-98.630919\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Texas\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-boerne-tx-us-jim-abshire',NULL,'2024-02-09 12:02:28','2024-04-10 15:20:50'),
