	('9bc65bbe-42d9-4353-91a7-0deedb6e86d1',3,1499,'CORE - Lowesville, VA, US | Kathy Pollard',NULL,'weekly','2247 Little Piney Rd  #6603','VA',NULL,'Lowesville','22967','US',-79.1381160,37.7660720,'Virginia',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:50',0,'men','2024-04-11 15:20:50','2024-04-14 15:20:50',NULL,'We invite you to come away for Core at Crossroads Camp and Conference Center, which is nestled in the beautiful Blue Ridge Mountains of Virginia.  There are hiking trails with amazing views and the Little Piney River runs through the camp.  A perfect place to experience the wonder of nature and spend time with Jesus as we take a journey to unveil the mysteries of your heart.\r\n\r\nAccommodations: Overnight lodging will be in hotel-style rooms, meeting space in an exclusive conference room.\r\n\r\nCost per person:  Single occupancy: $385\r\n                              Double occupancy: $320\r\nDress is casual\r\n \r\nLadies, we know it\'s nearly impossible to get away from all of the responsibilities we have. This event is best experienced off the grid, and we ask that you plan to arrive ready to unplug for the weekend.  No phones or electronic devices.  You owe it to yourself to disconnect and spend some time caring for your heart. You will not regret it!  Get ready for an unforgettable experience at Captivating Core!',31728,381642,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9440\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"2247 Little Piney Rd  #6603\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Lowesville\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"VA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"22967\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"37.766072\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-79.138116\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Virginia\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/core-lowesville-va-us-kathy-pollard-2',NULL,'2023-11-20 09:11:15','2024-04-10 15:20:50'),
	('9bc65bbe-6023-4c2e-a9a2-89af3f9b73b9',3,1500,'CORE - Ramona, OK, US | Amy Thomas',NULL,'weekly','38009-US75','OK',NULL,'Ramona','74061','US',-95.9268130,36.4602690,'Oklahoma',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:50',0,'men','2024-04-11 15:20:50','2024-04-14 15:20:50',NULL,'Join us for an unforgettable weekend at Jarrett Farm Resort, just a short drive from downtown Tulsa, Oklahoma.\r\n\r\nSpace is limited.\r\n\r\nFor more information and to sign up, visit the following link:\r\nhttps://www.highlandsok.com/',31767,404144,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9487\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"38009-US75\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Ramona\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"OK\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"74061\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"36.460269\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-95.926813\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Oklahoma\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/core-ramona-ok-us-amy-thomas-1',NULL,'2023-12-05 01:12:29','2024-04-10 15:20:50'),
	('9bc65bbe-7d88-413a-bd8a-dee4e28ddc28',3,1501,'CORE - Orlando, FL, US | Robin Moore',NULL,'weekly','','FL',NULL,'Orlando','','US',-81.3789270,28.5383830,'Florida',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:50',0,'men','2024-04-11 15:20:50','2024-04-14 15:20:50',NULL,'what better way to CORE than in sunny Florida???? in a resort community, 15 bedroom mansion with a private chef , pool &amp; hot tub!!!???!!!\r\n\r\nthis event is limited to 20 participants so reserve your spot now!\r\n\r\n*single room: $1,000/ double room: $750\r\n*due now = $350 deposit - NON-REFUNDABLE but is TRANSFERABLE - if we find someone else to take your spot we will return your deposit to you in full*',31722,473375,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9435\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Orlando\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"FL\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"28.538383\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-81.378927\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Florida\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/core-orlando-fl-us-robin-moore',NULL,'2023-11-19 03:11:04','2024-04-10 15:20:50'),
	('9bc65bbe-9994-4dbc-bc3f-24bc29037303',2,1456,'WAH BASIC - Van Reenen, ZA | Ilana Kloppers',NULL,'weekly','Van Reenen ,',NULL,NULL,'Van Reenen','','ZA',29.3838280,-28.3753460,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:50',0,'men','2024-04-11 15:20:50','2024-04-14 15:20:50',NULL,'Kit List (Suggested)\r\nSleeping bag, pillow, sheet – (bed and mattress provided)\r\nEarplugs x 2 pairs. (One for you in the chalet, one for when things get loud.)\r\nHiking boots if you want to take a stroll.\r\nRunning shoes if you wish to run up the mountain.\r\nSexy old clothes – nobody to impress in the bush.\r\nRaincoat – it may get wet.\r\nJacket – cold in winter. It\'s really cold in winter.\r\nShoes\r\nSlops\r\nSwim costume – summer splash pool &amp; dam available\r\nToiletries\r\nTowel\r\nWater bottle\r\nPartridge x1\r\nHeadlamp\r\nCamp Chair\r\nWide-brimmed hat\r\nInsect repellent\r\nSunscreen\r\nWalking Stick\r\nPear tree for the Partridge\r\nFishing kit – there are bass in the dam.',31769,369075,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9490\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"Van Reenen ,\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Van Reenen\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"za\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"-28.375346\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"29.383828\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"South Africa\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-van-reenen-za-ilana-kloppers',NULL,'2023-12-06 12:12:06','2024-04-10 15:20:50'),
	('9bc65bbe-b666-4ec6-8f1f-4931c3aee845',2,1502,'WAH BASIC - Diller, NE, US | David and Jenny Milligan',NULL,'weekly','','NE',NULL,'Diller','','US',-96.9350290,40.1072250,'Nebraska',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:50',0,'men','2024-04-11 15:20:50','2024-04-14 15:20:50',NULL,'',32162,28622,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9946\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Diller\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"NE\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"40.107225\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-96.935029\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Nebraska\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-diller-ne-us-david-and-jenny-milligan-1',NULL,'2024-04-08 02:04:03','2024-04-10 15:20:50'),
	('9bc65bbe-d3e1-4e4a-9505-67ab1d68a9f8',2,23,'WAH BASIC - Bellvue, CO, US | Steve Shelton',NULL,'weekly','8233 Old Flowers Rd','CO',NULL,'Bellvue','80512','US',-105.3883470,40.6327040,'Colorado',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:50',0,'men','2024-04-11 15:20:50','2024-04-14 15:20:50',NULL,'Join us this year, April 11-14th, at Sky Corral Ranch for this awesome weekend. It’s more than just a Men’s Retreat. It’s an encounter! We will have worship, teaching, fellowship, and reflection. Retreats are a perfect opportunity to create new friendships and deepen current friendships, so we encourage you to invite other men you know to experience this transformational weekend together.\r\n\r\nThe Wild at Heart Bootcamp is a time focused on recapturing the masculine soul. It will rekindle our love for God and deepen our thirst for living a life full of adventure and wonder in the King. It’s the life Jesus intended for every man.\r\n\r\nFood / Lodging provided for the duration of the event.  \r\n\r\nThe weather can be a bit unpredictable at 7,600 ft, so please bring warm / cold-weather clothes. (and hiking boots for mud/snow)\r\n\r\nAll bunk beds have mattresses/sheets/blankets/pillows but we suggest your bring your own pillow if you feel that would help you get a better nights sleep.  \r\n\r\nYou will need to bring your own toiletries including Toothpaste/Bath Soap/Shampoo.  Towels will be provided but feel free to bring your own towel if you prefer.   \r\n\r\nPrivate lake within walking distance for fishing and swimming',31923,452508,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9679\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"8233 Old Flowers Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Bellvue\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"80512\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"40.632704\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-105.388347\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Colorado\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-bellvue-co-us-steve-shelton-2',NULL,'2024-01-27 09:01:45','2024-04-10 15:20:50'),
	('9bc65bbe-f0d3-4242-aa67-d84ecc5cf279',2,1503,'WAH BASIC - Honey Brook, PA, US | Nelson Ocasio',NULL,'weekly','31 Lasso Dr Honey Brook','PA',NULL,'Honey Brook','19334','US',-75.8876380,40.0581320,'Pennsylvania',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:50',0,'men','2024-04-11 15:20:50','2024-04-14 15:20:50',NULL,'Join other men from Providence for Wild at Heart Basic at Tel Hai Camp in Honey Brook April 11th (7:00pm start time) - April 14th (12:00pm end time). \r\n\r\nWhat is the Cost?\r\n\r\nThe cost of the retreat is $250 per person. All meals and housing are included in the cost of the retreat.\r\n\r\nRegistration link- https://provlife.churchcenter.com/registrations/events/2191281\r\n\r\nFor any questions please reach out to Nelson Ocasio at nelson.ocasio@verizon.net.',32039,454102,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9812\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"31 Lasso Dr Honey Brook\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Honey Brook\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"PA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"19334\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"40.058132\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-75.887638\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Pennsylvania\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-honey-brook-pa-us-nelson-ocasio-0',NULL,'2024-03-04 09:03:00','2024-04-10 15:20:50'),
