	('9bc65bbf-d343-4920-a666-4e6304addf37',2,396,'WAH BASIC - Bennington, KS, US | Todd Just',NULL,'weekly','','KS',NULL,'Bennington','67422','US',-97.5941990,39.0305560,'Kansas',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:51',0,'men','2024-04-04 15:20:51','2024-04-07 15:20:51',NULL,'Over a decade ago I read the book Wild at Heart and soon after I attended my first Wild at Heart Bootcamp in Fraser, Colorado.  It changed my life!  God lifted the fog on several things in my life that have changed how I view God, myself, and others.  I’ll never be the same again.\r\n\r\nAbout seven years ago I met Tucker in a desperate place in his life and together we started walking out the message of Wild at Heart.  We’ve encountered a lot of really tough stuff in those seven years, but have remained overall hopeful, encouraged, and anchored by the Wild at Heart message.  \r\n\r\nOver the years Tucker and I have felt a strong pull to offer this message of love, freedom, and strength to other men.  Hosting a Wild at Heart BASIC in our local context is how we’ve sensed God calling us to share this good news with others.  We’re excited that you are considering this event because we know from experience just how powerful this weekend can be for you.\r\n\r\nWe have limited spots available and we will fill on a first-come, first-serve basis.  To register click on this link - https://forms.gle/WbmgF3eDFQBx78DR6\r\n\r\nCost to register is $300.  A full refund will be issued if cancellation occurs on or before March 1.  A half refund will be issued if cancellation occurs on or before March 31.  No refund will be issued if cancellation occurs after March 31.  \r\n\r\nIf you have questions, please feel free to call or email Todd using the info listed above.',31791,228256,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9517\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Bennington\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"KS\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"67422\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"39.030556\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-97.594199\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Kansas\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-bennington-ks-us-todd-just-0',NULL,'2023-12-12 02:12:48','2024-04-10 15:20:51'),
