	('9bc65bc0-bafd-4927-9365-a1d7124ea078',2,1510,'WAH BASIC - Hungry Horse, MT, US | Carl Wells',NULL,'weekly','Glacier Bible Camp ','MT',NULL,'Hungry Horse','59919','US',-114.0744550,48.3895610,'Montana',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:51',0,'men','2024-03-28 15:20:51','2024-03-31 15:20:51',NULL,'They can register for the event at the website. We will be staying in the lodge with two beds in each room, blankets will be provided. They will need to bring their own personal toiletries and a jacket and bring swimsuit, hiking boots and campfire clothes. We will be setting up an archery range so please bring your bow and arrows. There\'s a cafeteria in the building so they don\'t need to worry about food unless they\'re a special dietary request and then please call me. The meetings will be held in the lodge. It\'s a large log Lodge rustic and beautiful. All meetings and food will be inside. It is 15 minutes away from the entrance of Glacier National Park. There is a $225 per person cost this includes three nights in the lodge in all the food for the weekend. \r\nI\'m looking forward to making new friends and turning friends into brothers.\r\nIn every man\'s heart there\'s an adventure to live \r\nGod Bless Carl',18498,451697,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8325\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"Glacier Bible Camp \\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"400 5th St. West\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Hungry Horse\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MT\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"59919\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"48.389561\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-114.074455\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Montana\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-hungry-horse-mt-us-carl-wells',NULL,'2023-02-15 05:02:21','2024-04-10 15:20:51'),
