	('9bc65bc1-8336-410a-b523-63a52ee560d2',3,1514,'CORE - Carlisle, PA, US | Donna Sue Bongardt',NULL,'weekly','430 Union Hall Rd','PA',NULL,'Carlisle','17013','US',-77.2326120,40.2228820,'Pennsylvania',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:52',0,'men','2024-03-21 15:20:52','2024-03-24 15:20:52',NULL,'Time is running out. We have a few spaces left!  \r\n\r\nRegister: https://forms.gle/AkVEVgHa1c7w3eyf7\r\n\r\nDefinitely bring; your Bible, journal, water bottle, comfy shoes, and multi layers for various weather conditions. In the evenings we will have a campfire, so dress warm! Most of all, bring a warm and open heart! We\'ll provide the chocolate and hot cocoa! \r\n\r\nFor your free time (approx. 3 hrs. each afternoon) there is hiking, disc golf, pickle ball, gym time, reading, journaling, or a special craft.',31838,474742,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9563\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"430 Union Hall Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Carlisle\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"PA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"17013\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"40.222882\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-77.232612\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Pennsylvania\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/core-carlisle-pa-us-donna-sue-bongardt',NULL,'2024-01-05 10:01:45','2024-04-10 15:20:52'),
	('9bc65bc1-a07b-4d15-a9ca-ae6efaa616fb',2,547,'WAH BASIC - Pawleys Island, SC, US | Bernard Jones',NULL,'weekly','622 Rowel Road','SC',NULL,'Trio','29590','US',-79.7269890,33.4760220,'South Carolina',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:52',0,'men','2024-03-21 15:20:52','2024-03-24 15:20:52',NULL,'Fishing for bass and bream in pond. \r\nOptions for turkey and quail hunting. \r\nCampfire.\r\nNature trail.',31461,296048,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9131\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"622 Rowel Road\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Trio\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"SC\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"29590\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"33.476022\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-79.726989\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"South Carolina\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-pawleys-island-sc-us-bernard-jones',NULL,'2023-08-14 04:08:24','2024-04-10 15:20:52'),
	('9bc65bc1-be0b-41be-b2f0-6dd296037052',2,1515,'WAH BASIC - Nordegg, AB, CA | Jeff Chambers',NULL,'weekly','Frontier Lodge','AB',NULL,'Nordegg, Frontier Lodge ','t0m 2h0','CA',-116.1484700,52.4466800,'Alberta',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:52',0,'men','2024-03-21 15:20:52','2024-03-24 15:20:52',NULL,'~Check-In: 4:00 pm-5:30 pm Thursday, March 21, 2024\r\n~Conclusion: 1:00 pm Sunday, March 24, 2024\r\n~Event Location:\r\n      Frontier Lodge – Nordegg, Alberta - https://www.frontierlodge.ca/\r\n~Please do not contact Frontier Lodge prior to the event. If you have a pressing question \r\n      that must be answered before the event, email: BASICforAB@gmail.com\r\n~Lodging &amp; Meals: $265 (gst included) - Thurs - supper, Fri &amp; Sat - 3 meals, \r\n      Sun - breakfast &amp; lunch\r\n~Optional: Tyrolean adventure $61 (gst included)\r\n~Register at: https://basicnordegg23.wufoo.com/forms/wild-at-heart-basic-registration/\r\n      Registration deadline: March 7, 2024 attire is casual.  \r\n\r\n~Dress comfortably and prepare for typical late winter mountain weather. Be\r\nprepared for times when you’ll have the option to spend time outdoors in the rugged beauty\r\nsurrounding the Lodge.\r\n~Bring bedding and towels.\r\n\r\nEvent Specifics:\r\n\r\nOptional tyrolean traverse adventure available\r\n\r\n~ The following activities may be available, bring your own equipment if you have: ice- \r\n    fishing,\r\n    snowshoeing (a few snowshoes are available at the Lodge), cross-country skiing (no \r\n    groomed\r\n    trails), skating.\r\n~Phone access will be limited to emergencies only.  Cell phone and laptop/iPad usage is\r\n    discouraged during the event.  \r\n~Laptop, iPad/tablet, and camera use are not permitted during the sessions.\r\n~Internet access is not available.',31858,313400,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9594\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"Frontier Lodge\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\" 402062, Range Road 15 #4A, Nordegg, AB T0M 2H0\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Nordegg, Frontier Lodge \\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"AB\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"t0m 2h0\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"ca\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"52.446680\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-116.148470\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Alberta\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"Canada\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-nordegg-ab-ca-jeff-chambers-0',NULL,'2024-01-09 08:01:40','2024-04-10 15:20:52'),
	('9bc65bc1-daa3-4cfd-bc3c-28a7fb5419d6',2,1516,'WAH BASIC - Poole, DOR, GB | Ben Hines',NULL,'weekly','Banks Road',NULL,NULL,'Poole','','GB',-1.9386000,50.6899170,'Dorset',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:52',0,'men','2024-03-21 15:20:52','2024-03-24 15:20:52',NULL,'Swim gear, wetsuit if you want to go sailing, walking gear, sleeping bag, pillow, towel.\r\nThis is a small gathering of up to 5 men. We will cater together, and split food costs. \r\nCost: £30 towards utilities and accommodation, plus split of food cost (tbc) \r\nTiming: 7.00pm Thursday 21st - 12.00pm Sunday 24th March 2024',32041,125111,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9815\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"Banks Road\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"Sandbanks\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Poole\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"DOR\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"gb\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"50.689917\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-1.938600\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Dorset\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United Kingdom\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-poole-dor-gb-ben-hines',NULL,'2024-03-05 03:03:23','2024-04-10 15:20:52'),
	('9bc65bc1-f7d7-49ef-884f-aac107ca203d',2,1517,'WAH BASIC - McGregor, MN, US | Erik Swenson',NULL,'weekly','','MN',NULL,'McGregor','55760','US',-93.3086870,46.6068260,'Minnesota',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:52',0,'men','2024-03-21 15:20:52','2024-03-24 15:20:52',NULL,'When: Thursday-Sunday, Mar 21 - Mar 24 (arrive between 3 and 4pm Thursday and depart after 12:30pm Sunday)\r\n\r\nWhere: Covenant Pines Bible Camp, McGregor, MN\r\nhttps://covenantpines.org/\r\n\r\nCost: $195 - includes lodging, all meals, snacks, on-site camp activities, materials and retreat content.\r\n\r\nAccommodations: Lodging will be bunk style (electricity, indoor restrooms, showers, etc). You can request a roommate, otherwise roommates will be assigned. Retreat center also includes a meeting hall and gathering area with wood fireplace and coffee on tap. Dining hall and indoor gym are just a short walk across camp.\r\n\r\nActivities: On-site activities will be available during free time including, snowshoeing, hiking, sauna, crate-stacking, indoor gym (basketball, pickleball, dodgeball), game room, nightly campfires, coffee shop, etc.\r\n\r\nWhat to bring: Bedding, towel, indoor and outdoor clothing for activities.\r\n\r\nTo sign up, click on the google link below to complete a short registration form. Payment options are explained on the form.\r\n\r\nhttps://forms.gle/zb5aP9tj69xLkWyF8\r\n\r\nFor questions, feel free to contact Olaf Lee (onlee72@icloud.com) or\r\nErik Swenson (erikswensondesign@gmail.com).',31878,436224,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9660\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"McGregor\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MN\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"55760\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"46.606826\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-93.308687\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Minnesota\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-mcgregor-mn-us-erik-swenson-3',NULL,'2024-01-13 12:01:52','2024-04-10 15:20:52'),
