	('9bc65bc2-a72f-492e-a1f6-768b4d22abc3',6,1522,'CAPTIVATING - Lewisville, NC, US | Sheila Koone',NULL,'weekly','819 Williams Rd','NC',NULL,'Lewisville','27023','US',-80.4353900,36.0897200,'North Carolina',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:53',0,'women','2024-03-19 15:20:53',NULL,NULL,'',32084,92756,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9863\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"819 Williams Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Lewisville\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"NC\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"27023\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"36.089720\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-80.435390\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"North Carolina\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/captivating/small-group/captivating-lewisville-nc-us-sheila-koone',NULL,'2024-03-16 06:03:57','2024-04-10 15:20:53'),
	('9bc65bc2-c4da-49a4-8c13-41125b4d795b',2,1523,'WAH BASIC - Mena, AR, US | Jamie Pruitt',NULL,'weekly','1216 Polk County Rd 602','AR',NULL,'Mena','71953','US',-94.0452960,34.4184930,'Arkansas',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:53',0,'men','2024-03-14 15:20:53','2024-03-17 15:20:53',NULL,'Every man dies but not every man lives!\r\n\r\nWhat would your world look like if your masculine heart was fully alive?\r\n\r\nToday there\'s a lot of confusion and misunderstandings about  masculinity: what a man is and how he is designed and destined by God to live.\r\n\r\nMost men wander aimlessly through life. What is life all about and what am I supposed to do?\r\n\r\nEvery man should attend a Wild at Heart Basic! Every man needs -  orientation, permission, clarity, a start to healing, and vision!\r\nThis weekend is designed to give you just that.\r\n\r\nDates: March 14-17,2024\r\nLocation: Mena, AR\r\nCost: $200 (includes lodging, meals, and conference material)\r\n\r\nLog home bordered by the Ouachita National Forest and Caney Creek US Wilderness, fishing ponds, trails, rustic setting.\r\n\r\nThis weekend is not a retreat about the “seven things a man should  do to be a nicer guy.” It is a four-day quest into the recovery of a man’s masculine soul, the release of a man’s heart—his passions and his true nature—all given to him by God.\r\n\r\nThe environment is safe and there is freedom to be yourself. You will be among friends. We are men just like you, \"we got our stuff\".  We are on a journey. Join us on this quest!\r\n\r\nThis Wild at Heart BASIC is Wild at Heart Boot Camp led by John Eldredge and his team delivered through video sessions. You will gain a deeper understanding of your masculine heart and why God made you male. Imagine being released to follow your masculine heart with strength and confidence for the battles you face.\r\n\r\nNOTE: Contact host Byron Barlowe for specifics on meeting in Mena, Arkansas to shuttle up to this pretty remote location:\r\nbbarlowe@probe.org   214-929-0772',31905,52028,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9656\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"1216 Polk County Rd 602\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Mena\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"AR\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"71953\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"34.418493\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-94.045296\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Arkansas\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-mena-ar-us-jamie-pruitt',NULL,'2024-01-22 01:01:27','2024-04-10 15:20:53'),
	('9bc65bc2-e21f-43a4-bc8e-98ac7e500b4c',5,962,'WILD AT HEART - Bolham, NTT, GB | David Hearn',NULL,'weekly','The Barn',NULL,NULL,'Retford','DN22 9JQ','GB',-0.9607700,53.3680470,'Nottinghamshire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:53',0,'men','2024-03-08 15:20:53',NULL,NULL,'All are welcome!',32061,389087,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9837\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"The Barn\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"Tiln Road\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Retford\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"NTT\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"DN22 9JQ\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"gb\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"53.368047\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-0.960770\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Nottinghamshire\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United Kingdom\\\"}\"','/wildatheart/small-group/wild-heart-bolham-ntt-gb-david-hearn',NULL,'2024-03-08 10:03:08','2024-04-10 15:20:53'),
