	('9bc65bc3-738b-4919-b630-7a84349d0304',4,1527,'BECOMING A KING RETREAT- Dalmally, AGB, GB | Fr Gabriel Joseph Kyte',NULL,'weekly','Craig Lodge Family House of Prayer',NULL,NULL,'Dalmally','PA331AR','GB',-4.9526560,56.4068530,'Argyll and Bute',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:53',0,'men','2024-03-07 15:20:53','2024-03-10 15:20:53',NULL,'£265.00 for full room and board and materials.  Contact Craig Lodge directly for Wednesday arrivals.  Pick ups available from Dalmally station.\r\n\r\nLodge is located in Scottish Highlands.  Expect variable weather conditions.  Bring wet and warm gear and suitable footwear for optional hikes in surrounding hills.',31884,448882,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9627\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"Craig Lodge Family House of Prayer\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Dalmally\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"AGB\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"PA331AR\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"gb\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"56.406853\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-4.952656\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Argyll and Bute\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United Kingdom\\\"}\"','/becoming-king-retreat-dalmally-agb-gb-fr-gabriel-joseph-kyte',NULL,'2024-01-15 07:01:29','2024-04-10 15:20:53'),
	('9bc65bc3-91a8-4f15-a1ad-fb78013f83f6',4,1459,'BECOMING A KING RETREAT- Colorado Springs, CO, US | Brad Steininger',NULL,'weekly','5125 Brady Rd','CO',NULL,'Colorado Springs','80915','US',-104.7319960,38.8627910,'Colorado',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:53',0,'men','2024-03-07 15:20:53','2024-03-10 15:20:53',NULL,'NOTE: Registration for this retreat is closed (we have already filled all the slots). Please consider joining us for our other retreat, Jul 11-14, 2024:\r\nhttps://wildatheart.org/allies/becoming-king-retreat/becoming-king-retreat-colorado-springs-co-us-brad-steininger-9\r\n\r\nWhen: Thur-Sun, March 7-10, 2024 (arrive at 5:00 pm Thursday, depart after 12:00 Sunday)\r\n\r\nWhere: The Outpost at Stein Haus, 5125 Brady Rd, Colorado Springs, CO 80915\r\n\r\nWho: It is open to men of all ages (18 and above). This retreat can accommodate up to 4 men.\r\n\r\nAccommodations: Four men will share a single large room (bunk beds). Everyone will have a bed, pillow, linens and towels. There is one bathroom with a shower/sink/toilet and a second bathroom with a sink/toilet.\r\n\r\nCost: $77 which includes lodging, all meals and retreat content. A nonrefundable deposit of $50 is due no later than eight weeks prior to the retreat via check or PayPal. Full payment of the remaining $27 is due upon arrival at the retreat.\r\n\r\nRegistration: Please contact Brad Steininger to register or to request more information.\r\n\r\nOther info:\r\n\r\n* This event is designed to be experienced \"off the grid;\" we require participants to unplug from all devices. There will be a contact number provided for emergencies.\r\n\r\n* A couple hours of free time is built into the schedule both Friday and Saturday afternoons. During this time you will have the opportunity to participate in a hike, leisure time around the facility, take a nap, read a book, etc.\r\n\r\n* This retreat is in a rustic neighborhood on the East side of Colorado Springs (mostly dirt roads and equestrian properties). Bring season-appropriate casual clothes. There are some trails nearby for hiking and an excellent park with many trails just a couple miles away.\r\n\r\n* In the evenings, there will be an opportunity to relax, build a camp fire, tell stories and have fun. You\'ll leave with new friendships, greater clarity in your walk with the Lord, and inspired to live your life as a man fully alive.',31550,236529,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9236\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"5125 Brady Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Colorado Springs\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"80915\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"38.862791\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-104.731996\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Colorado\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/becoming-king-retreat-colorado-springs-co-us-brad-steininger-7',NULL,'2023-09-06 04:09:54','2024-04-10 15:20:53'),
