	('9bc65bc4-06cf-41d1-95fb-2904b93a3b9c',3,1531,'CORE - Carbon, TX, US | tiffany ward',NULL,'weekly','1202 County Road 358','TX',NULL,'Carbon','76435','US',-98.7931220,32.2615960,'Texas',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:53',0,'men','2024-02-29 15:20:54','2024-03-03 15:20:54',NULL,'What To Bring\r\nPlease do not overpack as there is limited space in each room. Below is a list of suggested items to bring: \r\n\r\n* Bible \r\n* Power Strip\r\n* Portable Chair \r\n* Blanket for outdoor quiet time\r\n* Favorite coffee tumbler and/or refillable water bottle\r\n* Any snacks you may want between mealtimes\r\n* Casual clothing',31842,457604,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9571\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"1202 County Road 358\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Carbon\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"TX\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"76435\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"32.261596\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-98.793122\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Texas\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/core-carbon-tx-us-tiffany-ward',NULL,'2024-01-07 02:01:16','2024-04-10 15:20:54'),
