	('9bc65bc4-4136-49d3-a38b-55cf8a536bdd',2,118,'WAH BASIC - Estes Park, CO, US | Gail Mclain',NULL,'weekly','515 Grand Estates Dr.','CO',NULL,'Estes Park','80517','US',-105.4955580,40.3788690,'Colorado',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:54',0,'men','2024-02-29 15:20:54','2024-03-03 15:20:54',NULL,'Definitely bring; your Bible, journal, water bottle, bath towels, and multi layers for various weather conditions in the high country. If you are traveling by air and unable to bring bulky items, please let us know and we will be glad to provide those for you.\r\nFor your free time (approx. 3 hrs.) bring; hiking gear, mountain climbing gear, mountain bikes, horse back riding and ATV rentals are also available!\r\nIdeas for free time; hiking, biking, sailing, kayaking, reading, journaling, snowshoeing... weather pending!!  However you enjoy spending alone time with God!\r\nMost of all, bring an open heart! We\'ll provide the rest!\r\n*If you communicate by email, please include your phone number.',31704,434550,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9411\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"515 Grand Estates Dr.\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Estes Park\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"80517\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"40.378869\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-105.495558\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Colorado\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-estes-park-co-us-gail-mclain-3',NULL,'2023-11-14 02:11:15','2024-04-10 15:20:54'),
