	('9bc65bc4-d20b-4406-9804-4293516fad92',3,118,'CORE - Estes Park, CO, US | Gail Mclain',NULL,'weekly','515 Grand Estates Dr.','CO',NULL,'Estes Park','80517','US',-105.4955580,40.3788690,'Colorado',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:54',0,'men','2024-02-22 15:20:54','2024-02-25 15:20:54',NULL,'Definitely bring; your Bible, journal, water bottle, bath towels, slippers and multi layers for various weather conditions in the high country. If you are traveling by air and unable to bring bulky items, please let us know and we will be glad to provide those for you.\r\nFor your free time (approx. 3 hrs.) bring; hiking gear, hammock, art supplies or other hand work! You\'re most welcome to play our piano! If driving; you are welcome to bring a mountain bike or road bike, nearby rentals are also available.\r\nIdeas for free time; hiking, biking, sailing, kayaking, reading, journaling, snowshoeing... weather pending!!  However you enjoy spending alone time with God!\r\nMost of all, bring a warm and open heart! We\'ll provide the chocolate!\r\n*If you communicate by email, please include your phone number.',31706,434550,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9414\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"515 Grand Estates Dr.\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Estes Park\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"80517\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"40.378869\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-105.495558\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Colorado\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/core-estes-park-co-us-gail-mclain-7',NULL,'2023-11-14 03:11:16','2024-04-10 15:20:54'),
