	('9bc65bc5-62b2-4b6b-aeb6-85a3eb360c1a',2,1008,'WAH BASIC - Forsyth , GA, US | Shawn Keldie',NULL,'weekly','463 Old Zebulon Rd','GA',NULL,'Forsyth ','31029','US',-83.9759090,32.9369970,'Georgia',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:54',0,'men','2024-02-22 15:20:54','2024-02-25 15:20:54',NULL,'Attendees should bring a pillow, sheets, blankets, towels, toiletries, and a camping chair. Lodging and food for the weekend is $225.00 per person. Scholarships are available if the money is an issue. This will be an unplugged weekend so be prepared to let the cell phones go! It\'s good! \r\n\r\nOhhh and there\'s a great pond for fishing and we will have targets for bow shooting. \r\n\r\nRegister through this link!!!\r\n\r\nYou can find my form \"Wild @ Heart Bootcamp\" at: https://form.jotform.com/240337239384156',31903,434570,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9653\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"463 Old Zebulon Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Forsyth \\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"GA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"31029\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"32.936997\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-83.975909\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Georgia\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-forsyth-ga-us-shawn-keldie',NULL,'2024-01-22 08:01:56','2024-04-10 15:20:54'),
