	('9bc65bc6-baf7-4442-96a9-5a8f7bc7ff35',2,1223,'WAH BASIC - Divide, CO, US | Joe Gurzi',NULL,'weekly','512 County Rd 512','CO',NULL,'Divide','80814','US',-105.1998900,38.9691950,'Colorado',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:55',0,'men','2024-02-08 15:20:55','2024-02-11 15:20:55',NULL,'This is held in the Beauty of the Pike National Forest at Above All Else @ Aspen Ridge (Please follow this web site to view facilities. https://www.aaelse.com/ ) Bring season appropriate clothing we are at 9000+ feet. We also have some of the best ATV trails nearby, so bring your toys. Mueller State Park is just minutes away with some excellent hiking trails. Fly fishing (EQUIPMENT PROVIDED) is only 18 miles away, on some of the Platte River\'s best waters (11 mile canyon). All meals included and No sleeping bags required.\r\n\r\nTo register:\r\nContact\r\nJoe Gurzi\r\njoegurzi@q.com\r\n\r\nREGISTRATOIN NOW OPEN',31747,125541,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9462\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"512 County Rd 512\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Divide\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"80814\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"38.969195\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-105.199890\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Colorado\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-divide-co-us-joe-gurzi-1',NULL,'2023-12-02 10:12:02','2024-04-10 15:20:55'),
	('9bc65bc6-d776-41df-853d-5904a22a9ef7',3,1442,'CORE - Cleveland, GA, US | Phil Gable',NULL,'weekly','1242 Old Blue Creek Road','GA',NULL,'Cleveland','30528','US',-83.7453380,34.6063620,'Georgia',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:55',0,'men','2024-02-08 15:20:55','2024-02-11 15:20:55',NULL,'***Registration website - https://lifeimpact.com/captivating/register/\r\n\r\nWhen: Thursday, February 8 - Sunday, February 11, 2023 (arrive between 3:30p-5:00p, Thursday, depart after 12:00p, Sunday)\r\n\r\nWhere: Woodlands Camp &amp; Retreat Center\r\nhttps://www.woodlandscamp.org\r\n\r\nClosest airports: Atlanta (1.5 hours); Chattanooga (2.5 hours); Greenville (Less than 2 hours)\r\n\r\nAccommodations: Overnight lodging will be in hotel-style rooms, meeting space in an exclusive conference room, and a private dining experience. You can request a roommate, otherwise roommates will be assigned.\r\n\r\nCost: $300, includes lodging, all meals, camp activities, and retreat content.\r\n\r\nWe will be spending the weekend nestled in the foothills of North Georgia\'s beautiful Blue Ridge Mountains at Woodlands Camp and Retreat Center. Woodlands is a 131-acre portrait of rolling hills, beautiful forests, and a spring-fed lake. It is a place where you can build lifelong friendships, develop unforgettable memories, and get to know the God who created it all. Woodlands has been partnering with ministries like ours since 1997 to provide unforgettable experiences where God’s presence is so significant that culture and its influences are drowned out.\r\n\r\nFree time is built into the retreat on Friday and Saturday afternoons. On-site and nearby activities are available including field games, hiking, swimming, fishing, river tubing, etc. You may want to bring a hammock and find a quiet spot by the lake or in the woods to rest and soak in God’s beauty. In the evenings we will have a campfire.\r\n\r\nLadies, I know it\'s nearly impossible to get away from all of the responsibilities we have. This event is best experienced off the grid, and we ask that you plan to arrive ready to unplug for the weekend. You owe it to yourself to disconnect and spend some time caring for your heart. You will not regret it! So mark your calendars and get ready for an unforgettable experience at Life Impact Captivating Core!',31669,435057,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9372\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"1242 Old Blue Creek Road\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Cleveland\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"GA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"30528\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"34.606362\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-83.745338\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Georgia\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/core-cleveland-ga-us-phil-gable',NULL,'2023-10-28 10:10:13','2024-04-10 15:20:55'),
	('9bc65bc6-f31a-4da1-ae7f-e178e38bedab',5,1544,'WILD AT HEART - Melbourne, VIC, AU | Paul Roe',NULL,'weekly','',NULL,NULL,'Melbourne','3027','AU',144.7439500,-37.8614860,'Victoria',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:55',0,'men','2024-02-12 15:20:55',NULL,NULL,'We are a strong group of men committed to journeying through life together.\r\nWe meet every Monday night and always welcome new men who want to grow in authenticity, or are just sick of struggling through life on their own. Iron Sharpens Iron. \r\nBand of Brothers.',31957,476866,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9720\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"Williams Landing\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Melbourne\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"VIC\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"3027\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"au\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"-37.861486\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"144.743950\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Victoria\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"Australia\\\"}\"','/wildatheart/small-group/wild-heart-melbourne-vic-au-paul-roe',NULL,'2024-02-05 04:02:36','2024-04-10 15:20:55'),
	('9bc65bc7-1111-4f53-a08d-c9ad37cbff20',5,1214,'WILD AT HEART - Taylors, SC, US | Dave Lange',NULL,'weekly','1720 Reid School Rd ','SC',NULL,'Taylors','26987','US',-82.3496550,34.9392630,'South Carolina',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:55',0,'men','2024-02-18 15:20:56',NULL,NULL,'We exist to build and strengthen our spiritual bond of fellowship within the body of Christ and to serve our community through our shared faith and love of the great outdoors.',31941,476696,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9700\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"1720 Reid School Rd \\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Taylors\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"SC\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"26987\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"34.939263\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-82.349655\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"South Carolina\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wildatheart/small-group/wild-heart-taylors-sc-us-dave-lange',NULL,'2024-02-01 08:02:45','2024-04-10 15:20:56'),
	('9bc65bc7-2dfd-4229-a473-908a36fa63c3',2,739,'WAH BASIC - Samson, AL, US | Bob Carnes',NULL,'weekly','363 Victory Circle','AL',NULL,'Samson','36477','US',-86.1764820,31.0792350,'Alabama',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:56',0,'men','2024-02-01 15:20:56','2024-02-04 15:20:56',NULL,'***Our registration is currently closed due to reaching full capacity. \r\n\r\nIf interested, and for more information and to register, for a future Basic, please contact Bob Carnes by email or phone. bobcarnesdc@gmail.com.  Phone/text: 334-8032929\r\nVisit website: HIStoryMakers.com\r\nVenue website: campvictoryal.org',31355,229508,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9007\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"363 Victory Circle\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Samson\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"AL\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"36477\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"31.079235\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-86.176482\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Alabama\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-samson-al-us-bob-carnes',NULL,'2023-07-08 02:07:26','2024-04-10 15:20:56'),
	('9bc65bc7-4abf-4fbb-b551-58147ef0b37e',2,1545,'WAH BASIC - Canton, GA, US | Breier Sanders',NULL,'weekly','493 Charles Cox Drive','GA',NULL,'Canton','30115','US',-84.4101810,34.1747110,'Georgia',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:56',0,'men','2024-02-01 15:20:56','2024-02-04 15:20:56',NULL,'',31698,473849,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9402\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"493 Charles Cox Drive\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Canton\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"GA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"30115\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"34.174711\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-84.410181\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Georgia\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-canton-ga-us-breier-sanders',NULL,'2023-11-13 09:11:10','2024-04-10 15:20:56'),
	('9bc65bc7-6685-40b3-8045-ffe1f6da3d0e',4,9,'BECOMING A KING RETREAT- Breckenridge, CO, US | Tony Hill',NULL,'weekly','','CO',NULL,'Breckenridge','','US',-106.0383520,39.4816540,'Colorado',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:56',0,'men','2024-01-28 15:20:56','2024-01-31 15:20:56',NULL,'This Becoming a King Retreat will take place at a backcountry hut situated at the summit of a 11,500\' mountain pass near Breckenridge, CO.  \r\n\r\nWe\'ll meet in Breckenridge at 9am on Sunday the 28th then drive to the trailhead together.  We\'ll return to the trailhead around 4pm on Wednesday the 31st.  Participants will be responsible for their own travel.  We\'ll arrange carpooling as appropriate.\r\n\r\nEveryone will be required to snowshoe up 6.5 miles with 1200\' of elevation gain carrying their own gear as well as help pull the sleds carrying the group food and supplies.\r\n\r\nDue to the physical demands of this trip, there is an application process so that we can verify everyone will make it and to better ensure the safety of the group.  The primary requirement will be to be able to run a mile in less than 11 minutes.\r\n\r\nWe\'ll have 9 participants and 3 facilitators who have years of journeying and leading with Wild at Heart and Becoming a King.\r\n\r\nCost is $250 per person which includes all food, snacks, and drinks at the hut.  $100 up front holds your spot.\r\n\r\nParticipants will need a medium/large hiking backpack, sleeping bag, winter outerwear, and snowshoes (we can help arrange rentals if needed).\r\n\r\nThere will be no electricity.  You\'ll give up your phones.  The outhouse is very cold.  We\'ll melt snow for water.  We\'ll burn wood for heat.  The menu will be simple, hearty, real food.  There are serious risks. You will experience discomfort and may experience pain. \r\n\r\nThis is an intensive, not a vacation.  There will be some time for hanging out, relaxing, and exploring, but the schedule is quite demanding and every participant is required to attend every session and fully engage in their story group.\r\n\r\nEmail me for a link to the application form. \r\n\r\nFurther up and further in!',31648,405321,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9347\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Breckenridge\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"39.481654\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-106.038352\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Colorado\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/becoming-king-retreat-breckenridge-co-us-tony-hill',NULL,'2023-10-20 04:10:58','2024-04-10 15:20:56');
