VALUES
	('9bc65bc7-820d-48a5-b137-984a008317c7',3,1546,'CORE - Schulenburg, TX, US | Andi Parris',NULL,'weekly','2123 FM 2238','TX',NULL,'Schulenburg','78956','US',-96.9431600,29.7929110,'Texas',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:56',0,'men','2024-01-26 15:20:56','2024-01-29 15:20:56',NULL,'Captivating Core, January 2024\r\n\r\nAddress: 2123 FM 2238 Schulenberg, TX 78956\r\n\r\nDates: January 26-28, 2024 (Friday-Sunday) \r\n(dates listed on the website are not accurate, please use these dates)\r\n\r\nCheck in time:                      10am-10:30am on January 26th\r\nDeparture time:                   Around lunch time on January 28th\r\n\r\nThis is an all or nothing retreat experience, so please arrive on time and plan to stay throughout the weekend.  \r\n\r\nThe Captivating Core retreat will be hosted at the beautiful Camp Jordan. This retreat center is hotel style with bedding, towels, and pillows provided. When you are gathering items to bring in your bag, pack like you would for a hotel. \r\n\r\nThere will be opportunities to spend time outside to explore the 70+ acres of property. We will have access a hot tub. Bring shoes safe to walk in, and your swimsuit if you want to enjoy the water.\r\n\r\nSuggested attire:\r\n\r\nDress for comfort \r\n\r\nBelow are a few suggested items to bring:\r\n\r\nBathroom Items:\r\n•Toothbrush and toothpaste\r\n•Deodorant\r\n•Hair brush\r\n•Sunscreen\r\n•Shampoo/Conditioner\r\n•Makeup/hair care products if desired.\r\n•Any medication, or supplements you take daily to insure you feel your best.\r\n\r\nClothing items: \r\n•3-4 outfits\r\n•Jacket, bring layers for the conference room\r\n•Undergarments\r\n•Socks\r\n•Sandals and/or shoes safe for walking\r\n•Swimsuit \r\n\r\nExtra Items:\r\n•Bible **please bring a Bible and journal, not apps on a phone or device\r\n•Pen\r\n•Booklights are great to have for this weekend \r\n•Speaker to play worship music in your room.\r\n•Earplugs or sound machine\r\n\r\nBRING A BLANKET, for fireside use or use in the conference room.\r\n\r\nPhones:  This retreat experience begins with \"unplugging\" from your world back home.  This is non-negotiable. The emergency contact number for the weekend is 281-635-0839.  Please let friends and family know not to contact you from Friday morning until Sunday after lunch time.  \r\n\r\nPlease leave other electronic devices at home.',31827,449984,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9554\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"2123 FM 2238\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Schulenburg\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"TX\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"78956\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"29.792911\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-96.943160\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Texas\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/core-schulenburg-tx-us-andi-parris-0',NULL,'2023-12-30 03:12:03','2024-04-10 15:20:56'),
	('9bc65bc7-9e70-40cc-9f45-cead88692cbd',6,1547,'CAPTIVATING - Fort Collins, CO, US | Steve Sovaiko',NULL,'weekly','4115 Shoreline Dr','CO',NULL,'Fort Collins','80526','US',-105.1629720,40.5298350,'Colorado',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:56',0,'women','2024-01-25 15:20:56',NULL,NULL,'This is closed session for my BASIC alumni, they are desiring to learn more about the image of God in their wives\' lives.  We will allow the Holy Spirit to reveal the Father\'s design in our most precious allies, our wives.',31913,393996,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9665\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"4115 Shoreline Dr\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Fort Collins\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"80526\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"40.529835\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-105.162972\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Colorado\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/captivating/small-group/captivating-fort-collins-co-us-steve-sovaiko',NULL,'2024-01-25 03:01:18','2024-04-10 15:20:56'),
	('9bc65bc7-baf1-4907-9243-ae1cada43cdb',2,1548,'WAH BASIC - Bernville, PA, US | Gloria Quaintance',NULL,'weekly','','PA',NULL,'Bernville','','US',-76.1121650,40.4334260,'Pennsylvania',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:56',0,'men','2024-01-25 15:20:56','2024-01-28 15:20:56',NULL,'',31888,441419,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9634\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Bernville\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"PA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"40.433426\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-76.112165\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Pennsylvania\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-bernville-pa-us-gloria-quaintance',NULL,'2024-01-17 06:01:06','2024-04-10 15:20:56'),
	('9bc65bc7-d797-4cf5-9edf-782c8ba5f358',4,1549,'BECOMING A KING RETREAT- Whitefish, MT, US | Raymond Mertens',NULL,'weekly','306 Lupfer Ave','MT',NULL,'Whitefish','59937','US',-114.3400180,48.4093700,'Montana',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:56',0,'men','2024-01-25 15:20:56','2024-01-28 15:20:56',NULL,'Hosted in Whitefish, Montana at Ray\'s House, with your own chef preparing meals.\r\nRay\'s home is an atmosphere of peace where R&amp;R is experienced by all.\r\nOver 20+ hrs of training materials on Becoming A King.\r\nFacilitated by Ray Mertens and team.\r\nVideo Training by Morgan Snyder from the Wild At Heart team.\r\nStory Sessions with Ray Mertens and team to share your life story.\r\nFriday afternoon Ice Fishing on a Montana Lake.\r\nSaturday afternoon skiing at Big Mountain in Whitefish, MT. (we cover your lift ticket $90 value) OR a Massage at Vibes Wellness Lounge downtown Whitefish, MT. ($120 value)\r\nGo home with a copy of Morgan Snyder\'s book \"Becoming A King\"\r\nTOTAL WEEKEND VALUE = $9997\r\nYOUR INVESTMENT ONLY $897',31832,262687,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9556\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"306 Lupfer Ave\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Whitefish\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MT\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"59937\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"48.409370\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-114.340018\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Montana\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/becoming-king-retreat-whitefish-mt-us-raymond-mertens',NULL,'2024-01-04 08:01:34','2024-04-10 15:20:56'),
