	('9bc65bc8-49de-4211-9fb6-0de7cd3fb21b',3,1552,'CORE - Hilton Head Island, SC, US | Becky Locke',NULL,'weekly','','SC',NULL,'Hilton Head Island','','US',-80.7526080,32.2163160,'South Carolina',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:56',0,'men','2024-01-25 15:20:56','2024-01-28 15:20:56',NULL,'Limited to the first 10 people to register.',31782,469275,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9507\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Hilton Head Island\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"SC\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"32.216316\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-80.752608\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"South Carolina\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/core-hilton-head-island-sc-us-becky-locke',NULL,'2023-12-08 09:12:11','2024-04-10 15:20:56'),
	('9bc65bc8-6536-4144-a63c-19225950fc70',3,118,'CORE - Estes Park, CO, US | Gail Mclain',NULL,'weekly','515 Grand Estates Dr.','CO',NULL,'Estes Park','80517','US',-105.4955580,40.3788690,'Colorado',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:56',0,'men','2024-01-25 15:20:56','2024-01-28 15:20:56',NULL,'Definitely bring; your Bible, journal, water bottle, bath towels, slippers and multi layers for various weather conditions in the high country. If you are traveling by air and unable to bring bulky items, please let us know and we will be glad to provide those for you.\r\nFor your free time (approx. 3 hrs.) bring; hiking gear, hammock, art supplies or other hand work! You\'re most welcome to play our piano! If driving; you are welcome to bring a mountain bike or road bike, nearby rentals are also available.\r\nIdeas for free time; hiking, biking, sailing, kayaking, reading, journaling, snowshoeing... weather pending!!  However you enjoy spending alone time with God!\r\nMost of all, bring a warm and open heart! We\'ll provide the chocolate!\r\n*If you communicate by email, please include your phone number.',31702,434550,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9408\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"515 Grand Estates Dr.\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Estes Park\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"80517\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"40.378869\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-105.495558\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Colorado\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/core-estes-park-co-us-gail-mclain-6',NULL,'2023-11-14 02:11:06','2024-04-10 15:20:56'),
	('9bc65bc8-8156-471c-9d53-d2a6f34029b5',4,1459,'BECOMING A KING RETREAT- Colorado Springs, CO, US | Brad Steininger',NULL,'weekly','5125 Brady Rd','CO',NULL,'Colorado Springs','80915','US',-104.7319960,38.8627910,'Colorado',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:56',0,'men','2024-01-25 15:20:56','2024-01-28 15:20:56',NULL,'NOTE: Registration for this retreat is closed (we have already filled all the slots). Please consider joining us for our other retreat, Jul 11-14, 2024:\r\nhttps://wildatheart.org/allies/becoming-king-retreat/becoming-king-retreat-colorado-springs-co-us-brad-steininger-9\r\n\r\nWhen: Thur-Sun, January 25-28, 2024 (arrive at 5:00 pm Thursday, depart after 12:00 Sunday)\r\n\r\nWhere: The Outpost at Stein Haus, 5125 Brady Rd, Colorado Springs, CO 80915\r\n\r\nWho: It is open to men of all ages (18 and above). This retreat can accommodate up to 4 men.\r\n\r\nAccommodations: Four men will share a single large room (bunk beds). Everyone will have a bed, pillow, linens and towels. There is one bathroom with a shower/sink/toilet and a second bathroom with a sink/toilet.\r\n\r\nCost: $77 which includes lodging, all meals and retreat content. A nonrefundable deposit of $50 is due no later than eight weeks prior to the retreat via check or PayPal. Full payment of the remaining $27 is due upon arrival at the retreat.\r\n\r\nRegistration: Please contact Brad Steininger to register or to request more information.\r\n\r\nOther info:\r\n\r\n* This event is designed to be experienced \"off the grid;\" we require participants to unplug from all devices. There will be a contact number provided for emergencies.\r\n\r\n* A couple hours of free time is built into the schedule both Friday and Saturday afternoons. During this time you will have the opportunity to participate in a hike, leisure time around the facility, take a nap, read a book, etc.\r\n\r\n* This retreat is in a rustic neighborhood on the East side of Colorado Springs (mostly dirt roads and equestrian properties). Bring season-appropriate casual clothes. There are some trails nearby for hiking and an excellent park with many trails just a couple miles away.\r\n\r\n* In the evenings, there will be an opportunity to relax, build a camp fire, tell stories and have fun. You\'ll leave with new friendships, greater clarity in your walk with the Lord, and inspired to live your life as a man fully alive.',31238,236529,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8883\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"5125 Brady Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Colorado Springs\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"80915\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"38.862791\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-104.731996\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Colorado\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/becoming-king-retreat-colorado-springs-co-us-brad-steininger-6',NULL,'2023-06-08 04:06:21','2024-04-10 15:20:56'),
	('9bc65bc8-9e2b-4778-a7f9-109573cc855b',4,25,'BECOMING A KING RETREAT- Hillsboro, TX, US | Christopher Gabel',NULL,'weekly','148 HCR 1323','TX',NULL,'Hillsboro','76645','US',-97.1729790,31.9148960,'Texas',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:56',0,'men','2024-01-25 15:20:57','2024-01-28 15:20:57',NULL,'Cost: $150 includes all meals for the whole weekend, materials, portable toilets, and facilities. \r\nAccommodations: Primitive tent camping at a deer camp, all meals will be provided, limited utilities in the deer cabin, bring your own gear for tent, sleeping bags, etc., bring a durable camp chair for the weekend.',31724,416374,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9437\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"148 HCR 1323\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Hillsboro\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"TX\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"76645\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"31.914896\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-97.172979\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Texas\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/becoming-king-retreat-hillsboro-tx-us-christopher-gabel',NULL,'2023-11-19 07:11:16','2024-04-10 15:20:57'),
	('9bc65bc8-baad-42af-8eac-87eab1ef0bd0',2,1553,'WAH BASIC - Haneyville, PA, US | Jesse Johnson',NULL,'weekly','','PA',NULL,'Haneyville','','US',-77.4749790,41.3256250,'Pennsylvania',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:57',0,'men','2024-01-25 15:20:57','2024-01-28 15:20:57',NULL,'$300 covers your registration, lodging, and food from Thursday night to Sunday noon. We have space for up to 25 men at a beautiful lodge in northern PA. The lodge is situated on 300 acres where we can hike, shoot, ride ATVs, and spend our quiet time.',31472,48915,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9144\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Haneyville\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"PA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"41.325625\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-77.474979\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Pennsylvania\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-haneyville-pa-us-jesse-johnson-1',NULL,'2023-08-16 09:08:54','2024-04-10 15:20:57'),
