	('9bc65bc9-fb63-4dcf-acb2-559987b19ac0',2,118,'WAH BASIC - Estes Park, CO, US | Gail Mclain',NULL,'weekly','515 Grand Estates Dr.','CO',NULL,'Estes Park','80517','US',-105.4955580,40.3788690,'Colorado',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:57',0,'men','2024-01-18 15:20:57','2024-01-21 15:20:57',NULL,'Definitely bring; your Bible, journal, water bottle, bath towels, and multi layers for various weather conditions in the high country. If you are traveling by air and unable to bring bulky items, please let us know and we will be glad to provide those for you.\r\nFor your free time (approx. 3 hrs.) bring; hiking gear, mountain climbing gear, mountain bikes, horse back riding and ATV rentals are also available!\r\nIdeas for free time; hiking, biking, sailing, kayaking, reading, journaling, snowshoeing... However you enjoy spending alone time with God!\r\nMost of all, bring an open heart! We\'ll provide the rest!',31700,434550,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9405\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"515 Grand Estates Dr.\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Estes Park\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"80517\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"40.378869\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-105.495558\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Colorado\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-estes-park-co-us-gail-mclain-2',NULL,'2023-11-14 01:11:09','2024-04-10 15:20:57'),
	('9bc65bca-17c7-4239-ad1f-5b8c625a90a8',2,1558,'WAH BASIC - Garden City, UT, US | Adam Salisbury',NULL,'weekly','334 N 130 W','UT',NULL,'Garden City','84028','US',-111.3960550,41.9524060,'Utah',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:57',0,'men','2024-01-17 15:20:58','2024-01-20 15:20:58',NULL,'Please send me a text message or email if you are interested in signing up.\r\n\r\nWe will be staying at my house in Garden City. You can view the house here: https://www.vacasa.com/unit/47152\r\nThis should be the best you ever sleep at a bootcamp.\r\n\r\nThe cost will depend on how many people come, but right now I am estimating it to be $300. This will cover the cost of materials provided along with the food and cleaning fee for the house. Included items:\r\n\r\n•	Wild at Heart book (if you have one, you will give this new one away)\r\n•	Field Study Guide\r\n•	Field Notes (places for taking notes)\r\n•	Pen\r\n•	Water bottle\r\n\r\nThe cost does not compensate me at all, it\'s just to pay for the items mentioned above.\r\n\r\nI will require a deposit of $100 to secure your spot and the remaining amount will be due by January 8th. My Venmo is: @Adam-Salisbury87\r\n\r\nWe will arrive Wednesday evening and depart Saturday evening. It\'s important to get here Wednesday evening because I am condensing down the BASIC from 4 days to 3. You\'ll only need to take Thursday/Friday off of work. \r\n\r\nHere is a basic packing list:\r\n\r\n•	Swimsuit (there is an indoor pool)\r\n•	Flashlight (No smartphone flashlights)\r\n•	3-days of clothing\r\n•	Outerwear (check whether for Garden City, UT)\r\n•	Hiking boots (snow boots for winter)\r\n•	Toiletries (The property has some shampoo and body soap)\r\n•	Prescriptions\r\n•	Scriptures (optional)\r\n•	A watch (No smartphone clocks)\r\n\r\nPLEASE reach out to me with any questions. I’m happy to have men gather to strengthen our brotherhood and relationship with God.',31712,473723,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9420\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"334 N 130 W\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Garden City\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"UT\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"84028\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"41.952406\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-111.396055\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Utah\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-garden-city-ut-us-adam-salisbury',NULL,'2023-11-15 09:11:42','2024-04-10 15:20:58'),
	('9bc65bca-33fe-4cf2-a43f-0714e472102f',3,1559,'CORE - Pine, AZ, US | Brittany Butler',NULL,'weekly','3457 Ridge Trail','AZ',NULL,'Pine','85544','US',-111.4565840,34.3800790,'Arizona',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:20:58',0,'men','2024-01-12 15:20:58','2024-01-15 15:20:58',NULL,'Limited to 8 attendees. Full amount due to reserve your spot. Fully refundable before January 1, 2024. $300 per person includes all meals and snacks during retreat and a twin bunk bed in a shared room (4 spots remaining). $350 per person includes all meals and snacks during retreat and a private queen bedroom (1 spot remaining). All food will have alternative allergy/dietary restriction options available. However, please disclose any food allergies. There may be snow so please pack accordingly. Bring a swimsuit if you plan to enjoy the jacuzzi! Text/call/email for registration.\r\nAttendees are responsible for their own transportation.',31606,449804,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9307\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"3457 Ridge Trail\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Pine\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"AZ\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"85544\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"34.380079\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-111.456584\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Arizona\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/core-pine-az-us-brittany-butler',NULL,'2023-09-27 09:09:12','2024-04-10 15:20:58'),
