	('9bc65bcd-83ad-4398-a244-4291a545f00f',2,1581,'WAH BASIC - Grosse Pointe Farms, MI, US | Robert Kinnear',NULL,'weekly','21 Waverly Ln','MI',NULL,'Grosse Pointe Farms','48236','US',-82.8879720,42.4117900,'Michigan',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:00',0,'men','2023-11-02 15:21:00','2023-11-05 15:21:00',NULL,'',31467,426126,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9139\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"21 Waverly Ln\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Grosse Pointe Farms\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MI\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"48236\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"42.411790\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-82.887972\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Michigan\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-grosse-pointe-farms-mi-us-robert-kinnear',NULL,'2023-08-15 08:08:01','2024-04-10 15:21:00'),
	('9bc65bcd-a041-484c-bf37-4f84cff59fdd',4,1451,'BECOMING A KING RETREAT- Copperhill, TN, US | Phil Gable',NULL,'weekly','703 Golf Course Road ','GA',NULL,'Copperhill','37317','US',-84.3257830,35.0357370,'Georgia',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:00',0,'men','2023-11-02 15:21:00','2023-11-05 15:21:00',NULL,'Registration website - https://lifeimpact.com/becoming-a-king/\r\n\r\nWhen: Thurs-Sun, November 2-5, 2023 (arrive between 3:30pm and 5:00pm Thursday, depart after 12:30 Sunday)\r\n\r\nWhere: Whitewater Express Retreat Center\r\nhttps://ocoee.whitewaterexpress.com/\r\n\r\nClosest airports: Atlanta (Approx 2.5 hours with traffic); Chattanooga (Less than 1.5 hours); Knoxville (Less than 2 hours)\r\n\r\nAccommodations: Overnight lodging will be in cabins, bunk style. All cabins have electricity and air conditioning and provide a rustic yet comfortable experience. There is a restroom and shower inside each cabin, with additional restrooms and showers in bathhouses throughout the camp. You can request a roommate, otherwise roommates will be assigned.\r\n\r\nCost: $275, includes lodging, all meals, camp activities, and retreat content.\r\n\r\nWe will be spending the weekend on 500 acres tucked into the rolling hills of East Tennessee, near the Georgia/Tennessee/North Carolina border. Free time is built into the retreat on Friday and Saturday afternoons. On-site and nearby activities are available including hiking, fishing, frisbee golf, etc. An optional adventure activity is also included (horseback riding, paintball, or high ropes course). You may want to bring a hammock and find a quiet spot by a stream to rest and soak in God’s beauty. In the evenings we will have a campfire. Bring a comfortable camp chair to sit in for sessions.',31171,435057,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8816\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"703 Golf Course Road \\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Copperhill\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"GA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"37317\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"35.035737\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-84.325783\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Georgia\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/becoming-king-retreat-copperhill-tn-us-phil-gable',NULL,'2023-05-24 05:05:29','2024-04-10 15:21:00'),
	('9bc65bcd-bcc8-490c-b77d-11dd1b25e150',4,1582,'BECOMING A KING RETREAT- Auckland, NZ | Rob Porter',NULL,'weekly','Hunua Falls Presbyterian Camp',NULL,NULL,'Auckland','2583','NZ',175.0897740,-37.0687720,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:00',0,'men','2023-11-02 15:21:00','2023-11-05 15:21:00',NULL,'FORMAT:\r\n\r\n•  The event centres around a series of video sessions, curated by Morgan Snyder and the Become Good Soil team in Colorado.\r\n\r\n•  Men will be assigned to a story group for the duration of the event.\r\n\r\n----------------------------\r\n\r\nLOCATION:\r\n\r\n•  Hunua Falls Presbyterian Camp at 203 Falls Road Hunua. \r\n\r\n•  The camp is adjacent to the Hunua Regional Park, just south of Auckland. \r\n\r\n•  Our hope is that you will be able to step away from the front lines of your life and enter into a culture and environment that awakens your heart and your intimacy with God. \r\n\r\n----------------------------\r\n\r\nCOSTS:\r\n\r\nWe don\'t want any man to be put off by the cost - so if you need to talk to one of our team about what is affordable for you please do and we will try to help. \r\n\r\nAlso, if you would like to subsidise for another man to attend please let us know.\r\n\r\nOtherwise, costs are as follows: \r\n\r\n•  $280 per person (NZ dollars)\r\n\r\n•  Included: This gets you everything you will need once you arrive - all meals, materials, facilities and a place to rest your head for 3 nights. \r\n\r\n•  We are asking for the full amount to be paid upfront as spaces are limited and we need to make a financial commitment to the Hunua Camp in order to secure the booking. That said, if something comes up after paying that prevents your attendance, we will do our best to refund the costs. \r\n\r\nWe encourage you to prayerfully be all in from day one.\r\n\r\n----------------------------\r\n\r\nREGISTRATION:\r\n\r\nPlease confirm your attendance by…\r\n\r\n1. Emailing: letskeeprising@gmail.com with the following details…\r\n\r\n•  Full name and age\r\n•  How you heard about the event\r\n•  Email address\r\n•  Contact phone number\r\n•  Dietary requirements\r\n•  T-shirt size\r\n•  If you would be able to subsidise another man to attend\r\n\r\n2. Send your payments to:\r\n\r\nName: BAK (Becoming A King) retreat Nov 2023\r\nBank details: 06-0193-0967161-01\r\n\r\nRegistration closes: Friday 8th September 2023\r\n\r\n----------------------------\r\n\r\nWHAT TO BRING:\r\n\r\nBring yourself, an open heart, something to write with, the scriptures and clothes you are comfortable in - there will be some free time and the opportunity to be outside including walking tracks in the Hunua Regional Park. More details will be emailed to you closer to the event.\r\n\r\nThe retreat will be a media-free zone and we will have safe storage for all of your devices for the duration of the retreat (phone, tablets, iwatches etc) - there will be an emergency number manned so your loved ones can reach you in case of need.\r\n\r\n----------------------------\r\n\r\nDATES:\r\n\r\nArrival: \r\nThursday 2nd November 2023 by 5:30pm\r\n\r\nDepart: \r\nSunday 5th November 2023 by 2pm\r\n\r\n----------------------------\r\n\r\nWHO WILL BE THERE AND HOW MANY?\r\n\r\nHonestly, we don\'t know - but God does. We expect up to 50 men to attend.',31357,373487,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9009\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"Hunua Falls Presbyterian Camp\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"203 Falls Road, Hunua\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Auckland\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"2583\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"nz\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"-37.068772\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"175.089774\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"New Zealand\\\"}\"','/becoming-king-retreat-auckland-nz-rob-porter',NULL,'2023-07-09 08:07:40','2024-04-10 15:21:00'),
	('9bc65bcd-d8c4-47c3-82ad-152b05d2051c',3,1474,'CORE - George, IA, US | Wanda Van Otterloo',NULL,'weekly','2445 Jackson Ave','IA',NULL,'George','51237','US',-96.0597670,43.2979240,'Iowa',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:00',0,'men','2023-11-02 15:21:00','2023-11-05 15:21:00',NULL,'All meals, bedding, towels will be provided. There is a hot tub you can relax in , so bring your swim suit. We live in the  country so there is plenty of space for long walks or just want to sit on the porch and relax. The cost for the retreat is $ 185.00 . We would like a 50.00 deposit to save your spot.',31564,438752,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9254\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"2445 Jackson Ave\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"George\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"IA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"51237\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"43.297924\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-96.059767\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Iowa\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/core-george-ia-us-wanda-van-otterloo-2',NULL,'2023-09-12 10:09:54','2024-04-10 15:21:00'),
	('9bc65bcd-f5fd-46fa-86b3-3015590a5423',2,1583,'WAH BASIC - West Pymble, NSW, AU | Steve Stokes',NULL,'weekly','6 Patterson Ave',NULL,NULL,'West Pymble','2073','AU',151.1258700,-33.7643380,'New South Wales',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:00',0,'men','2023-11-02 15:21:00','2023-11-05 15:21:00',NULL,'Blue Mountians , House Accomadation. Local bushwalks .',31608,417098,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9310\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"6 Patterson Ave\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"West Pymble\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"NSW\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"2073\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"au\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"-33.764338\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"151.125870\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"New South Wales\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"Australia\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-west-pymble-nsw-au-steve-stokes',NULL,'2023-09-27 09:09:02','2024-04-10 15:21:00'),
	('9bc65bce-133b-45c3-810e-09288dd2ba17',4,1584,'BECOMING A KING RETREAT- Ramona, OK, US | Neil Thomas ',NULL,'weekly','38009 US-75','OK',NULL,'Ramona','74061','US',-95.9268130,36.4602690,'Oklahoma',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:00',0,'men','2023-11-02 15:21:00','2023-11-05 15:21:00',NULL,'This event is held at Jarrett Farm Resort (https://www.jarrettfarmresort.com/) in the beautiful rolling hills of Northeast Oklahoma, just a short 20 minute drive from Tulsa.\r\nWe are limited to 24 spots.\r\nYou can find a registration link at https://www.highlandsok.com/ or https://forms.gle/g8W5UtiuLsgLgKct9',31308,419687,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8960\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"38009 US-75\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Ramona\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"OK\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"74061\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"36.460269\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-95.926813\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Oklahoma\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/becoming-king-retreat-ramona-ok-us-neil-thomas%C2%A0',NULL,'2023-06-24 03:06:04','2024-04-10 15:21:00'),
	('9bc65bce-2f53-4cd3-8b4c-918a2c361bcf',2,1585,'WAH BASIC - Sapello, NM, US | Ryan Likes',NULL,'weekly','44 County Road A28','NM',NULL,'Sapello','87445','US',-105.3168590,35.8047890,'New Mexico',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:00',0,'men','2023-11-02 15:21:00','2023-11-05 15:21:00',NULL,'Held on 5 beautiful acres near Hermit\'s Peak, this will be a \"glamping\" experience. So bring things you would for camping:\r\n- Layers of Clothes anticipating the weather\r\n- Sleeping bag (everyone will either be sleeping in a teepee or cabin)\r\n- Hiking boots/shoes\r\n- Fishing gear or other outdoor rec gear if so desired',31560,175033,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9250\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"44 County Road A28\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Sapello\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"NM\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"87445\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"35.804789\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-105.316859\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"New Mexico\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-sapello-nm-us-ryan-likes',NULL,'2023-09-10 02:09:52','2024-04-10 15:21:00'),
	('9bc65bce-4cd1-46ef-8d20-9c6e562b1857',2,1444,'WAH BASIC - Gaston, SC, US | Ray Schmidt',NULL,'weekly','750 Boy Scout Rd','SC',NULL,'Gaston','29053','US',-81.1238390,33.8489280,'South Carolina',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:00',0,'men','2023-11-02 15:21:00','2023-11-05 15:21:00',NULL,'\"If then you are wise, you will show yourself rather as a reservoir than as a canal. A canal spreads abroad water as it receives it, but a reservoir waits until it is filled before overflowing, and thus without loss to itself [it shares] its superabundant water.\" - Bernard of Clairvaux\r\n\r\nMost of us spend the majority of our time working. Working to provide for our wives and families. Working to serve our churches. Working in our community. Working, working, working until we are burned out to a crackling crunch. Dry and parched in a land that just keeps demanding more.\r\n\r\nAre you thirsty? Could you use some refreshment? A double shot caramel mocha latte? Or maybe what you really need is just a deep draught of living water?\r\n\r\nIf you are caring for others out of what is flowing through you instead of out of the overflow of God within you, BASIC is an opportunity for you to join other men and unplug from “The Matrix.” An opportunity for you to reconnect with God in the context of the most essential component of your identity … who you are as a man.\r\n\r\nBASIC is the Wild at Heart Boot Camp led by John Eldredge and his team via video followed by times alone with God by the lake or in the woods. There is also time set aside for you to fish, canoe, kayak, hike, or just chill. Whatever your heart needs.\r\n\r\nThis is not a retreat about the “Seven things you ought to do to be a better man.” This event is a unique opportunity to begin a quest to recover your masculine soul, to reengage your passion, and remember who God called you to be. First as a man. Second as a husband and father. Third in the service of others.',31349,16584,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8999\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"750 Boy Scout Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Gaston\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"SC\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"29053\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"33.848928\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-81.123839\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"South Carolina\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-gaston-sc-us-ray-schmidt-0',NULL,'2023-07-05 07:07:56','2024-04-10 15:21:00'),
	('9bc65bce-6a6a-4ec8-951c-fa88d1b878fc',2,1586,'WAH BASIC - Estes Park, CO, US | Kelly Schroeder',NULL,'weekly','2515 Tunnel Rd','CO',NULL,'Estes Park','80511','US',-105.5661540,40.3403700,'Colorado',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:00',0,'men','2023-11-02 15:21:00','2023-11-05 15:21:00',NULL,'',31579,249202,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9276\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"2515 Tunnel Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Estes Park\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"80511\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"40.340370\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-105.566154\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Colorado\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-estes-park-co-us-kelly-schroeder',NULL,'2023-09-14 07:09:45','2024-04-10 15:21:00'),
