	('9bc65bd0-8ebd-4f0f-b04b-d5e7bc01dea3',2,573,'WAH BASIC - Marble Falls, TX, US | Marc Bonasso',NULL,'weekly','1552 CR 344','TX',NULL,'Marble Falls','78654','US',-98.1679360,30.5432620,'Texas',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:02',0,'men','2023-10-26 15:21:02','2023-10-29 15:21:02',NULL,'Wild at Heart BASIC @ Camp of the Hills - Marble Falls, Texas\r\nThursday Evening, October 26 – Sunday at Noon, October 29\r\n\r\nREGISTRATION\r\n*Registration is open to men 18 and older.\r\n\r\nWHAT\'S INCLUDED\r\nThe cost of attending this BASIC Event is $150. This cost includes 4 days/3 nights stay at Camp of the Hills, all meals during your stay (8 meals beginning Thursday PM) and certain amenities at the camp. All Wild at Heart video content and materials are generously provided by Wild at Heart at no cost.\r\n\r\nWHAT TO BRING:\r\nBunk House Lodging is included in the registration price. You will be staying at various bunk houses on the property. These are communal cabins with twin beds, indoor toilets and showers, AC and Heating. You will need to bring your own linens: Towels, twin sheets, blanket, pillow, or sleeping bag. Journals and pens will be provided.\r\n\r\nOPENING NIGHT:\r\nCheck-in is from 4:30p-6p on Thursday evening, dinner will be from 6-7p, and the opening session for the BASIC will begin promptly at 7:30p.\r\n\r\nLOCATION\r\nThis BASIC event is taking place at Camp of the Hills Retreat Center in Marble Falls, Texas: \r\nhttps://www.campofthehills.org\r\n\r\nCAMP AMENITIES \r\nThe following amenities will be available to the BASIC event attendees on Friday and Saturday afternoon during free time:\r\n\r\n1. Covered Pavilion Area (open space with optional basketball courts, 9 square, gaga ball, etc.)\r\n2. Sand Volleyball Court\r\n3. Fishing Ponds (Catch and Release ONLY)\r\n4. Lakefront access to Lake Travis with boat ramp\r\n5. Soccer and Softball fields with bathroom facilities\r\n6. Picnic Table areas\r\n7. Scenic overlook at The Crosses with a seating area and amazing view of sunset &amp; lake – perfect for devotionals and other small gatherings.\r\n8. Hiking Trails',31421,218702,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9083\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"1552 CR 344\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Marble Falls\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"TX\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"78654\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"30.543262\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-98.167936\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Texas\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-marble-falls-tx-us-marc-bonasso-0',NULL,'2023-08-01 11:08:03','2024-04-10 15:21:02'),
	('9bc65bd0-abb6-4be7-8bba-f3e2105abcd4',2,45,'WAH BASIC - Ipswich, SFK, GB | Paul Boulton',NULL,'weekly','',NULL,NULL,'Ipswich','','GB',1.1482200,52.0567360,'Suffolk',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:02',0,'men','2023-10-26 15:21:02','2023-10-29 15:21:02',NULL,'Accommodation and all meals are provided on site (you’ll just need to bring a pillow, sleeping bag and towel). \r\nAll dietary requirements can be catered for - please provide these via email.\r\nThere is a swimming pool on-site and the option of guided walks - so please pack outdoor shoes and swim kit if this is something you want to do.\r\nAlso we’ll have fire pits in the evening with bring and share drinks - so feel free to bring your favourite tipple!',31591,408125,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9290\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Ipswich\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"SFK\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"gb\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"52.056736\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"1.148220\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Suffolk\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United Kingdom\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-ipswich-sfk-gb-paul-boulton',NULL,'2023-09-21 12:09:47','2024-04-10 15:21:02'),
