	('9bc65bd1-0143-443b-bcac-8c3db7d5fd45',6,1599,'CAPTIVATING - Twin Falls, ID, US | Kayla Cuellar',NULL,'weekly','','ID',NULL,'Twin Falls','','US',-114.4700520,42.5558380,'Idaho',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:02',0,'women','2023-10-29 15:21:02',NULL,NULL,'We will be meeting in a home, in Twin Falls, ID.  We are planning for about 10-12  and we have limited space, so please reach out asap if you want to join us.  On that note, we are open to moving the venue if there are more women than we expect but the sooner we know that, the better!\r\n\r\nAs soon as you are confirmed we\'ll get you the address for the small group.\r\n\r\nThe fine details:\r\n\r\nDates we are meeting\r\nSunday, October 29\r\nTuesday, November 7\r\nTuesday, November 14\r\n\r\nTime: 7:00pm\r\n\r\nWe will be fast-tracking this little journey in order to be finished before Thanksgiving week so we will be working through two lessons per night within a two hour period.\r\n\r\n\r\nWe are so excited to share this with you!  May God bless you with courage and a desire to discover more through this  journey.',31656,437618,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9355\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Twin Falls\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"ID\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"42.555838\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-114.470052\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Idaho\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/captivating/small-group/captivating-twin-falls-id-us-kayla-cuellar',NULL,'2023-10-23 04:10:15','2024-04-10 15:21:02'),
	('9bc65bd1-1ebf-499d-b567-545562f68c65',5,1600,'WILD AT HEART - Rifle, CO, US | Josh Allison',NULL,'weekly','200 County Rd 219 ','CO',NULL,'Rifle','81650','US',-107.7778370,39.6480080,'Colorado',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:02',0,'men','2023-10-25 15:21:02',NULL,NULL,'Open to current prisoners at the Rifle Correctional Center only. If you know an prisoner at RCC, please encourage them to join at the Inter-Faith building by attending church service on Saturday evenings from 6-8 PM.',31646,463721,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9345\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"200 County Rd 219 \\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Rifle\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"81650\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"39.648008\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-107.777837\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Colorado\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wildatheart/small-group/wild-heart-rifle-co-us-josh-allison',NULL,'2023-10-19 03:10:13','2024-04-10 15:21:02'),
	('9bc65bd1-3b21-4afd-a2ab-99d82422f44a',3,1601,'CORE - Somerset, KY, US | Gina Thornton',NULL,'weekly','2600 Close Rd','KY',NULL,'Somerset','42501','US',-84.3116830,37.0337630,'Kentucky',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:02',0,'men','2023-10-19 15:21:02','2023-10-22 15:21:02',NULL,'Register here:\r\nhttps://form.jotform.com/232257142254147',31463,409886,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9134\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"2600 Close Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Somerset\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"KY\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"42501\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"37.033763\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-84.311683\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Kentucky\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/core-somerset-ky-us-gina-thornton',NULL,'2023-08-14 05:08:47','2024-04-10 15:21:02'),
	('9bc65bd1-57a3-42cf-8d76-caffc2f61d9e',2,1448,'WAH BASIC - Woodworth, LA, US | Joe Pasqua',NULL,'weekly','300 Bayou Clear Road','LA',NULL,'Woodworth','71485','US',-92.5228490,31.1343180,'Louisiana',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:02',0,'men','2023-10-19 15:21:02','2023-10-22 15:21:02',NULL,'Hello, men. We are less than two months out from Basic, and we are pumped for what Father will do in your lives over the course of this weekend!\r\n\r\nGo to this Brushfire website to register and pay: https://bayoubandofbrothers.brushfire.com/camp/553535\r\n\r\nThe cost is $225.00 and covers every required expense: lodging, meals, drinks, snacks, coffee, and more.\r\n\r\nBring a comfy folding or lawn chair and a journal w/pen - you\'ll be using them a lot. You may want to bring walking shoes or boots to explore the campground. There are two small lakes to fish and kayak in.\r\n\r\nWe will send you a confirmation email separate from Brushfire, make updates here and will put out scouting reports to your email prior to the weekend.\r\n\r\nUnite with us in prayer as we seek Father, Jesus, and Holy Spirit\'s heart for this weekend. Folks have been praying for YOU before you even knew you were attending - God is awesome.\r\n\r\nBegin seeking what God has for you! He shows up every time!',18214,402187,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7947\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"300 Bayou Clear Road\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Woodworth\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"LA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"71485\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"31.134318\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-92.522849\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Louisiana\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-woodworth-la-us-joe-pasqua',NULL,'2023-01-06 09:01:21','2024-04-10 15:21:02'),
	('9bc65bd1-74d2-41c8-a15a-4d4e6795a5bc',2,1455,'WAH BASIC - Chichester, SXW, GB |  Gidney',NULL,'weekly','Cobnor Activity Centre, Cobnor Point',NULL,NULL,'Chichester','PO18 8TE','GB',-0.8766340,50.8115490,'West Sussex',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:02',0,'men','2023-10-19 15:21:02','2023-10-22 15:21:02',NULL,'We are near the sea so there is opportunity to swim, kayak etc. The area is also good for hiking and road/mtb bikes. We always have a fire!',18316,447663,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8084\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"Cobnor Activity Centre, Cobnor Point\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"Chidham\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Chichester\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"SXW\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"PO18 8TE\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"gb\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"50.811549\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-0.876634\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"West Sussex\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United Kingdom\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-chichester-sxw-gb-gidney',NULL,'2023-01-18 11:01:59','2024-04-10 15:21:02'),
