	('9bc65bd1-ace5-43f7-8c2e-a2bc1e73530d',2,1603,'WAH BASIC - Medora, ND, US | Tyler McKay',NULL,'weekly','3892 Bible Camp Rd','ND',NULL,'Medora','58645','US',-103.5310680,46.8491110,'North Dakota',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:02',0,'men','2023-10-19 15:21:02','2023-10-22 15:21:02',NULL,'To register or for more information on this and other future events, please visit us at: \r\nbelovedsons.net',18017,399054,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7739\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"3892 Bible Camp Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Medora\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"ND\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"58645\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"46.849111\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-103.531068\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"North Dakota\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-medora-nd-us-tyler-mckay-2',NULL,'2022-11-01 11:11:02','2024-04-10 15:21:02'),
	('9bc65bd1-ca5e-45b4-9904-1664b3611b4f',4,1604,'BECOMING A KING RETREAT- Elizabeth City, NC, US | Patrick Whipple',NULL,'weekly','2008 Asbury Dr.','NC',NULL,'Elizabeth City','27909','US',-76.1876790,36.2781680,'North Carolina',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:02',0,'men','2023-10-19 15:21:03','2023-10-22 15:21:03',NULL,'The river is a mile wide. \r\nWe have access to a few small boats.\r\nWe’re an hour from the beach. \r\nBring your favorite pole if you like to fish, or use one of ours. \r\nAltitude is just above sea level. \r\nBring your raincoat in case of hurricane.',31552,191775,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9238\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"2008 Asbury Dr.\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Elizabeth City\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"NC\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"27909\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"36.278168\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-76.187679\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"North Carolina\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/becoming-king-retreat-elizabeth-city-nc-us-patrick-whipple',NULL,'2023-09-06 09:09:36','2024-04-10 15:21:03'),
	('9bc65bd1-e6f5-4850-b947-90c008ed8e59',3,1605,'CORE - Parkville, MO, US | Erin Cox',NULL,'weekly','16965 MO-45 ','MO',NULL,'Parkville','64152','US',-94.7810930,39.2280640,'Missouri',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:03',0,'men','2023-10-19 15:21:03','2023-10-22 15:21:03',NULL,'We will be staying at Trask Lodge located within the beautiful 320 acre Heartland Retreat Center in Parkville, Missouri which is just outside of Kansas City.  Lodging is three dormitory style bedrooms with 2-3 bunk-beds in each room (4-6 beds per room).  There are three full bathrooms as well as a kitchen and an outdoor fire ring.  The lodge also has a large front porch.  Please bring your own twin bedding, pillow and blanket as well as a towel and toiletries.  Plan to dress in layers as the temperature can vary quite a lot in October in Missouri and we will be spending some time outdoors in fellowship as well as any hiking and exploring of the property.  \r\n\r\nCost includes your lodging and all meals/snacks/beverages from Thursday dinner through Sunday lunch. \r\n\r\nEarly bird pricing before September 1st is $275 and will be $300 after that. \r\n\r\nDon\'t hesitate to reach out with any questions.',31228,445443,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8872\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"16965 MO-45 \\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Parkville\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"64152\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"39.228064\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-94.781093\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Missouri\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/core-parkville-mo-us-erin-cox',NULL,'2023-06-06 03:06:27','2024-04-10 15:21:03'),
	('9bc65bd2-02af-416a-87cf-368c8466872b',3,1606,'CORE - Kinard, FL, US | Micah Duke',NULL,'weekly','11636 Chipola Park Rd','FL',NULL,'Kinard','32449','US',-85.1960280,30.2271120,'Florida',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:03',0,'men','2023-10-19 15:21:03','2023-10-22 15:21:03',NULL,'Registration Cost: $225\r\nRegistration includes lodging, all meals, and activities.\r\nTowels and Linens are provided.\r\nContact Kayla Duke or Jessie Pippin for more information.\r\n(540) 521-5709 or (850) 227-6850\r\nPlease follow this link to register. https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSc1CaBRbtWnqiuWKB-kwsL2j03Mk7q4vWtPYjtVOJSGlYNf0g/viewform',31000,339525,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8637\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"11636 Chipola Park Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Kinard\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"FL\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"32449\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"30.227112\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-85.196028\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Florida\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/core-kinard-fl-us-micah-duke',NULL,'2023-04-20 04:04:14','2024-04-10 15:21:03'),
	('9bc65bd2-1e32-40f8-b51a-2663cb628e67',3,1552,'CORE - Hilton Head, SC, US | Becky Locke',NULL,'weekly','','SC',NULL,'Hilton Head','','US',-80.7526080,32.2163160,'South Carolina',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:03',0,'men','2023-10-19 15:21:03','2023-10-22 15:21:03',NULL,'Dress for the weekend is casual. There will be opportunities for walking along the beach and soaking in a hot tub, so pack a bathing suit and comfortable clothes.',31405,469275,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9065\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Hilton Head\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"SC\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"32.216316\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-80.752608\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"South Carolina\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/core-hilton-head-sc-us-becky-locke',NULL,'2023-07-26 08:07:31','2024-04-10 15:21:03'),
	('9bc65bd2-3b65-4e79-85ab-ac061d09b22e',2,1607,'WAH BASIC - Mannford, OK, US | Matthew Baker',NULL,'weekly','2956 State Hwy 48','OK',NULL,'Mannford','74044','US',-96.3965270,36.1215010,'Oklahoma',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:03',0,'men','2023-10-14 15:21:03','2023-10-17 15:21:03',NULL,'',31387,443820,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9044\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"2956 State Hwy 48\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Mannford\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"OK\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"74044\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"36.121501\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-96.396527\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Oklahoma\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-mannford-ok-us-matthew-baker-0',NULL,'2023-07-22 10:07:42','2024-04-10 15:21:03'),
	('9bc65bd2-5766-420c-a561-08791ec0ef7b',4,396,'BECOMING A KING RETREAT- Bennington, KS, US | Todd Just',NULL,'weekly','','KS',NULL,'Bennington','67422','US',-97.5941990,39.0305560,'Kansas',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:03',0,'men','2023-10-12 15:21:03','2023-10-15 15:21:03',NULL,'',31430,228256,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9093\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Bennington\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"KS\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"67422\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"39.030556\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-97.594199\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Kansas\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/becoming-king-retreat-bennington-ks-us-todd-just-0',NULL,'2023-08-07 09:08:02','2024-04-10 15:21:03'),
	('9bc65bd2-72ec-44e4-b077-613e85e9cf15',2,118,'WAH BASIC - Estes Park, CO, US | Gail Mclain',NULL,'weekly','515 Grand Estates Dr.','CO',NULL,'Estes Park','80517','US',-105.4955580,40.3788690,'Colorado',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:03',0,'men','2023-10-12 15:21:03','2023-10-15 15:21:03',NULL,'Definitely bring;  your Bible, journal, water bottle, bath towels, and multi layers for various weather conditions in the high country.  If you are traveling by air and unable to bring bulky items, please let us know and we will be glad to provide those for you.  \r\n\r\nFor your free time (approx. 3 hrs.) bring; hiking gear, mountain climbing gear, mountain bikes, horse back riding and ATV rentals are also available!  \r\n\r\nIdeas for free time; hiking, biking, sailing, kayaking, reading, journaling, snowshoeing... However you enjoy spending alone time with God!  \r\n\r\nMost of all, bring a warm and open heart!  We\'ll provide the chocolate!',18970,434550,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8536\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"515 Grand Estates Dr.\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Estes Park\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"80517\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"40.378869\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-105.495558\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Colorado\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-estes-park-co-us-gail-mclain-1',NULL,'2023-03-24 11:03:41','2024-04-10 15:21:03'),
	('9bc65bd2-8f72-471e-9af0-e27658005faf',2,1608,'WAH BASIC - Rocksprings, TX, US | Rodney Fischer',NULL,'weekly','6424 Hackberry Rd','TX',NULL,'Rocksprings','78880','US',-99.9588640,29.9769320,'Texas',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:03',0,'men','2023-10-12 15:21:03','2023-10-15 15:21:03',NULL,'Bring your Bibles and expectations for God to reveal himself as we take time to step away from the daily grind to enjoy His creation along with the WAH sessions.  Rocksprings is in the hill country of Texas, so you will want to bring whatever this means for you: hiking, swimming, kayaking, fishing, and just relaxing!  If interested, we also have access to a shooting range, pistol range, and shotgun range.  So, bring your guns and ammo of choice!',31448,445903,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9116\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"6424 Hackberry Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Rocksprings\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"TX\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"78880\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"29.976932\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-99.958864\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Texas\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-rocksprings-tx-us-rodney-fischer-1',NULL,'2023-08-13 09:08:51','2024-04-10 15:21:03'),
	('9bc65bd2-abdd-42be-9cab-80c6f2eccb89',4,1609,'BECOMING A KING RETREAT- Shaftesbury, DOR, GB | Richard Ellison',NULL,'weekly','Lox Lane Retreat Centre',NULL,NULL,'Shaftesbury','SP7 9PU','GB',-2.2427930,51.0149150,'Dorset',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:03',0,'men','2023-10-12 15:21:03','2023-10-15 15:21:03',NULL,'12th - arrival 16.15-18.00\r\n\r\n15th - depart by 12.00 if you need to be away\r\n\r\nCost \r\n\r\nWe don\'t want any man to be put off by the cost - so if you need to talk to one of our team about what is affordable for you please do and we will help.  Otherwise, costs are as follows:\r\n\r\nHappy to share a room - £295\r\nSingle room preferred - £360\r\n\r\nThis gets you everything you will need once you arrive - meals, materials, facilities and a place to rest your head in a beautiful location\r\n\r\nWe are asking for the full amount to be paid upfront as spaces are limited and we need to make a financial commitment to Lox Lane in order to secure the booking.  That said, if something comes up after paying that prevents your attendance, we will do our best to refund the costs, provided we get a refund from Lox Lane.  Needless to say,  we  encourage you to prayerfully be all in from day one.\r\n\r\nPlease confirm your attendance by replying to via email (richard.ellison104@gmail.com) and send your payment to:\r\n\r\nAndrew Walsh\r\nNationwide\r\nAccount Number: 337 99 876\r\nSort Code:  07-01-16\r\n\r\nWhat will I need to bring?\r\n\r\nBring yourself, an open heart, something to write with, the scriptures and clothes you are comfortable in - there will be some free time and the opportunity to be outside\r\n\r\nPractices to help us slow down and hear God\r\n\r\nThe retreat will be a media free zone and we will have safe storage for all of your devices (phone, tablets iwatches etc)- there will be an emergency number manned so your loved ones can reach you in case of need.\r\n\r\nAs men we so often credentialise ourselves by our job - so we each commit to being a Chimney Sweep for the retreat and talking about our job as our sweep if we need to to tell our story -  we all come as equals made in the imago dei - the image of God\r\n\r\nWho will be there and how many?\r\n\r\nHonestly we don\'t know -God does.  But what can we tell you now?  We expect between 15-25 men but can cater for up to roughly double that.  We have invited Men we know and have journeyed with us first but this is also a public event open to those seeking the BAKR retreat on the Wild at Heart Website.  The retreat will be public from shortly after the Coronation weekend.\r\n\r\nMen from 18 upwards are welcome.',31094,408096,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8743\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"Lox Lane Retreat Centre\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Shaftesbury\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"DOR\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"SP7 9PU\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"gb\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"51.014915\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-2.242793\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Dorset\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United Kingdom\\\"}\"','/becoming-king-retreat-shaftesbury-dor-gb-richard-ellison',NULL,'2023-05-08 04:05:05','2024-04-10 15:21:03'),
