	('9bc65bd3-5760-4a5a-87cf-46160861c379',2,1614,'WAH BASIC - Arden, NC, US | Norman Brahen',NULL,'weekly','2511 Hendersonville Rd','NC',NULL,'Arden','28704','US',-82.5117290,35.4578170,'North Carolina',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:04',0,'men','2023-10-05 15:21:04','2023-10-08 15:21:04',NULL,'There are some easy hiking areas so light hiking clothes are optional. \r\nThere will be a campfire at least one night maybe two. \r\n\r\nTo register go to this site:\r\n\r\nWild at Heart Men\'s Retreat October 5-8, 2023 | Church of the Holy Cross\r\n\r\nholycross.net\r\nhttps://www.holycross.net › mens',31069,453656,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8719\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"2511 Hendersonville Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Arden\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"NC\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"28704\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"35.457817\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-82.511729\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"North Carolina\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-arden-nc-us-norman-brahen',NULL,'2023-05-02 01:05:30','2024-04-10 15:21:04'),
	('9bc65bd3-7302-49b6-835d-cf9cb20c31ab',2,289,'WAH BASIC - Troy, MT, US | Philip Soucy',NULL,'weekly','776 Gus Creek road','MT',NULL,'Troy','59935','US',-78.2464920,37.9508390,'Montana',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:04',0,'men','2023-10-05 15:21:04','2023-10-08 15:21:04',NULL,'Lodging will be in cabins and wall tent. Bring some warm cloths as October in the Yaak river valley can get chilly. There is no charge for this event. If you long to go deeper, we have a couple of spots left.',31479,108120,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9153\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"776 Gus Creek road\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Troy\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MT\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"59935\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"37.950839\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-78.246492\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Montana\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-troy-mt-us-philip-soucy-2',NULL,'2023-08-19 10:08:07','2024-04-10 15:21:04'),
	('9bc65bd3-8fb2-458e-91c1-7d72638af9ef',2,1615,'WAH BASIC - Ocean Shores, WA, US | John Divine',NULL,'weekly','381 Lake Bay Loop','WA',NULL,'Ocean Shores','98569','US',-124.1422670,46.9754300,'Washington',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:04',0,'men','2023-10-05 15:21:04','2023-10-08 15:21:04',NULL,'This is on the Washington coast in early fall so bring warm clothes and rain gear if you want to go outside. There will be kayaking, biking and beach activities depending on the weather. Bring your own bikes or kayaks though some are available on site. \r\n\r\nThe only cost of this weekend is sharing the cost of the food.',31200,466705,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8843\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"381 Lake Bay Loop\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Ocean Shores\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"WA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"98569\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"46.975430\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-124.142267\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Washington\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-ocean-shores-wa-us-john-divine',NULL,'2023-05-31 07:05:46','2024-04-10 15:21:04'),
