	('9bc65bd3-e7ee-44d4-acf1-7856c0f91deb',2,1617,'WAH BASIC - West Lebanon , IN, US | Jay Bennett',NULL,'weekly','6988 South St Rd 263','IN',NULL,'West Lebanon ','47991','US',-87.3948330,40.2156010,'Indiana',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:04',0,'men','2023-10-05 15:21:04','2023-10-08 15:21:04',NULL,'Event will be at Hanging Rock Christian Camp\r\n\r\nRegistration cost $100 for meals / lodging &amp; zip lining included\r\nHorseback riding available for $35 / person for 2 - 3 hours\r\nFishing is available - bring own equipment\r\n\r\nPlease bring:\r\nhiking boots and campfire clothes\r\nSleeping bag / pillow\r\novernight toiletries',31376,404245,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9027\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"6988 South St Rd 263\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"West Lebanon \\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"IN\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"47991\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"40.215601\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-87.394833\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Indiana\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-west-lebanon-us-jay-bennett',NULL,'2023-07-18 09:07:09','2024-04-10 15:21:04'),
	('9bc65bd4-06ce-4648-86f5-5a146b1b3896',2,17,'WAH BASIC - Rocksprings, TX, US | Michael Field',NULL,'weekly','6424 Hackberry Rd','TX',NULL,'Rocksprings','78880','US',-99.9588640,29.9769320,'Texas',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:04',0,'men','2023-10-05 15:21:04','2023-10-08 15:21:04',NULL,'This event will be held at Camp Eagle. Camp Eagle is an outdoor adventure camp. The Nueces River runs through the camp and has options for fishing, kayaking and swimming. Bring your own fishing gear if you like (catch and release only).\r\nThere is also options for Hiking and Mountain biking. Bring your own bike.\r\nBreakfast, Lunch and Dinner are provided for at the camp.\r\nYou will need to bring your own Bedding and Pillow. We have made sure not to over crowd any of the rooms making it so no man has to sleep on a top bunk. Everyone will get their own bunk and share a room with 4-6 other men. You will also need your own toiletries.\r\n\r\nRecommended but not required: Camp chair, Journal, Snacks, Cooler with Drinks (no alcohol allowed at camp) \r\n\r\nCost for the event is $275 per person. This is not a father and son event. You must be 18+ to attend. Registration is on a first come first serve basis and will be full at 24 men. You are not registered for the event until we have received your funds. Please send an email to get things started.',31343,138601,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8992\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"6424 Hackberry Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Rocksprings\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"TX\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"78880\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"29.976932\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-99.958864\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Texas\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-rocksprings-tx-us-michael-field',NULL,'2023-07-02 09:07:34','2024-04-10 15:21:04'),
