	('9bc65bd5-09ee-4448-926e-cc9a5aa5f51a',3,1621,'CORE - Lewisville, TX, US | Sherri Valdez',NULL,'weekly','2680 MacArthur Blvd','TX',NULL,'Lewisville','75067','US',-96.9773900,32.9978720,'Texas',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:05',0,'men','2023-09-28 15:21:05','2023-10-01 15:21:05',NULL,'Bing your swimsuit for jacuzzi time or time at the lake, hiking shoes for exploration, and workout attire for a game of volleyball.',31267,102188,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8919\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"2680 MacArthur Blvd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Lewisville\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"TX\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"75067\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"32.997872\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-96.977390\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Texas\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/core-lewisville-tx-us-sherri-valdez',NULL,'2023-06-13 06:06:10','2024-04-10 15:21:05'),
	('9bc65bd5-2651-40a0-847a-6570ae4c63c4',2,1451,'WAH BASIC - Cleveland, GA, US | Phil Gable',NULL,'weekly','1242 Old Blue Creek Road','GA',NULL,'Cleveland','30528','US',-83.7453380,34.6063620,'Georgia',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:05',0,'men','2023-09-28 15:21:05','2023-10-01 15:21:05',NULL,'***Registration website - https://lifeimpact.com/basic/\r\n\r\nWhen: Thursday, September 28 - Sunday, October 1, 2023 (arrive between 3:30p-5:00p, Thursday, depart after 12:00p, Sunday)\r\n\r\nWhere: Woodlands Camp &amp; Retreat Center\r\nhttps://www.woodlandscamp.org\r\n\r\nClosest airports: Atlanta (1.5 hours); Chattanooga (2.5 hours); Greenville (Less than 2 hours)\r\n\r\nAccommodations: Overnight lodging will be in hotel-style rooms, meeting space in an exclusive conference room, and a private dining experience. You can request a roommate, otherwise roommates will be assigned.\r\n\r\nCost: $285, includes lodging, all meals, camp activities, and retreat content.\r\nWorking on optional adventure activities for a small fee (possibly high ropes/kayaking/offroading/etc)\r\n\r\nWe will be spending the weekend on nestled in the foothills of North Georgia\'s beautiful Blue Ridge Mountains at Woodlands Camp and Retreat Center. Woodlands is a 131-acre portrait of rolling hills, beautiful forests, and a spring-fed lake. It is a place where you can build lifelong friendships, develop unforgettable memories, and get to know the God who created it all. Woodlands has been partnering with ministries like ours since 1997 to provide unforgettable experiences where God’s presence is so significant that culture and its influences are drowned out.  \r\n\r\nFree time is built into the retreat on Friday and Saturday afternoons. On-site and nearby activities are available including field games, hiking, swimming, fishing, river tubing, etc. An adventure activity is also included (zipline, giant swing). You may want to bring a hammock and find a quiet spot by a lake or in the woods to rest and soak in God’s beauty. In the evenings we will have a campfire.\r\n\r\nThis event is best experienced off the grid, and we ask that you plan to arrive ready to unplug for the weekend. We promise you won’t regret it, and your texts and e-mails will still be there on Sunday afternoon.',31142,435057,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8790\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"1242 Old Blue Creek Road\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Cleveland\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"GA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"30528\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"34.606362\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-83.745338\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Georgia\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-cleveland-ga-us-phil-gable',NULL,'2023-05-18 07:05:42','2024-04-10 15:21:05'),
