	('9bc65bd7-e4e9-47a8-b749-4259377ef074',3,1632,'CORE - Troy, MT, US | Barbara Soucy',NULL,'weekly','776 Gus Creek Road','MT',NULL,'Troy','59935','US',-115.8165710,48.8190660,'Montana',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:06',0,'men','2023-09-14 15:21:07','2023-09-17 15:21:07',NULL,'',31477,427313,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9150\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"776 Gus Creek Road\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Troy\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MT\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"59935\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"48.819066\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-115.816571\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Montana\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/core-troy-mt-us-barbara-soucy-1',NULL,'2023-08-17 09:08:54','2024-04-10 15:21:07'),
	('9bc65bd8-00d2-4e45-9d83-057f07222914',2,23,'WAH BASIC - Bellvue, CO, US | Steve Shelton',NULL,'weekly','8233 Old Flowers Road','CO',NULL,'Bellvue','80512','US',-105.3883470,40.6327040,'Colorado',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:07',0,'men','2023-09-14 15:21:07','2023-09-17 15:21:07',NULL,'All food and lodging for the entire event are included in the registration fee.   We host our WAH BASICs at Sky Corral Ranch (https://skycorral.org/) which is a private 105 acre slice of heaven nestled in the mountains West of Fort Collins, Colorado.  \r\nThe ranch is spectacular and has plenty to offer, weather permitting (fishing, hiking, archery, basketball, pickleball, frisbee golf, horseshoes, volleyball, cornhole, billiards, ping pong, foosball, and darts).  \r\nHere is a little more info about our event:\r\n1)  The tap water at the ranch is very clean/refreshing so we have decided not to provide bottled drinking water.  Please bring your own refillable water bottles. We will also be providing coffee, tea, and juice.\r\n2)  The beds are all bunk bed style, each room consisting of 8 beds and 1 bathroom. We suggest you bring ear plugs.    Clean bedding is provided but feel free to bring your sleeping bag if you would like.\r\n3)  We ask that you bring your own toiletries including Toothpaste/Bath Soap/Shampoo.  Towels will be provided but feel free to bring your own if you prefer.  \r\n4)  Please bring your bible. The good old-fashioned book kind as we prefer this weekend to be Electronic free.   If you don’t have one, just let us know and we’ll fix that.   THERE IS NO CELL SERVICE AT THE RANCH    We will provide an emergency number (land line) that friends and family will be able to reach you at if necessary.\r\n5)  Please take some time to read / re-read \"Wild at Heart\" prior to the event.   The book can be purchased directly from Amazon.\r\n6)  We have several hours of free time planned throughout the weekend. Feel free to bring your fishing poles / tackle as there is a private lake stocked with fish on the property.\r\n7)  We provide all the food for the entire event.   The majority of the food will be prepared on site by our volunteers and will be “ranch style”.   If you have any special dietary requests, please let us know ahead of time.    Meals provided are:  Dinner on Thursday; Breakfast, Lunch, and Dinner on Friday &amp; Saturday, and Breakfast on Sunday.\r\n8)  The event ends around noon on Sunday.',31326,452508,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8977\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"8233 Old Flowers Road\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Bellvue\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"80512\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"40.632704\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-105.388347\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Colorado\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-bellvue-co-us-steve-shelton-1',NULL,'2023-06-27 04:06:08','2024-04-10 15:21:07'),
	('9bc65bd8-1e4e-4ee1-822e-0827cf555254',5,79,'WILD AT HEART - Chaska, MN, US | Ty Decker',NULL,'weekly','6053 Highway 212 E.','MN',NULL,'Chaska','55318','US',-93.6738020,44.7750150,'Minnesota',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:07',0,'men','2023-09-18 15:21:07',NULL,NULL,'If you choose to accept the invitation, we will meet each Monday evening through October 30th, from 7:00 to 8:30 to hear the calling on our lives as men, and to hear stories of men pursuing their warrior hearts through God\'s invitation of a battle to fight, an adventure to live, and a beauty to rescue.\r\n\r\nThis six-week series is FREE',31567,232710,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9257\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"6053 Highway 212 E.\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Chaska\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MN\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"55318\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"44.775015\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-93.673802\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Minnesota\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wildatheart/small-group/wild-heart-chaska-mn-us-ty-decker',NULL,'2023-09-12 08:09:11','2024-04-10 15:21:07'),
	('9bc65bd8-3b82-4b16-a6b5-68f93585a52c',2,389,'WAH BASIC - Danville, VA, US | Spencer Johnson',NULL,'weekly','505 Windsor Ct.','VA',NULL,'Danville','24541','US',-79.5734920,36.6087580,'Virginia',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:07',0,'men','2023-09-07 15:21:07','2023-09-10 15:21:07',NULL,'This will be a private group for men in our church that cannot attend a 4-day off-campus event. This will be a weekly group that meets for 11 weeks.',19796,62596,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8616\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"505 Windsor Ct.\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Danville\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"VA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"24541\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"36.608758\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-79.573492\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Virginia\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-danville-va-us-spencer-johnson',NULL,'2023-04-17 08:04:47','2024-04-10 15:21:07'),
	('9bc65bd8-597f-4c98-8377-a3d2397de805',3,1633,'CORE - Caroline, AB, CA | Sharleen Thornberry',NULL,'weekly','Clearwater College Campus','AB',NULL,'Caroline','T0M 0M0','CA',-114.9020080,52.0854110,'Alberta',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:07',0,'men','2023-09-07 15:21:07','2023-09-10 15:21:07',NULL,'Registration starts at 4pm on September 7th. The event begins at 6pm (supper) on the 7th and ends at 12pm on the 10th.\r\n\r\nPlease bring bedding and towels. Some of the beds are queen sized and some are twin XL.\r\n\r\nMeals provided: supper on Thursday, three meals Friday and Saturday, breakfast and lunch on Sunday.\r\n\r\nThis beautiful campus has hiking trails, volleyball, basketball, a pool table and a game room with puzzles, etc.\r\n\r\nFacility: http://www.clearwatercollege.com/home\r\n\r\nMap to location: http://www.clearwatercollege.com/contact-us\r\n\r\nCost per person: $200 CA\r\n\r\nRegistration: email Laura Sandstra at laura.sandstra@gmail.com to register. Please let Laura know if you have any dietary restrictions. An additional event informational document will be sent to you upon your registration.\r\n\r\nPayment: etransfer the full amount to Laura at the above email or send a cheque to Laura at the following address: RR1, Site 20, Box 9, Rocky Mountain House, Alberta T4T 2A1. If you are paying via cheque, let Laura know when you send her an email to register.\r\n\r\nDeadline for registration is August 24th, 2023.',30998,411004,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8634\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"Clearwater College Campus\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"Box 100\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Caroline\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"AB\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"T0M 0M0\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"ca\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"52.085411\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-114.902008\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Alberta\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"Canada\\\"}\"','/core-caroline-ab-ca-sharleen-thornberry-0',NULL,'2023-04-20 03:04:22','2024-04-10 15:21:07'),
	('9bc65bd8-7644-4239-9319-a610e77499e6',2,1634,'WAH BASIC - McGregor, MN, US | Erik Swenson',NULL,'weekly','','MN',NULL,'McGregor','','US',-93.3086870,46.6068260,'Minnesota',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:07',0,'men','2023-09-07 15:21:07','2023-09-10 15:21:07',NULL,'NOTE: Registration closes Tuesday Aug 29, 2023\r\n\r\nWhen: Thursday-Sunday, Sept 7 - Sept 10, 2023 (arrive between 3 and 4pm Thursday and depart after 12:30pm Sunday)\r\n\r\nWhere: Covenant Pines Bible Camp, McGregor, MN\r\nhttps://covenantpines.org/\r\n\r\nCost: $195 - includes lodging, all meals, snacks, on-site camp activities, materials and retreat content. \r\n\r\nAccommodations: Lodging will be bunk style (electricity, indoor restrooms, showers, etc). You can request a roommate, otherwise roommates will be assigned. Retreat center also includes a meeting hall and gathering room with wood fireplace and coffee on tap. Dining hall is just a short walk across camp.\r\n\r\nActivities: On-site and off-site activities will be available during free time including hiking, kayaking, swimming, climbing, zip line, giant swing, disc golf, indoor gym, pickleball, game room, nightly campfires, coffee shop, etc.\r\n\r\nWhat to bring: Bedding, towel, indoor and outdoor clothing for activities. \r\n\r\nTo sign up, click on the google link below to complete a short registration form. Payment options are included on the form.\r\n\r\nhttps://forms.gle/S9BsB3eW1v8P2eic7\r\n\r\nWith questions, feel free to contact Erik Swenson at formedforgood@gmail.com or 612-597-1906.',31148,436224,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8795\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"McGregor\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MN\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"46.606826\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-93.308687\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Minnesota\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-mcgregor-mn-us-erik-swenson-2',NULL,'2023-05-20 08:05:49','2024-04-10 15:21:07'),
