	('9bc65bd8-b1b9-465d-8165-9b06d277141c',3,1599,'CORE - Garden Valley, ID, US | Kayla Cuellar',NULL,'weekly','28 Elk Run Drive','ID',NULL,'Garden Valley','83622','US',-116.0072410,44.1496840,'Idaho',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:07',0,'men','2023-09-07 15:21:07','2023-09-10 15:21:07',NULL,'Guests will stay in a stunning (3 bedroom 3 bath with a loft) cabin located in a small mountain community near the beautiful Middle Fork of the Payette river near Garden Valley, Idaho.  Space is limited to 10 attendees.\r\n\r\n-Attendees should bring toiletries, swimming suit, a little extra cash for activities.\r\n-Meals will be provided (dinner Thursday thru lunch, Sunday).  \r\n-Check in 4-5:30, Thursday. \r\n-Checkout noon, Sunday. \r\n-Nearby activities: Fly fishing, hiking, geothermal community swimming pool ($5), hot springing on the river, golf. \r\n\r\nThere are limited beds so guests may need to bring bedding / sleeping bag / air mattress for sleeping on floor/couches.',31413,437618,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9074\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"28 Elk Run Drive\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Garden Valley\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"ID\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"83622\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"44.149684\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-116.007241\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Idaho\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/core-garden-valley-id-us-kayla-cuellar',NULL,'2023-07-30 06:07:24','2024-04-10 15:21:07'),
