	('9bc65bd9-e9ee-43f2-91f3-05b6656bd1a8',5,1642,'WILD AT HEART - Bloomington, IN, US | Paul Konstanski',NULL,'weekly','311 S. Lincoln Street','IN',NULL,'Bloomington','47401','US',-86.5307960,39.1639560,'Indiana',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:08',0,'men','2023-09-12 15:21:08',NULL,NULL,'Men\'s Life Bloomington has been meeting for over 35 years. Each year God leads different men to join us and new faces are always welcome. During those 35 years we have covered many different topics that connect with men\'s hearts. We are excited to be doing the \"Wild at Heart\" small group study this year. \r\n\r\nWe meet on the 2nd and 4th Tuesday\'s of most months. So we will take our time and spread this study out to run from September through May. We will take two sessions per lesson. We meet over the lunch hour and pizza is provided.  We meet at the Boy\'s and Girl\'s Club in downtown B-town.',31526,470724,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9205\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"311 S. Lincoln Street\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Bloomington\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"IN\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"47401\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"39.163956\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-86.530796\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Indiana\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wildatheart/small-group/wild-heart-bloomington-us-paul-konstanski',NULL,'2023-08-30 08:08:13','2024-04-10 15:21:08'),
	('9bc65bda-06d1-4757-92dc-35c09156783f',5,76,'WILD AT HEART - Lake Worth, FL, US | Ed Murphy',NULL,'weekly','4306 Waterway Dr','FL',NULL,'Lake Worth','33461','US',-80.1108840,26.6039010,'Florida',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:08',0,'men','2023-09-07 15:21:08',NULL,NULL,'The Wild at Heart EXPERIENCE is a six-session study. Our format is a hybrid IN-PERSON and ON ZOOM study held weekly on Thursday 7pm starting September 7. You may click on the link to register. The registration link contains directions to the site, links to purchase the book, study guide and if desired the Field Manual. If you would like to work through the Field Manual with a trusted guide, contact Ed Murphy\r\nWe hope to see you there! \r\n\r\nhttps://mailchi.mp/7499cb19e445/m7d1i1yzs1',31509,236318,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9187\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"4306 Waterway Dr\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Lake Worth\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"FL\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"33461\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"26.603901\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-80.110884\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Florida\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wildatheart/small-group/wild-heart-lake-worth-fl-us-ed-murphy',NULL,'2023-08-25 04:08:23','2024-04-10 15:21:08'),
