	('9bc65bdd-8de1-4704-ace0-5eae05bb51f1',3,1662,'CORE - Payson, AZ, US | Brittany Butler',NULL,'weekly','902 N Holly Cir','AZ',NULL,'Payson','85541','US',-111.3166170,34.2525970,'Arizona',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:10',0,'men','2023-07-20 15:21:10','2023-07-23 15:21:10',NULL,'Swimsuit for hot tub, hiking shoes for trails nearby',31151,449804,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8798\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"902 N Holly Cir\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Payson\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"AZ\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"85541\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"34.252597\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-111.316617\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Arizona\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/core-payson-az-us-brittany-butler',NULL,'2023-05-21 10:05:16','2024-04-10 15:21:10'),
	('9bc65bdd-a9fd-47e4-93c7-6dd5603b7714',2,1663,'WAH BASIC - Williams, AZ, US | Mike Bouck',NULL,'weekly','5248 S. Hat Ranch Rd','AZ',NULL,'Williams','86046','US',-112.2672120,35.1745300,'Arizona',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:10',0,'men','2023-07-20 15:21:10','2023-07-23 15:21:10',NULL,'***Please contact Mike Bouck (801-309-8837 to register***\r\n\r\nDATES/TIMES\r\nArrive Thursday, July 20th at 11am MST\r\nDepart Saturday, July 22nd by 5pm MST\r\n\r\nLOCATION\r\nHistoric Hat Ranch near Williams, Arizona (learn more here https://nau.edu/hat-ranch/)\r\n\r\nCOST - $300/person for food and lodging. At least 1/2 the cost is due one week prior to the BASIC with the rest due upon check in. You can pay via Venmo (@Mike-Bouck) and/or cash. \r\n\r\nWHAT TO EXPECT\r\nLodging at an old working ranch in beautiful natural surroundings\r\nPlenty to eat (3 meals/day plus snacks and desserts)\r\nDaily devotionals\r\nVideos of John Eldredge and his team leading us through a series of recorded sessions helping us reclaim our masculine hearts\r\nMoments of mandatory silence\r\nDaily free time to adventure, rest, have meaningful conversation\r\nCampfire discussions\r\nHorseshoes, cornhole, disc golf, a movie, etc…\r\n\r\nWHAT TO BRING\r\nIn addition to bringing everything you need for 3 days away from home please bring…\r\nBed sheets or a sleeping bag\r\nYour own towel\r\n\r\nEMERGENCY CONTACT(S)\r\nAlthough there is cell service on some parts of the property, we’ll be asking you to give up your cell phones for the weekend in order to fully disconnect from the outside world. An emergency number will be provided for people in your life to get a hold of you and you them if a crisis arises.',31219,465299,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8861\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"5248 S. Hat Ranch Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Williams\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"AZ\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"86046\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"35.174530\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-112.267212\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Arizona\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-williams-az-us-mike-bouck',NULL,'2023-06-05 12:06:01','2024-04-10 15:21:10'),
	('9bc65bdd-c545-4e07-a822-94feeb7e4818',2,1664,'WAH BASIC - Eagletown, AR, US | Ken Chapman',NULL,'weekly','1263 Taberville Road','AR',NULL,'Eagletown','74734','US',-94.5749350,34.0342780,'Arkansas',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:10',0,'men','2023-07-13 15:21:10','2023-07-16 15:21:10',NULL,'Bring hiking boots, guns to shoot if wanted, fishing equipment and anything else needed  to do what repairs the soul!  There will be plenty of downtime.  Plan to spend time how the Father shows you too.',31051,234924,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8697\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"1263 Taberville Road\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Eagletown\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"AR\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"74734\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"34.034278\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-94.574935\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Arkansas\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-eagletown-ar-us-ken-chapman',NULL,'2023-04-30 03:04:24','2024-04-10 15:21:10'),
	('9bc65bdd-e1e4-44cb-b31b-840a35d2772c',2,1665,'WAH BASIC - Brian Head, UT, US | Chris Ashworth',NULL,'weekly','687 South Snowflake Lane','UT',NULL,'Brian Head','84719','US',-112.8517470,37.6862260,'Utah',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:10',0,'men','2023-07-13 15:21:10','2023-07-16 15:21:10',NULL,'During the 4 days set in the tree-filled mountains of Southern Utah, you will participate in a multi-media experience which will help you discover something profound about your own heart and the heart of God.\r\n\r\nThis isn’t your typical retreat. You will not be asked to break into small groups and share your feelings. Instead you will hear from other men living an intentional life in pursuit of the heart of God. Bring fishing gear, swim suit, and/or kayak for the nearby lake, hiking boots and/or mountain bike for the trails. Past attendees have indicated that this weekend has been a transformational experience in their walk with God.\r\n\r\nCost is $175 to cover lodging. Bring your own meals that take less than 10 minutes to prepare and clean up. We\'ll be staying at this cabin:\r\nhttps://www.airbnb.com/rooms/40617755\r\n\r\nArrive between 5-6pm July 13th. We\'ll be done by noon July 16th.\r\n\r\nIn order to make this a transformational experience, we ask you to disconnect from your world during the event. Please commit to no cell phones, wifi, or work.',31234,405815,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8878\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"687 South Snowflake Lane\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Brian Head\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"UT\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"84719\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"37.686226\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-112.851747\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Utah\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-brian-head-ut-us-chris-ashworth-2',NULL,'2023-06-08 03:06:49','2024-04-10 15:21:10'),
	('9bc65bde-029e-4f8d-b9e6-da4964f4e06a',5,1666,'WILD AT HEART - Kingsburg, CA, US | David Silva',NULL,'weekly','3090 ave 393','CA',NULL,'Kingsburg','93631','US',-119.5052870,36.5053710,'California',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:10',0,'men','2023-07-21 15:21:11',NULL,NULL,'',31367,458979,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9017\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"3090 ave 393\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Kingsburg\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"93631\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"36.505371\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-119.505287\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"California\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wildatheart/small-group/wild-heart-kingsburg-ca-us-david-silva',NULL,'2023-07-12 08:07:50','2024-04-10 15:21:11'),
