	('9bc65bde-c921-49c3-94e9-10b9af87edf8',5,1669,'WILD AT HEART - Knoxville, TN, US |  ',NULL,'weekly','8000 Middlebrook Pike','TN',NULL,'Knoxville','37923','US',-84.0527330,35.9418280,'Tennessee',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:11',0,'men','2023-09-05 15:21:11',NULL,NULL,'Hello and thank you for considering joining us this year as we go through Wild At Heart! My name is Dan Henson, and I help lead a men’s group at Fellowship Church in Knoxville, TN called The Good Fight. For the past two decades, The Good Fight has been helping men create intentional space to study the word of God together, and step further into the men He has called us to be. \r\n\r\nWe are PUMPED to have the opportunity to go through Wild At Heart this year, and we’d love to invite you to join us if you’re in the Knoxville area. We meet on Tuesday mornings at 6:00am at Fellowship Church. Please feel free to shoot us an email at thegoodfight1612@gmail.com with any questions you may have. We look forward to seeing how God works in and through our time together as we embark on this journey for the rest of 2023. \r\n\r\nIron Sharpens Iron! \r\n-Dan',31345,450192,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8995\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"8000 Middlebrook Pike\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Knoxville\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"TN\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"37923\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"35.941828\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-84.052733\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Tennessee\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wildatheart/small-group/wild-heart-knoxville-tn-us',NULL,'2023-07-02 03:07:58','2024-04-10 15:21:11'),
