	('9bc65bdf-4364-4db7-8872-bd492472057d',4,1130,'BECOMING A KING RETREAT- CAPE FAIR, MO, US | Michael Hogan',NULL,'weekly','10620 WEST STATE HWY 76','MO',NULL,'Cape Fair','65624','US',-93.5389290,36.7353610,'Missouri',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:11',0,'men','2023-06-22 15:21:11','2023-06-25 15:21:11',NULL,'LOCATION:\r\nF14 RANCH IS 75 GORGEOUS ACRES IN THE HEART OF THE OZARKS WITH TABLE ROCK LAKE AS A BACKDROP. WE ARE 15-20 MINUTES NORTHWEST OF BRANSON, MISSOURI.\r\n\r\nSpace is limited to the 1st 20 men who register.  \r\n\r\nCOST:\r\n\r\n$250 per person includes meals, accommodations, sessions, and activities. Bring $25 for additional (optional) activities in Branson, MO\r\n\r\nWHAT TO BRING:\r\n\r\nBedding is provided entirely. Bring personal toiletries and a shower towel. Bring comfortable clothes and some good shoes for walking along the wooded trails. \r\n\r\nWHAT ARE THE SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS?\r\n\r\nF14 Ranch has a beautiful log cabin lodge with two extra large rooms. Each room is equipped with one king size bed and 8 twins. Each room has a fully equipped bathroom with shower. We also have a shower room in the meeting hall if you so desire. Each bed is equipped with an electrical outlet and a personal reading light. \r\n\r\nFREEDOM-14 MINISTRIES IS A 501(C)3 NON-PROFIT ORGANIZATION DEDICATED TO THE PURPOSE OF PROVIDING THE FACILITIES AND THE MEANS FOR CHRIST-CENTERED EXPERIENCES.\r\n\r\nWatch this podcast with Morgan Snyder and Michael Hogan from F14 Ranch\r\nhttps://youtu.be/uBzjR1_uE5s',18488,117732,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8312\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"10620 WEST STATE HWY 76\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Cape Fair\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"65624\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"36.735361\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-93.538929\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Missouri\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/becoming-king-retreat-cape-fair-mo-us-michael-hogan-0',NULL,'2023-02-14 11:02:00','2024-04-10 15:21:11'),
