	('9bc65be1-5fdd-4dd2-973f-a0825a518383',2,1572,'WAH BASIC - Summersville, WV, US | Adam Diener',NULL,'weekly','162 Old Vinton Farm Rd.','WV',NULL,'Summersville','26651','US',-80.9600890,38.2257000,'West Virginia',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:13',0,'men','2023-06-01 15:21:13','2023-06-04 15:21:13',NULL,'This Wild at Heart Basic will take place at Wild Ridge Young Life camp in New River Gorge National Park,  June 1st - 4th, 2023. The newly constructed lodge is located 25 minutes west of Summersville, WV, and sits on top of cliffs that overlook the Gauley River. The weekend will begin with dinner at 6 p.m. on Thursday evening and end around 1 p.m. on Sunday afternoon. The cost of the weekend includes lodging and food; however, you also have the opportunity to join a 1/2 day whitewater rafting adventure on the New River. This part of the retreat is optional, costs an additional $95, and must be registered for separately (details will be provided after registering for the retreat).',18401,336958,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8200\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"162 Old Vinton Farm Rd.\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Summersville\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"WV\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"26651\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"38.225700\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-80.960089\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"West Virginia\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-summersville-wv-us-adam-diener',NULL,'2023-02-04 02:02:06','2024-04-10 15:21:13'),
