	('9bc65be2-29b2-4f32-bd66-43efd0181638',2,1478,'WAH BASIC - Muskoka, ON, CA | Thom Mills',NULL,'weekly','','ON',NULL,'Muskoka','','CA',-79.4084650,45.1841120,'Ontario',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:13',0,'men','2023-05-25 15:21:13','2023-05-28 15:21:13',NULL,'An incredible and huge cottage on Mary\'s lake in Muskoka, ON.  \r\n\r\nDates and Times – Boot Camp starts Thursday May 25th at 7 pm and runs until Sun May 28th at 12:30 pm.  To be registered for the event, you must be prepared to be present for the complete time of the event.\r\n\r\nPricing – $250\r\n\r\nWhat is Included – Accommodations at an incredible lake side and forested cottage large enough to host 22 guys, session material, food, a bed for you to sleep in.\r\n\r\nWhat you need to bring – Sleeping bag, pillow, and open and prayerful heart and mind.\r\n\r\nMore about the food – The food at these events is always great.  You can expect a group dinning experience with amazing quality and quantity of food.',19708,366993,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8568\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Muskoka\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"ON\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"ca\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"45.184112\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-79.408465\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Ontario\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"Canada\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-muskoka-ca-thom-mills-2',NULL,'2023-04-06 08:04:10','2024-04-10 15:21:13'),
