	('9bc65be2-f339-4d91-9be3-4c43d74b577d',2,1690,'WAH BASIC - zanesfield, OH, US | branden dillon',NULL,'weekly','6946 county road 10','OH',NULL,'zanesfield','43360','US',-83.6434320,40.3396950,'Ohio',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:14',0,'men','2023-05-19 15:21:14','2023-05-22 15:21:14',NULL,'Come prepared to take a journey with other like-minded men in this 3 day retreat at the Kirkmont retreat center in Zanesfield Ohio. \r\n\r\nWhat we\'ll be doing:\r\n- Video led discussions by the Wild at heart team; John Eldredge and his team of facilitators\r\n- Discussion times\r\n- Worship and Prayer times\r\n- Outdoor leisure time with your choice of lounging, hiking, fishing, corn hole, basketball.\r\n\r\nWhat to bring:\r\n-Hiking boots\r\n-A bible and journal (we\'ll provide small BASIC journals free of charge)\r\n-If staying overnight, bedding, pillows, towels will be provided but you are responsible for your own shampoo\'s, soaps, etc. You may want to bring an extra blanket and pillow for your own preference. \r\n-Bring your appetite. There will be plenty of food during the event. \r\nThe cost to attend is $175 for the entire event which includes all teaching sessions, events, food and lodging. If you wish to attend only the events over the three days you can sign up for $100 which includes teaching sessions, events, food (overnight stay not included).\r\n\r\nCLICK THE LINK BELOW TO REGISTER:\r\n\r\nhttps://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fvineyardmarysville.churchcenter.com%2Fregistrations%2Fevents%2F1704066%3Ffbclid%3DIwAR1lh57k4Z4gEGyl8xOQO7ZaveMsYSDsmjnFg9EhP6zH7uEtVPTbkhavbLs&amp;h=AT0EOkNyXwjE1APcx8_X1DJyAUJ3kuVJHCJb2uovnXtNSV3RYlgzUNy8fy5Sj52SBOC_YPMBw5tl2x2dYSD8jQhpuspvNlHxYM111OTiALJshiVgO8HghPYh4oJaWevx-z8QrWxuJiI',19758,408971,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8588\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"6946 county road 10\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"zanesfield\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"OH\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"43360\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"40.339695\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-83.643432\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Ohio\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-zanesfield-oh-us-branden-dillon',NULL,'2023-04-11 06:04:20','2024-04-10 15:21:14'),
