	('9bc65be5-5804-430b-ad9b-c7299911991b',2,1223,'WAH BASIC - Divide, CO, US | Joe Gurzi',NULL,'weekly','2072 County RD 512','CO',NULL,'Divide','80814','US',-105.2318680,38.9574880,'Colorado',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:15',0,'men','2023-05-04 15:21:15','2023-05-07 15:21:15',NULL,'Held in the Pike National Forest at over 9000ft, at Above All Else at Aspen Ridge.\r\nhttps://www.aaelse.com. \r\nOn the free time days we have hiking, mountain biking and fly fishing (some fly fishing gear provide, also an experienced teacher) all nearby. Did I mention you are at 9000+ft! so be prepared for weather! It can go from Nice to Ice in 3.2 seconds. We offer queen beds for all. 2 cabins in the woods and the barn, with private rooms.\r\nThis event will fill quickly as we can accommodate only 8 men.  \r\nCome experience the love of the Father with our team around the Campfire each evening. \r\n\r\nFULL!!!!',17957,125541,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7680\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"2072 County RD 512\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Divide\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"80814\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"38.957488\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-105.231868\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Colorado\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-divide-co-us-joe-gurzi-0',NULL,'2022-10-10 03:10:30','2024-04-10 15:21:15'),
	('9bc65be5-7566-4111-a4fa-e36c01cd5457',2,1381,'WAH BASIC - Gonzales, TX, US | John and Valerie Sperry',NULL,'weekly','673 Private Road 3381','TX',NULL,'Gonzales','78629','US',-97.5396260,29.5697130,'Texas',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:15',0,'men','2023-05-04 15:21:15','2023-05-07 15:21:15',NULL,'We\'re renting a lodge at the camp, comfortably holds 50 guests. We\'ll have fishing, firepits, and maybe a challenge course activity time. It\'s gonna be great. Contact John Sperry for more information.',18418,393672,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8223\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"673 Private Road 3381\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\" \\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Gonzales\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"TX\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"78629\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"29.569713\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-97.539626\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Texas\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-gonzales-tx-us-john-and-valerie-sperry',NULL,'2023-02-06 09:02:54','2024-04-10 15:21:15'),
	('9bc65be5-92f1-40a4-a332-1df2e81b45ad',3,1701,'CORE - Williams Bay, WI, US | Rachel Holeman',NULL,'weekly','300 Conference Point Rd','WI',NULL,'Williams Bay','53191','US',-88.5435030,42.5655930,'Wisconsin',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:15',0,'men','2023-05-04 15:21:16','2023-05-07 15:21:16',NULL,'Oh ladies, We are so excited to offer this Captivating Retreat.  We will be staying in Soderquist Lodge at Conference Point Center- located right on the beautiful Lake Geneva. (one hour from both Chicago and Milwaukee) I know it will be too cold to swim and there is no hot tub (boo!) However, there are beautiful grounds and a trail that goes for miles along the shore. I would recommend your own cozy blanket and white noise maker if you need it for sleep. Weather at this time in WI can be \"iffy\" so come prepared for anything!! We can\'t wait to meet you!!\r\nCheck in: May 4 at 4 pm\r\nCheck out: May 7 at 1:30\r\nall means from Thursday supper through Sunday lunch are included.\r\nDouble Room (2 queens) $350\r\nTriple/quad Room (everyone has their own bed- queen or twin) $300',18424,460732,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8235\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"300 Conference Point Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Williams Bay\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"WI\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"53191\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"42.565593\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-88.543503\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Wisconsin\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/core-williams-bay-wi-us-rachel-holeman',NULL,'2023-02-07 09:02:08','2024-04-10 15:21:16'),
	('9bc65be5-b12e-42d2-ae57-a7351e343c6d',2,1480,'WAH BASIC - Giddings, TX, US | Dave Shannon',NULL,'weekly','1038 Private Rd 2191','TX',NULL,'Giddings','78942','US',-96.9298490,30.0971620,'Texas',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:16',0,'men','2023-05-04 15:21:16','2023-05-07 15:21:16',NULL,'Join us at Camp Tejas in Giddings, TX for an incredible weekend.',19706,431747,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8564\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"1038 Private Rd 2191\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Giddings\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"TX\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"78942\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"30.097162\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-96.929849\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Texas\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-giddings-tx-us-dave-shannon',NULL,'2023-04-05 02:04:28','2024-04-10 15:21:16'),
	('9bc65be5-ce37-41ae-ab21-df805f35c162',2,1702,'WAH BASIC - Grants Pass , OR, US | Kirk Sager',NULL,'weekly','311 Ave de Teresa ','OR',NULL,'Grants Pass ','97526','US',-123.2524790,42.4237530,'Oregon',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:16',0,'men','2023-05-04 15:21:16','2023-05-07 15:21:16',NULL,'This event will start at my home listed above on the beautiful Rogue River in Grants Pass Oregon. We will then make our way to Graves creek boat ramp and launch in rafts and kayak\'s over the next 3 days and experience, Wild at Heart Basic in the Wild and Scenic section of the Rogue River ! Gear needed will be released at a later date . Limited group of 20 men for this trip .',18414,367477,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8217\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"311 Ave de Teresa \\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Grants Pass \\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"OR\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"97526\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"42.423753\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-123.252479\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Oregon\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-grants-pass-or-us-kirk-sager-1',NULL,'2023-02-06 06:02:02','2024-04-10 15:21:16'),
	('9bc65be5-eb44-4ea8-a4b1-35a954550fd4',4,1459,'BECOMING A KING RETREAT- Colorado Springs, CO, US | Brad Steininger',NULL,'weekly','5125 Brady Rd','CO',NULL,'Colorado Springs','80915','US',-104.7319960,38.8627910,'Colorado',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:16',0,'men','2023-05-04 15:21:16','2023-05-07 15:21:16',NULL,'When: Thur-Sun, May 4-7th, 2023 (arrive at 5:00 pm Thursday, depart after 12:00 Sunday)\r\n\r\nWhere: The Outpost at Stein Haus, 5125 Brady Rd, Colorado Springs, CO 80915\r\n\r\nWho: It is open to men of all ages (18 and above). This retreat can accommodate up to 4 men.\r\n\r\nAccommodations: Four men will share a single large room (bunk beds). Everyone will have a bed, pillow, linens and towels. There is one bathroom with a shower/sink/toilet and a second bathroom with a sink/toilet.\r\n\r\nCost: $77 which includes lodging, all meals and retreat content. A nonrefundable deposit of $50 is due no later than six weeks prior to the retreat via check or PayPal. Full payment of the remaining $27 is due upon arrival at the retreat.\r\n\r\nRegistration: Please contact Brad Steininger to register or to request more information.\r\n\r\nOther info:\r\n\r\n* This event is designed to be experienced \"off the grid;\" we require participants to unplug from all devices. There will be a contact number provided for emergencies.\r\n\r\n* A couple hours of free time is built into the schedule both Friday and Saturday afternoons. During this time you will have the opportunity to participate in a hike, leisure time around the facility, take a nap, read a book, etc.\r\n\r\n* This retreat is in a rustic neighborhood on the East side of Colorado Springs (mostly dirt roads and equestrian properties). Bring season-appropriate casual clothes. There are some trails nearby for hiking and an excellent park with many trails just a couple miles away.\r\n\r\n* In the evenings, there will be an opportunity to relax, build a camp fire, tell stories and have fun. You\'ll leave with new friendships, greater clarity in your walk with the Lord, and inspired to live your life as a man fully alive.',18086,236529,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7811\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"5125 Brady Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Colorado Springs\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"80915\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"38.862791\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-104.731996\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Colorado\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/becoming-king-retreat-colorado-springs-co-us-brad-steininger-4',NULL,'2022-11-18 04:11:30','2024-04-10 15:21:16'),
	('9bc65be6-08e6-4af0-92d4-d30b58b2c5ea',2,53,'WAH BASIC - High Hill, MO, US, WAH BASIC - High Hill, MO, US | Victor Miller | Victor Miller',NULL,'weekly','High Hill Christian Camp','MO',NULL,'High Hill','63350','US',-91.3823360,38.8679280,'Missouri',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:16',0,'men','2023-05-04 15:21:16','2023-05-07 15:21:16',NULL,'This will be our 4th Bootcamp!  We provide comfortable bunks and 8 meals over the 4 day 3 night bootcamp! Bring a sleeping bag and pillow and an open heart to what God is doing.',18259,47762,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8011\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"High Hill Christian Camp\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"20 Camp Lane\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"High Hill\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"63350\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"38.867928\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-91.382336\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Missouri\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/node/18259',NULL,'2023-01-10 01:01:58','2024-04-10 15:21:16'),
