e an opportunity to relax, build a camp fire, tell stories and have fun. You\'ll leave with new friendships, greater clarity in your walk with the Lord, and inspired to live your life as a man fully alive.',18694,236529,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8390\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"5125 Brady Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Colorado Springs\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"80915\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"38.862791\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-104.731996\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Colorado\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/becoming-king-retreat-colorado-springs-co-us-brad-steininger-5',NULL,'2023-02-27 05:02:45','2024-04-10 15:21:16'),
	('9bc65be6-437e-4219-a115-5392dbd5060f',2,1469,'WAH BASIC - Effie, MN, US | Skip Johnson',NULL,'weekly','65328 County Road 235','MN',NULL,'Effie','56639','US',-93.5290540,47.8314650,'Minnesota',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:16',0,'men','2023-05-04 15:21:16','2023-05-07 15:21:16',NULL,'The weekend will be hosted at our farm and hunting property in Northern MN on the Bigfork River.\r\n\r\nCost: $225/person -- this covers lodging, food, drinks, atv/utv gas, etc.\r\n\r\nWhat to bring: For those who haven\'t been there, the location is rustic and off the beaten path, with several hundred acres to explore. ATV trails and a river run through the property, so pack accordingly to be outside a lot in early May Northern MN weather! Outside of appropriate clothing, some other ideas are:\r\n\r\n-ATV or SXS if you have one\r\n-Kayak or canoe for the river\r\n-Guns and Ammo for target shooting or trap\r\n-Sleeping bag &amp; pillow\r\n-Shoes for the river\r\n-Bug/tick spray\r\n-Bible or download a version\r\n-Flashlight/headlamp\r\n-Folding chair or camp chair\r\n-Journal and pen',18383,430547,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8173\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"65328 County Road 235\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Effie\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MN\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"56639\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"47.831465\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-93.529054\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Minnesota\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-effie-mn-us-skip-johnson-1',NULL,'2023-02-01 08:02:26','2024-04-10 15:21:16'),
