	('9bc65be7-2d12-4b51-b295-31d60b7c3921',4,1709,'BECOMING A KING RETREAT- Mooresville , MO, US | Jeff Ninneman',NULL,'weekly','15050 LIV 415 ','MO',NULL,'Mooresville ','64664','US',-93.6808250,39.7575630,'Missouri',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:16',0,'men','2023-04-27 15:21:17','2023-04-30 15:21:17',NULL,'Join us for an incredible weekend with 25 men, set in a beautiful log cabin in woods. We are praying for the Father to restore hearts, reveal identities and heal the fragmented parts of us. We are expecting great things.',18828,422239,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8469\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"15050 LIV 415 \\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Mooresville \\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"64664\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"39.757563\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-93.680825\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Missouri\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/becoming-king-retreat-mooresville-mo-us-jeff-ninneman',NULL,'2023-03-11 10:03:25','2024-04-10 15:21:17'),
	('9bc65be7-4a24-4a87-ac3e-136549bbe6e0',4,1453,'BECOMING A KING RETREAT- Black Mountain, NC, US | Matthew Daughtry-Grubbs',NULL,'weekly','1233 N Fork Rd','NC',NULL,'Black Mountain','28711','US',-82.3543010,35.6253130,'North Carolina',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:17',0,'men','2023-04-27 15:21:17','2023-04-30 15:21:17',NULL,'When:\r\nThursday, April 27 - Sunday, April 30\r\nCheck in between 3:00 PM - 5:00 PM on Thursday. Event will end around 12:00 PM on Sunday\r\n\r\nWhere:\r\nCragmont Assembly – Camp and Retreat Center\r\n1233 North Fork Rd., Black Mountain, NC 28711\r\n40 minute drive from Asheville Regional Airport\r\n\r\nPrice:\r\n$200 Double Occupancy\r\n$300 Single Occupancy\r\n\r\nPrice includes:    \r\nFood – includes dinner on Thursday night through lunch on Sunday for a total of 9 meals, as well as snacks in between\r\nLodging including private bathroom per room, bed linens, towels, and washcloths\r\nAll event materials\r\n\r\nPrice does not include:\r\nToiletries\r\nTransportation to or from the event\r\n\r\nWhat to Expect:\r\nFor details regarding the event and a sample schedule, please visit ransomedheart.com/basic\r\nOnce your initial registration and payment are submitted, a welcome email will be send to you containing further details and a registration form where you will submit other information needed for the event.  \r\nThis event is designed to be experienced \"off the grid;\" we ask that you unplug and only use cell phones in extreme emergencies, and do not carry them around the whole weekend. (There will be a contact number for emergencies.)  Further information will be provided at the event. \r\nFree time is built into the schedule both Friday and Saturday afternoon.  During this time you will have the opportunity to participate in a hike, enjoy the gymnasium facilities (basketball, pickleball, etc.), outdoor volleyball court, leisure time around the camp grounds, or take a nap. \r\nIn the evenings, weather permitting, we will have a camp fire. This will be a great time to relax, tell stories, and have fun. You\'ll leave with new friendships, greater clarity in your walk with the Lord, and inspired to live your life to the fullest as a man fully alive.  Please bring clothes appropriate for the weather.',18050,438371,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7777\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"1233 N Fork Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Black Mountain\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"NC\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"28711\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"35.625313\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-82.354301\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"North Carolina\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/becoming-king-retreat-black-mountain-nc-us-matthew-daughtry-grubbs',NULL,'2022-11-06 06:11:44','2024-04-10 15:21:17'),
	('9bc65be7-6787-4c47-ac82-d2e3a483e37a',3,754,'CORE - Stone Lake, WI, US | Hannah Schmitt',NULL,'weekly','N3377 Long Lake Road','WI',NULL,'Stone Lake','54876','US',-91.6436030,45.7559570,'Wisconsin',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:17',0,'men','2023-04-27 15:21:17','2023-04-30 15:21:17',NULL,'Please see registration link for more information.',18330,442302,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8104\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"N3377 Long Lake Road\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Stone Lake\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"WI\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"54876\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"45.755957\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-91.643603\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Wisconsin\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/core-stone-lake-wi-us-hannah-schmitt',NULL,'2023-01-21 11:01:19','2024-04-10 15:21:17'),
	('9bc65be7-8470-4438-b9cf-f37d9050bce9',4,1710,'BECOMING A KING RETREAT- Sunrise Beach, MO, US | Jon Knapp',NULL,'weekly','29 Hollow Oak Road','MO',NULL,'Sunrise Beach','65079','US',-92.7174770,38.1134120,'Missouri',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:17',0,'men','2023-04-27 15:21:17','2023-04-30 15:21:17',NULL,'This retreat will be held at Lake of the Ozarks. We will meet in person but use the prerecorded Becoming A King Videos from Morgan Snyder through Wild at Heart.  This event mirrors what Morgan does in Colorado beginning Thursday evening running through Sunday noon.  Please contact Jon Knapp at 309-264-5293 for reservations and event details.',18817,360309,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8455\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"29 Hollow Oak Road\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Sunrise Beach\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"65079\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"38.113412\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-92.717477\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Missouri\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/becoming-king-retreat-sunrise-beach-mo-us-jon-knapp',NULL,'2023-03-09 06:03:03','2024-04-10 15:21:17'),
	('9bc65be7-a215-4efc-a2e6-af95d2dac978',2,1711,'WAH BASIC - Mount Hope, WV, US | Quint Pitts',NULL,'weekly','161 College Dr.','WV',NULL,'Mount Hope','25880','US',-81.2002350,37.8534530,'West Virginia',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:17',0,'men','2023-04-27 15:21:17','2023-04-30 15:21:17',NULL,'Alpine Lodge is located on the campus of Appalachian Bible College. $245 includes a single occupancy room in the lodge, all meals, basic recreation, 10 life-changing sessions.  Paintball is an optional group activity for an additional $30.',18208,311437,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7940\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"161 College Dr.\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Mount Hope\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"WV\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"25880\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"37.853453\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-81.200235\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"West Virginia\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-mount-hope-wv-us-quint-pitts-3',NULL,'2023-01-04 07:01:30','2024-04-10 15:21:17'),
	('9bc65be7-bf53-4b2f-8a31-6dcd2f18ca81',4,40,'BECOMING A KING RETREAT- Somerset, KY, US | Brian Thornton',NULL,'weekly','2600 Close Rd','KY',NULL,'Somerset','42501','US',-84.3116830,37.0337630,'Kentucky',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:17',0,'men','2023-04-27 15:21:17','2023-04-30 15:21:17',NULL,'The retreat center will allow 16 participants. Once it fills up, I will keep a waiting list in the event of any who need to dropout.\r\n\r\nRegistration for this event can be found here:\r\nhttps://form.jotform.com/203215134697050\r\n\r\nOnce you have registered I will contact you for payment information. The cost of the weekend will be $195.00 per person. This will cover the fee for lodging and food for the weekend.\r\n\r\n* All linens, pillows and towels are provided. Bring your own extra pillow and extra blankets, sleeping bag, etc, if desired\r\n\r\n* Filtered water will be available on site, but you might consider bringing some bottled water with you. Drinking water from the tap is not advisable.\r\n\r\n* Bring snacks that you like and wouldn\'t mind sharing. Also bring drinks that you like.\r\n\r\nThe facility has a generator to provide electricity. We will only use the generator during the sessions to run the videos. Appliances and hot water are gas powered. Feel free to bring flashlights, lamps, candles, etc. for lighting.\r\n\r\n**Get a copy of Becoming a King and read it before the retreat. (See the coupon link in this listing.) You might also want to consider getting a copy of the Becoming a King Study guide as well, but it isn\'t necessary for the retreat.  You will be receiving a note taking book as part of your registration.**\r\n\r\nDirections to the site: https://maps.apple.com/?address=2600%20Close%20Rd,%20Somerset,%20KY%20%2...\r\n\r\nI have photos of the location on my Facebook page. You can send me a friend request to see the photos. https://www.facebook.com/media/set/?set=a.10157915652930765&amp;type=3',18035,53015,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7760\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"2600 Close Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Somerset\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"KY\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"42501\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"37.033763\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-84.311683\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Kentucky\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/becoming-king-retreat-somerset-ky-us-brian-thornton',NULL,'2022-11-02 01:11:27','2024-04-10 15:21:17'),
	('9bc65be7-dbe5-4344-9fa1-c51442891af8',2,101,'WAH BASIC - Pine Valley, CA, US | Bobby Nothwang',NULL,'weekly','8668 Pine Creek Rd.','CA',NULL,'Pine Valley','91962','US',-116.5315400,32.8429150,'California',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:17',0,'men','2023-04-27 15:21:17','2023-04-30 15:21:17',NULL,'Hello brothers! My name is Bobby and I am so excited to partner up with Journey Community Church in La Mesa to bring you the Wild at Heart Basic. We will be in the beautiful hills of Pine Valley California at The Pine Valley Bible Conference Center http://pinevalleybible.com/. The facility has tons of activities and trails for hiking and exploring with lots of quiet space to just be with God. If you have never been through the Wild at Heart content, I am especially excited for you because your existence as a man in this world is about to change. If you are not ready for that then maybe this isn’t for you however, I assure you it’s exactly what you need. How do I know that? Well you’re here aren’t you? If you have any questions or concerns please don\'t hesitate to contact me directly.\r\n\r\nRegistration for this event is expected to be available in the coming weeks through the Journey Community Church Event\'s page https://journeycommunitychurch.com/events/. Until then please contact me directly if you want to pre-register and I will reserve your space.  There are only 24 spots available so if this is for you don’t hesitate. If you’re not sure and need prayer, I would be happy to pray with you and for you. Godspeed brothers, I hope to see you soon!',18205,421014,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7937\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"8668 Pine Creek Rd.\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Pine Valley\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"91962\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"32.842915\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-116.531540\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"California\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-pine-valley-ca-us-bobby-nothwang-0',NULL,'2023-01-02 06:01:28','2024-04-10 15:21:17'),
