	('9bc65be9-03f7-4213-9eef-f350fb0f8930',4,1459,'BECOMING A KING RETREAT- Colorado Springs, CO, US | Brad Steininger',NULL,'weekly','5125 Brady Rd','CO',NULL,'Colorado Springs','80915','US',-104.7319960,38.8627910,'Colorado',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:18',0,'men','2023-04-20 15:21:18','2023-04-23 15:21:18',NULL,'NOTE: Registration for this event is closed (all the slots have been filled).\r\n\r\nWhen: Thur-Sun, April 20-23, 2023 (arrive at 5:00 pm Thursday, depart after 12:00 Sunday)\r\n\r\nWhere: The Outpost at Stein Haus, 5125 Brady Rd, Colorado Springs, CO 80915\r\n\r\nWho: It is open to men of all ages (18 and above). This retreat can accommodate up to 4 men.\r\n\r\nAccommodations: Four men will share a single large room (bunk beds). Everyone will have a bed, pillow, linens and towels. There is one bathroom with a shower/sink/toilet and a second bathroom with a sink/toilet.\r\n\r\nCost: $77 which includes lodging, all meals and retreat content. A nonrefundable deposit of $50 is due no later than six weeks prior to the retreat via check or PayPal. Full payment of the remaining $27 is due upon arrival at the retreat.\r\n\r\nRegistration: Please contact Brad Steininger to register or to request more information.\r\n\r\nOther info:\r\n\r\n* This event is designed to be experienced \"off the grid;\" we require participants to unplug from all devices. There will be a contact number provided for emergencies.\r\n\r\n* A couple hours of free time is built into the schedule both Friday and Saturday afternoons. During this time you will have the opportunity to participate in a hike, leisure time around the facility, take a nap, read a book, etc.\r\n\r\n* This retreat is in a rustic neighborhood on the East side of Colorado Springs (mostly dirt roads and equestrian properties). Bring season-appropriate casual clothes. There are some trails nearby for hiking and an excellent park with many trails just a couple miles away.\r\n\r\n* In the evenings, there will be an opportunity to relax, build a camp fire, tell stories and have fun. You\'ll leave with new friendships, greater clarity in your walk with the Lord, and inspired to live your life as a man fully alive.',18044,236529,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7770\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"5125 Brady Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Colorado Springs\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"80915\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"38.862791\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-104.731996\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Colorado\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/becoming-king-retreat-colorado-springs-co-us-brad-steininger-2',NULL,'2022-11-04 05:11:15','2024-04-10 15:21:18'),
	('9bc65be9-218c-4850-bd73-0d3797e70891',3,1716,'CORE - Lowesville, VA, US | Kathy Pollard',NULL,'weekly',' 2247 Little Piney Rd','VA',NULL,'Lowesville','22967','US',-79.1381160,37.7660720,'Virginia',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:18',0,'men','2023-04-20 15:21:18','2023-04-23 15:21:18',NULL,'We hope you join us in the beautiful Blue Ridge mountains of Virginia.  During our time here, you will be able to enjoy God\'s wonderous creation whether you hike up to \"the rock\" or sit quietly by the Little Piney River.  \r\n\r\nRegistration is open, so please contact us for more information.',18055,381642,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7782\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\" 2247 Little Piney Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Lowesville\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"VA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"22967\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"37.766072\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-79.138116\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Virginia\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/core-lowesville-va-us-kathy-pollard-1',NULL,'2022-11-08 09:11:56','2024-04-10 15:21:18'),
