	('9bc65be9-eddd-481b-a431-cdf985ccb924',5,1719,'WILD AT HEART - Waupaca, WI, US | Jacob Vegter',NULL,'weekly','1500 Roman Rd.','WI',NULL,'Waupaca','54981','US',-89.1194140,44.3584370,'Wisconsin',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:18',0,'men','2023-04-21 15:21:18',NULL,NULL,'I will be providing the Wild at Heart study guide but if you would like the Wild at Heart book itself please let me know and I will order it for you.',19789,432354,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8608\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"1500 Roman Rd.\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Waupaca\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"WI\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"54981\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"44.358437\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-89.119414\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Wisconsin\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wildatheart/small-group/wild-heart-waupaca-wi-us-jacob-vegter',NULL,'2023-04-14 10:04:54','2024-04-10 15:21:18'),
	('9bc65bea-0acd-4edf-8339-99692b31dffa',2,32,'WAH BASIC - Kinard, FL, US | Micah Duke',NULL,'weekly','11636 Chipola Park Rd','FL',NULL,'Kinard','32449','US',-85.1960280,30.2271120,'Florida',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:18',0,'men','2023-04-13 15:21:18','2023-04-16 15:21:18',NULL,'This event runs from Thursday at 5:30pm CST (check-in begins at 4:00PM CST) and runs until Sunday at noon. \r\n\r\nEVENT IS IN THE CENTRAL TIME ZONE. ALL TIMES ARE CENTRAL. \r\n\r\nThe cost for this event is $200.00.\r\nLodging and food are included.\r\nTowels and linens are provided.\r\nEach room sleeps 2-8 men. If registering for a group and would like to bunk together, please email ahead of time to make arrangements. \r\n\r\nThe number of attendees is capped at 20 men. \r\n\r\nThe facility has River frontage on the Dead Lakes, so attendees may bring fishing gear or kayaks. There are some kayaks available to use free of charge on a first come, first serve basis. There is also plenty of opportunity to explore nature, so pack appropriately. \r\n\r\nThis beautiful and historic host facility has been in operation for many years serving as a ministry to displaced and desperate people. Check out the YouTube video to see some great aerial video of the site. \r\nhttps://youtu.be/fzQbOOyc6eo\r\n\r\nLink to registration form:\r\nhttps://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfo1qW2aV3evrs8cjyO7FYrR74UWhRTqCXI4qJAu-rrPtrs4Q/viewform?vc=0&amp;c=0&amp;w=1&amp;flr=0',18318,339525,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8087\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"11636 Chipola Park Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Kinard\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"FL\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"32449\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"30.227112\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-85.196028\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Florida\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-kinard-fl-us-micah-duke',NULL,'2023-01-18 03:01:45','2024-04-10 15:21:18'),
	('9bc65bea-2921-42a4-8198-b391849409ed',2,23,'WAH BASIC - Bellvue, CO, US | Steve Shelton',NULL,'weekly','8233 Old Flowers Road','CO',NULL,'Bellvue','80512','US',-105.3883470,40.6327040,'Colorado',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:18',0,'men','2023-04-13 15:21:19','2023-04-16 15:21:19',NULL,'All food and lodging for the entire event are included in the registration fee.   We host our WAH BASICs at Sky Corral Ranch (https://skycorral.org/) which is a private 105 acre slice of heaven nestled in the mountains West of Fort Collins, Colorado.  \r\nThe ranch is spectacular and has plenty to offer, weather permitting (fishing, hiking, archery, basketball, pickleball, frisbee golf, horseshoes, volleyball, cornhole, billiards, ping pong, foosball, and darts).  \r\nHere is a little more info about our event:\r\n1)  The tap water at the ranch is very clean/refreshing so we have decided not to provide bottled drinking water.  Please bring your own refillable water bottles. We will also be providing coffee, tea, and juice.\r\n2)  The beds are all bunk bed style, each room consisting of 8 beds and 1 bathroom. We suggest you bring ear plugs.    Clean bedding is provided but feel free to bring your sleeping bag if you would like.\r\n3)  We ask that you bring your own toiletries including Toothpaste/Bath Soap/Shampoo.  Towels will be provided but feel free to bring your own if you prefer.  \r\n4)  Please bring your bible. The good old-fashioned book kind as we prefer this weekend to be Electronic free.   If you don’t have one, just let us know and we’ll fix that.   THERE IS NO CELL SERVICE AT THE RANCH    We will provide an emergency number (land line) that friends and family will be able to reach you at if necessary.\r\n5)  Please take some time to read / re-read \"Wild at Heart\" prior to the event.   The book can be purchased directly from Amazon.\r\n6)  We have several hours of free time planned throughout the weekend. Feel free to bring your fishing poles / tackle as there is a private lake stocked with fish on the property.\r\n7)  We provide all the food for the entire event.   The majority of the food will be prepared on site by our volunteers and will be “ranch style”.   If you have any special dietary requests, please let us know ahead of time.    Meals provided are:  Dinner on Thursday; Breakfast, Lunch, and Dinner on Friday &amp; Saturday, and Breakfast on Sunday.\r\n8)  The event ends around noon on Sunday.\r\n9)   If you have any other specific questions about the event, please email them to Steve Shelton at Steve.Shelton@VintageCityChurch.com and we will do our best to answer them.\r\n10)  To register, click on the following link: https://vintage.churchcenter.com/registrations/events/1612645',18784,452508,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8419\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"8233 Old Flowers Road\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Bellvue\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"80512\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"40.632704\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-105.388347\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Colorado\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-bellvue-co-us-steve-shelton-0',NULL,'2023-03-02 08:03:38','2024-04-10 15:21:19'),
