	('9bc65bea-8324-403e-acf9-aa1fe45b0727',4,1720,'BECOMING A KING RETREAT- Mio, MI, US | Kevi Schaeffer',NULL,'weekly','615 12 St.','MI',NULL,'Mio','48647','US',-84.1398960,44.6466920,'Michigan',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:19',0,'men','2023-04-13 15:21:19','2023-04-16 15:21:19',NULL,'**UPDATE 4/10/23: We still have space for a few more guys. If you\'re a last-minute planner (I know how that goes) don\'t let that stop you from joining us. Send me an email for more info: kschaeffer1@gmail.com.\r\n\r\nThe event will be hosted in a beautiful lodge sitting on 60 acres with scenic views atop Mio Mountain.\r\n\r\n* This event is designed to be experienced \"off the grid;\" we require participants to unplug from all devices. There will be a contact number provided for emergencies.\r\n\r\n* A couple hours of free time is built into the schedule on both Friday and Saturday afternoons. During this time you will have the opportunity to participate in a hike, leisure time around the facility, take a nap, read a book, etc.\r\n\r\n* In the evenings, there will be an opportunity to relax, build a campfire, tell stories, and have fun. You\'ll leave with new friendships, greater clarity in your walk with the Lord, and inspired to live your life as a man fully alive.\r\n\r\nRetreat cost: $ free (donations accepted); Max participants: 15',18370,92146,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8153\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"615 12 St.\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Mio\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MI\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"48647\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"44.646692\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-84.139896\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Michigan\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/becoming-king-retreat-mio-mi-us-kevi-schaeffer',NULL,'2023-01-31 08:01:12','2024-04-10 15:21:19'),
