	('9bc65beb-7006-4605-abc7-13fe7fd8f019',2,1525,'WAH BASIC - Liberty, MO, US | Mark Reiter',NULL,'weekly','816 NE 350 P','MO',NULL,'Clinton','64735','US',-93.7101010,38.4160750,'Missouri',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:19',0,'men','2023-03-30 15:21:19','2023-04-02 15:21:19',NULL,'WHEN: Our next Boot Camp begins Thursday, March 30, 2023, at 6:30 PM and concludes on Sunday, April 2, 2023, at 12:00pm. Please prayerfully consider your application prior to submitting. By applying, you are agreeing to be present for the entire event.\r\n\r\nWHERE: LifeChange Camp is 13 miles north-east of Clinton, MO – appx. 1.5 hour drive from Kansas City.\r\n\r\nCOST: The cost for the event is $200. This includes lodging, meals (Thursday dinner – Sunday breakfast), and training materials. Participants are responsible for getting to and from LifeChange Camp. Limited scholarships are available. You can begin the scholarship application process on the Boot Camp Scholarship page at https://e6ministries.org/scholar_request\r\n\r\nThis event has limited space available so we encourage you register early.\r\n\r\nRegister at:  www.e6ministries.org/bootcamp',18275,260103,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8032\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"816 NE 350 P\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Clinton\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"64735\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"38.416075\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-93.710101\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Missouri\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-liberty-mo-us-mark-reiter',NULL,'2023-01-11 05:01:46','2024-04-10 15:21:19'),
	('9bc65beb-8d86-466a-ab0a-e9480a271a51',2,1634,'WAH BASIC - McGregor, MN, US | Erik Swenson',NULL,'weekly','','MN',NULL,'McGregor','','US',-93.3086870,46.6068260,'Minnesota',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:19',0,'men','2023-03-30 15:21:19','2023-04-02 15:21:19',NULL,'When: Thursday-Sunday, March 30 - April 2, 2022 (arrive between 3 and 4pm Thursday and depart after 12:30pm Sunday)\r\n\r\nWhere: Covenant Pines Bible Camp, McGregor, MN\r\nhttps://covenantpines.org/\r\n\r\nCost: $195 - includes lodging, all meals, snacks, on-site camp activities, materials and retreat content. \r\n\r\nAccommodations: Lodging will be bunk style (electricity, indoor restrooms, showers, etc). You can request a roommate, otherwise roommates will be assigned. Retreat center also includes a meeting hall and gathering room with wood fireplace and coffee on tap. Dining hall is just a short walk across camp.\r\n\r\nActivities: On-site activities will be available during free time including hiking, basketball, pickleball, crate stacking challenge, game room, sauna, nightly campfires, coffee shop, etc. And the camp can always use help cutting firewood for anyone interested in a good work project.\r\n\r\nWhat to bring: Bedding, towel, indoor and outdoor clothing for activities. \r\n\r\nTo sign up, click on the google link below to complete a short registration form. Payment options are included on the form.\r\n\r\nhttps://forms.gle/hU8ntjNFC1B11kwr9\r\n\r\nWith questions, feel free to contact Erik Swenson at formedforgood@gmail.com or 612-597-1906.',17996,436224,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7721\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"McGregor\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MN\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"46.606826\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-93.308687\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Minnesota\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/