	('9bc65bed-9ca0-44a4-9d77-ff8b2897961d',4,1459,'BECOMING A KING RETREAT- Colorado Springs, CO, US | Brad Steininger',NULL,'weekly','5125 Brady Rd','CO',NULL,'Colorado Springs','80915','US',-104.7319960,38.8627910,'Colorado',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:21',0,'men','2023-03-09 15:21:21','2023-03-12 15:21:21',NULL,'NOTE: Registration for this event is closed (all the slots have been filled).\r\n\r\nWhen: Thur-Sun, March 9-12th, 2023 (arrive at 5:00 pm Thursday, depart after 12:00 Sunday)\r\n\r\nWhere: The Outpost at Stein Haus, 5125 Brady Rd, Colorado Springs, CO 80915\r\n\r\nWho: It is open to men of all ages (18 and above). This retreat can accommodate up to 4 men.\r\n\r\nAccommodations: Four men will share a single large room (bunk beds). Everyone will have a bed, pillow, linens and towels. There is one bathroom with a shower/sink/toilet and a second bathroom with a sink/toilet.\r\n\r\nCost: $77 which includes lodging, all meals and retreat content. A nonrefundable deposit of $50 is due no later than six weeks prior to the retreat via check or PayPal. Full payment of the remaining $27 is due upon arrival at the retreat.\r\n\r\nRegistration: Please contact Brad Steininger to register or to request more information.\r\n\r\nOther info:\r\n\r\n* This event is designed to be experienced \"off the grid;\" we require participants to unplug from all devices. There will be a contact number provided for emergencies.\r\n\r\n* A couple hours of free time is built into the schedule both Friday and Saturday afternoons. During this time you will have the opportunity to participate in a hike, leisure time around the facility, take a nap, read a book, etc.\r\n\r\n* This retreat is in a rustic neighborhood on the East side of Colorado Springs (mostly dirt roads and equestrian properties). Bring season-appropriate casual clothes. There are some trails nearby for hiking and an excellent park with many trails just a couple miles away.\r\n\r\n* In the evenings, there will be an opportunity to relax, build a camp fire, tell stories and have fun. You\'ll leave with new friendships, greater clarity in your walk with the Lord, and inspired to live your life as a man fully alive.',18031,236529,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7755\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"5125 Brady Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Colorado Springs\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"80915\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"38.862791\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-104.731996\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Colorado\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/becoming-king-retreat-colorado-springs-co-us-brad-steininger-1',NULL,'2022-11-02 06:11:29','2024-04-10 15:21:21'),
