	('9bc65bee-fd21-42de-af11-fb533f85d2bf',2,1044,'WAH BASIC - Edmond, OK, US | Brian Jackson',NULL,'weekly','533 Man O War Ct','OK',NULL,'Edmond','73025','US',-97.4884770,35.7007500,'Oklahoma',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:22',0,'men','2023-02-23 15:21:22','2023-02-26 15:21:22',NULL,'Gentlemen, I will be hosting this event from my home so we will be limiting the size of the event to between 8 and 10 attendees.  Please contact me soon if you are interested in attending, as spaces will likely fill up fast.\r\n\r\nAccommodations: \r\nOur home is a 4000 sq. ft. multi-generational two-story layout. We have 4 available beds and will be purchasing air mattresses on stands for the additional sleeping arrangements.  We will be providing all bedding and toiletries, but if you have a favorite pillow feel free to bring it.\r\n\r\nWe live in a neighborhood, but we will have a firepit in the backyard to enjoy during our break sessions.  Weather depending, our neighborhood has walking trails and places to get away for reflection.\r\n\r\nMy wife will not be staying onsite during the event but will be in and out through the event to help with meal accommodations.\r\n\r\nActivities: \r\nOn Saturday during the break time, we will have an opportunity to break up into groups and enjoy the local indoor gun range or an outdoor skeet &amp; trap range.  Feel free to bring your favorite firearm.\r\n\r\nIf you have additional questions, feel free to contact me. The cost of the event will be minimal for meals and supplies.',17970,412917,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7695\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"533 Man O War Ct\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Edmond\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"OK\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"73025\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"35.700750\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-97.488477\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Oklahoma\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-edmond-ok-us-brian-jackson',NULL,'2022-10-15 08:10:03','2024-04-10 15:21:22'),
