	('9bc65bf0-2469-4158-a375-64b038a1d85e',2,76,'WAH BASIC - Lake Wales, FL, US | Ed Murphy',NULL,'weekly','237 Golden Bough Rd, Lake Wales, FL 33898','FL',NULL,'Lake Wales','33898','US',-81.4669050,27.8835930,'Florida',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:22',0,'men','2023-02-16 15:21:22','2023-02-19 15:21:22',NULL,'Florida in February!  Pack for warm days and cool nights. Lake activities include swimming, kayaking, paddle boats and fishing. Sports activities include game room, basketball, disc golf, and paintball. Towels, linens and fishing gear provided. \r\n\r\nShuttle service is available from Orlando and Tampa airports. Flights must arrive BEFORE 2pm on Thursday and depart AFTER 4pm on Sunday to utilize this free service.',17696,236318,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7396\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"237 Golden Bough Rd, Lake Wales, FL 33898\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Lake Wales\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"FL\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"33898\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"27.883593\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-81.466905\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Florida\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-lake-wales-fl-us-ed-murphy-0',NULL,'2022-07-18 01:07:17','2024-04-10 15:21:22'),
	('9bc65bf0-41ab-407a-a3f5-ac59b5e6af67',4,1459,'BECOMING A KING RETREAT- Colorado Springs, CO, US | Brad Steininger',NULL,'weekly','5125 Brady Rd','CO',NULL,'Colorado Springs','80915','US',-104.7319960,38.8627910,'Colorado',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:22',0,'men','2023-02-16 15:21:23','2023-02-19 15:21:23',NULL,'NOTE: Registration for this event is closed (all the slots have been filled).\r\n\r\nWhen: Thur-Sun, February 16-19th, 2023 (arrive at 5:00 pm Thursday, depart after 12:00 Sunday)\r\n\r\nWhere: The Outpost at Stein Haus, 5125 Brady Rd, Colorado Springs, CO 80915\r\n\r\nWho: It is open to men of all ages (18 and above). This retreat can accommodate up to 4 men.\r\n\r\nAccommodations: Four men will share a single large room (bunk beds). Everyone will have a bed, pillow, linens and towels. There is one bathroom with a shower/sink/toilet and a second bathroom with a sink/toilet.\r\n\r\nCost: $77 which includes lodging, all meals and retreat content. A nonrefundable deposit of $50 is due no later than six weeks prior to the retreat via check or PayPal. Full payment of the remaining $27 is due upon arrival at the retreat.\r\n\r\nRegistration: Please contact Brad Steininger to register or to request more information.\r\n\r\nOther info:\r\n\r\n* This event is designed to be experienced \"off the grid;\" we require participants to unplug from all devices. There will be a contact number provided for emergencies.\r\n\r\n* A couple hours of free time is built into the schedule both Friday and Saturday afternoons. During this time you will have the opportunity to participate in a hike, leisure time around the facility, take a nap, read a book, etc.\r\n\r\n* This retreat is in a rustic neighborhood on the East side of Colorado Springs (mostly dirt roads and equestrian properties). Bring season-appropriate casual clothes. There are some trails nearby for hiking and an excellent park with many trails just a couple miles away.\r\n\r\n* In the evenings, there will be an opportunity to relax, build a camp fire, tell stories and have fun. You\'ll leave with new friendships, greater clarity in your walk with the Lord, and inspired to live your life as a man fully alive.',18083,236529,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7809\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"5125 Brady Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Colorado Springs\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"80915\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"38.862791\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-104.731996\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Colorado\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/becoming-king-retreat-colorado-springs-co-us-brad-steininger-3',NULL,'2022-11-18 01:11:40','2024-04-10 15:21:23'),
	('9bc65bf0-5efc-451d-b5aa-1f18f3f7eeb5',5,1741,'WILD AT HEART - Lisbon, OH, US | Scott Ricciardi DC',NULL,'weekly','361 E Lincoln Way','OH',NULL,'Lisbon','44432','US',-80.7627210,40.7724970,'Ohio',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:23',0,'men','2023-02-25 15:21:23',NULL,NULL,'',18483,127523,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8306\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"361 E Lincoln Way\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Lisbon\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"OH\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"44432\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"40.772497\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-80.762721\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Ohio\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wildatheart/small-group/wild-heart-lisbon-oh-us-scott-ricciardi-dc',NULL,'2023-02-13 02:02:44','2024-04-10 15:21:23'),
	('9bc65bf0-7c82-40af-bf22-67a87d3534d4',2,573,'WAH BASIC - Marble Falls, TX, US | Marc Bonasso',NULL,'weekly','1552 CR 344','TX',NULL,'Marble Falls','78654','US',-98.1679360,30.5432620,'Texas',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:23',0,'men','2023-02-09 15:21:23','2023-02-12 15:21:23',NULL,'Wild at Heart BASIC @ Camp of the Hills - Marble Falls, Texas\r\nThursday Evening, February 9 – Sunday at Noon, February 12\r\n\r\nREGISTER TODAY\r\nRegistration is closed for this event.\r\n*Registration is open to men 18 and older.\r\n\r\nWHAT\'S INCLUDED\r\nThe cost of attending this BASIC Event is $150. This cost includes 4 days/3 nights stay at Camp of the Hills, all meals during your stay (7 meals beginning Friday AM) and certain amenities at the camp. All Wild at Heart video content and materials are generously provided by Wild at Heart at no cost.\r\n\r\nWHAT TO BRING:\r\nBunk House Lodging is included in the registration price. You will be staying at various bunk houses on the property. These are communal cabins with twin beds, indoor toilets and showers, AC and Heating. You will need to bring your own linens: Towels, twin sheets, blanket, pillow, or sleeping bag. It will likely be cold in February so dress in layers. Journals and pens will be provided.\r\n\r\nOPENING NIGHT:\r\nCheck-in is from 5p-7p on Thursday evening and the opening session for the BASIC will begin promptly at 7:30p. So grab some dinner on your way out to the camp and we\'ll see you then!\r\n\r\nLOCATION\r\nThis BASIC event is taking place at Camp of the Hills Retreat Center in Marble Falls, Texas: \r\nhttps://www.campofthehills.org\r\n\r\nCAMP AMENITIES \r\nThe following amenities will be available to the BASIC event attendees on Friday and Saturday afternoon during free time:\r\n\r\n1. Covered Pavilion Area (open space with optional basketball courts, 9 square, gaga ball, etc.)\r\n2. Sand Volleyball Court\r\n3. Fishing Ponds (Catch and Release ONLY)\r\n4. Lakefront access to Lake Travis with boat ramp\r\n5. Soccer and Softball fields with bathroom facilities\r\n6. Picnic Table areas\r\n7. Scenic overlook at The Crosses with a seating area and amazing view of sunset &amp; lake – perfect for devotionals and other small gatherings.\r\n8. Hiking Trails',17871,218702,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7576\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"1552 CR 344\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Marble Falls\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"TX\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"78654\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"30.543262\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-98.167936\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Texas\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-marble-falls-tx-us-marc-bonasso',NULL,'2022-09-19 07:09:18','2024-04-10 15:21:23'),
	('9bc65bf0-9a72-442a-a1c3-ac648a1280ae',2,1742,'WAH BASIC - Brookfield, WI, US | Brian Edwards',NULL,'weekly','3725 N 125th St ','WI',NULL,'Brookfield','53219','US',-88.0673570,43.0994430,'Wisconsin',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:23',0,'men','2023-02-06 15:21:23','2023-02-09 15:21:23',NULL,'',18320,262434,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8090\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"3725 N 125th St \\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"Ste J\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Brookfield\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"WI\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"53219\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"43.099443\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-88.067357\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Wisconsin\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-brookfield-wi-us-brian-edwards',NULL,'2023-01-19 07:01:05','2024-04-10 15:21:23'),
