	('9bc65bf1-8859-4aa3-b201-c140eb461c64',2,1470,'WAH BASIC - Medical Lake, WA, US | Rollie Snider',NULL,'weekly','Silver Lake Camp','WA',NULL,'Medical Lake','99022','US',-117.6588750,47.5545650,'Washington',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:23',0,'men','2023-01-26 15:21:23','2023-01-29 15:21:23',NULL,'Expect cold weather at Silver Lake Camp near Spokane, WA (https://silverlakecamp.org) - IF (only if) the ice on Silver Lake is thick enough we\'ll offer. . . ICE FISHING!  (Some equipment will be supplied).  Camp beds and mattresses are comfy, but you\'ll need to bring a pillow &amp; sleeping bag as bedding is not included.  We\'ll supply an official Wild at Heart BASIC journal for note-taking, but bring along a pen, Bible, and whatever journals and other reading materials as you see fit.  Be prepared for MANY indoor and outdoor activities for an amazing life-changing weekend!  \r\n\r\nBe sure to \"Like\" us on Facebook: bit.ly/AKNfacebook and check out our NEW website at allkingsnet.com.',17908,53282,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7623\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"Silver Lake Camp\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"10919 S Lakehurst Dr\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Medical Lake\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"WA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"99022\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"47.554565\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-117.658875\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Washington\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-medical-lake-wa-us-rollie-snider',NULL,'2022-09-29 07:09:53','2024-04-10 15:21:23'),
	('9bc65bf1-a589-4f80-9da7-cdbdb88a3f57',2,118,'WAH BASIC - Estes Park, CO, US | Gail McLain',NULL,'weekly','515 Grand Estates Dr.','CO',NULL,'Estes Park','80517','US',-105.4955580,40.3788690,'Colorado',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:23',0,'men','2023-01-26 15:21:23','2023-01-29 15:21:23',NULL,'“Wild at Heart BASIC &amp; CORE for COUPLES!  Many times spouses bring previous wounds into a marriage, which unresolved, create conflict and even more pain.  Thru the BASIC &amp; CORE videos, John &amp; his team will speak into the men’s heart while at the same time, Staci and her team will speak to the women’s hearts.  Location: Estes Park, Colorado.  \r\n\r\nOften times, after a spouse attends either a Captivating/CORE or Bootcamp/BASIC event, they come home with lifelong wounds healed and have experienced the deep, deep love of our Father.  Yet their spouse has no clue what they’ve experienced.  Thus, with the permission of the Wild at Heart Team, we are offering both on the same weekend for couples. \r\n\r\nJohn Eldredge &amp; his team know how to speak into a man’s heart, dealing with issues they may have struggled with, possibly since childhood.  Staci &amp; her team, as well, know the tender parts of a woman’s heart. Both teams will lead you to the Father’s heart to bring healing and deepen your relationship with the Lord and as a result it will strengthen your love for one another. \r\n\r\nCost:  $650. Includes lodging &amp; meals (Thurs dinner - Sat brunch)\r\n\r\nPlease email or text Gail for a registration form, which will give more details.  It\'s best to return your registration &amp; payment at your earliest convenience to reserve your place, deadline; January 19, 2023.  Space is limited.  Otherwise, your name will be added to a wait list in case of cancellations and will be contacted after the registration deadline.   \r\n\r\nPlease feel free to call if you have questions;  \r\nGail      970/310.3492    BristolMountainHome@gmail.com \r\nFor a view of the property;    www.youtube.com/watch?v=muiYov4Ku8o&amp;t=14s',18110,434550,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7836\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"515 Grand Estates Dr.\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Estes Park\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"80517\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"40.378869\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-105.495558\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Colorado\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-estes-park-co-us-gail-mclain',NULL,'2022-11-24 09:11:47','2024-04-10 15:21:23'),
	('9bc65bf1-c3c7-45e2-830b-d08e4bd2ec6b',3,1749,'CORE - Chapin , SC, US | Rebecca Wilson',NULL,'weekly','1416 Old Rd. ','SC',NULL,'Chapin ','29036','US',-81.2671550,34.1209920,'South Carolina',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:23',0,'men','2023-01-26 15:21:23','2023-01-29 15:21:23',NULL,'We will be staying in a beautiful VRBO on Lake Murray. Bring your swim suit if you’d like to enjoy time in the hot tub! (There are also 2 kayaks and 2 paddle boards however, I\'ve been told that the lake is down 10 feet so I\'m not sure they will be usable.) Come ready for any type of weather because we are in SC and it fluctuates a lot! Meals and snacks will be provided Thursday evening through Sunday at lunchtime. You are welcome to bring snacks if there is something specific you’d like to have. (Please inform us if you have any food allergies.)',18175,389982,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7907\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"1416 Old Rd. \\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Chapin \\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"SC\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"29036\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"34.120992\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-81.267155\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"South Carolina\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/core-chapin-sc-us-rebecca-wilson',NULL,'2022-12-17 10:12:00','2024-04-10 15:21:24'),
