	('9bc65bf2-9306-4b19-86b3-059301cef487',3,1712,'CORE - Florissant, CO, US | Tyler McKay',NULL,'weekly','178 Palmer Dr','CO',NULL,'Florissant','80816','US',-105.2423830,38.9250840,'Colorado',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:24',0,'men','2023-01-19 15:21:24','2023-01-22 15:21:24',NULL,'To register or for more information on this and other future events, please visit us at: \r\nbelovedsons.net',18021,399054,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7745\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"178 Palmer Dr\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Florissant\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"80816\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"38.925084\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-105.242383\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Colorado\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/core-florissant-co-us-tyler-mckay',NULL,'2022-11-01 11:11:56','2024-04-10 15:21:24'),
	('9bc65bf2-b121-418b-8dc9-e2e6e78f92e7',4,1459,'BECOMING A KING RETREAT- Colorado Springs, CO, US | Brad Steininger',NULL,'weekly','5125 Brady Rd','CO',NULL,'Colorado Springs','80915','US',-104.7319960,38.8627910,'Colorado',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:24',0,'men','2023-01-19 15:21:24','2023-01-22 15:21:24',NULL,'NOTE: Registration for this event is closed (all the slots have been filled).\r\n\r\nWhat: Becoming a King Retreat is for men who are fully consented to becoming wholehearted kings, in the company of wise, older men who have taken the ancient path.  The retreat is designed for world-changing men who are ready to become the kind of men, the kind of kings, to whom God can gladly entrust the care of his Kingdom.  It is open to men of all ages (18 and above).\r\n\r\nWhen: Thur-Sun, January 19-22th, 2023 (arrive at 5:00 pm Thursday, depart after 12:00 Sunday)\r\n\r\nWhere: The Outpost at Stein Haus, 5125 Brady Rd, Colorado Springs, CO 80915\r\n\r\nWho: This retreat can accommodate up to 4 men (there will be a waiting list in the event someone needs to dropout).\r\n\r\nAccommodations: Four men will share a single large room (bunk beds). Everyone will have a bed, pillow, linens and towels. There is one bathroom with a shower/sink/toilet and a second bathroom with a sink/toilet.\r\n\r\nCost: $77 which includes lodging, all meals and retreat content. A nonrefundable deposit of $50 is due no later than six weeks prior to the retreat via check or PayPal. Full payment of the remaining $27 is due upon arrival at the retreat.\r\n\r\nRegistration: Please contact Brad Steininger to register or to request more information.\r\n\r\nOther info:\r\n\r\n* This event is designed to be experienced \"off the grid;\" we require participants to unplug from all devices. There will be a contact number provided for emergencies.\r\n\r\n* A couple hours of free time is built into the schedule both Friday and Saturday afternoons. During this time you will have the opportunity to participate in a hike, leisure time around the facility, take a nap, read a book, etc.\r\n\r\n* This retreat is in a rustic neighborhood on the East side of Colorado Springs (mostly dirt roads and equestrian properties). Bring season-appropriate casual clothes. There are some trails nearby for hiking and an excellent park with many trails just a couple miles away.\r\n\r\n* In the evenings, there will be an opportunity to relax, build a camp fire, tell stories and have fun. You\'ll leave with new friendships, greater clarity in your walk with the Lord, and inspired to live your life as a man fully alive.\r\n\r\n* This event utilizes the content provided by the Wild at Heart team in their Becoming a King Retreat (this resource, filmed at a live event, includes eight sessions led by Morgan Snyder). This trailer provides a glimpse into the heart behind the message: \r\n\r\nhttps://becomegoodsoil.com/retreat/',17892,236529,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7601\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"5125 Brady Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Colorado Springs\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"80915\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"38.862791\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-104.731996\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Colorado\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/becoming-king-retreat-colorado-springs-co-us-brad-steininger-0',NULL,'2022-09-23 01:09:23','2024-04-10 15:21:24'),
	('9bc65bf2-cebc-4c35-a7a9-3b2afec88b6e',3,1633,'CORE - Caroline, AB, CA | Sharleen Thornberry',NULL,'weekly','Clearwater College','AB',NULL,'Caroline','TOM0M0','CA',-114.9020080,52.0854110,'Alberta',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:24',0,'men','2023-01-19 15:21:24','2023-01-22 15:21:24',NULL,'Event starts at 4pm on January 19th and ends at 12pm on the 22nd.\r\n\r\nPlease bring queen sized bedding and towels. Not all of the rooms are queen sized but if you happen to get one of the queen beds, you will need that size of bedding. Some rooms are queen and some are two twin beds. Rooms will be first come first serve.\r\n\r\nMeals provided: Supper on Thursday. Three meals Friday and Saturday. Breakfast and lunch on Sunday.\r\n\r\nFacility:  http://www.clearwatercollege.com/home\r\n\r\nMap to location: http://www.clearwatercollege.com/contact-us\r\n\r\nCost per person: $200 CA\r\n\r\nRegistration: email Laura Sandstra at laura.sandstra@gmail.com to register. Please let Laura know if you have any dietary restrictions. An additional event informational document will be sent to you upon your registration.\r\n\r\nPayment: etransfer the full amount to Laura at the above email or send a cheque to Laura at the following address:  RR1, Site 20, Box 9, Rocky Mountain House, Alberta T4T 2A1. If you are paying via cheque, let Laura know when you send her an email to register.\r\n\r\nDeadline for registration is January 6th, 2023.',18140,411004,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7870\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"Clearwater College\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Caroline\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"AB\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"TOM0M0\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"ca\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"52.085411\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-114.902008\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Alberta\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"Canada\\\"}\"','/core-caroline-ab-ca-sharleen-thornberry',NULL,'2022-12-05 05:12:55','2024-04-10 15:21:24'),
