	('9bc65bf3-7d64-477d-8c1e-538ea76f417f',4,1754,'BECOMING A KING RETREAT- Inwood, IA, US | Casey Buller',NULL,'weekly','1242 280th Street','IA',NULL,'Inwood','51240','US',-96.5337290,43.2524410,'Iowa',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:25',0,'men','2023-01-12 15:21:25','2023-01-15 15:21:25',NULL,'Location:\r\nInspiration Hills Camp and Retreat Center, Inwood, IA. \r\n\r\nSpace is limited to the 40 men. \r\n\r\nCost: $180 per person includes meals, accommodations, sessions, and activities. \r\n\r\nWhat to bring:\r\nBedding is provided entirely. Bring personal toiletries and a shower towel. Bring comfortable clothes and some good shoes for walking along the wooded trails.\r\n\r\nSleeping Arrangement:\r\nRooms will be private with 2-3 guys per room, each with their own bed. There will be a bathroom for each room. \r\n\r\nRegister:\r\nhttps://www.ndwildatheart.org/event-details/becoming-a-king-retreat-south-dakota',17977,428677,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7701\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"1242 280th Street\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Inwood\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"IA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"51240\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"43.252441\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-96.533729\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Iowa\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/becoming-king-retreat-inwood-ia-us-casey-buller',NULL,'2022-10-16 08:10:48','2024-04-10 15:21:25'),
