	('9bc65bf3-d645-4f44-aa74-2be9dc34ce42',3,1756,'CORE - SAN CARLOS, SJ, CR | Katrina Kiselinchev',NULL,'weekly','Atlanta Buckhead Home with Outdoor Space','GA',NULL,'Atlanta','30326','US',-121.8852530,37.3387400,'Georgia',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:25',0,'men','2023-01-12 15:21:25','2023-01-15 15:21:25',NULL,'I am so excited to see what God does through my agreeing to host Captivating Core! \r\nThe ministry, book, and Core has brought immeasurable transformation to my life. \r\nWe will tune in to all the sessions in incredible Atlanta at a beautiful multi-color property with a pool! You will be in awe!  \r\n\r\nWe will be unplugged at beautiful space with outdoor surroundings! \r\n\r\nIn the future, I will host one internationally!\r\n\r\nEmail for more details on options, Costa Rica Covid Requirements, and pricing!',16927,439801,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"6671\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"Atlanta Buckhead Home with Outdoor Space\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Atlanta\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"GA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"30326\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"37.338740\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-121.885253\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Georgia\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/core-san-carlos-sj-cr-katrina-kiselinchev',NULL,'2021-12-17 08:12:36','2024-04-10 15:21:25'),
