	('9bc65bf4-c154-4c64-b1bd-7d7738f6cb45',2,1665,'WAH BASIC - Orderville, UT, US | Chris Ashworth',NULL,'weekly','West Pheasant Run Road','UT',NULL,'Sevier','84766','US',-112.2271850,38.6055040,'Utah',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:25',0,'men','2022-12-29 15:21:25','2023-01-01 15:21:25',NULL,'An incredible way to begin the new year! During the 4 days set among the snow-covered mountains of Central Utah, you will participate in a multi-media experience which will help you discover something profound about your own heart and the heart of God.\r\nThis isn’t your typical retreat. You will not be asked to break into small groups and share your feelings. Instead you will hear from other men living an intentional life in pursuit of the heart of God. Bring hiking boots for the trails and prepare for snow. Past attendees have indicated that this weekend has been a transformational experience in their walk with God.\r\nCost is $150 to cover lodging. Bring your own meals that take less than 10 minutes to prepare and clean up. Here is a link to the cabin where we\'ll be staying:\r\nhttps://www.airbnb.com/rooms/22586821\r\n\r\nArrive between 5-6pm, Dec 29th. We\'ll be done by noon, Jan 1st.\r\nIn order to make this a transformational experience, we ask you to disconnect from your world during the event. Please commit to no cell phones, wifi, or work.',18097,405815,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7822\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"West Pheasant Run Road\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Sevier\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"UT\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"84766\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"38.605504\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-112.227185\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Utah\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-orderville-ut-us-chris-ashworth-0',NULL,'2022-11-22 04:11:17','2024-04-10 15:21:25'),
