	('9bc65bf7-34bd-4c02-8e63-939847537780',2,744,'WAH BASIC - Melrose, FL, US | Andrew Hobbs',NULL,'weekly','647 SR 26','FL',NULL,'Melrose','32666','US',-82.0073330,29.7160490,'Florida',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:27',0,'men','2022-11-03 15:21:27','2022-11-06 15:21:27',NULL,'Experience Fall in Florida at the Lake Swan Retreat Campground! \r\nActivities include fishing disc golf swimming archery and more…all surrounding the beautiful spring -fed Lake Swan. \r\nFeel free to bring your bike or just relax and catch up on your rest! \r\nExperience old Florida with great home-style cooked food and dorm style bunk lodging. \r\nThe largest largemouth bass ever caught on record (over 11lbs) for this lake was at this Wild at Heart  event last year, and it was released back into the lake so you know what that means!!\r\nYou will need your own fishing gear✅\r\nHigh upper 70’s-80’s\r\nLow upper 50’s - low 60’s\r\nBring a headlamp/or flashlight\r\nBring a full bedding linens or a sleeping bag/pillow\r\nRegistration can be made by emailing me your information &amp; payment Venmo or check\r\n$180 includes everything \r\nJoin us and/or sponsor another man to attend paying it forward!\r\n\r\nLove God Live Free!\r\nhttps://youtu.be/-R1aRkn3S1I',17927,88539,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7647\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"647 SR 26\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Melrose\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"FL\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"32666\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"29.716049\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-82.007333\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Florida\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-melrose-fl-us-andrew-hobbs',NULL,'2022-10-03 12:10:49','2024-04-10 15:21:27'),
