	('9bc65bf7-a97c-43db-9a5d-745bfe45d98f',4,1130,'BECOMING A KING RETREAT- Cape Fair, MO, US | Michael Hogan',NULL,'weekly','10620 West State Hwy 76','MO',NULL,'Cape Fair','65624','US',-93.5389290,36.7353610,'Missouri',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:27',0,'men','2022-10-27 15:21:27','2022-10-30 15:21:27',NULL,'LOCATION:\r\nF14 RANCH IS 75 GORGEOUS ACRES IN THE HEART OF THE OZARK MOUNTAINS, OVERLOOKING TABLE ROCK LAKE NEAR BRANSON, MISSOURI.\r\n\r\nSpace is limited to the 1st 20 men who register. Registration link coming soon. \r\n\r\n$250 per person includes meals, accommodations, sessions, and activities. Bring $25 for additional (optional) activities in Branson, MO\r\n\r\nWHAT TO BRING:\r\n\r\nBedding is provided entirely. Bring personal toiletries and a shower towel. Bring comfortable clothes and some good shoes for walking along the wooded trails. \r\n\r\nWHAT ARE THE SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS?\r\n\r\nF14 Ranch has a beautiful log cabin lodge with two extra large rooms. Each room is equipped with one king size bed and 8 twins. Each room has a fully equipped bathroom with shower. We also have a shower room in the meeting hall if you so desire. Each bed is equipped with an electrical outlet and a personal reading light. \r\n\r\nFREEDOM-14 MINISTRIES IS A 501(C)3 NON-PROFIT ORGANIZATION DEDICATED TO THE PURPOSE OF PROVIDING THE FACILITIES AND THE MEANS FOR CHRIST-CENTERED EXPERIENCES. \r\n\r\nWWW.F14RANCH.ORG',17890,117732,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7599\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"10620 West State Hwy 76\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Cape Fair\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"65624\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"36.735361\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-93.538929\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Missouri\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/becoming-king-retreat-cape-fair-mo-us-michael-hogan',NULL,'2022-09-23 10:09:18','2024-04-10 15:21:27'),
