	('9bc65bfa-c02b-47e0-8f9f-60b1cfdaa25b',6,1786,'CAPTIVATING - Delisle, SK, CA |  ',NULL,'weekly','417 - 2nd Street East','SK',NULL,'Delisle','S0L 0P0','CA',-107.1301670,51.9266310,'Saskatchewan',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:29',0,'women','2022-10-17 15:21:29',NULL,NULL,'Come and join us on either a Monday evening at 7 pm or Tuesday morning at 10 am. Both studies will be the same, with a different facilitator. You are welcome to either one.',17943,455968,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7666\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"417 - 2nd Street East\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Delisle\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"SK\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"S0L 0P0\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"ca\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"51.926631\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-107.130167\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Saskatchewan\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"Canada\\\"}\"','/captivating/small-group/captivating-delisle-sk-ca',NULL,'2022-10-06 01:10:17','2024-04-10 15:21:29'),
	('9bc65bfa-dca3-4de0-a977-c9e1df22e5d4',2,1543,'WAH BASIC - Colcord, OK, US | Brent Farmer',NULL,'weekly','160 New Life Ranch Dr. ','OK',NULL,'Colcord','74338','US',-94.6415680,36.2185980,'Oklahoma',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:29',0,'men','2022-10-06 15:21:29','2022-10-09 15:21:29',NULL,'Join Us for a Pause in your life of 4 days getting your heart back and doing life with Men in the NWA area!\r\n\r\nDue on the First day: $195 All Food, Activities, and, Rooms included in the Price\r\nScholarships available [Full &amp; Partial]\r\n\r\nActivities Available during the break:\r\nSkeet Shooting: Friday 2 hours\r\n\r\nCanoeing - Kayaking - Fishing (bring your own gear) - Mountain Biking (bring your own bike and helmet) - Hiking - Carpetball - Corn Hole - Smashball - Nine Square - Pickleball - Basketball - Sand Volleyball - Wiffleball - Disc Golf - Ultimate Frisbee - Flicker - Football - Soccer - Tetherball - Jump Pillow - Foosball - Ping Pong - Basketball - Dodgeball - Volleyball - Floor Hockey - Soccer\r\n\r\nMore info to come on Packing lists:\r\nYou will need a Sheet, Blanket &amp; Pillow or a Sleeping bag &amp; Pillow (Mattress Provided)  \r\n\r\nPlease Reach out to Brent Farmer @ 479-305-1403 or Brent.farmer2@gmail.com\r\n\r\nEvent Starts 500 pm Thursday Oct 6th - Ends Sunday Oct 9th at 1pm\r\n\r\nhttps://vimeo.com/744265678',17713,428932,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7419\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"160 New Life Ranch Dr. \\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Colcord\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"OK\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"74338\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"36.218598\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-94.641568\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Oklahoma\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-colcord-ok-us-brent-farmer',NULL,'2022-07-26 04:07:02','2024-04-10 15:21:29'),
	('9bc65bfa-f82c-43cc-9a0c-fe4c19e87c02',2,1469,'WAH BASIC - Effie, MN, US | Skip Johnson',NULL,'weekly','65328 County Road 235','MN',NULL,'Effie','56639','US',-93.5290540,47.8314650,'Minnesota',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:29',0,'men','2022-10-06 15:21:30','2022-10-09 15:21:30',NULL,'The weekend will be hosted at our farm and hunting property in Northern MN on the Bigfork River.\r\n\r\nCost: $200/person -- this covers lodging, food, drinks, atv/utv gas, etc.\r\n\r\nWhat to bring: For those who haven\'t been there, the location is definitely rustic and off the beaten path with several hundred acres to explore. There are ATV trails and a river running through the property, so pack accordingly to be outside a lot in Northern MN fall weather! Outside of appropriate clothing, some other ideas are:\r\n\r\n-ATV or SXS if you have one\r\n-Kayak or canoe for the river\r\n-Guns and Ammo for target shooting or trap\r\n-Sleeping bag &amp; pillow\r\n-Shoes for the river\r\n-Bug/tick spray\r\n-Bible or download a version\r\n-Flashlight/headlamp\r\n-Folding chair or camp chair\r\n-Journal and pen',17747,430547,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7457\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"65328 County Road 235\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Effie\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MN\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"56639\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"47.831465\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-93.529054\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Minnesota\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-effie-mn-us-skip-johnson-0',NULL,'2022-08-08 09:08:54','2024-04-10 15:21:30'),
