	('9bc65bfc-bff7-4356-a0f9-0581a833c6d0',3,118,'CORE - Estes Park, CO, US | Gail McLain',NULL,'weekly','515 Grand Estates Dr.','CO',NULL,'Estes Park','80517','US',-105.4955580,40.3788690,'Colorado',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:31',0,'men','2022-09-29 15:21:31','2022-10-02 15:21:31',NULL,'Bring; your Bible, journal, pen, water bottle, bath towels, personal toiletries and slippers.  Bedding will be provided.  Our mornings and evenings can be cool, so bring rain/snow layers for various weather conditions in the high country.   \r\n\r\nFor our free time (approx 3 hrs); feel free to bring a book you\'ve been wanting to read, a journal, art palate or hand work, piano music, comfortable walking/hiking shoes, snowshoes (weather pending that is!) or a mountain bike. \r\nThere is a 3 mile walking/biking path around nearby Lake Estes.\r\n\r\nMost of all, we\'ll provide the chocolate!  \r\n\r\nFor a view of the property; \r\nwww.youtube.com/watch?v=muiYov4Ku8o&amp;t=14s\r\n\r\nCost:  $350. Includes lodging &amp; meals (Thurs dinner - Sat brunch)\r\nPlease email or text Gail for a registration form, which gives more details.  It\'s best to return your registration &amp; payment at your earliest convenience to reserve your place.  Otherwise, your name will be added to a wait list in case of cancellations and will be contacted after the registration deadline.   \r\n\r\nFeel free to call if you have questions; Gail or Julie \r\nGail      970/310.3492    BristolMountainHome@gmail.com \r\nJulie     970/361.1931',17473,434550,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7191\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"515 Grand Estates Dr.\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Estes Park\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"80517\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"40.378869\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-105.495558\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Colorado\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/core-estes-park-co-us-gail-mclain-1',NULL,'2022-05-14 06:05:20','2024-04-10 15:21:31'),
