	('9bc65bfd-87b4-430d-a13e-f17e2c4f3117',3,754,'CORE - Effie, MN, US | Hannah Schmitt',NULL,'weekly','65328 County Rd 235','MN',NULL,'Effie','56639','US',-93.5290540,47.8314650,'Minnesota',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:31',0,'men','2022-09-22 15:21:31','2022-09-25 15:21:31',NULL,'Visit the registration link above for more details!',17745,442302,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7454\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"65328 County Rd 235\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Effie\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MN\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"56639\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"47.831465\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-93.529054\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Minnesota\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/core-effie-mn-us-hannah-schmitt-0',NULL,'2022-08-06 12:08:46','2024-04-10 15:21:31'),
	('9bc65bfd-a434-4dc2-b2aa-4f6b7c8b29ae',2,1471,'WAH BASIC - Wellsboro, PA, US | Pete Emhoff',NULL,'weekly','458 Phippen Road','PA',NULL,'Wellsboro','16901','US',-77.3411920,41.7647500,'Pennsylvania',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:31',0,'men','2022-09-22 15:21:31','2022-09-25 15:21:31',NULL,'The Wild at Heart Basic / True Pursuit weekend is a four-day modern treasure hunt (think Indiana Jones or National Treasure). What we will be looking for is the heart of man, when he is not faking it, and the true heart of God. To rescue and restore what has been lost, stolen, or surrendered. It is a journey that is well worth your time.\r\n \r\nThe Wild at Heart Basic is not a retreat about the “seven things a man should do to be a better man.” It is a four-day quest into the recovery of a man’s masculine soul, the release of a man’s heart—his passions and his true nature—all given him by God. Through video sessions led by John Eldredge and his team, personal stories from the True Pursuit team, film clips, times of reflection and journaling, and adventure activities, each man that attends will be invited to reconnect with God in a fresh and powerful way. The Wild at Heart message is a unique, powerful, no-BS message that has been setting men’s hearts free for over two decades.',17704,28280,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7408\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"458 Phippen Road\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Wellsboro\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"PA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"16901\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"41.764750\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-77.341192\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Pennsylvania\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-wellsboro-pa-us-pete-emhoff',NULL,'2022-07-19 01:07:24','2024-04-10 15:21:31'),
	('9bc65bfd-c02a-4072-b690-d48c50ad9633',5,1604,'WILD AT HEART - Elizabeth City, NC, US | Patrick Whipple',NULL,'weekly','','NC',NULL,'Elizabeth City','','US',-76.2510460,36.2946010,'North Carolina',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:31',0,'men','2022-09-23 15:21:31',NULL,NULL,'Fridays from 5 to 6 pm. Bring a chair and a willing heart.',17887,191775,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7593\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Elizabeth City\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"NC\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"36.294601\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-76.251046\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"North Carolina\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wildatheart/small-group/wild-heart-elizabeth-city-nc-us-patrick-whipple',NULL,'2022-09-21 05:09:19','2024-04-10 15:21:31'),
	('9bc65bfd-dc47-4db2-9a77-3c36b042a587',2,1794,'WAH BASIC - Ponderosa, CA, US | Layne Davis',NULL,'weekly','Quaker Meadow Christian Camp','CA',NULL,'Ponderosa','93265','US',-118.5541000,36.1100640,'California',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:31',0,'men','2022-09-15 15:21:31','2022-09-18 15:21:31',NULL,'',17423,411208,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7143\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"Quaker Meadow Christian Camp\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Ponderosa\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"93265\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"36.110064\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-118.554100\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"California\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-ponderosa-ca-us-layne-davis',NULL,'2022-04-27 06:04:06','2024-04-10 15:21:31'),
	('9bc65bfd-fa16-4475-9300-746f9bb95183',2,1459,'WAH BASIC - Colorado Springs, CO, US | Brad Steininger',NULL,'weekly','5125 Brady Rd','CO',NULL,'Colorado Springs','80915-1107','US',-104.7319960,38.8627910,'Colorado',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:31',0,'men','2022-09-15 15:21:32','2022-09-18 15:21:32',NULL,'NOTE: REGISTRATION IS CLOSED FOR THIS EVENT\r\n\r\nWhat: This is no ordinary men\'s retreat. No breakout sessions or small groups. Just awesome teaching by John and his team via video followed by time alone with the Father.\r\n\r\nWhen: Thur-Sun, Sep 15-18, 2022 (arrive between 5:00-5:30 pm Thursday, depart after 12:00 Sunday)\r\n\r\nWhere: The Outpost at Stein Haus, 5125 Brady Rd, Colorado Springs, CO 80915\r\n\r\nWho: This retreat can accommodate up to 4 men (there will be a waiting list in the event someone needs to dropout).\r\n\r\nAccommodations: Four men will share a single large room (bunk beds). Everyone will have a bed, pillow, linens and towels. There is one bathroom with a shower/sink/toilet and a second bathroom with a sink/toilet.\r\n\r\nCost: $77 which includes lodging, all meals and retreat content. A nonrefundable deposit of $50 is due four weeks prior to the event via check or PayPal. Full payment of the remaining $27 is due upon arrival at the retreat.\r\n\r\nRegistration: Please contact Brad Steininger to register or for more information.\r\n\r\nOther info:\r\n\r\n* Get a copy of Wild at Heart and read it before the retreat.\r\n\r\n* This event is designed to be experienced \"off the grid;\" we ask that you unplug and only use cell phones in extreme emergencies. There will be a contact number for emergencies.\r\n\r\n* Free time is built into the schedule both Friday and Saturday afternoon. During this time you will have the opportunity to participate in a hike, leisure time around the facility, take a nap, read a book, play disc golf, etc.\r\n\r\n* This retreat is in a rustic neighborhood on the East side of Colorado Springs (mostly dirt roads and equestrian properties). Bring season-appropriate casual clothes. There are some trails nearby for hiking and an excellent park with many trails just a couple miles away.\r\n\r\n* In the evenings, there will be an opportunity to relax, build a camp fire, tell stories and have fun. You\'ll leave with new friendships, greater clarity in your walk with the Lord, and inspired to live your life as a man fully alive.',17053,236529,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"6802\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"5125 Brady Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Colorado Springs\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"80915-1107\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"38.862791\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-104.731996\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Colorado\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-colorado-springs-co-us-brad-steininger-7',NULL,'2022-01-26 09:01:09','2024-04-10 15:21:32'),
	('9bc65bfe-1746-40b2-820d-7ecdf5660e59',3,1795,'CORE - Strawberry Point, IA, US | Connie Debner',NULL,'weekly','35124 Hwy 13','IA',NULL,'Strawberry Point','52076','US',-91.5706210,42.6504330,'Iowa',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:32',0,'men','2022-09-15 15:21:32','2022-09-18 15:21:32',NULL,'* The Stone Center provides cozy motel-style bedrooms. Linens are provided in this comfortable facility. \r\n*The Stone Center sports several miles of hiking trails through the surrounding, restored Iowa prairies and forested valley.  You\'ll want your walking shoes.',17325,434371,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7076\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"35124 Hwy 13\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Strawberry Point\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"IA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"52076\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"42.650433\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-91.570621\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Iowa\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/core-strawberry-point-ia-us-connie-debner',NULL,'2022-04-01 03:04:59','2024-04-10 15:21:32'),
	('9bc65bfe-36a6-4b31-9006-28ec20e2d11a',2,14,'WAH BASIC - Decorah, IA, US | Ron Fischer',NULL,'weekly','','IA',NULL,'Decorah','','US',-91.7857090,43.3033060,'Iowa',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:32',0,'men','2022-09-14 15:21:32','2022-09-17 15:21:32',NULL,'Join me in in beautiful Decorah, Iowa for a life changing event.  We\'ll stay in an amazing cabin surrounded by 5 acres of Iowa woods in the \"driftless\" northeast Iowa.  If enough participants are interested, I can also set up a guided trout fly fishing excursion for an extra charge.  We\'ll also check out a local brewery and even go hiking during breaks.  Get ready for where God is leading.\r\n\r\nRegister before August 31.  Also, ask me about a discount if you bring a guy and they come!',17572,435135,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7282\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Decorah\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"IA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"43.303306\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-91.785709\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Iowa\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-decorah-ia-us-ron-fischer-0',NULL,'2022-06-06 09:06:33','2024-04-10 15:21:32'),
