	('9bc65bff-27b6-4b7b-be74-4dd4d9cf47ff',2,1634,'WAH BASIC - McGregor, MN, US | Erik Swenson',NULL,'weekly','','MN',NULL,'McGregor','55760','US',-93.3086870,46.6068260,'Minnesota',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:32',0,'men','2022-09-08 15:21:32','2022-09-11 15:21:32',NULL,'When: Thursday-Sunday, Sept 8-11, 2022 (arrive between 3 and 4pm Thursday and depart after 12:30pm Sunday)\r\n\r\nWhere: Covenant Pines Bible Camp, McGregor, MN\r\nhttps://covenantpines.org/\r\n\r\nCost: $190 - includes lodging, all meals, snacks, on-site camp activities, materials and retreat content. \r\n\r\nAccommodations: Lodging will be bunk style (electricity, indoor restrooms, showers, etc). You can request a roommate, otherwise roommates will be assigned. Retreat center also includes a meeting hall and gathering room with wood fireplace and coffee on tap. Dining hall is just a short walk across camp.\r\n\r\nActivities: On-site and off-site activities will be available during free time including hiking, kayaking, swimming, climbing, zip line, disc golf, indoor gym, game room, nightly campfires, coffee shop, etc.\r\n\r\nWhat to bring: Bedding, towel, clothing for activities. \r\n\r\nTo sign up, click on the google link below to complete a short registration form. Payment options are included on the form.\r\n\r\nhttps://forms.gle/EeWowXUAWR98SgN56\r\n\r\nWith questions, feel free to contact Erik Swenson at formedforgood@gmail.com or 612-597-1906.',17321,436224,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7070\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"McGregor\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MN\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"55760\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"46.606826\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-93.308687\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Minnesota\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-mcgregor-mn-us-erik-swenson-0',NULL,'2022-03-30 02:03:03','2024-04-10 15:21:32'),
