	('9bc65bff-60a7-469a-b85c-24f838851c4a',5,1801,'WILD AT HEART - Houston, TX, US |  ',NULL,'weekly','16707 Creeksouth Rd','TX',NULL,'Houston','77068','US',-95.4780470,30.0147260,'Texas',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:32',0,'men','2022-09-08 15:21:32',NULL,NULL,'Hello, my name is John Palmer. I am the leader of The Vine lifegroup at Champion Forest Baptist Church. Please follow this link to stay connected with us on Group Me and social media like Instagram:\r\nhttps://linktr.ee/TheVineCFBC \r\n\r\nIf you miss any sessions, please feel free to come to others that you can make. \r\nWe can catch you up at the next session. Any ones missed can easily be watched for free online at your own pace. \r\n\r\nWe will be watching the series and discussing questions according to the study guide. \r\nNothing is required, but a personal study guide of your own is a plus.',17836,448582,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7544\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"16707 Creeksouth Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Houston\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"TX\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"77068\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"30.014726\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-95.478047\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Texas\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wildatheart/small-group/wild-heart-houston-tx-us-0',NULL,'2022-09-07 10:09:59','2024-04-10 15:21:32'),
