	('9bc65bff-f196-475f-8bee-17df04349079',2,1803,'WAH BASIC - Horton , KS, US |  ',NULL,'weekly','1550 125th St ','KS',NULL,'Horton ','66439','US',-95.5185440,39.6871550,'Kansas',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:33',0,'men','2022-08-25 15:21:33','2022-08-28 15:21:33',NULL,'There is a lake for fishing so bring a pole. no acholic beverages allowed on sight. \r\nwe will spend a lot of time around a campfire so bring a lawn chair and cigars. \r\nunfortunately, we do have a fee of $200 for food and the price of the camp rental.',17561,425370,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7271\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"1550 125th St \\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"1550 125th St Horton KS \\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Horton \\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"KS\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"66439\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"39.687155\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-95.518544\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Kansas\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-horton-ks-us',NULL,'2022-06-01 02:06:50','2024-04-10 15:21:33'),
	('9bc65c00-0f97-4e7e-ba14-88d8f00c7a67',2,1779,'WAH BASIC - Pagosa Springs, CO, US | Rob Forino',NULL,'weekly','Top Ridge Place','CO',NULL,'Pagosa Springs','81147','US',-106.9684900,37.0484740,'Colorado',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:33',0,'men','2022-08-25 15:21:33','2022-08-28 15:21:33',NULL,'Reference Website',16624,401276,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"6356\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"Top Ridge Place\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Pagosa Springs\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"81147\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"37.048474\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-106.968490\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Colorado\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-pagosa-springs-co-us-rob-forino-4',NULL,'2021-09-29 10:09:41','2024-04-10 15:21:33'),
	('9bc65c00-2e48-49e4-a493-0a6835fcc73f',2,635,'WAH BASIC - Lakewood, WI, US | Chad Hendricks',NULL,'weekly','18495 PEEK RD','WI',NULL,'Lakewood','54138','US',-88.3904800,45.3449970,'Wisconsin',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:33',0,'men','2022-08-18 15:21:33','2022-08-21 15:21:33',NULL,'Our location is an old 80 acre family farm in Lakewood, WI.  This land is surrounded by the Nicolet National Forest.  We will be camping outside with no running water or electricity.  It will be an amazing experience of unplugging from the modern world. \r\n\r\nStart Time: \r\nNoon to 6pm is your time to set up camp.  Dinner will start at 6pm on Thursday with our first session following.\r\n\r\nWhat Should I bring: \r\nBring a notebook/journal and pens.  Camping gear. If you need something, just ask.\r\nAccommodations: \r\n\r\nBring your own tents, campers and gear.  If you don\'t own any of these items, please let me know and we will find what you need.\r\n\r\nRegistration Fee:\r\nThe fees for this event is to help pay for fresh water, gasoline for the generator, snacks, toilet paper, etc. \r\n\r\nThere is an option to buy the meal plan option.  We will be having a local restaurant cater to us. \r\n\r\nAirports:\r\nClosest airport is Austin Straubel in Green Bay, WI. (1.5 hours drive to Lakewood)\r\nGeneral Mitchell in Milwaukee, WI (3 hr 15 min drive to Lakewood)\r\n\r\nOther Activities: \r\nThere is free time each day.  Currently, we will be offering  map and compass (orienteering) training and archery training as added activities. \r\nFOOD:\r\nYou can bring your own food, but you can also purchase food with the group. If you bring food, plan on keeping preparation time to a minimum. (I recommend bringing some snacks and letting the food prep to the professionals.)  Food orders will be collected before the event via email and payment will be made when you register.  The menu for this trip is below. \r\nTotal Food Costs: $105.00 plus $20 for tip\r\nBreakfast @ $10 each (Friday, Saturday, Sunday)1. Scrambled Eggs, Sausage, Tator tots, English muffin, Danish2. Ham &amp; Egg on an English muffin, hashbrowns, yogurt, mixed fruit3. Pancakes &amp; Syrup, sausage links, American fries, apple,\r\nLunch @ $10 each (Friday, Saturday, Sunday)1. Chicken Bacon Wrap, granola bar, chips2. sub sandwich, cookie, chips3. Burger with potato wedges \r\nDinner @ $15 each (Thursday, Friday, Saturday)1. 3 piece Broasted chicken, mashed potatoes, dressing, Green Beans, Pasta Salad2. 1/2 Rack BBQ ribs, baked potato, dinner roll, side salad3. Fish Fry (Friday) Breaded Alaskan Pollack , baby reds, coleslaw, rye bread',17456,411000,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7177\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"18495 PEEK RD\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Lakewood\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"WI\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"54138\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"45.344997\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-88.390480\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Wisconsin\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-lakewood-wi-us-chad-hendricks-2',NULL,'2022-05-09 07:05:13','2024-04-10 15:21:33'),
	('9bc65c00-4c9f-4e07-9f1a-a972b87290b8',2,1450,'WAH BASIC - Grand Lake, CO, US | Tim Little',NULL,'weekly','25 County Rd. 4435','CO',NULL,'Grand Lake','80447','US',-105.8269240,40.2410470,'Colorado',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:33',0,'men','2022-08-18 15:21:33','2022-08-21 15:21:33',NULL,'Register Here:  https://newwildernessadventures.churchcenter.com/registrations/events/1268456\r\n \r\n\r\nBring hiking gear and light coat for cool evenings.  Depending on fire restrictions, we will have a fire at night.  Details on afternoon adventures are forth coming.',17377,231614,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7114\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"25 County Rd. 4435\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Grand Lake\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"80447\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"40.241047\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-105.826924\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Colorado\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-grand-lake-co-us-tim-little',NULL,'2022-04-18 10:04:11','2024-04-10 15:21:33'),
