	('9bc65c01-8782-459d-9018-ebbe6fe69678',5,1810,'WILD AT HEART - Newport News, VA, US | Christopher Settembrino',NULL,'weekly','30 Curtis Tignor Road','VA',NULL,'Newport News','23608','US',-76.5505840,37.1432730,'Virginia',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:34',0,'men','2022-08-10 15:21:34',NULL,NULL,'The Men\'s Ministry will meet every Wednesday night from 6:30 P.M. to 7:30 P.M. starting on the 3rd of August and ending on the 7th of September for this particular study.  Come and enjoy this small group study while building trust between men of Christ and experiencing fulfilling fellowship.',17711,436387,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7416\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"30 Curtis Tignor Road\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Newport News\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"VA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"23608\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"37.143273\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-76.550584\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Virginia\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wildatheart/small-group/wild-heart-newport-news-va-us-christopher-settembrino',NULL,'2022-07-24 03:07:17','2024-04-10 15:21:34'),
	('9bc65c01-a3ed-4a85-96d9-2a1af7b8dbad',4,1459,'BECOMING A KING RETREAT- Colorado Springs, CO, US | Brad Steininger',NULL,'weekly','5125 Brady Rd','CO',NULL,'Colorado Springs','80915','US',-104.7319960,38.8627910,'Colorado',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:34',0,'men','2022-07-21 15:21:34','2022-07-24 15:21:34',NULL,'What: Becoming a King Retreat is for men who are fully consented to becoming wholehearted kings, in the company of wise, older men who have taken the ancient path.  The retreat is designed for world-changing men who are ready to become the kind of men, the kind of kings, to whom God can gladly entrust the care of his Kingdom.  It is open to men of all ages (18 and above).\r\n\r\nWhen: Thur-Sun, July 21-24th, 2022 (arrive between 5:00-5:30 pm Thursday, depart after 12:00 Sunday)\r\n\r\nWhere: The Outpost at Stein Haus, 5125 Brady Rd, Colorado Springs, CO 80915\r\n\r\nWho: This retreat can accommodate up to 4 men (there will be a waiting list in the event someone needs to dropout).\r\n\r\nAccommodations: Four men will share a single large room (bunk beds). Everyone will have a bed, pillow, linens and towels. There is one bathroom with a shower/sink/toilet and a second bathroom with a sink/toilet.\r\n\r\nCost: $77 which includes lodging, all meals and retreat content. A nonrefundable deposit of $50 is due no later than six weeks prior to the retreat via check or PayPal. Full payment of the remaining $27 is due upon arrival at the retreat.\r\n\r\nRegistration: Please contact Brad Steininger to register or to request more information.\r\n\r\nOther info:\r\n\r\n* This event is designed to be experienced \"off the grid;\" we require participants to unplug from all devices. There will be a contact number provided for emergencies.\r\n\r\n* A couple hours of free time is built into the schedule both Friday and Saturday afternoons. During this time you will have the opportunity to participate in a hike, leisure time around the facility, take a nap, read a book, etc.\r\n\r\n* This retreat is in a rustic neighborhood on the East side of Colorado Springs (mostly dirt roads and equestrian properties). Bring season-appropriate casual clothes. There are some trails nearby for hiking and an excellent park with many trails just a couple miles away.\r\n\r\n* In the evenings, there will be an opportunity to relax, build a camp fire, tell stories and have fun. You\'ll leave with new friendships, greater clarity in your walk with the Lord, and inspired to live your life as a man fully alive.\r\n\r\n* This event utilizes the content provided by the Wild at Heart team in their Becoming a King Retreat (this resource, filmed at a live event, includes eight sessions led by Morgan Snyder). This trailer provides a glimpse into the heart behind the message: \r\n\r\nhttps://vimeo.com/411124701',17609,236529,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7315\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"5125 Brady Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Colorado Springs\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"80915\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"38.862791\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-104.731996\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Colorado\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/becoming-king-retreat-colorado-springs-co-us-brad-steininger',NULL,'2022-06-21 05:06:19','2024-04-10 15:21:34'),
