	('9bc65c03-eacc-4876-b624-2cb9558659e3',2,1823,'WAH BASIC - Rising Fawn, GA, US | Brian Park',NULL,'weekly','122 Cloudland Canyon Park Rd','GA',NULL,'Rising Fawn','30738','US',-85.4836210,34.8246310,'Georgia',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:35',0,'men','2022-06-02 15:21:35','2022-06-05 15:21:35',NULL,'Our 1st Annual Boot Camp. Backcountry camping. You need it, you have to bring it! This will be an amazing time. You do not want to miss it!',17071,410648,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"6824\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"122 Cloudland Canyon Park Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Rising Fawn\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"GA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"30738\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"34.824631\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-85.483621\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Georgia\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-rising-fawn-ga-us-brian-park',NULL,'2022-01-28 12:01:19','2024-04-10 15:21:35'),
	('9bc65c04-0754-4978-b0f7-97afe8eb3649',5,1824,'WILD AT HEART - Bismarck, ND, US |  ',NULL,'weekly','3307 Hamilton St. Unit H','ND',NULL,'Bismarck','58503','US',-100.7401590,46.8418280,'North Dakota',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:35',0,'men','2022-06-01 15:21:35',NULL,NULL,'We meet every other week at the Mighty Missouri Coffee Roasting Facility. We would love to have you join us! We do ask that you first complete a Wild at Heart Basic (for more information about North Dakota Wild at Heart Basic, visit www.ndwildatheart.org).',17559,448888,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7268\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"3307 Hamilton St. Unit H\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Bismarck\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"ND\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"58503\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"46.841828\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-100.740159\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"North Dakota\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wildatheart/small-group/wild-heart-bismarck-nd-us',NULL,'2022-06-01 05:06:07','2024-04-10 15:21:35'),
	('9bc65c04-23ca-42f5-9981-5ac713074570',4,7,'BECOMING A KING RETREAT- Smithville, MO, US |  ',NULL,'weekly','1601 NE 196th Street','MO',NULL,'Smithville','64089','US',-94.5571440,39.4486230,'Missouri',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:35',0,'men','2022-05-26 15:21:36','2022-05-29 15:21:36',NULL,'',17541,432784,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7252\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"1601 NE 196th Street\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Smithville\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"64089\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"39.448623\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-94.557144\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Missouri\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/becoming-king-retreat-smithville-mo-us',NULL,'2022-05-25 09:05:57','2024-04-10 15:21:36'),
	('9bc65c04-40e8-461f-b541-9a3e11dcad72',3,1473,'CORE - Effie, MN, US | Skip Johnson ',NULL,'weekly','65328 County Road 235 ','MN',NULL,'Effie','56639','US',-93.5290540,47.8314650,'Minnesota',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:36',0,'men','2022-05-19 15:21:36','2022-05-22 15:21:36',NULL,'Ladies! Prepare your hearts for a weekend to remember in northern Minnesota! It will be a time to reflect, renew &amp; restore. Our captivating weekend will consist of quite a few sessions, but we will have the opportunity to be in nature to restore our souls. Some of the outdoor adventures, will be walks, kayaking, foraging, four wheeling trails, fires &amp; a sauna. Pack comfortably for lounging, good walking/hiking shoes, swimsuit and clothes to just get dirty in! Excited for what God has in store for us! More to details to follow.',17268,432639,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7013\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"65328 County Road 235 \\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Effie\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MN\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"56639\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"47.831465\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-93.529054\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Minnesota\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/core-effie-mn-us-skip-johnson-0',NULL,'2022-03-20 12:03:00','2024-04-10 15:21:36'),
	('9bc65c04-5e71-4acb-a684-506b47a33ffc',2,1459,'WAH BASIC - Colorado Springs, CO, US | Brad Steininger',NULL,'weekly','5125 Brady Rd','CO',NULL,'Colorado Springs','80915-1107','US',-104.7319960,38.8627910,'Colorado',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:36',0,'men','2022-05-19 15:21:36','2022-05-22 15:21:36',NULL,'What: This is no ordinary men\'s retreat. No breakout sessions or small groups. Just awesome teaching by John and his team via video followed by time alone with the Father.\r\n\r\nWhen: Thur-Sun, May 19-22, 2022 (arrive between 5:00-5:30 pm Thursday, depart after 12:00 Sunday)\r\n\r\nWhere: The Outpost at Stein Haus, 5125 Brady Rd, Colorado Springs, CO 80915\r\n\r\nWho: This retreat can accommodate up to 4 men (there will be a waiting list in the event someone needs to dropout).\r\n\r\nAccommodations: Four men will share a single large room (bunk beds). Everyone will have a bed, pillow, linens and towels. There is one bathroom with a shower/sink/toilet and a second bathroom with a sink/toilet.\r\n\r\nCost: $77 which includes lodging, all meals and retreat content. A nonrefundable deposit of $50 is due four weeks prior to the event via check or PayPal. Full payment of the remaining $27 is due upon arrival at the retreat.\r\n\r\nRegistration: Please contact Brad Steininger to register or for more information.\r\n\r\nOther info:   \r\n\r\n* Get a copy of Wild at Heart and read it before the retreat.\r\n\r\n* This event is designed to be experienced \"off the grid;\" we ask that you unplug and only use cell phones in extreme emergencies. There will be a contact number for emergencies.\r\n\r\n* Free time is built into the schedule both Friday and Saturday afternoon. During this time you will have the opportunity to participate in a hike, leisure time around the facility, take a nap, read a book, play disc golf, etc.\r\n\r\n* This retreat is in a rustic neighborhood on the East side of Colorado Springs (mostly dirt roads and equestrian properties). Bring season-appropriate casual clothes. There are some trails nearby for hiking and an excellent park with many trails just a couple miles away. \r\n\r\n* In the evenings, there will be an opportunity to relax, build a camp fire, tell stories and have fun. You\'ll leave with new friendships, greater clarity in your walk with the Lord, and inspired to live your life as a man fully alive.',17047,236529,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"6796\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"5125 Brady Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Colorado Springs\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"80915-1107\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"38.862791\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-104.731996\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Colorado\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-colorado-springs-co-us-brad-steininger-6',NULL,'2022-01-26 08:01:18','2024-04-10 15:21:36'),
	('9bc65c04-7b5c-4e81-86af-e3ba5b99e95b',2,1825,'WAH BASIC - Alvord, TX, US | Brad Davis',NULL,'weekly','4285 Old Decatur Rd','TX',NULL,'Alvord','76225','US',-97.6252410,33.3443510,'Texas',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:36',0,'men','2022-05-19 15:21:36','2022-05-22 15:21:36',NULL,'Rhema Ranch is a privately owned homestead nestled in the woodlands of the LBJ National Grasslands (https://www.fs.usda.gov/texas) in Wise County, Texas. The homestead/ranch is located just north of Decatur, Texas (the county seat) and perfectly situated outside the hustle and bustle of the DFW metroplex, yet close enough to accommodate visitors arriving via DFW International Airport (45 to 60-minute drive). There are countless beautiful options to spread out and be alone with God during our breakout sessions. If you feel like being active, play some basketball on the full-size basketball court, relax in the swimming pool, or go for a hike and explore. In addition to the ranch, the surrounding LBJ government land provides many thousands of acres for hiking, mountain biking, fishing on picturesque lakes, and seeing all kinds of wildlife.\r\n\r\nOur fellowship is made up of a small group of family and friends who love Jesus and want to see His Kingdom advance. We believe the Wild at Heart approach to building a \"band of brothers\" is the exact model that Jesus used to profoundly impact the hearts of his followers and make disciples. And we feel honored to be able to host Wild at Heart Basic camps.\r\n\r\nYou\'ll be fed some incredible meals while attending, prepared by the wonderful women of our fellowship, with several of the meals consisting of homegrown beef raised at Rhema Ranch. Please let us know if you have any food allergies in advance and we will do our best to accommodate. \r\n\r\nCheck-In: 5:00-6:30 pm on Thursday, May 19, 2022\r\nConclusion: 12:00 noon on Sunday, May 22, 2022\r\nThe total cost of the camp is $175 (with a $50 nonrefundable deposit, due at sign up). Your registration fee covers your lodging, meals (Thursday evening dinner through Sunday breakfast) and all of the teaching (video sessions) and materials by Wild at Heart for the duration of the weekend. Additional recreational supplies such as moutain bikes and fishing gear, etc. are not included. Participants must bring their own towels, shower supplies, and any additional personal items (rain gear, hiking boots, basketball shoes, smokes, etc.). Enrollment is limited, so please act quickly if you want to be a part of this camp.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, a shuttle service is available for those traveling to and from the airport for $50 round-trip. \r\n\r\nWild at Heart Basic camps are truly life changing experiences. You\'ll leave with new friendships, greater clarity about yourself, and more importantly a rediscovery of your \"wild heart\", as you connect with your Father who created it.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nTo sign up for this camp, please follow this link: https://www.surveymonkey.com/r/3TWXKZY\r\n\r\nAlso, please feel free to contact Brad via text at 940-389-0645 or email at brad@sonorusmi.com with any further questions. Thanks and God bless!',14604,207762,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"4506\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"4285 Old Decatur Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Alvord\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"TX\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"76225\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"33.344351\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-97.625241\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Texas\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-alvord-tx-us-brad-davis',NULL,'2020-01-01 01:01:36','2024-04-10 15:21:36'),
