	('9bc65c05-a0e7-4242-8178-e3ec8f1fff12',2,1832,'WAH BASIC - Palomar Mountain, CA, US |  ',NULL,'weekly','34764 Doane Valley Rd','CA',NULL,'Palomar Mountain','92060','US',-116.9183860,33.3466540,'California',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:36',0,'men','2022-04-28 15:21:37','2022-05-01 15:21:37',NULL,'',17385,434601,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7117\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"34764 Doane Valley Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Palomar Mountain\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"92060\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"33.346654\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-116.918386\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"California\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-palomar-mountain-ca-us-1',NULL,'2022-04-18 10:04:45','2024-04-10 15:21:37'),
	('9bc65c05-be30-4ddb-9069-b28ab67ade33',2,40,'WAH BASIC - Somerset, KY, US | Brian Thornton',NULL,'weekly','2600 Close Rd','KY',NULL,'Somerset','42501','US',-84.3116830,37.0337630,'Kentucky',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:37',0,'men','2022-04-28 15:21:37','2022-05-01 15:21:37',NULL,'The retreat center will allow 18 participants. Once it fills up, I will keep a waiting list in the event of any who need to dropout.\r\n\r\nRegistration for this event can be found here:\r\nhttps://form.jotform.com/203215134697050\r\n\r\nOnce you have registered I will contact you for payment information. The cost of the weekend will be $195.00 per person. This will cover the fee for lodging and food for the weekend.\r\n\r\n* Linens are provided, however you will need your own towel/washcloth. Bring your own pillow and extra blankets, sleeping bag, etc.\r\n\r\n* While bottled water will be available on site, consider bringing some bottled water    with you. The center recommends we don\'t drink from the tap. \r\n\r\n* Bring snacks that you like and wouldn\'t mind sharing. Also bring drinks that you like.\r\n\r\nThe facility has a generator to provide electricity. We will only use the generator during the sessions to run the videos. Appliances and hot water are gas powered. Feel free to bring flashlights, lamps, candles, etc. for lighting.\r\n\r\n**Get a copy of Wild at Heart and read it before the retreat. You might also want to consider getting a copy of the Wild at Heart Field Guide as well, but it isn\'t necessary for the retreat.**\r\n\r\nDirections to the site: https://maps.apple.com/?address=2600%20Close%20Rd,%20Somerset,%20KY%20%2...\r\n\r\nI have photos of the location on my Facebook page. You can send me a friend request to see the photos. https://www.facebook.com/media/set/?set=a.10157915652930765&amp;type=3',16973,53015,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"6716\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"2600 Close Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Somerset\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"KY\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"42501\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"37.033763\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-84.311683\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Kentucky\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-somerset-ky-us-brian-thornton-0',NULL,'2022-01-04 09:01:00','2024-04-10 15:21:37'),
	('9bc65c05-dcaf-4a8b-aca3-d162764720ea',3,1488,'CORE - Quarryville, PA, US | Robyn Jameson',NULL,'weekly','Black Rock Retreat Center','PA',NULL,'Lancaster','17566','US',-76.1059640,39.8673260,'Pennsylvania',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:37',0,'men','2022-04-28 15:21:37','2022-05-01 15:21:37',NULL,'Please go to the Intimate Allies website for more information about this retreat.  www.intimateallies.org',14337,231895,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"4292\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"Black Rock Retreat Center\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"1345 Kirkwood Pike\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Lancaster\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"PA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"17566\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"39.867326\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-76.105964\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Pennsylvania\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/core-quarryville-pa-us-robyn-jameson',NULL,'2019-10-07 10:10:35','2024-04-10 15:21:37'),
	('9bc65c05-fb18-43f7-b678-c99dc2168781',2,42,'WAH BASIC - Cleveland, GA, US | Phillip Gable',NULL,'weekly','1242 Old Blue Creek Road','GA',NULL,'Cleveland','30528','US',-83.7453380,34.6063620,'Georgia',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:37',0,'men','2022-04-28 15:21:37','2022-05-01 15:21:37',NULL,'When: Thursday, April 28, to Sunday, May 1, 2022 (arrive between 3:30pm and 5pm Thursday, depart after 12:30 Sunday)\r\n\r\nWhere: The Lodge at Woodlands Camp, Cleveland GA: https://www.woodlandscamp.org/lodge-woodlands\r\n\r\nAccommodations: Lodging will be double occupancy. Each room has two queen beds. You can request a roommate, otherwise roommates will be assigned.\r\n\r\nWho: Men ages 18 and older.\r\n\r\nCost: $260, includes lodging, all meals, and retreat content.\r\n\r\nOn-site and off-site activities will be available during free time including hiking, swimming, kayaking, etc.\r\n\r\nFor more information, contact:\r\nPhil Gable (gablephillip@gmail.com) or\r\nMark Fischer (da.fischers@gmail.com)\r\n\r\nA deposit of $100 will be required to hold your spot. Full payment will be due by April 18th. Payment details are included in the registration form.\r\n\r\nIf you\'re ready to register, please click here:\r\nhttps://forms.gle/5HDv3zu9WUHbxbgaA',16471,435057,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"6195\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"1242 Old Blue Creek Road\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Cleveland\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"GA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"30528\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"34.606362\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-83.745338\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Georgia\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-cleveland-ga-us-phillip-gable',NULL,'2021-08-24 10:08:28','2024-04-10 15:21:37'),
	('9bc65c06-1906-4161-bda1-f315ef98b4b3',2,7,'WAH BASIC - Smithville, MO, US |  ',NULL,'weekly','1601 NE 196th Street','MO',NULL,'Smithville','64089','US',-94.5571440,39.4486230,'Missouri',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:37',0,'men','2022-04-28 15:21:37','2022-05-01 15:21:37',NULL,'',17413,432784,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"7131\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"1601 NE 196th Street\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Smithville\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"64089\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"39.448623\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-94.557144\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Missouri\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-smithville-mo-us',NULL,'2022-04-25 09:04:34','2024-04-10 15:21:37'),
	('9bc65c06-368c-44a8-bd9b-be8ca2161250',2,1469,'WAH BASIC - Effie, MN, US | Skip Johnson',NULL,'weekly','65328 County Road 235','MN',NULL,'Effie','56639','US',-93.5290540,47.8314650,'Minnesota',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:37',0,'men','2022-04-28 15:21:37','2022-05-01 15:21:37',NULL,'The weekend will be hosted at our farm and hunting property in Northern MN on the Bigfork River. \r\n\r\nCost: $200/person -- this covers lodging, food, drinks, atv/utv gas, etc.\r\n\r\nWhat to bring: For those who haven\'t been there, the location is definitely rustic and off the beaten path with several hundred acres to explore. There are ATV trails and a river running through the property, so pack accordingly to be outside a lot in late-April/early May Northern MN weather! Outside of appropriate clothing, some other ideas are: \r\n\r\n-ATV or SXS if you have one\r\n-Kayak or canoe for the river\r\n-Guns and Ammo for target shooting or trap\r\n-Sleeping bag &amp; pillow\r\n-Shoes for the river\r\n-Bug/tick spray\r\n-Bible or download a version\r\n-Flashlight/headlamp\r\n-Folding chair or camp chair\r\n-Journal and pen',17187,430547,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"6936\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"65328 County Road 235\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Effie\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MN\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"56639\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"47.831465\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-93.529054\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Minnesota\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-effie-mn-us-skip-johnson',NULL,'2022-03-09 06:03:36','2024-04-10 15:21:37'),
	('9bc65c06-53b8-4676-9969-51053e361494',2,1711,'WAH BASIC - Mount Hope, WV, US | Quint Pitts',NULL,'weekly','161 College Drive','WV',NULL,'Mount Hope','25880','US',-81.2029090,37.8546360,'West Virginia',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:37',0,'men','2022-04-28 15:21:37','2022-05-01 15:21:37',NULL,'Cost is $245 which includes single room lodging, all meals, materials, basic recreation, and eleven life-changing sessions.  Optional paintball adventure is available for an additional fee of $28.  Optional activities include hiking and indoor wall climbing.\r\n\r\nAlpine Lodge is on the campus of Appalachian Bible College',16870,311437,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"6615\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"161 College Drive\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Mount Hope\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"WV\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"25880\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"37.854636\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-81.202909\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"West Virginia\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-mount-hope-wv-us-quint-pitts-1',NULL,'2021-12-01 08:12:59','2024-04-10 15:21:37'),
	('9bc65c06-71ba-4bc2-b382-f09784a4f222',3,1499,'CORE - Lowesville, VA, US | Kathy Pollard',NULL,'weekly','2247 Little Piney Rd','VA',NULL,'Lowesville','22967','US',-79.1381160,37.7660720,'Virginia',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:37',0,'men','2022-04-28 15:21:37','2022-05-01 15:21:37',NULL,'There is time each day to enjoy this beautiful mountain setting.  You may hike up to an overlook that is breathtaking - God\'s creation at its finest.  If relaxing is what you need, there are plenty of places to sit and enjoy the stream that flows through the camp or even grab a nap.  Causal dress is recommended.',16953,381642,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"6693\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"2247 Little Piney Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Lowesville\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"VA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"22967\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"37.766072\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-79.138116\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Virginia\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/core-lowesville-va-us-kathy-pollard-0',NULL,'2021-12-31 01:12:43','2024-04-10 15:21:37'),
