	('9bc65c09-baf9-46fc-8f03-b5b6c76df9ca',2,1845,'WAH BASIC - Hardeeville, SC, US | Tom Rowland',NULL,'weekly','545 Glasgow Landing Road','SC',NULL,'Hardeeville','29927','US',-80.9872800,32.1494250,'South Carolina',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:39',0,'men','2022-03-17 15:21:39','2022-03-20 15:21:39',NULL,'',16992,406411,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"6735\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"545 Glasgow Landing Road\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Hardeeville\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"SC\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"29927\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"32.149425\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-80.987280\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"South Carolina\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-hardeeville-sc-us-tom-rowland-0',NULL,'2022-01-11 11:01:38','2024-04-10 15:21:39'),
	('9bc65c09-d7a3-4257-8105-25b57e29ffaf',2,1459,'WAH BASIC - Colorado Springs, CO, US | Brad Steininger',NULL,'weekly','5125 Brady Rd','CO',NULL,'Colorado Springs','80915','US',-104.7319960,38.8627910,'Colorado',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:39',0,'men','2022-03-17 15:21:39','2022-03-20 15:21:39',NULL,'NOTE: Registration for this retreat is closed (we have already filled all the slots). Please consider joining us for our next retreat, May 19-22, 2022: https://wildatheart.org/allies/basic/wah-basic-colorado-springs-co-us-brad-steininger-6\r\n\r\nWhat: This is no ordinary men\'s retreat. No breakout sessions or small groups. Just awesome teaching by John and his team via video followed by time alone with the Father.\r\n\r\nWhen: Thur-Sun, March 17-20, 2022 (arrive between 5:00-5:30 pm Thursday, depart after 12:00 Sunday)\r\n\r\nWhere: The Outpost at Stein Haus, 5125 Brady Rd, Colorado Springs, CO 80915\r\n\r\nWho: This retreat can accommodate up to 4 men (there will be a waiting list in the event someone needs to dropout).\r\n\r\nAccommodations: Four men will share a single large room (bunk beds). Everyone will have a bed, pillow, linens and towels. There is one bathroom with a shower/sink/toilet and a second bathroom with a sink/toilet.\r\n\r\nCost: $77 which includes lodging, all meals and retreat content. A nonrefundable deposit of $50 is due four weeks prior to the event via check or PayPal. Full payment of the remaining $27 is due upon arrival at the retreat.\r\n\r\nRegistration: Please contact Brad Steininger to register or for more information.\r\n\r\nOther info:   \r\n\r\n* Get a copy of Wild at Heart and read it before the retreat.\r\n\r\n* This event is designed to be experienced \"off the grid;\" we ask that you unplug and only use cell phones in extreme emergencies. There will be a contact number for emergencies.\r\n\r\n* Free time is built into the schedule both Friday and Saturday afternoon. During this time you will have the opportunity to participate in a hike, leisure time around the facility, take a nap, read a book, play disc golf, etc.\r\n\r\n* This retreat is in a rustic neighborhood on the East side of Colorado Springs (mostly dirt roads and equestrian properties). Bring season-appropriate casual clothes. There are some trails nearby for hiking and an excellent park with many trails just a couple miles away. \r\n\r\n* In the evenings, there will be an opportunity to relax, build a camp fire, tell stories and have fun. You\'ll leave with new friendships, greater clarity in your walk with the Lord, and inspired to live your life as a man fully alive.',16754,236529,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"6502\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"5125 Brady Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Colorado Springs\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"80915\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"38.862791\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-104.731996\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Colorado\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-colorado-springs-co-us-brad-steininger-5',NULL,'2021-10-26 12:10:33','2024-04-10 15:21:39'),
