	('9bc65c0a-a359-4bd7-8dc3-c6e91d5e2ebc',2,1851,'WAH BASIC - Chattanooga, TN, US |  ',NULL,'weekly','13 Ridgeside Rd','TN',NULL,'Chattanooga','37411','US',-85.2510430,35.0354310,'Tennessee',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:40',0,'men','2022-03-10 15:21:40','2022-03-13 15:21:40',NULL,'',17139,446255,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"6887\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"13 Ridgeside Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Chattanooga\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"TN\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"37411\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"35.035431\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-85.251043\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Tennessee\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-chattanooga-tn-us',NULL,'2022-02-24 04:02:26','2024-04-10 15:21:40'),
	('9bc65c0a-bfb3-4270-96b7-18b8fd1a754c',2,1852,'WAH BASIC - McGregor, MN, US | Erik Swenson',NULL,'weekly','43696 245th Pl','MN',NULL,'McGregor','55760','US',-93.3725750,46.6462780,'Minnesota',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:40',0,'men','2022-03-10 15:21:40','2022-03-13 15:21:40',NULL,'To register, please email Erik Swenson at erikswensondesign@gmail.com.\r\n\r\nInclude the following information:\r\n\r\nFirst and last name\r\nEmail address\r\nPhone number\r\nAddress\r\nNumber of men in your group\r\n\r\nErik will follow up with confirmation and further event information.\r\n\r\nWhen: Thursday-Sunday, March 10-13, 2022 (arrive between 3:30pm and 5pm Thursday and depart after 12:30pm Sunday)\r\n\r\nWhere: Covenant Pines Bible Camp, McGregor, MN\r\nhttps://covenantpines.org/\r\n\r\nAccommodations: Lodging will be bunk style (electricity, indoor restrooms, showers, etc). You can request a roommate, otherwise roommates will be assigned.\r\n\r\nWho: Men ages 18 and older. Space still available.\r\n\r\nCost: $185, includes lodging, all meals, camp activities and retreat content. Payment can be made via check or PayPal (contact Erik regarding payments).\r\n\r\nOn-site and off-site activities will be available during free time including hiking, biking, kayaking, climbing, zip line, campfires, etc. (NOTE: In the event of challenging weather, the camp offers a large number of indoor ropes and recreational activities).\r\n\r\nFor more information, feel free to contact Erik Swenson at\r\nerikswensondesign@gmail.com or 612-597-1906',16793,436224,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"6542\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"43696 245th Pl\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"McGregor\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MN\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"55760\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"46.646278\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-93.372575\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Minnesota\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-mcgregor-mn-us-erik-swenson',NULL,'2021-11-07 07:11:14','2024-04-10 15:21:40'),
	('9bc65c0a-db95-45dd-8923-8d524a707d80',3,1460,'CORE - Van Reenen , KN, ZA | Ilana Kloppers',NULL,'weekly','T289, Zandspruit, Van Reenen,','KN',NULL,'Van Reenen ','3372','ZA',27.9410100,-26.0101840,'KwaZulu-Natal',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:40',0,'men','2022-03-10 15:21:40','2022-03-13 15:21:40',NULL,'Packing list:\r\nSleeping bag, pillow &amp; sheet – (bed and mattress provided)\r\nHiking boots\r\nSexy old clothes\r\nRaincoat\r\nJacket\r\nShoes\r\nSlops\r\nSwim costume\r\nWater bottle\r\nToiletries\r\nTowel\r\nHeadlamp / with spare batteries\r\nWide-brimmed hat\r\nCamp Chair\r\nInsect repellent\r\nSunscreen\r\nWalking Stick',17005,369075,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"6748\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"T289, Zandspruit, Van Reenen,\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Van Reenen \\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"KN\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"3372\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"za\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"-26.010184\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"27.941010\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"KwaZulu-Natal\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"South Africa\\\"}\"','/core-van-reenen-kn-za-ilana-kloppers-0',NULL,'2022-01-14 09:01:26','2024-04-10 15:21:40'),
	('9bc65c0a-f834-4c65-9550-4777fe0082b2',2,1453,'WAH BASIC - Black Mountain, NC, US | Matthew Daughtry-Grubbs',NULL,'weekly','1233 N Fork Rd','NC',NULL,'Black Mountain','28711','US',-82.3543470,35.6253710,'North Carolina',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:40',0,'men','2022-03-10 15:21:40','2022-03-13 15:21:40',NULL,'Arrangements:\r\n     • Lodging will be single occupancy.  Bed linens and towels will be provided. \r\n\r\nWhat to Expect:\r\n     • Once your initial registration and payment are submitted, a welcome email will be send to you containing further details and a registration form where you will submit other information needed for the event.  \r\n     • This event is designed to be experienced \"off the grid;\" we ask that you unplug and only use cell phones in extreme emergencies, and do not carry them around the whole weekend. (There will be a contact number for emergencies.)  Further information will be provided at the event. \r\n     • Free time is built into the schedule both Friday and Saturday afternoon.  During this time you will have the opportunity to participate in a hike, enjoy the gymnasium facilities (basketball, etc.), outdoor volleyball court, leisure time around the camp grounds, or take a nap. \r\n     • In the evenings, weather permitting, we will have a camp fire. This will be a great time to relax, tell stories, and have fun. You\'ll leave with new friendships, greater clarity in your walk with the Lord, and inspired to live your life to the fullest as a man fully alive.  Please bring clothes appropriate for the weather. \r\n\r\nGroups are welcome. On the sign-up sheet sent in the welcome email, please specify what group you\'re a part of.',16799,415441,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"6549\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"1233 N Fork Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Black Mountain\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"NC\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"28711\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"35.625371\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-82.354347\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"North Carolina\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-black-mountain-nc-us-matthew-daughtry-grubbs-3',NULL,'2021-11-08 04:11:14','2024-04-10 15:21:40'),
