	('9bc65c0d-1f05-4b1f-b451-48768a7d1f8d',2,1665,'WAH BASIC - Brian Head, UT, US | Chris Ashworth',NULL,'weekly','708 Red Rock Drive','UT',NULL,'Orderville','84758','US',-112.6222630,37.2822140,'Utah',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:41',0,'men','2022-02-10 15:21:41','2022-02-13 15:21:41',NULL,'During the 4 days set in the snow-covered mountains of Southern Utah, you will participate in a multi-media experience which will help you discover something profound about your own heart and the heart of God.\r\nThis isn’t your typical retreat. You will not be asked to break into small groups and share your feelings. Instead you will hear from other men living an intentional life in pursuit of the heart of God. Bring hiking boots for the trails and prepare for snow. Past attendees have indicated that this weekend has been a transformational experience in their walk with God.\r\nCost is $150 to cover lodging. Bring your own meals that take less than 10 minutes to prepare and clean up. Here is a link to the cabin where we\'ll be staying:\r\nhttps://www.eastzionresort.com/lodge\r\n\r\nArrive between 5-6pm, Feb 10th. We\'ll be done by noon, Feb 13th.\r\nIn order to make this a transformational experience, we ask you to disconnect from your world during the event. Please commit to no cell phones, wifi, or work.',16904,405815,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"6652\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"708 Red Rock Drive\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Orderville\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"UT\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"84758\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"37.282214\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-112.622263\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Utah\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-brian-head-ut-us-chris-ashworth-1',NULL,'2021-12-14 07:12:41','2024-04-10 15:21:41'),
