	('9bc65c0e-c13a-4ebe-b59d-7e4970b0c858',5,593,'WILD AT HEART - Fort Wayne , IN, US | Brian  Murphy',NULL,'weekly','8611 Mayhew Road ','IN',NULL,'Fort Wayne ','46835','US',-85.0718890,41.1645400,'Indiana',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:42',0,'men','2022-08-07 15:21:42',NULL,NULL,'',17033,429709,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"6780\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"8611 Mayhew Road \\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Fort Wayne \\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"IN\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"46835\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"41.164540\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-85.071889\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Indiana\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wildatheart/small-group/wild-heart-fort-wayne-us-brian-murphy',NULL,'2022-01-22 06:01:48','2024-04-10 15:21:43'),
	('9bc65c0e-e072-4981-bb86-3dc3d184a850',2,1459,'WAH BASIC - Colorado Springs, CO, US | Brad Steininger',NULL,'weekly','5125 Brady Rd','CO',NULL,'Colorado Springs','80915','US',-104.7319960,38.8627910,'Colorado',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:43',0,'men','2022-01-20 15:21:43','2022-01-23 15:21:43',NULL,'NOTE: Registration for this retreat is closed (we have already filled all the slots). Please consider joining us for our next retreat, March 17-20, 2022: https://wildatheart.org/allies/basic/wah-basic-colorado-springs-co-us-brad-steininger-5\r\n\r\nWhat: This is no ordinary men\'s retreat. No breakout sessions or small groups. Just awesome teaching by John and his team via video followed by time alone with the Father.\r\n\r\nWhen: Thur-Sun, January 20-23, 2022 (arrive between 5:00-5:30 pm Thursday, depart after 12:00 Sunday)\r\n\r\nWhere: The Outpost at Stein Haus, 5125 Brady Rd, Colorado Springs, CO 80915\r\n\r\nWho: This retreat can accommodate up to 4 men (there will be a waiting list in the event someone needs to dropout).\r\n\r\nAccommodations: Four men will share a single large room (bunk beds). Everyone will have a bed, pillow, linens and towels. There is one bathroom with a shower/sink/toilet and a second bathroom with a sink/toilet.\r\n\r\nCost: $77 which includes lodging, all meals and retreat content. A nonrefundable deposit of $50 is due three weeks prior to the retreat via check or PayPal. Full payment of the remaining $27 is due upon arrival at the retreat.\r\n\r\nRegistration: Please contact Brad Steininger to register or for more information.\r\n\r\nOther info:   \r\n\r\n* Get a copy of Wild at Heart and read it before the retreat.\r\n\r\n* This event is designed to be experienced \"off the grid;\" we ask that you unplug and only use cell phones in extreme emergencies. There will be a contact number for emergencies.\r\n\r\n* Free time is built into the schedule both Friday and Saturday afternoon. During this time you will have the opportunity to participate in a hike, leisure time around the facility, take a nap, read a book, play disc golf, etc.\r\n\r\n* This retreat is in a rustic neighborhood on the East side of Colorado Springs (mostly dirt roads and equestrian properties). Bring season-appropriate casual clothes. There are some trails nearby for hiking and an excellent park with many trails just a couple miles away. \r\n\r\n* In the evenings, there will be an opportunity to relax, build a camp fire, tell stories and have fun. You\'ll leave with new friendships, greater clarity in your walk with the Lord, and inspired to live your life as a man fully alive.',16577,236529,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"6307\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"5125 Brady Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Colorado Springs\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"80915\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"38.862791\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-104.731996\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Colorado\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-colorado-springs-co-us-brad-steininger-4',NULL,'2021-09-20 01:09:33','2024-04-10 15:21:43'),
	('9bc65c0e-ffc4-4c06-922d-1b0f73bd7744',2,1548,'WAH BASIC - Spring City, PA, US |  ',NULL,'weekly','Camp Sankanac','PA',NULL,'Spring City','19475','US',-75.6518800,40.1584000,'Pennsylvania',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:43',0,'men','2022-01-13 15:21:43','2022-01-16 15:21:43',NULL,'This is a winter event. \r\nWe can shoot clay birds, rifles &amp; pistols.\r\nArchery\r\nThere is an on-site game room.\r\nWe can hang out in the cabin with a fireplace or hike on the property.\r\nPossibly an outside fire.',16937,441419,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"6681\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"Camp Sankanac\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"68 Bertolet School Rd\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Spring City\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"PA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"19475\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"40.158400\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-75.651880\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Pennsylvania\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-spring-city-pa-us',NULL,'2021-12-22 08:12:39','2024-04-10 15:21:43'),
