	('9bc65c0f-56ef-4388-b6ac-c453c79355c8',2,1470,'WAH BASIC - Adams, OR, US | Rollie Snider',NULL,'weekly','58840 Bar M Lane','OR',NULL,'Adams','97810','US',-118.2341840,45.7422230,'Oregon',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:43',0,'men','2022-01-06 15:21:43','2022-01-09 15:21:43',NULL,'January in the Blue Mountains can be cold (and unseasonably warm as well), so bring extra clothes and hiking boots. BAR-M ranch (www.barmranch.com) also has a hot-spring-fed outdoor pool for our fun - even in Winter! - so bring a swimsuit and towel. The mattresses at BAR-M are new and comfy, but you\'ll need to bring a pillow &amp; sleeping bag as bedding is not included.  A notebook/journal will be provided for note-taking, but bring along a pen, Bible, and whatever journals and other reading materials as you see fit.  Be prepared for MANY indoor and outdoor activities for an amazing life-changing weekend!  Be sure to \"Like\" us on Facebook:  bit.ly/AKNfacebook',16486,53282,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"6208\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"58840 Bar M Lane\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Adams\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"OR\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"97810\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"45.742223\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-118.234184\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Oregon\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-adams-or-us-rollie-snider',NULL,'2021-08-30 06:08:03','2024-04-10 15:21:43'),
