	('9bc65c11-47c5-47cc-8c0d-5943bd5cb9c9',3,754,'CORE - Effie, MN, US | Hannah Schmitt',NULL,'weekly','65328 Co Rd 235','MN',NULL,'Effie','56639','US',-93.5290540,47.8314650,'Minnesota',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:44',0,'men','2021-11-04 15:21:44','2021-11-07 15:21:44',NULL,'Hey ladies! A few details about the weekend. It is a beautiful location on a farm in northern MN along the Big Fork River. Make sure to dress accordingly. We will be spending some time outdoors going on walks, four wheeling, and quiet time. Bring a swimsuit for the sauna if desired and comfortable shoes or boots for walking trails. It is also recommended that you read the Captivating book before attending to get the most out of the weekend (if possible, as we know we are just a few weeks out now!). We will be sending out another email with further details regarding suggested packing list, carpooling, etc. Please reach out with any questions. So excited and expectant to see how God is going to touch our hearts!',16726,442302,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"6481\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"65328 Co Rd 235\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Effie\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MN\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"56639\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"47.831465\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-93.529054\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Minnesota\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/core-effie-mn-us-hannah-schmitt',NULL,'2021-10-14 11:10:38','2024-04-10 15:21:44'),
	('9bc65c11-660b-4ec0-a594-8e28168e82b6',2,1839,'WAH BASIC - Felton, CA, US |  ',NULL,'weekly','1420 Newport Ave','CA',NULL,'San Jose','95125','US',-121.9005950,37.3015770,'California',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:44',0,'men','2021-11-04 15:21:44','2021-11-07 15:21:44',NULL,'Wild at Heart Boot Camps have been going on at Mount Hermon for many years. We are excited for a new leadership team, The Heart of Men, to take up the mantle. Our goal is that men walk away from these retreats closer to God, and learn what it means to be a godly man in all areas of life.',16591,421422,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"6319\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"1420 Newport Ave\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"San Jose\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"95125\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"37.301577\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-121.900595\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"California\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-felton-ca-us',NULL,'2021-09-23 02:09:57','2024-04-10 15:21:44'),
	('9bc65c11-83fe-4345-aff2-05ca8e02e3b1',2,1880,'WAH BASIC - Alexandria, MN, US | Joseph Godfrey',NULL,'weekly','605 Birch Ave.','MN',NULL,'Alexandria','56308','US',-95.3379560,45.8955100,'Minnesota',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:44',0,'men','2021-10-28 15:21:44','2021-10-31 15:21:44',NULL,'',16163,218397,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"5890\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"605 Birch Ave.\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Alexandria\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MN\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"56308\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"45.895510\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-95.337956\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Minnesota\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-alexandria-mn-us-joseph-godfrey-0',NULL,'2021-05-05 02:05:02','2024-04-10 15:21:44'),
	('9bc65c11-a156-4aba-bd59-dedee492f2f3',2,204,'WAH BASIC - GEORGE, IA, US | Darwin Van Otterloo',NULL,'weekly','2445 JACKSON AVE','IA',NULL,'GEORGE','512377683','US',-89.9765670,35.1576400,'Iowa',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:44',0,'men','2021-10-28 15:21:44','2021-10-31 15:21:44',NULL,'This basic will be lead by John Eldridge, Morgan Snyder and the Wild a Heart team through video.\r\n It will be held in our home on our acreage.\r\n Lodging, bedding ,towels etc. and all home cooked meals will be provided in our home.\r\nThere is a hot tub,so if you wish, take a swimsuit.\r\nWe live across the road from a river, so bring appropriate  shoes. A camp fire will be at night also if weather will permit. There is a limit set of 10 attendees. \r\nCost is $150 with a $50 deposit. If the cost is an issue please contact me. There may be a scholarship  available. \r\nFor info on where to send the deposit,  please call Darwin at 616 460 2517 or email dwvano@gmail.com.',16438,380029,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"6152\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"2445 JACKSON AVE\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"GEORGE\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"IA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"512377683\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"35.157640\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-89.976567\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Iowa\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-george-ia-us-darwin-van-otterloo-4',NULL,'2021-08-12 09:08:06','2024-04-10 15:21:44'),
	('9bc65c11-bdae-4819-9ba8-9c666abd4b70',2,1881,'WAH BASIC - York , SC, US | Mark Folk',NULL,'weekly','922 W Mt Gallant Rd.','SC',NULL,'York ','29745','US',-81.1368010,34.9777800,'South Carolina',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:44',0,'men','2021-10-28 15:21:44','2021-10-31 15:21:44',NULL,'Warm clothes for mountain weather, hiking boots, fishing gear and clothing for outdoor activities and fishing gear for fishing.',16046,139892,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"5779\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"922 W Mt Gallant Rd.\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"York \\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"SC\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"29745\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"34.977780\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-81.136801\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"South Carolina\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-york-sc-us-mark-folk',NULL,'2021-04-02 10:04:09','2024-04-10 15:21:44'),
	('9bc65c11-da81-4e24-ae13-670c4c05cc02',2,204,'WAH BASIC - GEORGE, IA, US | Darwin Van Otterloo',NULL,'weekly','2445 JACKSON AVE','IA',NULL,'GEORGE','512377683','US',-89.9765670,35.1576400,'Iowa',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:44',0,'men','2021-10-28 15:21:45','2021-10-31 15:21:45',NULL,'',16436,380029,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"6149\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"2445 JACKSON AVE\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"GEORGE\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"IA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"512377683\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"35.157640\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-89.976567\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Iowa\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-george-ia-us-darwin-van-otterloo-3',NULL,'2021-08-12 09:08:01','2024-04-10 15:21:45'),
	('9bc65c11-f6b2-4809-b01a-6a17fd76a24f',2,15,'WAH BASIC - Three Lakes, WI, US |  Brian Valentini',NULL,'weekly','8660 Honey Rock Rd','WI',NULL,'Three Lakes','54562','US',-89.1405920,45.8777660,'Wisconsin',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:45',0,'men','2021-10-28 15:21:45','2021-10-31 15:21:45',NULL,'We realize this event ends on Halloween - we aim to start early on Sunday, watch all the content and sessions in full, and have men on the road by 10am.\r\n\r\n**Covid-19 Update** - We will still be having this event, but all attendees must show proof of a negative Covid-19 test, taken on 10/26/2021) or later, to check-in at the camp.  Does not matter what kind of test, but must be negative, and to be taken on 10/26/2021 or later.  At this point, no masks will be required (subject to change).  If you register/pay and end up not being able to attend due to Covid-19, you will be issued a full, 100% refund.\r\n\r\nWhere:\r\nHoneyRock Camp\r\n8660 Honey Rock Rd, Three Lakes, WI 54562\r\n~4.5 hour drive from Minneapolis area\r\n~5.5 hour drive from Chicagoland area\r\n\r\nPrice: \r\n$185\r\nPrice includes all food (dinner on 10/28 through lunch on 10/31), snacks, lodging, and all event materials. \r\nThis is a life changing event and we do not want cost to be prohibitive; if costs are an issue for you, please contact one of us re a scholarship opportunity\r\n\r\nSleeping Arrangements:\r\nBunk rooms\r\nBring your own bedding (sheets, pillows, blankets, sleeping bag, etc.), toiletries, and towels\r\n\r\nWhat to Expect:\r\nOutside of Wild at Heart Boot Camp Basic content - \r\nWeekend will have periods of free time where we you will have some options, including (dependent on weather and availability): riflery, kayaking, indoor and outdoor climbing walls, mountain biking, extensive hiking trails, archery, High Elements Challenge Course Circuit, Giant Swing, and more',16466,405247,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"6189\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"8660 Honey Rock Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Three Lakes\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"WI\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"54562\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"45.877766\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-89.140592\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Wisconsin\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-three-lakes-wi-us-brian-valentini-0',NULL,'2021-08-22 08:08:25','2024-04-10 15:21:45'),
	('9bc65c12-1349-4d32-b98a-6a54c02eb5da',2,1882,'WAH BASIC - Castlewellan, DOW, GB | Chris Howie',NULL,'weekly','Castlewellan Castle',NULL,NULL,'Castlewellan','BT31 9BU','GB',-5.9554780,54.2644080,'County Down',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:45',0,'men','2021-10-28 15:21:45','2021-10-31 15:21:45',NULL,'The Conference Centre is located right in the middle of an extensive forest park on the edge of the Mourne Mountains, with some of the most breathtaking scenery in Ireland.\r\nAdvisable to bring walking / hiking footwear. Bed linen will be provided, please bring your own towel. Please check in with the website; www.wahni.org and the Facebook group; https://www.facebook.com/groups/980257459430475 for the latest information and registration. As the Wild at Heart weekends are very popular. We suggest registering your place early as bookings will be on a first come first served basis.\r\nThe retreat runs from Thursday 28th Oct -5pm until Sunday 31st Oct approx 2pm.\r\nRegistration is available through the following link:\r\nhttps://www.eventbrite.co.uk/e/wild-at-heart-bootcamp-basic-northern-ireland-2021-registration-167669021557?aff=WAHNIwildatheart\r\nRegister early to avoid disappointment',16451,418747,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"6166\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"Castlewellan Castle\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"The Forest Park\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Castlewellan\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"DOW\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"BT31 9BU\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"gb\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"54.264408\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-5.955478\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"County Down\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United Kingdom\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-castlewellan-dow-gb-chris-howie',NULL,'2021-08-17 08:08:41','2024-04-10 15:21:45'),
	('9bc65c12-2fc5-4427-9825-c1ed3c0a3f0d',6,1883,'CAPTIVATING - Beaver Bank, NS, CA |  ',NULL,'weekly','160 Kinsac Rd','NS',NULL,'Beaver Bank','B4G 1C5','CA',-63.6774940,44.8460380,'Nova Scotia',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:45',0,'women','2022-01-04 15:21:45',NULL,NULL,'After a long season of isolating I wanted an opportunity for women to come together and share the love of Jesus and grow our relationship with Him in a safe environment with other women.',16762,442802,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"6509\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"160 Kinsac Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Beaver Bank\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"NS\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"B4G 1C5\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"ca\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"44.846038\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-63.677494\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Nova Scotia\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"Canada\\\"}\"','/captivating/small-group/captivating-beaver-bank-ns-ca',NULL,'2021-10-28 03:10:41','2024-04-10 15:21:45'),
