VALUES
	('9bc65c12-fb3c-4ccb-baaa-8dec0929421e',2,1459,'WAH BASIC - Colorado Springs, CO, US | Brad Steininger',NULL,'weekly','5125 Brady Rd','CO',NULL,'Colorado Springs','80915','US',-104.7319960,38.8627910,'Colorado',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:45',0,'men','2021-10-21 15:21:45','2021-10-24 15:21:45',NULL,'What: Advanced Boot Camp is for men who have attended a Basic Boot Camp (or the live-event Boot Camp in Colorado). It is for men who are ready to go further and deeper on the path to freedom, healing, restoration and fellowship with God. At Basic Boot Camp, men discover how to regain their heart, their place in the battle and how to love God and live free. But there is so much more. Advanced is the next step, during which men will go deeper in walking with God, warfare, wounds, healing, calling, suffering, and loving Jesus. (Note: we offer the Basic Boot Camp at various times throughout the year; however, this listing is only for the Advanced Boot Camp.)\r\n\r\nWhen: Thur-Sun, October 21-24, 2021 (arrive between 4:30-5:00 pm Thursday, depart after 12:00 Sunday)\r\n\r\nWhere: The Outpost at Stein Haus, 5125 Brady Rd, Colorado Springs, CO 80915\r\n\r\nWho: This retreat can accommodate up to 4 men (there will be a waiting list in the event someone needs to dropout).\r\n\r\nAccommodations: Four men will share a single large room (bunk beds). Everyone will have a bed, pillow, linens and towels. There is one bathroom with a shower/sink/toilet and a second bathroom with a sink/toilet.\r\n\r\nCost: $77 which includes lodging, all meals and retreat content. A nonrefundable deposit of $50 is due no later than 30 Sep via check or PayPal. Full payment of the remaining $27 is due upon arrival at the retreat.\r\n\r\nRegistration: Please contact Brad Steininger to register or for more information.\r\n\r\nOther info:   \r\n\r\n* This event is designed to be experienced \"off the grid;\" we ask that participants unplug and only use cell phones in extreme emergencies. There will be a contact number for emergencies.\r\n\r\n* Free time is built into the schedule both Friday and Saturday afternoon. During this time you will have the opportunity to participate in a hike, leisure time around the facility, take a nap, read a book, play disc golf, etc.\r\n\r\n* This retreat is in a rustic neighborhood on the East side of Colorado Springs (mostly dirt roads and equestrian properties). Bring season-appropriate casual clothes. There are some trails nearby for hiking and an excellent park with many trails just a couple miles away. \r\n\r\n* In the evenings, there will be an opportunity to relax, build a camp fire, tell stories and have fun. You\'ll leave with new friendships, greater clarity in your walk with the Lord, and inspired to live your life as a man fully alive.',16298,236529,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"6026\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"5125 Brady Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Colorado Springs\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"80915\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"38.862791\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-104.731996\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Colorado\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-colorado-springs-co-us-brad-steininger-3',NULL,'2021-06-23 04:06:26','2024-04-10 15:21:45'),
	('9bc65c13-180a-47dc-a5ce-a7c379ae3c65',2,1886,'WAH BASIC - Billingsley, AL, US | William  Waldrop',NULL,'weekly','County road 383','AL',NULL,'Billingsley','36006','US',-86.6498260,32.7268830,'Alabama',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:45',0,'men','2021-10-21 15:21:45','2021-10-24 15:21:45',NULL,'Some optional activities may include swimming by day and campfires by night. If you would like to sit around the campfire and enjoy time with everyone or swim, bring a swim suit and camp fire clothes if you want.\r\nThere are some trails for light hikes if you want to bring hiking boots or good shoes. \r\n\r\nBring your paper Bible as phones are not welcome during this weekend.',16530,297025,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"6262\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"County road 383\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Billingsley\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"AL\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"36006\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"32.726883\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-86.649826\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Alabama\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-billingsley-al-us-william-waldrop',NULL,'2021-09-06 10:09:20','2024-04-10 15:21:45'),
	('9bc65c13-34f3-4b3a-8fcf-ab4a60a242a7',2,1836,'WAH BASIC - Medora, ND, US | Tyler McKay',NULL,'weekly','3892 Bible Camp Rd, Medora, ND 58645','ND',NULL,'Medora','58645','US',-103.5232930,46.8742620,'North Dakota',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:45',0,'men','2021-10-21 15:21:45','2021-10-24 15:21:45',NULL,'Join us in Medora, ND @ Badlands Ministry Camp on October 21-24. Registration will be at 4:00 PM CST on October 21, 2021 and will conclude around 12:30 PM CST on October 24, 2021. \r\nThis men\'s retreat will have 3 pricing options based on lodging arrangements. All materials, lodging, and meals are including within all 3 pricing options - please bring your own snacks and toiletries. Bedding is provided for the $300 package - all other pricing options should bring their own bedding. \r\nAttendees should bring campfire clothes and other clothing for the ever-unpredictable North Dakota October weather.',16143,399054,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"5869\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"3892 Bible Camp Rd, Medora, ND 58645\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Medora\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"ND\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"58645\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"46.874262\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-103.523293\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"North Dakota\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-medora-nd-us-tyler-mckay',NULL,'2021-05-02 08:05:14','2024-04-10 15:21:45'),
