	('9bc65c13-e6df-4ebc-96b1-b26c7894ffda',2,1759,'WAH BASIC - Mullaghmore, SL, IE | Aiden Mc Guinness',NULL,'weekly','Star of the Sea Retreat Centre','SL',NULL,'Mullaghmore','F91 CC98','IE',-8.4499240,54.4656820,'Sligo',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:46',0,'men','2021-10-21 15:21:46','2021-10-24 15:21:46',NULL,'Sign Up for this BASIC is now Closed - 15/10/2021  \r\nBring a good pair of walking shoes and warm waterproof clothing. There will be plenty of free time on Friday &amp; Saturday afternoon for some physical exercise, to get out in the fresh Atlantic Sea air and to enjoy the spectacular scenic views around Mullaghmore Head.',16528,419399,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"6260\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"Star of the Sea Retreat Centre\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Mullaghmore\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"SL\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"F91 CC98\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"ie\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"54.465682\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-8.449924\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Sligo\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"Ireland\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-mullaghmore-sl-ie-aiden-mc-guinness',NULL,'2021-09-06 03:09:02','2024-04-10 15:21:46'),
	('9bc65c14-0418-41e8-8591-46a860913194',3,1887,'CORE - Lowesville, VA, US | Cheryl Haymes',NULL,'weekly','2247 Little Piney Rd.','VA',NULL,'Lowesville','22967','US',-79.1381160,37.7660720,'Virginia',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:46',0,'men','2021-10-21 15:21:46','2021-10-24 15:21:46',NULL,'The event is held at CrossRoads Camp and Conference Center, www.crossroadssccc.com, in the Blue Ridge Mountains of Virginia just south of Charlottesville, Va and north of Lynchburg, Va. The scenery is beautiful in the mountains in late October and the temperatures will be cool/cold. Walking shoes, hiking boots, and warm clothing are suggested. The camp offers hiking trails, meandering mountain streams, and a high-ropes course. There is a limit of 25 participants so please register soon by emailing me, 1chaymes@gmail.com. Can\'t wait to hear from you!',15934,414494,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"5665\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"2247 Little Piney Rd.\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Lowesville\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"VA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"22967\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"37.766072\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-79.138116\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Virginia\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/core-lowesville-va-us-cheryl-haymes-0',NULL,'2021-03-08 12:03:55','2024-04-10 15:21:46'),
	('9bc65c14-2106-4928-b232-9dc9a3d8c0e9',2,1525,'WAH BASIC - Clinton, MO, US | Mark Reiter',NULL,'weekly','816 NE 350 P','MO',NULL,'Clinton','64735','US',-93.7841500,38.3820460,'Missouri',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:46',0,'men','2021-10-21 15:21:46','2021-10-24 15:21:46',NULL,'WHO:  Men, ages 18 and older, who want to go deeper into healing their hearts and exploring their masculine journeys with God.\r\n\r\nWHEN: Our next Boot Camp begins Thursday, October 21, 2021, at 6:30 PM and concludes on Sunday, October 24, 2021, at 12:00pm. Please prayerfully consider your application prior to submitting. By applying, you are agreeing to be present for the entire event.\r\n\r\nWHERE: LifeChange Camp is 13 miles north-east of Clinton, MO – appx. 1.5 hour drive from Kansas City.\r\n\r\nCOST:  The cost for the event is $180. This includes lodging, meals (Thursday dinner – Sunday breakfast), and materials.  Participants are responsible for getting to and from LifeChange Camp.  Limited scholarships are available.  You can begin the scholarship application process on the Boot Camp Scholarship page at https://e6ministries.org/scholar_request/',16663,260103,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"6401\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"816 NE 350 P\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Clinton\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"64735\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"38.382046\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-93.784150\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Missouri\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-clinton-mo-us-mark-reiter-5',NULL,'2021-10-03 05:10:47','2024-04-10 15:21:46'),
