	('9bc65c15-a298-457d-ade8-aa84e32e00c9',2,1893,'WAH BASIC - Lexington, KY, US | Tim Harrison',NULL,'weekly','7463 Athens-Boonesboro Road','KY',NULL,'Lexington','40509','US',-84.3401140,37.9323000,'Kentucky',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:47',0,'men','2021-10-14 15:21:47','2021-10-17 15:21:47',NULL,'This Wild at Heart BASIC will be held at the Summit Retreat Center of Blue Grass Christian Camp near Lexington, KY.  Registration and Check-in will begin at 3:30 on Thursday, October 14 and dinner will be at 6:00. We will wrap up before noon on Sunday October 17.  Bring recreational clothing, hiking shoes, journal and pen, a camp chair, toiletries and your own pillow if desired. Lodging is hotel room style with bedding and towels provided. Cost is $195 and financial assistance is available upon request.  If you have not read Wild at Heart or read it recently, reading it or listening to the audio book before you come is recommended. To register, contact Tim Harrison at tim@gracetoglory.org.',16000,25269,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"5738\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"7463 Athens-Boonesboro Road\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Lexington\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"KY\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"40509\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"37.932300\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-84.340114\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Kentucky\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-lexington-ky-us-tim-harrison',NULL,'2021-03-22 12:03:50','2024-04-10 15:21:47'),
