	('9bc65c18-25d4-43b2-a08e-3e69afe71499',2,1908,'WAH BASIC - Palmdale, CA, US | Gilbert Jimenez',NULL,'weekly','20075 Angeles Crest Highway','CA',NULL,'Palmdale','93550','US',-117.9991070,34.3470930,'California',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:49',0,'men','2021-09-23 15:21:49','2021-09-26 15:21:49',NULL,'PLEASE sign up through http://forfreedomoutreach.org/ffo-la \r\n\r\nFor those who register early (before June 23, 2021), the fee for this event will be $250.00. After June 23,  the fee will be $285.00. 8 meals will be provided for this camp. If you have any questions about this camp, please reach out to George Harrison at 818-854-1744 or email him @ gihwork@msm.com. \r\n\r\nBring the following:\r\nSleeping bags (2) one for the mat and the other to cover\r\nHiking shoes for the trails\r\nMountain bike trails are available\r\nsoap, towel etc for shower\r\nMeals will be provided.',16169,418102,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"5898\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"20075 Angeles Crest Highway\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Palmdale\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"93550\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"34.347093\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-117.999107\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"California\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-palmdale-ca-us-gilbert-jimenez',NULL,'2021-05-06 02:05:20','2024-04-10 15:21:49'),
