	('9bc65c19-c4b5-4a1f-bf1f-f3d1df35c06d',2,1916,'WAH BASIC - Hocking Hills, OH, US | Michael Finfrock',NULL,'weekly','','OH',NULL,'Hocking Hills','','US',-82.5379230,39.4236880,'Ohio',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:50',0,'men','2021-09-09 15:21:50','2021-09-12 15:21:50',NULL,'Bring your Hiking shoes and swim trunks too. This BASIC Event is being held at Eagle Wings Lodge in Hocking Hills, OH. Situated on 14 acres surrounded by lush forest located just 48 miles south east of Columbus. During your quiet time with Abba you can enjoy magnificent views from the wrap around covered porches while sitting by the extra wide outdoor fire place or enjoying a meal while overlooking the spring fed lake and waterfall. Take a swim in the lake to cool down or unwind in the 8 person hot tub after hike in the many nearby state parks. . Enjoy a relaxing evening roasting marshmallows around the firepit and swapping stories together under the stars,',16048,372638,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"5782\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Hocking Hills\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"OH\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"39.423688\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-82.537923\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Ohio\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-hocking-hills-oh-us-michael-finfrock',NULL,'2021-04-02 01:04:48','2024-04-10 15:21:50'),
