	('9bc65c1d-3f9d-46cc-8771-d45a40d7ad72',3,1460,'CORE - Van Reenen, KN, ZA | Ilana Kloppers',NULL,'weekly','Sandriver Valley Lodge','KN',NULL,'Van Reenen','3372','ZA',29.3800590,-28.3743530,'KwaZulu-Natal',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:52',0,'men','2021-06-25 15:21:52','2021-06-28 15:21:52',NULL,'1. Bedding. Either duvet and pillow or sleeping bag etc.  A fitted sheet helps too. \r\n2. It\'s a cool weekend. Rain gear is a good idea. Good shoes for a walk. Earplugs for loud bunk partners. \r\n4. Bug spray \r\n5. Costume if is warm. \r\n6. Adult refreshments and snack are your responsibility. We provide tea/coffee/water/meals\r\n7. Ask questions if you are unsure.\r\n\r\nWe are looking forward to hosting you in our beautiful province. This is a life-changing weekend, please make the time.',16030,369075,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"5764\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"Sandriver Valley Lodge\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Van Reenen\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"KN\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"3372\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"za\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"-28.374353\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"29.380059\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"KwaZulu-Natal\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"South Africa\\\"}\"','/core-van-reenen-kn-za-ilana-kloppers',NULL,'2021-03-29 05:03:45','2024-04-10 15:21:52'),
