	('9bc65c1d-d292-4192-88e6-65bed4e9507e',5,1932,'WILD AT HEART - La Mesa, CA, US | Bobby Nothwang',NULL,'weekly','8363 Center Dr.','CA',NULL,'La Mesa','91942','US',-117.0172950,32.7745450,'California',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:52',0,'men','2021-06-22 15:21:52',NULL,NULL,'We will be meeting in the Plaza Room at 6:30pm on Tuesday nights',16288,421014,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"6017\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"8363 Center Dr.\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"Suite 6c\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"La Mesa\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"91942\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"32.774545\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-117.017295\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"California\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wildatheart/small-group/wild-heart-la-mesa-ca-us-bobby-nothwang',NULL,'2021-06-16 04:06:42','2024-04-10 15:21:52'),
	('9bc65c1d-ef16-4d77-80d4-84b22d9c414d',5,1197,'WILD AT HEART - Brantford, ON, CA | Michael Carter',NULL,'weekly','28 Ivanhoe Road','ON',NULL,'Brantford','N3R 5T8','CA',-80.2653370,43.1853960,'Ontario',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:52',0,'men','2021-06-16 15:21:52',NULL,NULL,'We are also a CR group as well.',16284,426914,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"6012\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"28 Ivanhoe Road\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Brantford\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"ON\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"N3R 5T8\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"ca\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"43.185396\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-80.265337\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Ontario\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"Canada\\\"}\"','/wildatheart/small-group/wild-heart-brantford-ca-michael-carter',NULL,'2021-06-16 08:06:10','2024-04-10 15:21:52'),
	('9bc65c1e-0c8a-42f3-b3ae-d16b0a69fb96',2,1459,'WAH BASIC - Colorado Springs, CO, US | Brad Steininger',NULL,'weekly','5125 Brady Rd','CO',NULL,'Colorado Springs','80915','US',-104.7319960,38.8627910,'Colorado',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:52',0,'men','2021-06-10 15:21:53','2021-06-13 15:21:53',NULL,'What: This is no ordinary men\'s retreat. No breakout sessions or small groups. Just awesome teaching by John and his team via video followed by time alone with the Father.\r\n\r\nWhen: Thur-Sun, June 10-13, 2021 (arrive between 4:30-5:00 pm Thursday, depart after 12:00 Sunday)\r\n\r\nWhere: The Outpost at Stein Haus, 5125 Brady Rd, Colorado Springs, CO 80915\r\n\r\nWho: This retreat can accommodate up to 4 men (there will be a waiting list in the event someone needs to dropout).\r\n\r\nAccommodations: Four men will share a single large room (bunk beds). Everyone will have a bed, pillow, linens and towels. There is one bathroom with a shower/sink/toilet and a second bathroom with a sink/toilet.\r\n\r\nCost: $77 which includes lodging, all meals and retreat content. A nonrefundable deposit of $50 is due 3 June via check or PayPal. Full payment of the remaining $27 is due upon arrival at the retreat.\r\n\r\nRegistration: Please contact Brad Steininger to register or for more information.\r\n\r\nOther info:   \r\n\r\n* Get a copy of Wild at Heart and read it before the retreat.\r\n\r\n* This event is designed to be experienced \"off the grid;\" we ask that you unplug and only use cell phones in extreme emergencies. There will be a contact number for emergencies.\r\n\r\n* Free time is built into the schedule Friday and Saturday afternoons. During this time you will have the opportunity to participate in a hike, leisure time around the facility, take a nap, read a book, play disc golf, etc.\r\n\r\n* This retreat is in a rustic neighborhood on the East side of Colorado Springs (mostly dirt roads and equestrian properties). Bring season-appropriate casual clothes. There are some trails nearby for hiking and an excellent park with many trails just a couple miles away. \r\n\r\n* Bottled water will be provided. Bring snacks that you like and wouldn\'t mind sharing. Also, please bring drinks that you like. Cigars, pipes and adult beverages are welcome (all smoking will be done outside and is, therefore, weather dependent). \r\n\r\n* In the evenings, there will be an opportunity to relax, build a campfire, tell stories and have fun. You\'ll leave with new friendships, greater clarity in your walk with the Lord, and inspired to live your life as a man fully alive.',15837,236529,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"5574\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"5125 Brady Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Colorado Springs\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"80915\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"38.862791\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-104.731996\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Colorado\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-colorado-springs-co-us-brad-steininger-1',NULL,'2021-02-23 09:02:28','2024-04-10 15:21:53'),
