	('9bc65c1e-bfb1-42f0-82c8-f36ced4cb6f9',2,1935,'WAH BASIC - Baraboo, WI, US |  ',NULL,'weekly','E11844 County Rd DL','WI',NULL,'Baraboo','53913','US',-89.7303660,43.4358650,'Wisconsin',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:53',0,'men','2021-06-03 15:21:53','2021-06-06 15:21:53',NULL,'This is no ordinary men\'s retreat. No breakout sessions or small groups. Just awesome teaching by John and his team via video, with a plethora of optional organized activities to choose from, including hiking, high ropes, rock climbing and paintball. \r\n\r\nNestled in the woods directly across from beautiful Devil\'s Lake State Park, the facilities are top-notch and the food is probably the best food you\'ve ever experienced at a retreat. \r\n\r\nCost is only $20, thanks to a group of generous donors. This includes all lessons, lodging, 8 meals, and optional activities.  \r\n\r\nSpace is limited to 30 so don\'t wait to commit.  Register online today @ https://forms.gle/41qH9nepo1GH91H16.\r\n\r\nThis is truly a life changing experience.  You\'ll leave with new friendships, greater clarity about yourself, and inspired to live your life to the fullest.',15740,432966,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"5483\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"E11844 County Rd DL\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Baraboo\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"WI\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"53913\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"43.435865\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-89.730366\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Wisconsin\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-baraboo-wi-us',NULL,'2021-01-27 04:01:09','2024-04-10 15:21:53'),
