	('9bc65c21-83dc-4c8e-9eb7-0ad4c6c323d3',3,1951,'CORE - Cascade, CO, US | Christine Hofler',NULL,'weekly','4519 Edwards Place','CO',NULL,'Cascade','80809','US',-104.9707160,38.8981690,'Colorado',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:55',0,'men','2021-05-13 15:21:55','2021-05-16 15:21:55',NULL,'We are at an elevation over 7300 feet, so come well-hydrated. Bring hiking boots or walking shoes for exploring the area around the house; there are both neighborhood streets and mountain paths to walk on. \r\n\r\nWe have space for up to 8 women to attend this event. You will most likely be sharing a room, so this is for individuals who are comfortable coming and staying in close proximity with those they have not previously known.\r\n\r\nThere are 3 bedrooms available. We have 2 queen beds, 3 twin beds and a futon, allowing us to accommodate 6 women in their own beds, or up to 8 women, if 4 are willing to share the 2 queens. If you want further information about the bedrooms and bathrooms, please ask.\r\n\r\nPlease be aware that we will make every effort to accommodate food preferences and needs. We are not able to guarantee every specific request, however, as we are just 2 women, working in a home kitchen, and not professional chefs in a commercial kitchen.',15893,53788,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"5625\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"4519 Edwards Place\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"PO Box 247\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Cascade\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"80809\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"38.898169\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-104.970716\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Colorado\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/core-cascade-co-us-christine-hofler',NULL,'2021-03-03 10:03:33','2024-04-10 15:21:55'),
