	('9bc65c23-207f-4176-ad4d-18af8ec8ed12',2,26,'WAH BASIC - Martinsville, NSW, AU | Phil Cairns',NULL,'weekly','Watagan State Forest',NULL,NULL,'Martinsville','2265','AU',151.3351060,-33.0670010,'New South Wales',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:56',0,'men','2021-04-29 15:21:56','2021-05-02 15:21:56',NULL,'This is out in the bush, no hotels, no running water. Please see my blog post for details: https://www.cairns-family.com/blog/2021/03/04/wild-at-heart-basic-april-29-may-2-2021/',15907,414158,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"5640\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"Watagan State Forest\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Martinsville\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"NSW\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"2265\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"au\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"-33.067001\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"151.335106\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"New South Wales\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"Australia\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-martinsville-nsw-au-phil-cairns',NULL,'2021-03-03 09:03:59','2024-04-10 15:21:56'),
	('9bc65c23-3eea-4056-afd2-6e3f53d7fd3c',2,942,'WAH BASIC - Midway, TX, US | Mark Dudley',NULL,'weekly','13464 OSR Highway','TX',NULL,'Midway','75852','US',-95.8103340,31.0556480,'Texas',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:56',0,'men','2021-04-29 15:21:56','2021-05-02 15:21:56',NULL,'The venue for our BASIC retreat will be the Rontis Ranch, a working cattle ranch with a small beef production operation on 174 acres in the hills and lakes region of Texas. Rontis Ranch sits about 8 miles east of Interstate 45 between Houston and Dallas Texas.\r\n\r\nBASIC Retreat participants should bring casual clothing.  Bring at least one change of work clothes and one pair of closed-toe shoes. Some planned, but optional, activities will be a steak-grilling cookout, late night campfire conversations, ranching chores and projects, and shooting sports (shotgun clays, range target shooting).',16036,413860,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"5769\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"13464 OSR Highway\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Midway\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"TX\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"75852\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"31.055648\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-95.810334\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Texas\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-midway-tx-us-mark-dudley-0',NULL,'2021-03-30 08:03:32','2024-04-10 15:21:56'),
	('9bc65c23-5d20-42bd-be51-37d137134b31',2,1961,'WAH BASIC - Black Mountain, NC, US | Matthew Daughtry-Grubbs',NULL,'weekly','1233 North Fork Road','NC',NULL,'Black Mountain','28711','US',-82.3543470,35.6253710,'North Carolina',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:56',0,'men','2021-04-29 15:21:56','2021-05-02 15:21:56',NULL,'Arrangements:\r\n     • Lodging will be double occupancy.  Bed linens and towels will be provided. \r\n     • Room assignments will be random, unless you specify preferred roommates on sign-up sheet sent in the welcome email; we will try our to best accommodate roommate requests.\r\n\r\nWhat to Expect:\r\n     • Once your initial registration and payment are submitted, a welcome email will be send to you containing further details and a registration form where you will submit other information needed for the event.  \r\n     • This event is designed to be experienced \"off the grid;\" we ask that you unplug and only use cell phones in extreme emergencies, and do not carry them around the whole weekend. (There will be a contact number for emergencies.)  Further information will be provided at the event. \r\n     • Free time is built into the schedule both Friday and Saturday afternoon.  During this time you will have the opportunity to participate in a hike, enjoy the gymnasium facilities (basketball, etc.), outdoor volleyball court, leisure time around the camp grounds, or take a nap. \r\n     • In the evenings, weather permitting, we will have a camp fire. This will be a great time to relax, tell stories, and have fun. You\'ll leave with new friendships, greater clarity in your walk with the Lord, and inspired to live your life to the fullest as a man fully alive.  Please bring clothes appropriate for the weather. \r\n\r\nGroups are welcome. On the sign-up sheet sent in the welcome email, please specify what group you\'re a part of.',15495,415441,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"5257\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"1233 North Fork Road\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Black Mountain\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"NC\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"28711\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"35.625371\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-82.354347\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"North Carolina\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-black-mountain-nc-us-matthew-daughtry-grubbs-1',NULL,'2020-10-02 09:10:05','2024-04-10 15:21:56'),
