	('9bc65c27-91c3-46b3-89f7-753c61497584',2,568,'WAH BASIC - Horton, KS, US | Brad Farr',NULL,'weekly','1550 125th Street ','KS',NULL,'Horton','66439','US',-95.5185440,39.6871550,'Kansas',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:21:59',0,'men','2021-03-18 15:21:59','2021-03-21 15:21:59',NULL,'This event is $200 per person. You can bring the payment with you or pay at farrchiro@rainbowtel.net @paypal.com.\r\n\r\nBring layers of clothing. Who knows what the weather in Kansas will throw at us. Campfires are optional. Bring your sleeping bags or whatever. They have bunk beds. Showers are available.  The accommodations are comfortable. The sitting is remote. The food will be fantastic. Bring your pipes or cigars is you choose. In the past we have had firearms to shoot. The availability of ammo may prevent those activities, this time. However, there is always hope that ammo can be found. Contact me if you have any other questions.',15797,264841,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"5539\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"1550 125th Street \\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"Mission Lake Christian Camp\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Horton\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"KS\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"66439\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"39.687155\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-95.518544\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Kansas\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-horton-ks-us-brad-farr',NULL,'2021-02-12 09:02:30','2024-04-10 15:21:59'),
