	('9bc65c31-f856-42c0-a03f-d8e614c7de03',2,2023,'WAH BASIC - Niles, MI, US | Ken Whah',NULL,'weekly','7383 Steinbauer Rd','MI',NULL,'Niles','49120','US',-86.2793640,41.9064230,'Michigan',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:06',0,'men','2020-09-17 15:22:06','2020-09-20 15:22:06',NULL,'Wild at Heart Boot Camp BASIC - Southwest Michigan\r\n\r\nDate:  September 17 - 20, 2020\r\n\r\nLocation:  Michiana Camp, 7383 Niles MI 49120\r\n\r\nTuition:  $349\r\nTuition includes accommodations, meals, teaching &amp; activities. \r\n\r\nWhat to Bring:  \r\nCasual / weather appropriate clothing &amp; shoes, campfire clothes, towel &amp; personal toiletries.  Bedding is provided.\r\n\r\nimmeasurablyMORE has partnered with Wild at Heart Ministries, John Eldredge and local Wild at Heart Boot Camp graduates to bring this epic four-day men’s retreat to Southwest Michigan.  Set on 65 acres of natural beauty, you will have the opportunity to get the full experience of the Wild at Heart Boot Camp presented by John, Bart, Morgan &amp; Alex from Wild at Heart Ministries via video while enjoying the beauty of nature in this relaxing, but powerful weekend.  \r\n\r\nEach day is packed with sessions that include movie clips and stories that will engage you from the first moment.  Throughout the weekend, there are 8 strategic times you\'ll have alone with the Lord to hear His voice for you and where you are in life. Come expecting Him to speak, draw you into intimacy with Himself, and instruct you in His ways.\r\n\r\nYou will have time both Friday and Saturday to relax, take a nap, hike, participate in group activities or just sit quietly by the lake and take in the beauty of nature.  At night, we will have bonfires to relax, tell stories, and have fun. You\'ll leave with new friendships, greater clarity in your walk with the Lord, and inspired to live your life to the fullest as a man fully alive.\r\n\r\n**We have limited capacity to comply with COVID-19 social distancing guidelines, but still have space available!** \r\n\r\n**REGISTRATION ENDS AUGUST 31, 2020**  \r\n\r\nDON\'T WAIT REGISTER NOW!  https://shop.imm320.com',14651,411137,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"4565\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"7383 Steinbauer Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Niles\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MI\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"49120\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"41.906423\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-86.279364\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Michigan\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-niles-mi-us-ken-whah',NULL,'2020-01-16 12:01:17','2024-04-10 15:22:06'),
