	('9bc65c33-0809-4cac-9ffe-d5a89aca0731',2,1436,'WAH BASIC - Wee Jasper, NSW, AU | Les Shelley',NULL,'weekly','Mountain Trails Adventure School',NULL,NULL,'Wee Jasper','2582','AU',148.7670280,-35.1166000,'New South Wales',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:06',0,'men','2020-08-21 15:22:06','2020-08-24 15:22:06',NULL,'',15127,231515,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"4911\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"Mountain Trails Adventure School\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"998 Doctors Flat Rd\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Wee Jasper\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"NSW\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"2582\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"au\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"-35.116600\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"148.767028\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"New South Wales\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"Australia\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-wee-jasper-nsw-au-les-shelley-0',NULL,'2020-05-28 06:05:03','2024-04-10 15:22:06'),
	('9bc65c33-26b5-45ff-9bc6-546316945cb9',2,289,'WAH BASIC - Yaak, MT, US | Philip Soucy',NULL,'weekly','776','MT',NULL,'Yaak','59935','US',-115.7086590,48.8330050,'Montana',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:06',0,'men','2020-08-20 15:22:06','2020-08-23 15:22:06',NULL,'We will be meeting at the Stillwater camp on the Yaak river. Some lodging in cabins and some in wall tents. Just bring a sleeping bag, pillow and your heart. Or at least what you can find of it. Treasure will be found!',15322,108120,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"5084\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"776\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"Gus creek \\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Yaak\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MT\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"59935\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"48.833005\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-115.708659\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Montana\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-yaak-mt-us-philip-soucy',NULL,'2020-08-03 09:08:44','2024-04-10 15:22:06'),
	('9bc65c33-43e5-4f38-a63c-a81c6f432f88',3,2028,'CORE - Wynne, AR, US | Janet Benson',NULL,'weekly','Village Creek State Park','AR',NULL,'Wynne','72396','US',-90.7867800,35.2245330,'Arkansas',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:06',0,'men','2020-08-20 15:22:06','2020-08-23 15:22:06',NULL,'Dress will be very casual. Bring comfortable shoes for hiking the trails or a swimsuit for enjoying the lake. All linens and towels will be provided, but if you plan to swim, please bring your own beach towels.',15213,427143,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"5002\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"Village Creek State Park\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"201 County Road 754\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Wynne\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"AR\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"72396\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"35.224533\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-90.786780\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Arkansas\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/core-wynne-ar-us-janet-benson',NULL,'2020-06-25 08:06:23','2024-04-10 15:22:06'),
	('9bc65c33-61d5-4a85-bc39-6060a4aeb065',2,1665,'WAH BASIC - Toquerville, UT, US | Chris Ashworth',NULL,'weekly','1700 Shangri-La Rd','UT',NULL,'Toquerville','84774','US',-113.2866100,37.2186100,'Utah',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:06',0,'men','2020-08-20 15:22:07','2020-08-23 15:22:07',NULL,'During the 4 days set on the Shangri-La ranch next to Ash Creek in Toquerville, you will participate in a multi-media experience which will help you discover something profound about your own heart and the heart of God.\r\n\r\nThis isn’t your typical retreat. You will not be asked to break into small groups and share your feelings. Instead you will hear from other men living an intentional life in pursuit of the heart of God. Bring your fishing gear and/or kayak for the stocked pond, your swimsuit for the pool or pond, and your hiking boots for the trails. Past attendees have indicated that this weekend has been a transformational experience in their walk with God.\r\n\r\nCost is $150 to cover lodging. Bring your own meals that take less than 10 minutes to prepare and clean up.\r\n\r\nArrive between 5-6pm Aug 20th. We\'ll be done by noon Aug 23rd. \r\n\r\nIn order to make this a transformational experience, we ask you to disconnect from your world during the event. Please commit to no cell phones, wifi, or work.',15202,405815,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"4987\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"1700 Shangri-La Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Toquerville\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"UT\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"84774\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"37.218610\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-113.286610\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Utah\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-toquerville-ut-us-chris-ashworth',NULL,'2020-06-23 07:06:07','2024-04-10 15:22:07'),
	('9bc65c33-7fd3-4612-bf3b-c26d009c458a',3,2029,'CORE - Durbanville, WC, ZA | Rozelle Johansen',NULL,'weekly','20 Olive Road','WC',NULL,'Durbanville','7550','ZA',18.6831940,-33.8313940,'Western Cape',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:07',0,'men','2020-08-16 15:22:07','2020-08-19 15:22:07',NULL,'Come with ready hearts and something to keep warm.',15357,105536,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"5123\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"20 Olive Road\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"Pinehurst\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Durbanville\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"WC\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"7550\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"za\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"-33.831394\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"18.683194\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Western Cape\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"South Africa\\\"}\"','/core-durbanville-wc-za-rozelle-johansen',NULL,'2020-08-12 10:08:02','2024-04-10 15:22:07'),
