	('9bc65c34-911e-47e1-bf5c-631beab76950',2,1450,'WAH BASIC - Oak Creek, CO, US | Mark Folk',NULL,'weekly','	      15700 County Road 16','CO',NULL,'Oak Creek','80467','US',-106.7142140,40.1449260,'Colorado',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:07',0,'men','2020-07-30 15:22:07','2020-08-02 15:22:07',NULL,'Mt. Elim is located in the rugged Northern Central Colorado Rockies, Routt National Forrest.\r\nYou will need to come prepared mountain of weather including cold nights and warm days. \r\nYou will want to bring hiking clothes and boots for rough terrain.\r\nYou will need to bring your own linens and toiletries. I recommend a sleeping bag and your own pillow.\r\nIf you enjoy fly fishing bring your gear and you will need to get a CO. fishing license.\r\nWe will have nightly campfires so come prepared for evening around the fire.\r\n\r\nFor more info contact tim@newwildernessadventures.com',14788,139892,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"4721\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"\\\\t      15700 County Road 16\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Oak Creek\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"80467\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"40.144926\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-106.714214\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Colorado\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-oak-creek-co-us-mark-folk',NULL,'2020-03-02 01:03:23','2024-04-10 15:22:07'),
