	('9bc65c37-1369-4399-849f-f3e6bb9f1cf6',2,2042,'WAH BASIC - Hocking Hills, OH, US | Greg Adams',NULL,'weekly','','OH',NULL,'Hocking Hills','','US',-82.5392920,39.4240120,'Ohio',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:09',0,'men','2020-06-04 15:22:09','2020-06-07 15:22:09',NULL,'All men die, but few men really live! Battle, adventure and rescue are what make men come alive!  God calls us to more than just salvation - but also to freedom, to life, to sonship.  Join us at the spectacular Eagle Wings Lodge for a Boot Camp based on the book Wild At Heart. During the 4 days set in the majestic rolling landscape of Hocking Hills, you will participate in a multi-media experience and live presentations which will help you discover something profound about your own heart and the heart of God.\r\n\r\nThis isn’t your typical retreat.  You will not be asked to break into small groups and share your feelings.  Instead you will hear from other men living an intentional life in pursuit of the heart of God.  Bring your fishing gear for the stocked pond, your hiking boots for the trails, and your guns or bows for target shooting.  Past attendees have indicated that this weekend has been a transformational experience in their walk with God – don’t miss out.\r\n\r\nThe cost is $285 and includes all food and lodging.\r\n\r\nTo register, watch a video, download a brochure and get more information go to https://centralohiobootcamp.weebly.com/\r\n\r\nYou may also email  bootcamp@ualc.org',14439,181564,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"4393\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Hocking Hills\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"OH\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"39.424012\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-82.539292\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Ohio\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-hocking-hills-oh-us-greg-adams-2',NULL,'2019-11-27 08:11:21','2024-04-10 15:22:09'),
