	('9bc65c37-4f2f-4711-8f47-5413c9c2c281',2,2043,'WAH BASIC - Troy, MT, US | Phil Soucy',NULL,'weekly','766 Gus creek Rd','MT',NULL,'Troy','59935','US',-115.8154450,48.8199140,'Montana',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:09',0,'men','2020-05-28 15:22:09','2020-05-31 15:22:09',NULL,'This boot camp will be at the Stillwater cabins on the Yaak River. There is no cost for this event. Come prepared to have a life changing encounter. Contact us for more details. \r\nDue to the Coronavirus, we have changed the date to May 28th through 31. \r\nIt appears that everyone that registered for the April event will be able to make the new date, so this event is full. We were planning three men’s Basic events at Stillwater in the Yaak this summer, but if there is more interest, we could add a fourth. \r\nAlso the ladies will be hosting two Captivating Core events. The June event is full. Stay tuned for upcoming details and dates.',14719,108120,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"4647\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"766 Gus creek Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Troy\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MT\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"59935\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"48.819914\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-115.815445\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Montana\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-troy-mt-us-phil-soucy-2',NULL,'2020-02-04 10:02:03','2024-04-10 15:22:09'),
