	('9bc65c37-8e1c-40bd-8e9c-907e55b7e4f0',2,2044,'WAH BASIC - Newton, IA, US | Michael Adams',NULL,'weekly','TBD','IA',NULL,'TBD','','US',0.0000000,0.0000000,'Iowa',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:09',0,'men','2020-05-14 15:22:09','2020-05-17 15:22:09',NULL,'MEN! I am looking into options for a location as we speak. I have reached out to Several Locations thus far for pricing, and availability.\r\n\r\nIf I have waited too long for this then I will postpone this for a later date but still be hosting it. \r\n\r\nI appreciate all your grace, and patience with me at this time. Reach out if you have ANY questions.',14333,419065,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"4286\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"TBD\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"TBD\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"IA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"0.000000\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"0.000000\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Iowa\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-newton-ia-us-michael-adams',NULL,'2019-10-07 08:10:13','2024-04-10 15:22:09'),
	('9bc65c37-ac82-411d-a376-411ef8b89105',2,2045,'WAH BASIC - Lake Hughes, CA, US | Gilbert Jimenez',NULL,'weekly','18651 Pine Canyon Road  ','CA',NULL,'Lake Hughes','93532','US',-118.4623640,34.6835090,'California',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:09',0,'men','2020-05-14 15:22:09','2020-05-17 15:22:09',NULL,'Please bring the following:\r\n\r\n1. two sleeping bags, one for the bunk and the second for coverage\r\n2. basket ball, disks for frisbee golf, &amp; softball field, also mountain trais for hiking are \r\n   available. Please check The Oaks at Lake Hughes, California\r\n3. Bath towel\r\n4. Toiletries (soap, shaving, lotions etc.)\r\n5. THIS IS A 4 DAY EVENT: Starting 4 pm Thursday, ending Sunday @ 12pm\r\n\r\nPLEASE REGISTER FOR THIS EVENT @\r\nForFreedomOutreach.org\r\nUnder MEN select\r\nTRAINING CAMP - THE OAKS\r\n\r\nEvent Fees: $250.00 (this includes 8 meals)',14727,418102,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"4656\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"18651 Pine Canyon Road  \\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Lake Hughes\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"93532\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"34.683509\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-118.462364\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"California\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-lake-hughes-ca-us-gilbert-jimenez-0',NULL,'2020-02-06 06:02:28','2024-04-10 15:22:09'),
	('9bc65c37-cb9c-4d58-a023-a27766059a87',2,2042,'WAH BASIC - Hocking Hills Ohio, OH, US | Greg Adams',NULL,'weekly','','OH',NULL,'Hocking Hills Ohio','','US',-82.5392920,39.4240120,'Ohio',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:09',0,'men','2020-04-30 15:22:09','2020-05-03 15:22:09',NULL,'All men die, but few men really live! Battle, adventure and rescue are what make men come alive!  God calls us to more than just salvation - but also to freedom, to life, to sonship.  Join us at the spectacular Eagle Wings Lodge for a Boot Camp based on the book Wild At Heart. During the 4 days set in the majestic rolling landscape of Hocking Hills, you will participate in a multi-media experience and live presentations which will help you discover something profound about your own heart and the heart of God.\r\n\r\nThis isn’t your typical retreat.  You will not be asked to break into small groups and share your feelings.  Instead you will hear from other men living an intentional life in pursuit of the heart of God.  Bring your fishing gear for the stocked pond, your hiking boots for the trails, and your guns or bows for target shooting.  Past attendees have indicated that this weekend has been a transformational experience in their walk with God – don’t miss out.\r\n\r\nThe cost is $285 and includes all food and lodging.\r\n\r\nTo register, watch a video, download a brochure and get more information go to https://centralohiobootcamp.weebly.com/\r\n\r\nYou may also email  bootcamp@ualc.org',14441,181564,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"4396\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Hocking Hills Ohio\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"OH\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"39.424012\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-82.539292\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Ohio\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-hocking-hills-ohio-oh-us-greg-adams',NULL,'2019-11-27 08:11:35','2024-04-10 15:22:09'),
	('9bc65c37-e9e5-4999-ac30-7d36b247e7d3',2,1957,'WAH BASIC - McCall, ID, US | Jason Lloyd',NULL,'weekly','300 N Mission Street','ID',NULL,'McCall','83638','US',-116.1065000,44.9035600,'Idaho',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:09',0,'men','2020-04-30 15:22:09','2020-05-03 15:22:09',NULL,'CHECK-IN / CHECK-OUT\r\nCheck-in is 3:30 pm – 5:30 pm on Thursday with dinner served at 6 pm. The event will conclude at 1 pm on Sunday.\r\n\r\nTHE VENUE\r\nThis event will be held at Camp Pinewood in McCall , Idaho. Housing is comfortable, bunk beds, dormitory style – in rooms that house up to 9. You will need to bring your own bedding and pillow (sleeping bags acceptable), hygiene toiletries and towel.\r\n\r\nREGISTRATION\r\nPlease follow the link to the Foothills website to register for the event and confirm your attendance. This event will be posted for registering as we get closer to the event start date. \r\n\r\nADDITIONAL INFORMATION\r\nMeals are included. Dress is casual. In addition to comfortable everyday clothing you should bring shoes and clothing appropriate for hiking during the day and cool nights by the campfire in the evening. You will need to bring your own bedding (sleeping bags) and toiletries, including towel. You may want a flashlight for evenings and a refillable water bottle to stay hydrated. This will be an immersive weekend where men fully unplug. An emergency contact number will be provided for you to make available to those who may need it. We will ask that men turn off all devices for the weekend starting on Saturday. This will be one of the best decisions you make, trust us. The outside world will distract you.\r\n\r\nPlease Note: This event is for men 18 years and older.',14681,253503,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"4601\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"300 N Mission Street\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"McCall\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"ID\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"83638\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"44.903560\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-116.106500\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Idaho\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-mccall-id-us-jason-lloyd-0',NULL,'2020-01-23 12:01:05','2024-04-10 15:22:09'),
	('9bc65c38-09af-4c7d-98af-86dc90af9ce4',2,2046,'WAH BASIC - Forest Falls, CA, US | Jacob Carroll',NULL,'weekly','40,000 Valley of the Falls Drive','CA',NULL,'Forest Falls','92339','US',-116.9314040,34.0886570,'California',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:09',0,'men','2020-04-24 15:22:10','2020-04-27 15:22:10',NULL,'This camp is located in the San Bernardino mountains, so hiking boots would be a good idea.  There are plenty of trails to explore.  We\'ll also be spending a fair amount of time around the campfire.  Could be chilly so dress appropriately.',14793,392718,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"4728\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"40,000 Valley of the Falls Drive\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Forest Falls\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"92339\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"34.088657\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-116.931404\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"California\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-forest-falls-ca-us-jacob-carroll',NULL,'2020-03-03 03:03:31','2024-04-10 15:22:10'),
	('9bc65c38-2960-4bf9-80a6-8fd5ffca126b',2,1711,'WAH BASIC - Gore, VA, US | Quint Pitts',NULL,'weekly','1794 Back Creek Road','VA',NULL,'Gore','22637','US',-78.3745160,39.2320020,'Virginia',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:10',0,'men','2020-04-23 15:22:10','2020-04-26 15:22:10',NULL,'This event is open to men from Horizons Church only.\r\nYou have options for this retreat! Price includes lodging for three nights, plus all meals, 12 soul stirring sessions and basic recreation. Optional adventure recreation (like zip-lines and climbing walls) will be available for an additional fee.\r\n$245 single occupancy if registered on or before April 1.\r\n$205 double occupancy if registered on or before April 1.\r\n$182 triple occupancy if registered on or before April 1.',14416,311437,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"4364\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"1794 Back Creek Road\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Gore\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"VA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"22637\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"39.232002\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-78.374516\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Virginia\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-gore-va-us-quint-pitts-0',NULL,'2019-11-18 02:11:05','2024-04-10 15:22:10'),
	('9bc65c38-4963-4929-a45c-df00051afdd9',2,2043,'WAH BASIC - Troy, MT, US | Phil Soucy',NULL,'weekly','766 Gus creek Rd','MT',NULL,'Troy','59935','US',-115.8154450,48.8199140,'Montana',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:10',0,'men','2020-04-23 15:22:10','2020-04-26 15:22:10',NULL,'This boot camp will be at the Stillwater cabins on the Yaak River. There is no cost for this event. Come prepared to have a life changing encounter. Contact us for more details.',14717,108120,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"4644\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"766 Gus creek Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Troy\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MT\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"59935\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"48.819914\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-115.815445\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Montana\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-troy-mt-us-phil-soucy-1',NULL,'2020-02-04 10:02:59','2024-04-10 15:22:10'),
	('9bc65c38-67f5-405e-882f-e1356fb4aa0f',2,2017,'WAH BASIC - Denton, TX, US | Stuart Brown',NULL,'weekly','8200 E McKinney St.','TX',NULL,'Denton','75022','US',-97.0374370,33.1847150,'Texas',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:10',0,'men','2020-04-23 15:22:10','2020-04-26 15:22:10',NULL,'We have CANCELLED this event due to Covid-19 concerns.  We are hosting our next Basic on 1-4 Oct. at the same location.  We are sorry for the inconvenience but hope you will join us then.  We are processing refunds this week.  Please be patient.\r\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\nXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\nWild at Heart BASIC Boot Camp - April 23-26,2020\r\n\r\nCamp Copass\r\n8200 E. McKinney Street\r\nDenton,  TX 76208\r\n\r\n————————————————————————\r\n\r\nAll the information you need prior to arrival at this event is included below.\r\n\r\nThis page last updated Mar. 17, 2020\r\n\r\n————————————————————————\r\n\r\nPLEASE USE THE LINK IN THE TUITION SECTION BELOW TO REGISTER AND PAY FOR THE EVENT.\r\n\r\n————————————————————————\r\n\r\nEvent Description\r\n\r\nWild at Heart BASIC is not just another men’s retreat.  That’s the last thing any man needs.  The reason most messages for men ultimately fail is simple:  they ignore what is deep and true to a man’s heart and try to shape him up through pressure and various forms of compliance.\r\n\r\nNot this retreat!  This weekend is an honest trek into the deep passions and desires of a man’s heart, into the healing of the wounds he’s taken in this battle, into the realm of fatherhood, sex, and calling - life as it was meant to be lived.  Through the video sessions, the times of quiet reflection, the movies, the adventures and the downtime, you will discover something profound about the heart of God and the heart he gave you as a man.  Those who have been, say it is one of the greatest weekends of their entire life. \r\n\r\n————————————————————————\r\n\r\nAudience\r\n\r\n\r\nDue to the intimate and personal nature of the content, Wild at Heart BASIC cannot be viewed as a father/son event initially.  We strongly encourage fathers and sons to attend, but they will need to participate in different Boot Camps, at least for each of their first experiences of this Boot Camp.  \r\n\r\nDue to the nature and depth of the content and experience, Wild at Heart Basic Boot Camp is not designed for youth.  You must be at least 18 years of age by the date of the event to attend.\r\n\r\n————————————————————————\r\n\r\nTuition\r\n\r\n\r\nTuition for this event is $295.  This covers the cost of lodging (hotel style rooms), all meals (Thursday dinner through Sunday breakfast), video teaching and event supplies.  No transportation is provided to or from the event. If you would like to attend, but need help with tuition, please email and explain your specific situation.  All requests will be considered.\r\n\r\nThere are two payment options:\r\n\r\nPay the full amount of $295, which includes a $100 non-refundable deposit.\r\n\r\nPay the non-refundable deposit of $100, then pay the remaining amount of $195 before April 1, 2020, three weeks prior to the event.  Accounts not paid in full by March 31, 2020, will be automatically charged the outstanding balance on April 1, 2020.\r\n\r\nPlease click on this link to register and pay for the Wild at Heart BASIC Boot Camp:\r\n\r\nThis event has been Cancelled!!\r\n\r\nNote: We have 18 rooms for 36 attendees.  Reservations will be on a first come first served basis.  If this Boot Camp is full, please consider registering for the Oct.1 -4, 2020 Wild at Heart Basic Boot Camp to be held at the same location.  We will keep a small waiting list, in case there are cancellations.\r\n\r\n————————————————————————\r\n\r\nSchedule and Content\r\n\r\n\r\nCheck in is Thursday evening 4:30-6:30\r\n\r\nDinner is at 7 pm, followed by the 1st video session.  You DO NOT want to miss the Thursday evening session as it sets the tone and pace for the entire weekend experience.\r\n\r\nCheck out is Sunday at 12:00pm.  Lunch Sunday is not included.\r\n\r\nWild at Heart BASIC is a Wild at Heart Boot Camp led by John Eldredge and his team through eleven video sessions.  \r\n\r\nPhones, laptops, notebooks and cameras are NOT permitted during the sessions.  Our desire is to minimize all distractions during the sessions.\r\n————————————————————————\r\n\r\nCamp Information\r\n\r\n\r\nDirections to Camp Copass can be found here:\r\n\r\nhttps://campcopass.com/contact-us/driving-directions/\r\n\r\nWe will be staying in the Tally Retreat Center.  All rooms are double occupancy,  2 queen beds, full sized bathroom and coffee bar.  All linens are provided, and there is an elevator.  Our video sessions will be in a conference room, on the same floor as our rooms.  More information on the rooms can be found here:\r\n\r\nhttps://campcopass.com/facilities/accomodations/tally-retreat-center/\r\n\r\nThe menu for all the meals is provided here:\r\n\r\nhttps://campcopass.com/retreats/dining-hall-menu/\r\n\r\nRemember Thursday dinner through Sunday breakfast is included in your tuition.  If you have any special needs, please note on your registration at sign up.  You can also email Stu Brown at stu2fly1@yahoo.com, no later than April 1st, 2020.  Please note that special needs refers to medical conditions and medically restricted diets.  We are not able to accommodate special preferences.  \r\n\r\nCamp Copass is located on the shores of Lake Lewisville, which is a beautiful spot to hike, fish (shore only, bring your own gear), play basketball, horseshoes, softball, volleyball, frisbee or miniature golf.  There will also be a guided fishing trip (limited space, all gear included), on Saturday afternoon, for an additional fee.  A Camp map can be found here:\r\n\r\nhttps://campcopass.com/the-camp/camp-map/\r\n\r\nAlthough there are lots of recreational opportunities, You will also want to spend time in personal reflection as you consider what God is revealing throughout the weekend.  We will not be the only event taking place at the camp so some areas may be unavailable.\r\n————————————————————————\r\n\r\nAttire\r\n\r\nBoot camp is comfortable casual.  Bring season appropriate clothes, a waterproof jacket, hat and comfortable shoes.  Walking is required between the Tally Retreat Center and the dining hall.\r\n\r\n————————————————————————\r\n\r\nEmergency Contact Information\r\n\r\nWe strongly encourage all participants to “unplug” from the steady stream of noise and demands that is constantly bombarding us through our cell phones and other devices.  Our desire is for you to be completely “present” and relaxed throughout the weekend; able to hear from God and others.  Please provide your family with the emergency phone numbers below and let them know that you will be unavailable from 7:00pm Thursday until 12:00 pm on Sunday after the close of Boot Camp.  \r\n\r\nStu Brown\r\n(972) 365-6354 (leave message if no answer)\r\n\r\nOnly use the Camp Copass phone number is you are unable to reach the emergency contact. \r\n\r\nCamp Copass Office\r\n(940) 565-0050',13678,411346,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3748\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"8200 E McKinney St.\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Denton\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"TX\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"75022\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"33.184715\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-97.037437\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Texas\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-denton-tx-us-stuart-brown-0',NULL,'2019-03-16 11:03:29','2024-04-10 15:22:10'),
	('9bc65c38-8756-4288-a8c2-7ca6eefd538f',2,2047,'WAH BASIC - Cape Town, WC, ZA | Johan Human',NULL,'weekly','50 Botterblom Street, ','WC',NULL,'Cape Town','7550','ZA',18.6518460,-33.8087690,'Western Cape',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:10',0,'men','2020-04-22 15:22:10','2020-04-25 15:22:10',NULL,'During the very strict COVID-19 lockdown in South Africa, we are trying something different, shifting and trialling a different format using Zoom.\r\n\r\nThe format we are going to try is a daily session at  6am each morning for 11 consecutive days.',15029,415908,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"4820\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"50 Botterblom Street, \\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"Vierlanden Heights, Durbanville\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Cape Town\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"WC\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"7550\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"za\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"-33.808769\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"18.651846\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Western Cape\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"South Africa\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-cape-town-wc-za-johan-human',NULL,'2020-04-21 06:04:30','2024-04-10 15:22:10'),
	('9bc65c38-a602-4c14-b2f3-cf2945a972c5',2,2048,'WAH BASIC - Bergton, VA, US | Greg Tutwiler',NULL,'weekly','14370 Upper Highland Dr.','VA',NULL,'Bergton','22811','US',-78.9006150,38.7698730,'Virginia',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:10',0,'men','2020-04-16 15:22:10','2020-04-19 15:22:10',NULL,'Cost for the entire retreat is $199.00, includes all meals prepared on site. Attendees will need to byo bed linens or sleeping bag, and pillow. Rooms are bunk style with mattress. (groups of 5 can stay together in one bunk room if requested)\r\n\r\nWe\'ll be staying at the Red Oak Lodge at Virginia\'s Highland Retreat. The lodge is located at the wood’s edge in the beautiful Shenandoah Valley, surrounded by inspiring mountain views. It\'s the perfect setting for the BASIC retreat. \r\n\r\nThis event will be limited to the first 48 attendees. \r\nRetreat registration:    https://fccharrisonburg.churchcenter.com/registrations/events/363116  \r\n\r\nSee the facilities here:\r\n(https://highlandretreat.org/red-oak-lodge/)',14091,47898,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"4117\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"14370 Upper Highland Dr.\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"Red Oak Lodge, Highland Retreat\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Bergton\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"VA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"22811\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"38.769873\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-78.900615\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Virginia\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-bergton-va-us-greg-tutwiler',NULL,'2019-08-19 09:08:57','2024-04-10 15:22:10'),
