	('9bc65c39-d45d-4975-a325-d81eea1f035c',2,1453,'WAH BASIC - Black Mountain, NC, US | Matthew Daughtry-Grubbs',NULL,'weekly','1233 North Fork Road','NC',NULL,'Black Mountain','28711','US',-82.3543470,35.6253710,'North Carolina',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:11',0,'men','2020-03-26 15:22:11','2020-03-29 15:22:11',NULL,'Check out the information website above for all details and registration.  Please feel free to call or email with any questions.',14658,415441,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"4574\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"1233 North Fork Road\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Black Mountain\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"NC\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"28711\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"35.625371\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-82.354347\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"North Carolina\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-black-mountain-nc-us-matthew-daughtry-grubbs',NULL,'2020-01-17 08:01:50','2024-04-10 15:22:11'),
	('9bc65c39-f396-48c8-8048-a8ecb0432994',2,2055,'WAH BASIC - Mt. Lemmon, AZ, US | Kurt Koenig',NULL,'weekly','12900 Casa Grande Ave.','AZ',NULL,'Mt. Lemmon','85619','US',-110.7562860,32.4437890,'Arizona',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:11',0,'men','2020-03-26 15:22:11','2020-03-29 15:22:11',NULL,'We are hosting Wild at Heart Basic in a 3 story cabin at an altitude of about 9000 feet near Tucson, Arizona in late March. So you will need to dress for a mountain environment and have layers of clothing for temperatures ranging from 30 to 75 degrees. \r\n\r\nWhile this cabin has mattresses, you will need to bring your own sleeping bag or bedding and extra padding is recommended. The cost is $140 per man. This includes the cabin and food for 4 days and 3 nights. We hope to see you there.',14687,42466,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"4610\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"12900 Casa Grande Ave.\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Mt. Lemmon\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"AZ\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"85619\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"32.443789\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-110.756286\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Arizona\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-mt-lemmon-az-us-kurt-koenig',NULL,'2020-01-25 02:01:34','2024-04-10 15:22:11'),
	('9bc65c3a-12a0-4e2d-a2e1-3f856be72567',2,2056,'WAH BASIC - Winslow, AZ, US | Brian Snyder',NULL,'weekly','229 State Route 99','AZ',NULL,'Winslow','86047','US',-110.6984600,35.0204950,'Arizona',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:11',0,'men','2020-03-26 15:22:11','2020-03-29 15:22:11',NULL,'Attendees will need to bring warmer clothes for evening and toiletries. All towels, washcloths, bedding and blankets are provided. \r\n\r\nThe location can be tricky to find. From I-40 (east or west) you would take exit 245 towards Leupp (Highway 99 North). It is six miles on the right at the stucco church building. The words LIFEhouse are written on the front of the building.  Directions from Winslow, AZ: https://goo.gl/maps/ipKurayPyFchsdeE8',14741,168589,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"4673\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"229 State Route 99\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Winslow\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"AZ\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"86047\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"35.020495\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-110.698460\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Arizona\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-winslow-az-us-brian-snyder-2',NULL,'2020-02-13 06:02:06','2024-04-10 15:22:11'),
	('9bc65c3a-31c3-4683-9a80-3d5d249aa1ee',2,2057,'WAH BASIC - Humphreys, AR, US | Rob Vandiver',NULL,'weekly','140 Pintail Lane ','AR',NULL,'Humphreys','72073','US',-91.6723500,34.3685070,'Arkansas',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:11',0,'men','2020-03-26 15:22:11','2020-03-29 15:22:11',NULL,'This Basic is being held at a lodge just outside of Stuttgart, Arkansas.  The lodge has 16 rooms.  Each room has 2 queen beds and one bathroom.  There is room for 34 men, and is well appointed.  The name of the lodge is CrossHeirs Retreat Center.  Experienced lodge staff will cook all meals.  This lodge sits on 60 acres.  There is a 15 acre stocked pond for fishing, as well as trap shooting, so you can bring a fishing rod and a shotgun.  Other than that, you can walk/jog rural roads if you like.  There is a fire pit, outdoor decks, and plenty of other space to be outside.   I would bring a camp chair and clothing that would allow me to be outside considering the time of year.   Other than your personal toiletries, you need no other special items.  All linens are provided.  Google CrossHeirs Retreat Center for additional information about the facility and area.  The cost of this retreat is $250 per person, which covers all meals and the cost of lodging.',14754,125634,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"4687\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"140 Pintail Lane \\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Humphreys\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"AR\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"72073\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"34.368507\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-91.672350\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Arkansas\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-humphreys-ar-us-rob-vandiver',NULL,'2020-02-17 11:02:09','2024-04-10 15:22:11'),
