	('9bc65c3a-ca41-4dea-8e0b-8765396b001d',2,737,'WAH BASIC - Colenso, KN, ZA | Ilana Kloppers',NULL,'weekly','Colenso, KN South Africa','KN',NULL,'Colenso','3610','ZA',29.8294430,-28.7458580,'KwaZulu-Natal',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:11',0,'men','2020-03-12 15:22:11','2020-03-15 15:22:11',NULL,'Stoney Ridge Camp is a rustic location. Please pay attention to the kit list as its there for a reason.\r\n\r\nSleeping bag, pillow &amp; sheet – (bed and mattress provided)\r\nEarplugs x2 pairs. (One for you in the tent, one for just in case.)\r\nHiking boots\r\nSexy old clothes... nothing new.\r\nRaincoat (dependant on time of year)\r\nJacket\r\nShoes\r\nSlops\r\nSwim costume\r\nWater bottle\r\nToiletries\r\nTowels x2\r\nPartridge x1\r\nHeadlamp/Torch\r\nWide-brimmed hat\r\nCamp Chair\r\nInsect repellent\r\nSunscreen\r\nWalking Stick\r\nPear tree for the Partridge\r\nOptional: Roll of duct tape - sometimes people get out of hand.\r\nFishing Rod and kit. River Fishing.\r\n\r\nThere are moments for a few extra curricular activities... more info on registration',14708,369075,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"4637\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"Colenso, KN South Africa\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Colenso\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"KN\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"3610\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"za\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"-28.745858\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"29.829443\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"KwaZulu-Natal\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"South Africa\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-colenso-kn-za-ilana-kloppers',NULL,'2020-02-03 02:02:14','2024-04-10 15:22:11'),
