	('9bc65c41-3fc5-4d38-80bf-8b94a11dc4fe',2,1665,'WAH BASIC - Orderville, UT, US | Chris Ashworth',NULL,'weekly','1 N Fork County Rd','UT',NULL,'Orderville','84758','US',-112.8373040,37.2543810,'Utah',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:16',0,'men','2019-10-24 15:22:16','2019-10-27 15:22:16',NULL,'Located in the highlands near Zion National Park, Clear Creek Ranch is an incredible setting to go deeper with God. Possible activities include hiking in Zion National Park, canoeing, fishing, horseback riding (for a fee), volleyball, horseshoes, etc.\r\nhttps://theranchatzion.com\r\n\r\n$230 per person. Includes lodging and meals.\r\n\r\nBring a sleeping bag, pillow, and/or sheets (bunk and mattress provided)\r\nFlashlight\r\nCampfire clothes\r\nClothes for different temperatures (jacket/coat)\r\nHiking boots\r\nWristwatch (cell phones should be turned off)\r\nEarplugs :)\r\nWater bottle\r\nArrive at the ranch between 4-5pm Thursday, Oct 24th. Ends at noon on Sunday, Oct 27th.\r\n\r\nCheck out this podcast to hear a few men share their first-time attending experiences:\r\nhttps://leadingsaints.org/is-elders-quorum-working/',14004,405815,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"4043\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"1 N Fork County Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Orderville\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"UT\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"84758\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"37.254381\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-112.837304\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Utah\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-orderville-ut-us-chris-ashworth',NULL,'2019-07-20 07:07:15','2024-04-10 15:22:16'),
