	('9bc65c41-b7ab-42c8-8a13-92d8d113bd96',3,1488,'CORE - Pocono Pines, PA, US | Robyn Jameson',NULL,'weekly','322 Appleseed Road','PA',NULL,'Pocono Pines','18350','US',-75.4635420,41.1146480,'Pennsylvania',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:16',0,'men','2019-10-24 15:22:16','2019-10-27 15:22:16',NULL,'',14335,231895,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"4289\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"322 Appleseed Road\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Pocono Pines\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"PA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"18350\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"41.114648\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-75.463542\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Pennsylvania\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/core-pocono-pines-pa-us-robyn-jameson',NULL,'2019-10-07 10:10:49','2024-04-10 15:22:16'),
	('9bc65c41-d630-4976-9a00-e3641e64ff2c',2,1875,'WAH BASIC - Hocking Hills, OH, US | Adam Diener',NULL,'weekly','','OH',NULL,'Hocking Hills','','US',-82.5195320,39.5743470,'Ohio',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:16',0,'men','2019-10-24 15:22:16','2019-10-27 15:22:16',NULL,'This is hosted by my church and we could max out quickly. Contact me for details as I help several other churches in the area and they are hosting some right after us in November in the event that ours is full.\r\nThe site has a hot tub and pond. You can bring swim trunks. Food is provided as well as linens and a comfortable bed. Dinner starts at 6PM Thursday. If you’re remotely interested, I’ll be glad to give details if you email me.\r\nStrength and Honor-\r\nAdam',13933,336958,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3968\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Hocking Hills\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"OH\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"39.574347\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-82.519532\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Ohio\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-hocking-hills-oh-us-adam-diener',NULL,'2019-06-08 05:06:19','2024-04-10 15:22:16'),
	('9bc65c41-f380-44eb-a46f-6daa5b44461d',2,2056,'WAH BASIC - Winslow, AZ, US | Brian Snyder',NULL,'weekly','229 State Route 99','AZ',NULL,'Winslow','86047','US',-110.6984600,35.0204950,'Arizona',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:16',0,'men','2019-10-24 15:22:16','2019-10-27 15:22:16',NULL,'Attendees should dress for desert weather: Warm during the day and very cool at night. Jackets and campfire clothing would be helpful for evenings. Additionally, closed-toed shoes are a must due to critters and thorns. Bring toiletries, but all bedding, pillow, washcloth and towel are provided.',13918,168589,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3949\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"229 State Route 99\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Winslow\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"AZ\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"86047\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"35.020495\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-110.698460\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Arizona\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-winslow-az-us-brian-snyder',NULL,'2019-06-04 11:06:26','2024-04-10 15:22:16'),
	('9bc65c42-117a-4f14-9d7f-8eb787d213a3',2,2085,'WAH BASIC - Leatherhead, SRY, GB | Gareth Tindall',NULL,'weekly','Leatherhead Trinity Centre',NULL,NULL,'Leatherhead','KT22 7QT','GB',-0.3310780,51.3077860,'Surrey',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:16',0,'men','2019-10-24 15:22:16','2019-10-27 15:22:16',NULL,'This is a non-residential retreat. We are not providing accommodation or breakfast but we will provide lunch, dinner and refreshments. The days will start at 8:30am and finish at 9:30pm. You will need to find accommodation locally for the 3 nights of 24th - 26th inclusive.\r\n\r\nPlease bring with you to the sessions:\r\n\r\nA paper Bible if you have one (mobile devices will be safely stored away)\r\nA pen or pencil\r\n\r\nFor a ticket visit:\r\nhttps://www.eventbrite.co.uk/e/wild-at-heart-basic-retreat-2019-leatherhead-uk-non-residential-tickets-74029870335',14308,383569,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"4257\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"Leatherhead Trinity Centre\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"Apperdale Road\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Leatherhead\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"SRY\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"KT22 7QT\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"gb\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"51.307786\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-0.331078\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Surrey\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United Kingdom\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-leatherhead-sry-gb-gareth-tindall-0',NULL,'2019-09-24 04:09:24','2024-04-10 15:22:16'),
	('9bc65c42-2fdc-4b55-84e1-528a8635d049',2,1525,'WAH BASIC - Clinton, MO, US | Mark Reiter',NULL,'weekly','351 NE 831 Road','MO',NULL,'Clinton','64735','US',-93.6029820,38.4111270,'Missouri',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:16',0,'men','2019-10-24 15:22:16','2019-10-27 15:22:16',NULL,'QUICK DETAILS:\r\n\r\nWhere:  Life Change Camp (351 NE 831 Rd, Clinton, MO) is approximately 90 minutes southeast of Kansas City by car.\r\n\r\nWhen:  Oct 24-27, 2019.  Check-in is between 4 – 6 PM on Thursday (late arrivals by 7pm) and the event concludes at Noon on Sunday.  \r\n\r\nCost: $180 per person. Scholarships are available (call, email or go to our website for details).  This includes lodging, food, snacks and materials.  \r\n\r\nWhat to Bring: Your own linens or sleeping bag, pillow, towels, folding chair, and bible (paper copy is best).  Accommodations are modern bunkhouse style cabins with (mostly) twin-size mattresses.\r\n\r\nQuestions &amp; Registration:  Feel free to contact us at any of the following:\r\n\r\n	Email: 	bootcamp@e6ministries.org\r\n	Call: 	816-368-1383\r\n	Online:  www.e6ministries.org/bootcamp\r\n\r\nABOUT E6 MINISTRIES\r\n\r\nOur passion and mission is to help men discover life, freedom and healing in walking with God daily along the masculine journey. We are a tax-exempt 501(c)(3) charitable organization located in Liberty, Missouri. The men of E6 first held a Boot Camp in 2015, our Fall 2019 Boot Camp will be our tenth. To learn more about E6 Ministries, visit www.e6ministries.org and follow us on Facebook, Twitter, and Instagram.',14229,260103,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"4158\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"351 NE 831 Road\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Clinton\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"64735\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"38.411127\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-93.602982\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Missouri\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-clinton-mo-us-mark-reiter-2',NULL,'2019-08-30 10:08:02','2024-04-10 15:22:16'),
	('9bc65c42-4d27-4fec-ac5f-06ad185114e6',2,2085,'WAH BASIC - Leatherhead, SRY, GB | Gareth Tindall',NULL,'weekly','Leatherhead Trinity Centre',NULL,NULL,'Leatherhead','KT22 7QT','GB',-0.3310780,51.3077860,'Surrey',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:16',0,'men','2019-10-24 15:22:16','2019-10-27 15:22:16',NULL,'This is a non-residential retreat. We are not providing accommodation or breakfast but we will provide lunch, dinner and refreshments. The days will start at 8:30am and finish at 9:30pm. You will need to find accommodation locally for the 3 nights of 24th - 26th inclusive.\r\n\r\nPlease bring with you to the sessions:\r\n\r\nA paper Bible if you have one (mobile devices will be safely stored away)\r\nA pen or pencil\r\n\r\nFor a ticket visit:\r\nhttps://www.eventbrite.co.uk/e/wild-at-heart-basic-retreat-2019-leatherhead-uk-non-residential-tickets-74029870335',14306,383569,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"4254\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"Leatherhead Trinity Centre\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"Apperdale Road\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Leatherhead\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"SRY\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"KT22 7QT\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"gb\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"51.307786\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-0.331078\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Surrey\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United Kingdom\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-leatherhead-sry-gb-gareth-tindall',NULL,'2019-09-24 04:09:19','2024-04-10 15:22:16'),
	('9bc65c42-6b72-4240-9944-bc03241287c5',2,2086,'WAH BASIC - Burnet, TX, US | Joseph Rollins',NULL,'weekly','3835 FM 2342','TX',NULL,'Burnet','78611','US',-98.3809480,30.6919420,'Texas',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:16',0,'men','2019-10-24 15:22:16','2019-10-27 15:22:16',NULL,'Wild at Heart BASIC Boot Camp - October 24-27, 2019\n\nCamp Buckner Retreat &amp; Conference Center\n3835 FM 2342\nBurnet, Texas 78611\n\nOffice: 512-756-7540\n\n________________________________________\nAll the information you need prior to arrival at this event is included below.   If any changes are made, they will be posted here.  \n\nThis page was last updated September 9, 2019.\n\n________________________________________\n\nPLEASE USE THE LINK IN THE TUITION SECTION BELOW TO REGISTER AND PAY FOR THE EVENT.\n________________________________________\nEvent Description\n\nWild at Heart Boot Camp is not just another men\'s retreat. That\'s the last thing any man needs. The reason most messages for men ultimately fail is simple:  they ignore what is deep and true to a man\'s heart and try to shape him up through pressure and various forms of compliance. \n\nNot this. This weekend is an honest, no bs trek into the deep passions and desires of a man\'s heart, into the healing of the wounds he\'s taken in this battle, into the realm of fatherhood and sex and God and calling – life as it was meant to be lived. Through the sessions, the times of quiet reflection, the movies, the adventures and the downtime, you will discover something profound about the heart of God and the heart he gave you as a man. Those who come say it is one of the greatest weekends of their entire life.\n\n________________________________________\nAudience\n\nDue to the intimate and personal nature of the content, the Wild at Heart BASIC Boot Camp cannot be viewed as a father/son event.  We strongly encourage fathers and sons to attend, but they will need to participate in different Boot Camps, at least for each of their first experiences of this Boot Camp.  \n\nDue to the nature and depth of the content and the experience, Wild at Heart BASIC Boot Camp is not designed for youth.  You must be at least eighteen years of age by the date of the event to attend.\n\n________________________________________\nTuition\n\nTuition for this event is $200.  It covers the costs of lodging, meals, video teaching and event supplies.  It does not include transportation to and from the event.\n\nThere are two payment options.\n\n- Pay the full amount of $200 which includes the $100 non-refundable deposit.\n- Pay the non-refundable deposit of $100, then pay the remaining amount of $100 before October 3, 2019 three weeks prior to the event.  Accounts not paid in full by October 2, 2019 will be automatically charged the outstanding balance October 3, 2019.\n\n\nPlease click on this link to register and pay for the Wild at Heart BASIC Boot Camp:\n\nhttps://centraltexaswildatheartbasicbo.regfox.com/ransomed-heart-wild-at-heart-basic-boot-camp\n\nYou will receive confirmation emails when you register and when your payments are received.\n\n________________________________________\nWhen\n\nCheck-In:  4:00-5:30 pm, Thursday, October 24, 2019\n\nCheck-Out:  12:00 noon, Sunday, October 27, 2019\n\n________________________________________\nWhere\n\nCamp Buckner Retreat &amp; Conference Center\n3835 FM 2342\nBurnet, Texas 78611\n\nOffice: 512-756-7540\n\nPlease do not contact the camp prior to the event.  If you have a pressing question that must be answered, see the e-mail addresses under the Emergencies &amp; Cancellations section at the bottom of this page. \n\n________________________________________\nTravel and Transportation\n\nYou are responsible for your own transportation to and from Camp Buckner. \n\nA map from north Austin to Camp Buckner is available via this link:  \n\nhttps://goo.gl/maps/aUEWkYZEisLq78n8A\n\n\nAustin Bergstrom Airport (AUS) is the closest major airline hub about 68 miles from Camp Buckner.  A map showing routes to/from Camp Buckner and Austin Bergstrom is available via this link:  \n\nhttps://goo.gl/maps/x5xaDQFm1KNVuMgp8\n\n\nTravel time between Camp Buckner and Austin Bergstrom Airport is about 1 hour 20 minutes via US 71 depending on traffic.\n\n________________________________________\nGeneral Information\n\n•	Your registration fee covers the Wild at Heart BASIC teaching via video sessions, your lodging and meals for the weekend. It does not include travel to and from Camp Buckner. Optional recreational activities will be offered, weather permitting, for an additional charge. Details will be provided at the Boot Camp.\n\n•	Wild at Heart BASIC is a Wild at Heart Boot Camp led by John Eldredge and his team through video sessions.\n\n•	Cabins at Camp Buckner are equipped with bunk beds and are temperature controlled.\n\n•	Attendees must provide their own bedding, towels and shower supplies.\n\n•	Phones, laptops, notebooks and cameras ARE NOT PERMITTED during the sessions.  Our desire is to minimize all distractions during the sessions.\n\n________________________________________\nEmergency Contact Information\n\nPlease note: Cell phone access and internet access will not be available during Boot Camp. Phone access at Boot Camp will be for emergencies only. Please provide your family with the emergency phone numbers below and let them know you will be unavailable from 6:00 pm Thursday until 12:00 noon Sunday after the close of the Boot Camp.\n\n     Joseph Rollins\n     512-560-3603 (leave a message if no answer)\n\n    Or\n\n    Patrick Hayes\n    912-614-1785\n\nOnly use the Camp Buckner phone number if you are unable to reach the emergency contact numbers above:\n\nCamp Buckner Office: 512-756-7540\n\n________________________________________\nSpecial Needs\n\nIf you have special needs, please email jprollins48@gmail.com no later than Thursday, October 3rd.   Please note that special needs refer to medical conditions and medically restricted diets.  We are not able to accommodate special preferences.\n\n________________________________________\nSchedule\n\nCheck-in is between 4:00 pm and 5:30 pm on Thursday, October 24, followed by dinner and the evening session. \n\nYou DO NOT want to miss the Thursday evening session as it sets the tone and the pace for the entire weekend experience. \n\nBoot Camp concludes at 12:00 noon on Sunday.\n\n________________________________________\nWeather Conditions and Attire\n\nCamp Buckner (Burnet, TX) weather is available via this link:  \n\nhttps://weather.com/weather/5day/l/35ccb7a82058a969552e1380a33b9ca1e6bf570ff106f08fe65bb41b52177a79\n\nBoot Camp attire is comfortable casual. Bring season appropriate clothes, a waterproof jacket, hat and hiking boots or comfortable shoes. Walking is required between the cabins, auditorium and dining hall.\n\nIf you are interested, Camp Buckner is a great launching point for hiking, fishing, basketball, etc. (depending on weather).  If you are interested in adventuring, make sure to bring appropriate clothes.  Longhorn Caverns State Park and Inks Lake State Park are short drives from Camp Buckner.\n\nWe will provide all the information you need for activities when you arrive.\n\nAlthough recreation will be available, much of the time will be devoted to personal reflection and what God is revealing throughout the weekend.  \n\n________________________________________\nLate Arrival\n\nInformation to follow …\n\n________________________________________\nEmergencies and Cancellations\n\nIf you have a CANCELLATION or an EMERGENCY, please contact us at \n\n     Joseph Rollins\n     512-560-3603 (leave a message if no answer)\n\n    Or\n\n    Patrick Hayes\n    912-614-1785\n \n________________________________________\nCancellation Policies: \n\nCancellation by Registrant \nYou may cancel your registration until Monday, September 30th and forfeit your $100 non-refundable deposit. If you cancel your registration after Monday, September 30th, you will forfeit the entire $200 registration fee. Regardless of when you cancel your registration, your registration is not transferable to another event, date, or person.\n\nCancellation by the Central Texas Wild at Heart BASIC Boot Camps Team \nIf the event is made impossible by any act of God, war, earthquake, fire, strike, sickness, accident, epidemic, act of government, its agencies or officers, or any other legitimate cause beyond our control, we will cancel the event and will refund your full Wild at Heart Basic event registration fee to you.\n\n________________________________________\nCamp Buckner Retreat &amp; Conference Center\n\nFor more than 30 years, Camp Buckner has provided life-changing camp experiences for children, adults, families and organizations. Nestled in the heart of the Texas Hill Country, Camp Buckner offers a variety of housing options to meet the needs of any group, whether young or old, large or small. Camp Buckner offers flexible and individualized lodging in our climate-controlled cabins, hotels and all the buildings combine the rustic charm of the Texas Hill Country with modern conveniences such as air conditioning, high-speed internet access and telecommunications and audio/visual equipment.\n\nAs a bonus, your experience at Camp Buckner benefits foster children and families and single-parent families served by Buckner. By staying at Camp Buckner, you’re allowing others to learn about the hope of Christ.\n\n________________________________________\nWelcome to the weekend!',13971,231706,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"4004\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"3835 FM 2342\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Burnet\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"TX\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"78611\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"30.691942\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-98.380948\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Texas\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-burnet-tx-us-joseph-rollins',NULL,'2019-07-07 05:07:23','2024-04-10 15:22:16');
