	('9bc65c42-a591-480c-b401-94f387537213',2,2060,'WAH BASIC - Belleville, Cape Town, WC, ZA | Shane Bradley Johansen',NULL,'weekly','Shofar Durbanville, Mispel Street','WC',NULL,'Belleville, Cape Town','7530','ZA',18.6415530,-33.8674420,'Western Cape',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:16',0,'men','2019-10-22 15:22:17','2019-10-25 15:22:17',NULL,'Just an open heart ready to be both honest and vulnerable',14354,105536,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"4313\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"Shofar Durbanville, Mispel Street\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"Rosenpark\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Belleville, Cape Town\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"WC\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"7530\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"za\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"-33.867442\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"18.641553\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Western Cape\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"South Africa\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-belleville-cape-town-wc-za-shane-bradley-johansen',NULL,'2019-10-14 01:10:47','2024-04-10 15:22:17'),
	('9bc65c42-c345-4d92-adc5-7ba2daa397a8',2,15,'WAH BASIC - Three Lakes, WI, US |  Brian Valentini',NULL,'weekly','8660 Honey Rock Road','WI',NULL,'Three Lakes','54562','US',-89.1387850,45.8770730,'Wisconsin',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:17',0,'men','2019-10-17 15:22:17','2019-10-20 15:22:17',NULL,'When: \r\nThursday, October 17 (5pm) - Sunday, October 20 (12pm)\r\nCheck in between 3:00 PM - 5:00 PM on Thursday. Event will end around 12:00 PM on Sunday\r\n\r\nWhere:\r\nHoney Rock Camp\r\n8660 Honey Rock Rd, Three Lakes, WI 54562\r\n5.5 hour drive from Chicagoland area\r\n\r\nPrice: \r\n$160\r\nPrice includes food (dinner on 10/17-lunch on 10/20), lodging, and all event materials. Price does not include transportation to the event.\r\nBring your own bedding (sheets, pillows, blankets, sleeping bag, etc.), toiletries, and towels.',13567,405247,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3644\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"8660 Honey Rock Road\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Three Lakes\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"WI\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"54562\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"45.877073\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-89.138785\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Wisconsin\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-three-lakes-wi-us-brian-valentini',NULL,'2019-02-21 08:02:11','2024-04-10 15:22:17'),
	('9bc65c42-e133-4fed-8750-2333b333a8a4',2,2087,'WAH BASIC - Anglesea, VIC, AU | Nicholas Kent',NULL,'weekly','Eumeralla Scout Camp',NULL,NULL,'Anglesea','3230','AU',144.2115250,-38.3970770,'Victoria',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:17',0,'men','2019-10-17 15:22:17','2019-10-20 15:22:17',NULL,'Wild At Heart Basic - Anglesea 2019\r\n\r\nAll of the information you need prior to arrival at this event is included below.  This page may be updated before the event.  It was last updated October 3, 2019 \r\n\r\nThank you for registering for the 2019 Wild at Heart Basic - Anglesea!  \r\nPlease read the event details listed below.\r\n\r\nEvent Location: \r\nEumeralla Scout Camp, 1415 Great Ocean Road, Anglesea. http://www.eumeralla.com.au/ \r\n\r\nSchedule:\r\nCheck-In: 5:30 pm - 6:30 pm on Thursday the 17th October. \r\nCheck-Out: Midday on Sunday the 20th October.\r\n \r\nThursday dinner will be casual and served from 6.30pm. \r\nPlease let us know if you cannot arrive in time for dinner so that we can make alternate arrangements for you. \r\n\r\nThe first session will commence at 7.30pm. It is very important that you are at present at this first session. It is a session which sets the scene and outlines a framework for the rest of the whole weekend.\r\nIn the unlikely chance that you find yourself arriving after 7.30pm please contact the emergency phone number you received in your email.\r\n\r\nUpon Arrival:\r\nUpon your arrival at the Eumerlla Scout Camp you will most probably find yourself faced with a closed gate.  It is not locked.  Open and close the gate behind you and follow the road down to the site office.  From there you will follow the signs directing you to the Envirocentre where you will find parking directly behind the Envirocentre and a member of The Bennett’s Boys Event Team to welcome you. \r\n\r\nGoogle Maps link: https://goo.gl/maps/9Ax7hVHaCLNXELrXA \r\n\r\nTransportation: \r\nAttendees are responsible for their own transportation. If you would like to car pool or have spare seats in your car, please get in contact with us and we can help you to get in contact with other attendees.\r\n \r\nWhat to Pack: \r\nAccommodation is in huts with a mattress, so you will need a sleeping bag or bedding, pillow, towel and toiletries. \r\nEvent attire is casual.  The evenings at this time of year can still be cold and the weather temperamental so pack a warm jumper or jacket, a waterproof jacket, hat, sunscreen, insect repellant and comfortable, weather-appropriate shoes. Dress comfortably and prepare for a wide range of weather. The beach is close and the site is a 330 acres of beautiful natural bush so you may like to bring items for a swim, surf, run or walk. You may want to include a watch, or alarm clock. Don’t over pack keep it light. \r\n\r\nSpecial Needs: \r\nIf you have dietary restrictions, a medical condition we need to know about, or other special needs that you have not already submitted, please e-mail bennettsbasic@gmail.com \r\n\r\nMobile Devices:\r\nDuring the event no phones, tablets, laptops or electronic devices are allowed so that you can fully unplug from the matrix and become immersed in the event. Please notify your friends and family that you will not be contactable for the duration of the event.\r\n(No we will not be confiscating your phones, we simply ask that you turn them off, leave them in your accommodation and give your undistracted attention to focusing on this awesome event) \r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nSee you soon! \r\n\r\nThe Bennett’s Boys Events Team\r\n“Get Wild!”',13920,226187,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3953\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"Eumeralla Scout Camp\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"1415 Great Ocean Road\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Anglesea\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"VIC\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"3230\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"au\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"-38.397077\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"144.211525\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Victoria\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"Australia\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-anglesea-vic-au-nicholas-kent',NULL,'2019-06-04 09:06:39','2024-04-10 15:22:17'),
