	('9bc65c43-1ebd-47f7-a48f-ec49d2c53e43',2,2088,'WAH BASIC - Tahoe City, CA , CA, US | Chris Scott',NULL,'weekly','520 Joseph Ct.','CA',NULL,'Tahoe City, CA ','96145','US',-120.1737920,39.1420280,'California',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:17',0,'men','2019-10-17 15:22:17','2019-10-20 15:22:17',NULL,'This BASIC will be held at a Cabin on the North-West side of Lake Tahoe.  There are spots available for 10 men.  Cost of the event is $265 for all food and accommodations. The event starts at 5 PM October 17th and runs through noon October 20th. Contact host for more details and to register.',14088,225606,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"4114\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"520 Joseph Ct.\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Tahoe City, CA \\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"96145\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"39.142028\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-120.173792\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"California\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-tahoe-city-ca-ca-us-chris-scott',NULL,'2019-08-16 11:08:45','2024-04-10 15:22:17'),
	('9bc65c43-3d5d-4e97-a320-6d0cb1d4b424',2,2089,'WAH BASIC - GRAND PORTAGE, MN, US | Mike Boomer',NULL,'weekly','56 Mink Lake Rd','MN',NULL,'GRAND MARAIS ','55604','US',-90.2203640,47.8690110,'Minnesota',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:17',0,'men','2019-10-17 15:22:17','2019-10-20 15:22:17',NULL,'Please bring Swimsuit (for Sauna), hiking boots, campfire cloths, and work out cloths if interested in Mountain Biking.',13785,28993,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3853\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"56 Mink Lake Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"MINK LAKE\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"GRAND MARAIS \\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MN\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"55604\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"47.869011\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-90.220364\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Minnesota\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-grand-portage-mn-us-mike-boomer',NULL,'2019-04-25 02:04:32','2024-04-10 15:22:17'),
	('9bc65c43-5c23-42ef-b8bd-5f5b8f46f3c1',2,1694,'WAH BASIC - Prescott, AZ, US | Aaron Witsoe',NULL,'weekly','1131 Country Club Dr','AZ',NULL,'Prescott','86303','US',-112.4921500,34.5340350,'Arizona',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:17',0,'men','2019-10-17 15:22:17','2019-10-20 15:22:17',NULL,'Attendees should bring warm clothes (consider layers) for evenings around the fire, hiking boots, favorite cigar and toiletries. Linens provided. Hotel-style rooms, and food included.\r\n\r\nA hike of moderate difficulty will be on Saturday afternoon.',13703,404698,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3774\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"1131 Country Club Dr\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Prescott\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"AZ\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"86303\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"34.534035\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-112.492150\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Arizona\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-prescott-az-us-aaron-witsoe-1',NULL,'2019-03-25 12:03:49','2024-04-10 15:22:17'),
	('9bc65c43-7bbd-494a-b50e-e72a45457368',2,2090,'WAH BASIC - Nebraska City, NE, US | Dave Perkins',NULL,'weekly','2700 Sylvan Rd','NE',NULL,'Nebraska City','68410','US',-95.8821690,40.6752220,'Nebraska',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:17',0,'men','2019-10-11 15:22:17','2019-10-14 15:22:17',NULL,'Bring a swimsuit, warm clothes for campfires in the evening, workout gear and a Bible, pen and notepad. We will be \"off the grid\" for 3 full days (no mobile phones, internet, television), so be sure that your loved ones know they will only be able to contact you in the event of an emergency.',13843,376734,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3909\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"2700 Sylvan Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Nebraska City\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"NE\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"68410\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"40.675222\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-95.882169\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Nebraska\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-nebraska-city-ne-us-dave-perkins',NULL,'2019-05-12 08:05:33','2024-04-10 15:22:17'),
	('9bc65c43-9b01-4f2a-9f1a-665a001aca07',2,2091,'WAH BASIC - South Haven, MN, US | Ross Davidson',NULL,'weekly','Koinonia Retreat Center','MN',NULL,'South Haven','55382','US',-94.2007330,45.2649920,'Minnesota',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:17',0,'men','2019-10-10 15:22:17','2019-10-13 15:22:17',NULL,'Koinonia Retreat Center is in the woods alongside beautiful Lake Sylvia.  Check out the retreat center at www.koinoniaretreatcenter.com.\r\n\r\nActivities include fishing, hiking, volleyball, campfires, hiking, canoeing, wood-fired sauna, and games room.\r\n\r\nInformation and registration online at www.BootcampMN.com.',13939,95345,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3971\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"Koinonia Retreat Center\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"7768 Pilger Aave NW\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"South Haven\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MN\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"55382\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"45.264992\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-94.200733\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Minnesota\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-south-haven-mn-us-ross-davidson',NULL,'2019-06-15 02:06:06','2024-04-10 15:22:17'),
	('9bc65c43-b9c0-4323-ac52-b449e539bcb1',2,1879,'WAH BASIC - Fayetteville, NC, US | Jared Stump',NULL,'weekly','','NC',NULL,'Fayetteville','','US',-78.8783590,35.0526640,'North Carolina',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:17',0,'men','2019-10-10 15:22:17','2019-10-13 15:22:17',NULL,'We are excited to bring Wild at Heart: BASIC to North Carolina! This is our second time hosting this event at Camp Rockfish near Fayetteville, easily accessible within a few hours drive from most places in the Carolinas.\r\n\r\nLife Impact is partnering with Jerry Creekmore to host this event\r\nFor more information and registration, please visit https://lifeimpact.com/events/\r\n(We anticipate registration opening around August 15)',14047,329227,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"4088\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Fayetteville\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"NC\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"35.052664\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-78.878359\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"North Carolina\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-fayetteville-nc-us-jared-stump-0',NULL,'2019-08-05 12:08:30','2024-04-10 15:22:17'),
