	('9bc65c45-47eb-4ab5-a3d9-ac96bf9770fa',2,1502,'WAH BASIC - Diller, NE, US | David Milligan',NULL,'weekly','','NE',NULL,'Diller','','US',-96.9350290,40.1072250,'Nebraska',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:18',0,'men','2019-09-19 15:22:18','2019-09-22 15:22:18',NULL,'',14233,28622,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"4164\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Diller\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"NE\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"40.107225\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-96.935029\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Nebraska\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-diller-ne-us-david-milligan',NULL,'2019-08-30 02:08:35','2024-04-10 15:22:18'),
	('9bc65c45-65e7-480b-be47-87c0bc5a00ec',2,1925,'WAH BASIC - Xenia, OH, US | Rob Forino',NULL,'weekly','651 Hudson Taylor Dr','OH',NULL,'Xenia','45385','US',-83.9206200,39.6693990,'Ohio',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:18',0,'men','2019-09-19 15:22:18','2019-09-22 15:22:18',NULL,'Thank you for your interest in the Wild at Heart BASIC Men\'s Retreat! This event is hosted at the Athletes in Action Retreat Center in Xenia Ohio. It\'s a beautiful sprawling campus with plenty of opportunity to enjoy historic architecture and beautiful grounds. \r\nCost for the BASIC is $150 for ($170 if doing the optional ropes course).  Tuition includes all meals and lodging and video presentations / course materials.  \r\n\r\nBedding and towels are provided.  You\'ll have to bring your own toiletries etc.  The rooms are dorm style - 2 men to a room.  I\'d recommend bringing ear plugs for sleeping in case there are any folks who might snore/use CPAP etc..  Also, make sure to keep an eye on the weather forecast because there are some optional outdoor activities planned along with access to a bonfire pit each night so bring appropriate clothing for those activities.  That said, all of the Wild at Heart sessions take place indoors; casual / comfortable clothing is perfect all weekend. Breakfast, Lunch, and Dinner are served, and dietary restrictions can be accommodated but I\'ll need to know in advance (i.e. Gluten allergy etc.).  You can let me know at the time of registration. \r\n\r\nIf you are interested in signing up for this retreat, I must receive your payment no later than September 5th 2019. There are enough spots for 10 guys in this retreat. Once I know you are interested, I will send you an email to collect all of the required information and you can make your payment at that time. \r\n\r\nThanks guys and God bless!\r\nRob Forino',13495,401276,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3542\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"651 Hudson Taylor Dr\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Xenia\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"OH\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"45385\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"39.669399\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-83.920620\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Ohio\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-xenia-oh-us-rob-forino-4',NULL,'2019-02-05 06:02:56','2024-04-10 15:22:18'),
	('9bc65c45-8509-4ac5-9143-e48e1477c261',2,2096,'WAH BASIC - Worton, MD, US | Emmet Eckman',NULL,'weekly','YMCA Camp Tockwogh','MD',NULL,'Worton','21678','US',-76.1272290,39.3524520,'Maryland',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:18',0,'men','2019-09-19 15:22:18','2019-09-22 15:22:18',NULL,'Plan for Maryland weather in September (burning or, sunshine, rain, windy, cool). We are in cabins in the woods, just need a bedroll, clothes for the weekend, toiletries and an open heart.',14041,389154,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"4083\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"YMCA Camp Tockwogh\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"24370 Still Pond Neck Rd\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Worton\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MD\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"21678\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"39.352452\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-76.127229\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Maryland\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-worton-md-us-emmet-eckman',NULL,'2019-08-04 07:08:40','2024-04-10 15:22:18'),
