	('9bc65c46-1e87-4853-b09b-08e4c298c47d',2,1620,'WAH BASIC - Ledbury, HEF, GB | Andrew Udale-Smith',NULL,'weekly','The Poplars',NULL,NULL,'Ledbury','HR8 1QY','GB',-2.3919650,52.0013390,'Herefordshire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:19',0,'men','2019-09-13 15:22:19','2019-09-16 15:22:19',NULL,'We\'ll be a group of about 50 men, mainly from Bath but also from Bristol, Oxford and further afield. Click on the website link to see details of the Poplars and how to register. Please email the Widcombe Warriors email address if you have any questions. 12 of us from Widcombe in Bath went to the Wild at Heart boot camp in Wales last September and found the weekend so transformational that we wanted to put on our own BASIC this September. Please do join us!\r\n\r\nThe Poplars has an outside pool (so bring swimming kit and towel if you want to swim) and also a sports barn, playing fields, 5K circuit and local walks. But you can do as little or as much of these sorts of activities as you want!',13648,260438,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3715\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"The Poplars\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"Bromsberrow Heath\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Ledbury\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"HEF\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"HR8 1QY\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"gb\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"52.001339\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-2.391965\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Herefordshire\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United Kingdom\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-ledbury-hef-gb-andrew-udale-smith',NULL,'2019-03-09 09:03:35','2024-04-10 15:22:19'),
