	('9bc65c47-7006-48e2-958b-167565101a01',2,2107,'WAH BASIC - St. Augustine, FL, US | William Hughes',NULL,'weekly','','FL',NULL,'St. Augustine','','US',-81.3124340,29.9012440,'Florida',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:20',0,'men','2019-08-25 15:22:20','2019-08-28 15:22:20',NULL,'',14007,419898,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"4046\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"St. Augustine\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"FL\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"29.901244\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-81.312434\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Florida\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-st-augustine-fl-us-william-hughes',NULL,'2019-07-22 09:07:16','2024-04-10 15:22:20'),
	('9bc65c47-8f46-4493-a6b0-614bd58f360f',2,635,'WAH BASIC - Lakewood, WI, US | Shelly Hendricks',NULL,'weekly','18495 PEEK RD','WI',NULL,'Lakewood','54138','US',-88.3904800,45.3449970,'Wisconsin',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:20',0,'men','2019-08-22 15:22:20','2019-08-25 15:22:20',NULL,'Location:\r\n\r\nOur location is an old 80 acre family farm in Lakewood, WI. This land is surrounded by the Nicolet National Forest. We will be camping outside with no running water or electricity. It will be an amazing experience of unplugging from the modern world.\r\n\r\nStart Time:\r\n\r\nNoon to 5pm is your time to set up camp. Dinner will start at 6pm on Thursday with our first session following.\r\n\r\nWhat Should I bring:\r\n\r\nBring a notebook/journal and pens. Camping gear.\r\n\r\nAccommodations:\r\n\r\nBring your own tents, campers and gear. If you don\'t own any of these items, please let me know and we will find what you need.\r\n\r\nRegistration Fee:\r\n\r\nThe fees for this event is to help pay for fresh water, gasoline for the generator, snacks, toilet paper, etc.\r\n\r\nThere is an option to buy the meal plan option. We will be having a local restaurant cater to us.\r\n\r\nAirports:\r\n\r\nClosest airport is Austin Straubel in Green Bay, WI. (1.5 hours drive to Lakewood)\r\n\r\nGeneral Mitchell in Milwaukee, WI (3 hr 15 min drive to Lakewood)\r\n\r\nOther Activities:\r\n\r\nThere is free time each day. Currently, we will be offering map and compass (orienteering) training and archery training as added activities.\r\n\r\nFOOD:\r\n\r\nYou can bring your own food, but you can also purchase food with the group. If you bring food, plan on keeping preparation time to a minimum. (I recommend bringing some snacks and letting the food prep to the professionals.) Food orders will be collected before the event and payment when you register via our eventbrite page. \r\nTotal Food Costs: $105.00 plus $20 for tip',13952,411000,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3982\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"18495 PEEK RD\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Lakewood\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"WI\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"54138\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"45.344997\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-88.390480\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Wisconsin\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-lakewood-wi-us-shelly-hendricks',NULL,'2019-06-23 03:06:29','2024-04-10 15:22:20'),
	('9bc65c47-add9-46c6-9dff-03aa9c106606',2,40,'WAH BASIC - Brownsville, KY, US | Brian Thornton',NULL,'weekly','300 Main Cross St','KY',NULL,'Brownsville','42210','US',-86.2679080,37.1941610,'Kentucky',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:20',0,'men','2019-08-15 15:22:20','2019-08-18 15:22:20',NULL,'Registration is $150.00.  You can pay by check,, cash or PayPal.  We will have room for 30 men.  If you plan to come let me know as quickly as possible in order to get your name on the list.  I\'ll keep a waiting list in case some drop out.\r\n\r\nItems to bring:  Bedding (sheets or sleeping bag), towel and wash cloth, swim suit, hiking shoes, campfire clothes.  Hammocks and camp chairs are welcome.\r\n\r\nClick to join a Facebook group page for participants in this event.  You can check this page for information or updates.\r\nhttps://www.facebook.com/groups/2005186489535406/',13519,53015,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3582\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"300 Main Cross St\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Brownsville\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"KY\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"42210\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"37.194161\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-86.267908\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Kentucky\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-brownsville-ky-us-brian-thornton',NULL,'2019-02-13 09:02:00','2024-04-10 15:22:20'),
	('9bc65c47-ccfc-4771-8b52-73ee1f744228',2,289,'WAH BASIC - Troy, MT, US | Phil Soucy',NULL,'weekly','776 Gus creek rd','MT',NULL,'Troy','59935','US',-115.8244250,48.8242400,'Montana',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:20',0,'men','2019-08-15 15:22:20','2019-08-18 15:22:20',NULL,'Some of our lodging will be in the cabin, but others will be in wall tents. For those opting for a tent, cots will be provided, but a sleeping bag and pillow would be a requirement. We are on the banks of the Yaak River as well as close to other high mountain lakes. Hiking boots, a day pack and fishing rod maybe something you will want to bring. There will be some kayaking at camp as the Yaak is deep and slow along this stretch of river.',13777,108120,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3847\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"776 Gus creek rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Troy\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MT\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"59935\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"48.824240\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-115.824425\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Montana\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-troy-mt-us-phil-soucy',NULL,'2019-04-21 08:04:18','2024-04-10 15:22:20'),
	('9bc65c47-ec98-4322-b9ab-16bcf3004b20',2,2108,'WAH BASIC - Sparta, NJ, US | Jimmie Biggs',NULL,'weekly','753 Burnt Meadow Rd.','NJ',NULL,'Hewitt','07421','US',-74.3272420,41.1256630,'New Jersey',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:20',0,'men','2019-08-08 15:22:20','2019-08-11 15:22:20',NULL,'Shiloh Bible Camp Retreat Center in northern New Jersey is uniquely equipped. Shiloh means \"Place of Peace\" and with its beautiful landscape of ponds, streams, and mountains it offers a perfect place for a Wild at Heart adventure! We will be staying in a replica frontier fort equipped with bunks and fulls bathrooms.  The retreat will include: WAH basic course, 400ft Zip line, rock climbing wall, rope challenge course, fishing, hiking, archery range and most important.....The adventure every man needs to grow with our Heavenly Father. \r\n\r\nCost is $220.00 per person. This pays for lodging, meals, adventure activities, WAH Basic course and journal book.  Full payment is due no later then 1 August with a down payment of $100.00 upfront upon registration. 25 spots are available to first come, first serve.\r\n\r\nWhat to bring:\r\n\r\nSleeping bag, Pillow, shower gear, towel, camp fire clothes, fishing pole/gear, hiking boots, tennis shoes, writing material, Bible, and any items you may need (sunblock, bug spray, medicine, etc....) Lastly bring a adventurous heart willing to come alive!!',13775,418067,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3844\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"753 Burnt Meadow Rd.\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Hewitt\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"NJ\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"07421\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"41.125663\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-74.327242\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"New Jersey\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-sparta-nj-us-jimmie-biggs',NULL,'2019-04-20 06:04:53','2024-04-10 15:22:20'),
	('9bc65c48-0bca-478f-9413-21def1f8b229',2,2098,'WAH BASIC - Loganton, PA, US | Paul Leininger',NULL,'weekly','2272 Narrows Road','PA',NULL,'Loganton','17747','US',-77.4828970,40.9764980,'Pennsylvania',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:20',0,'men','2019-08-08 15:22:20','2019-08-11 15:22:20',NULL,'',13916,374254,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3946\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"2272 Narrows Road\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Loganton\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"PA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"17747\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"40.976498\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-77.482897\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Pennsylvania\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-loganton-pa-us-paul-leininger',NULL,'2019-06-04 09:06:03','2024-04-10 15:22:20'),
	('9bc65c48-2ad4-4e38-9c20-33e9f5fe8bc7',2,1018,'WAH BASIC - Keystone, SD, US | Carey Warren',NULL,'weekly','Spokane Creek Campground','SD',NULL,'Keystone','57751','US',-103.3768110,43.8349050,'South Dakota',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:20',0,'men','2019-08-05 15:22:20','2019-08-08 15:22:20',NULL,'Intended for a handful of serious Harley/Indian/whatever bikers, and offered in the heart of the Black Hills during the annual rally.\r\n\r\nSpokane Creek is a family non-party remote campground with almost no cell reception and no wifi. Obviously cigars, camp fires and other familiar Boot Camp amenities will abound, along with incredible motorcycle adventures through Iron Mountain Road, the Needles, Custer State Park ... just to name a few.',13969,409381,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"4001\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"Spokane Creek Campground\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"24631 Iron Mountain Road\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Keystone\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"SD\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"57751\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"43.834905\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-103.376811\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"South Dakota\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-keystone-sd-us-carey-warren',NULL,'2019-07-06 06:07:14','2024-04-10 15:22:20'),
	('9bc65c48-499c-46f8-89b9-544840d4fda1',2,2109,'WAH BASIC - Dublin, DB, IE | Daniel P',NULL,'weekly','44 Rathgar Road','DB',NULL,'Dublin','D06 E516','IE',-6.2703590,53.3180750,'Dublin',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:20',0,'men','2019-08-01 15:22:20','2019-08-04 15:22:20',NULL,'',13858,418241,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3922\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"44 Rathgar Road\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Dublin\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"DB\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"D06 E516\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"ie\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"53.318075\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-6.270359\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Dublin\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"Ireland\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-dublin-db-ie-daniel-p',NULL,'2019-05-15 11:05:34','2024-04-10 15:22:20'),
	('9bc65c48-6849-4a50-a0ba-d02ecaa32d28',2,2110,'WAH BASIC - Waterloo, NE, US | Dan Michalski',NULL,'weekly','2304 Campanile Road','NE',NULL,'Waterloo','68069','US',-96.3535940,41.2373320,'Nebraska',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:20',0,'men','2019-07-25 15:22:20','2019-07-28 15:22:20',NULL,'Our property is located off the Platte River. We have 25 acres and there is also a 5 acre lake where you can enjoy peaceful trail walks, swimming, kayaking, and campfires.  Meals, snacks, and basic toiletries are provided, but bring swimsuits, proper footwear for hiking, bug spray, and any special toiletries you may need or prefer.  We have accommodations for up to 14 men with dorm style housing, so bring a friend that you can share a room with. Please let me know if you have any food allergies that we need to plan for. This course is recommended for men 18 and over.  \r\n\r\nDay 1 arrive after 4PM, dinner at 6PM , Session 1 and free time. \r\n\r\nDay 2 starts with breakfast at 8AM Sessions 2, 3, 4, and 5 with free time and meals throughout. \r\n\r\nDay 3 breakfast at 8AM, Sessions 6, 7, 8, and 9 with meals and free time throughout. \r\n\r\nDay 4 Breakfast 8AM with Sessions 10 and 11 to follow. Checkout will be at noon.  \r\n\r\nCost: $400.00 \r\n\r\nEarly bird special if booked and paid in full by 7/15/2019 $350.00\r\n\r\nThis is going to be my first of hopefully many events like this and  please come willing to be open minded and willing to give me feedback on how I can improve! I am opening this event to men I look to as leaders and people I feel will be honest with me!!',13914,418864,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3943\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"2304 Campanile Road\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Waterloo\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"NE\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"68069\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"41.237332\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-96.353594\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Nebraska\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-waterloo-ne-us-dan-michalski',NULL,'2019-06-03 10:06:21','2024-04-10 15:22:20'),
	('9bc65c48-876b-4a79-aecf-fd9f2ff0024c',2,2111,'WAH BASIC - Tucson, AZ, US | Tim Brown',NULL,'weekly','4241 W Ajo Hwy','AZ',NULL,'Tucson','85746','US',-111.0559040,32.1748630,'Arizona',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:20',0,'men','2019-07-25 15:22:20','2019-07-28 15:22:20',NULL,'Bedding\r\nToiletries\r\nTowel\r\nSwimsuit\r\nHat\r\nSunscreen',13999,229332,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"4037\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"4241 W Ajo Hwy\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Tucson\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"AZ\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"85746\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"32.174863\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-111.055904\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Arizona\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-tucson-az-us-tim-brown',NULL,'2019-07-18 02:07:58','2024-04-10 15:22:20'),
	('9bc65c48-a64b-460e-9db4-c9db4de00b8c',2,1280,'WAH BASIC - Forster, NSW, AU | Michael Robertson',NULL,'weekly','18A Panorama Crescent',NULL,NULL,'Forster','2428','AU',152.5430490,-32.2107040,'New South Wales',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:20',0,'men','2019-07-19 15:22:20','2019-07-22 15:22:20',NULL,'Please bring your own linen or sleeping bags.',13653,398230,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3718\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"18A Panorama Crescent\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Forster\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"NSW\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"2428\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"au\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"-32.210704\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"152.543049\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"New South Wales\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"Australia\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-forster-nsw-au-michael-robertson',NULL,'2019-03-11 02:03:25','2024-04-10 15:22:20'),
	('9bc65c48-c505-4f4c-8b3c-5a09ae3103ec',2,1925,'WAH BASIC - Xenia, OH, US | Rob Forino',NULL,'weekly','651 Hudson Taylor Dr','OH',NULL,'Xenia','45385','US',-83.9206200,39.6693990,'Ohio',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:20',0,'men','2019-07-18 15:22:21','2019-07-21 15:22:21',NULL,'Thank you for your interest in the Wild at Heart BASIC Men\'s Retreat! This event is hosted at the Athletes in Action Retreat Center in Xenia Ohio. It\'s a beautiful sprawling campus with plenty of opportunity to enjoy historic architecture and beautiful grounds. \r\nCost for the BASIC is $150 for ($170 if doing the optional ropes course).  Tuition includes all meals and lodging and video presentations / course materials.  \r\n\r\nBedding and towels are provided.  You\'ll have to bring your own toiletries etc.  The rooms are dorm style - 2 men to a room.  I\'d recommend bringing ear plugs for sleeping in case there are any folks who might snore/use CPAP etc..  Also, make sure to keep an eye on the weather forecast because there are some optional outdoor activities planned along with access to a bonfire pit each night so bring appropriate clothing for those activities.  That said, all of the Wild at Heart sessions take place indoors; casual / comfortable clothing is perfect all weekend. Breakfast, Lunch, and Dinner are served, and dietary restrictions can be accommodated but I\'ll need to know in advance (i.e. Gluten allergy etc.).  You can let me know at the time of registration. \r\n\r\nIf you are interested in signing up for this retreat, I must receive your payment no later than July 4th 2019. There are enough spots for 10 guys in this retreat. Once I know you are interested, I will send you an email to collect all of the required information and you can make your payment at that time. \r\n\r\nThanks guys and God bless!\r\nRob Forino',13493,401276,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3539\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"651 Hudson Taylor Dr\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Xenia\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"OH\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"45385\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"39.669399\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-83.920620\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Ohio\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-xenia-oh-us-rob-forino-3',NULL,'2019-02-05 06:02:32','2024-04-10 15:22:21'),
	('9bc65c48-e4c5-4c8d-a631-ecf8a3481882',2,2112,'WAH BASIC - Norwich, GB | Dave Lewis',NULL,'weekly','Knyvett Green',NULL,NULL,'Norwich','NR161HA','GB',1.1600070,52.5336760,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:21',0,'men','2019-07-05 15:22:21','2019-07-08 15:22:21',NULL,'This is a private unsearchable session with friends only.',13958,407508,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3988\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"Knyvett Green\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"Ashwellthorpe\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Norwich\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"NR161HA\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"gb\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"52.533676\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"1.160007\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United Kingdom\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-norwich-gb-dave-lewis',NULL,'2019-06-28 05:06:48','2024-04-10 15:22:21'),
	('9bc65c49-0497-4b2e-8ef8-e6f32798fff3',2,2076,'WAH BASIC - Weston, OR, US | Roland Snider',NULL,'weekly','78357 ABC Lane','OR',NULL,'Weston','97886','US',-118.2137360,45.7910780,'Oregon',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:21',0,'men','2019-06-27 15:22:21','2019-06-30 15:22:21',NULL,'FACEBOOK PAGE: (Copy &amp; Paste) @alchemybros102 - or - https://www.facebook.com/pg/alchemybros102/community/\r\n\r\nSummer time in the Blues!  Could be rainy, but anticipate very warm and sunny weather.    Might want to bring insect repellent, sun block, good boots for hiking all over the camp (80 Acres!)  Photography a must... mountain bikes for the trails (not motorized) and disc golf discs welcome!  Bring a sleeping bag, Bible, and a notebook.  Come expecting God to work! \r\n\r\nEmail/Call/Text us if you need help with travel details such as closest airports, etc.',13682,53282,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3753\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"78357 ABC Lane\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Weston\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"OR\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"97886\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"45.791078\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-118.213736\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Oregon\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-weston-or-us-roland-snider',NULL,'2019-03-16 07:03:29','2024-04-10 15:22:21'),
