	('9bc65c49-dfaa-4957-a62c-ce93514c8af5',2,1101,'WAH BASIC - Muskoka, ON, CA | Thom Mills',NULL,'weekly','','ON',NULL,'Muskoka','','CA',-79.4084650,45.1841120,'Ontario',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:21',0,'men','2019-05-30 15:22:21','2019-06-02 15:22:21',NULL,'Located at an incredible cottage in the beautiful Muskoka region of Ontario, this is your opportunity to contact with your Heavenly Father and some incredible guys away from the distractions of life.\r\n\r\nEarly June is still in Ontario so dress appropriately.  We\'re on a lake and you may choose to take a dip, but it will likely be a quick one.  Kayaks, canoes and other boats available to enjoy.',13312,366993,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3327\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Muskoka\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"ON\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"ca\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"45.184112\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-79.408465\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Ontario\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"Canada\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-muskoka-ca-thom-mills',NULL,'2018-12-10 08:12:37','2024-04-10 15:22:21'),
