	('9bc65c4c-232e-4be0-a42a-c54ae116cfe4',2,1702,'WAH BASIC - Grants Pass, OR, US | Kirk Sager',NULL,'weekly','311 Ave De Teresa','OR',NULL,'Grants Pass','97526','US',-123.2524790,42.4237530,'Oregon',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:23',0,'men','2019-05-03 15:22:23','2019-05-06 15:22:23',NULL,'This event will take place in the Wild and Scenic section of the Rogue river.  Table rock fellowship men’s team is hosting the event, a 4 day trip on the river with sessions taking place on the banks of the rogue river.  This first event of Basic is taking place after the conclusion of a 12 week walk through, Wild at Heart, hosted at Kirk Sager’s on the Rogue river.  There will be 16 men on the trip, all completing the book study prior to going.  All men who have signed up have received information concerning what to bring for the trip and signed release forms.  We are expecting to repeat this basic yearly and opening it up to the public outside of Table Rock Fellowship.',13751,367477,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3824\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"311 Ave De Teresa\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Grants Pass\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"OR\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"97526\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"42.423753\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-123.252479\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Oregon\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-grants-pass-or-us-kirk-sager',NULL,'2019-04-08 02:04:09','2024-04-10 15:22:23'),
