	('9bc65c4c-61e4-4c09-b220-ef8b9a14a40e',2,942,'WAH BASIC - Midway, TX, US | Mark Dudley',NULL,'weekly','13464 OSR Hwy','TX',NULL,'Midway','75852','US',-95.8017880,31.0479580,'Texas',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:23',0,'men','2019-05-02 15:22:23','2019-05-05 15:22:23',NULL,'Rontis Ranch is a working cattle ranch with a small beef production operation on 174 acres in the hills and lakes region of Texas.  Rontis Ranch sits about 8 miles east of Interstate 45 between Houston and Dallas Texas.  \r\n\r\nBASIC Retreat participants should bring casual clothes with a change of work clothes and least one pair of closed-toe shoes.  Some planned/optional activities will be a cowboy cookout, late night campfire conversation, and shooting sports (shotgun clays, handguns).',13485,413860,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3530\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"13464 OSR Hwy\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"Rontis Ranch\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Midway\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"TX\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"75852\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"31.047958\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-95.801788\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Texas\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-midway-tx-us-mark-dudley',NULL,'2019-02-04 08:02:13','2024-04-10 15:22:23'),
	('9bc65c4c-812f-4dcb-904b-f8a7615d9487',2,188,'WAH BASIC - Shalfleet, IOW, GB | Matthew Mckeown',NULL,'weekly','Corfe Camp',NULL,NULL,'Shalfleet','PO30 4NT','GB',-1.4105780,50.7091430,'Isle of Wight',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:23',0,'men','2019-05-02 15:22:23','2019-05-05 15:22:23',NULL,'FAQ Isle of Wight Wild at Heart Basic Retreat 2nd - 5th May 2019\r\n\r\n-How much? - £30\r\n-Will there be food? - Yes, but please bring a donation as we will be cooking together.\r\n-Do I have to stay over? - No, but you will be missing out on the chance to completely check-out of the matrix (the world) and on fellowship.\r\n-Can I bring phone/laptop is there WiFi? - There is no WiFi and poor signal, we expect no phones or tech, as this is a fully immersive experience of God.\r\n-Are tents provided? - No, there are many primitive campsites and fires allowed in fire-pits, there are also bunks/dormitories for those who prefer not to camp.\r\n-Is there group work/testimonies/accountability groups/role-play? - Absolutely not! The atmosphere is relaxed, leave religion and the poser at home.\r\n-Is this \'muscular Christianity\'? - No! But it is masculine in the way in which we bear the image of God. \r\n\r\nhttp://www.corfcamp.org/facilities.html\r\n\r\nhttps://www.isleofwightguru.co.uk/isle-of-wight-ferry-beginners-guide.html',13555,385617,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3633\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"Corfe Camp\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"Corfe Road\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Shalfleet\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"IOW\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"PO30 4NT\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"gb\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"50.709143\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-1.410578\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Isle of Wight\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United Kingdom\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-shalfleet-iow-gb-matthew-mckeown-0',NULL,'2019-02-19 03:02:53','2024-04-10 15:22:23'),
	('9bc65c4c-a0d5-4d57-8a09-6c8a678e909d',2,561,'WAH BASIC - Estes Park, CO, US | Greg Manke',NULL,'weekly','2515 Tunnel Road','CO',NULL,'Estes Park','80511','US',-105.5661540,40.3403700,'Colorado',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:23',0,'men','2019-05-02 15:22:23','2019-05-05 15:22:23',NULL,'',13668,385664,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3736\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"2515 Tunnel Road\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"YMCA of the Rockies\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Estes Park\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"CO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"80511\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"40.340370\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-105.566154\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Colorado\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-estes-park-co-us-greg-manke-0',NULL,'2019-03-14 03:03:49','2024-04-10 15:22:23'),
	('9bc65c4c-bfd9-43fd-acce-aeed2e89739d',2,521,'WAH BASIC - Highlands, NC, US | Benson \"Davis\" Picklesimer',NULL,'weekly','3872 Dillard Rd (Hwy 106)','NC',NULL,'Highlands','28741','US',-83.2564610,35.0311520,'North Carolina',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:23',0,'men','2019-05-02 15:22:23','2019-05-05 15:22:23',NULL,'Bring your hiking boots...we are in the mountains of North Carolina!  You will be staying at the top of \"The Mountain\" with incredible views and waterfalls near by.  We will have excursions, hikes, campfires and a couple surprises available for breaks.  Food, lodging (either single or double occupancy) and activities for $325 (single room $430).',13327,62010,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3345\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"3872 Dillard Rd (Hwy 106)\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"The Mountain Retreat\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Highlands\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"NC\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"28741\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"35.031152\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-83.256461\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"North Carolina\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-highlands-nc-us-benson-davis-picklesimer',NULL,'2018-12-12 10:12:03','2024-04-10 15:22:23'),
	('9bc65c4c-df55-439c-9750-ddc73fdfd71e',2,2125,'WAH BASIC - Melrose, FL, US | Jamie Sellers',NULL,'weekly','647 State Road 26','FL',NULL,'Melrose','32666','US',-82.0057050,29.7168140,'Florida',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:23',0,'men','2019-05-02 15:22:23','2019-05-05 15:22:23',NULL,'Swimsuit, outdoor clothes, bug spray, campfire clothes.',13686,225984,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3760\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"647 State Road 26\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Melrose\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"FL\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"32666\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"29.716814\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-82.005705\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Florida\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-melrose-fl-us-jamie-sellers',NULL,'2019-03-17 02:03:48','2024-04-10 15:22:23'),
	('9bc65c4c-fdfe-449b-b375-d9b0284ecf8b',2,1957,'WAH BASIC - McCall, ID, US | Jason Lloyd',NULL,'weekly','300 N Mission Street','ID',NULL,'McCall','83638','US',-116.1065000,44.9035600,'Idaho',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:23',0,'men','2019-05-02 15:22:23','2019-05-05 15:22:23',NULL,'CHECK-IN / CHECK-OUT\r\nCheck-in is 3:30 pm – 5:30 pm on Thursday with dinner served at 6 pm. The event will conclude at 1 pm on Sunday\r\n\r\nTHE VENUE\r\nThis event will be held at Camp Pinewood in McCall , Idaho. Housing is comfortable, bunk beds, dormitory style – in rooms that house up to 9. You will need to bring your own bedding and pillow (sleeping bags acceptable), hygiene toiletries and towel.\r\n\r\nTHE COST\r\nWe are requesting $26.50 at registration to reserve your spot. A remaining balance of $100 will be due at the event. For this camp the total cost per attendee is $126.50 – which helps cover the hard costs.\r\n\r\nADDITIONAL INFORMATION\r\nMeals are included. Dress is casual. In addition to comfortable everyday clothing you should bring shoes and clothing appropriate for hiking during the day and cool nights by the campfire in the evening. You will need to bring your own bedding (sleeping bags) and toiletries, including towel. You may want a flashlight for evenings and a refillable water bottle to stay hydrated. This will be an immersive weekend where men fully unplug. An emergency contact number will be provided for you to make available to those who may need it. We will ask that men turn off all devices for the weekend starting on Saturday. This will be one of the best decisions you make, trust us. The outside world will try to distract you.\r\n\r\nPlease Note: This event is for men 18 years and older.',11657,253503,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"2954\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"300 N Mission Street\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"Camp Pinewood\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"McCall\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"ID\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"83638\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"44.903560\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-116.106500\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Idaho\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-mccall-id-us-jason-lloyd',NULL,'2018-09-11 05:09:24','2024-04-10 15:22:23'),
	('9bc65c4d-1d1b-4d36-ad59-305118224e98',2,1880,'WAH BASIC - Paynesville, MN, US | Joseph Godfrey',NULL,'weekly','15752 Lake Avenue','MN',NULL,'Paynesville','56362','US',0.0000000,0.0000000,'Minnesota',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:23',0,'men','2019-04-25 15:22:23','2019-04-28 15:22:23',NULL,'Our event will be at the Lake Koronis Conference &amp; Retreat Center, about 90 minutes from the Twin Cities. Our camp will have access to sand volleyball courts, a ball field, a full gymnasium, bike and running paths, and hiking trails. Our meetings will be inside during the day and we will have a campfire at night for those interested. April weather in Minnesota could be cold so pack accordingly.',13436,218397,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3482\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"15752 Lake Avenue\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Paynesville\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MN\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"56362\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"0.000000\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"0.000000\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Minnesota\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-paynesville-mn-us-joe-godfrey',NULL,'2019-01-21 02:01:30','2024-04-10 15:22:23'),
	('9bc65c4d-3bf2-4d81-a18e-af0e10a4d868',2,2042,'WAH BASIC - Hocking Hills, OH, US | Greg Adams',NULL,'weekly','','OH',NULL,'Hocking Hills','','US',-82.4070990,39.5400670,'Ohio',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:23',0,'men','2019-04-25 15:22:23','2019-04-28 15:22:23',NULL,'All men die, but few men really live! Battle, adventure and rescue are what make men come alive!  God calls us to more than just salvation - but also to freedom, to life, to sonship.  Join us at the spectacular Eagle Wings Lodge April 25-28, 2019 for a Boot Camp based on the book Wild At Heart. During the 4 days set in the majestic rolling landscape of Hocking Hills, you will participate in a multi-media experience and live presentations which will help you discover something profound about your own heart and the heart of God.\r\n\r\nThis isn’t your typical retreat.  You will not be asked to break into small groups and share your feelings.  Instead you will hear from other men living an intentional life in pursuit of the heart of God.  Bring your fishing gear for the stocked pond, your hiking boots for the trails, and your guns or bows for target shooting.\r\n\r\nThe cost is $285 and includes room and board.  Previous attendees have indicated that this weekend has been a transformational experience in their walk with God – don’t miss out.',13335,181564,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3352\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Hocking Hills\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"OH\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"39.540067\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-82.407099\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Ohio\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-hocking-hills-oh-us-greg-adams-0',NULL,'2018-12-13 02:12:27','2024-04-10 15:22:23'),
	('9bc65c4d-5a7a-4cf2-b4c7-b38ced53fca0',2,2126,'WAH BASIC - Tualatin, OR, US | Kevin Wolley',NULL,'weekly','Silver Falls State Park Lodge and Conference Center','OR',NULL,'Sublimity','97385','US',-122.6459600,44.8514270,'Oregon',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:23',0,'men','2019-04-25 15:22:24','2019-04-28 15:22:24',NULL,'Hiking boots',13271,219742,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3273\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"Silver Falls State Park Lodge and Conference Center\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"20022 Silver Falls Hwy SE\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Sublimity\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"OR\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"97385\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"44.851427\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-122.645960\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Oregon\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-tualatin-or-us-kevin-wolley',NULL,'2018-11-23 09:11:50','2024-04-10 15:22:24'),
