	('9bc65c4f-49b2-44ff-a003-9779e994fd69',2,1768,'WAH BASIC - Quarryville, PA, US | Nathan Jameson',NULL,'weekly','','PA',NULL,'Quarryville','','US',-76.1635660,39.8970470,'Pennsylvania',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:25',0,'men','2019-04-04 15:22:25','2019-04-07 15:22:25',NULL,'Bring hiking boots and campfire clothes. Average early April temps near Lancaster, PA range from low 60s F (high) to high 20s F (low). Bring your own linens including sheets for bunk. Check-in is Thursday between 4 and 5 p.m. The retreat will conclude Sunday at 12 noon.',11760,231895,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3053\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Quarryville\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"PA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"39.897047\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-76.163566\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Pennsylvania\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-quarryville-pa-us-nathan-jameson-0',NULL,'2018-10-01 06:10:16','2024-04-10 15:22:25'),
	('9bc65c4f-691c-401d-8baf-9cbdc1a1c2fd',2,2065,'WAH BASIC - Landford, HAM, GB | Matthew Elsom',NULL,'weekly','Beech Grange',NULL,NULL,'Landford','SP5 2AN','GB',-1.6336570,50.9691400,'Hampshire',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:25',0,'men','2019-04-04 15:22:25','2019-04-07 15:22:25',NULL,'There will be a campfire and walking but not too strenuous!',13691,409572,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3764\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"Beech Grange\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Landford\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"HAM\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"SP5 2AN\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"gb\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"50.969140\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-1.633657\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Hampshire\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United Kingdom\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-landford-ham-gb-matthew-elsom',NULL,'2019-03-19 04:03:23','2024-04-10 15:22:25'),
	('9bc65c4f-88de-4845-8c6a-a0a26dbe4909',2,1525,'WAH BASIC - Clinton, MO, US | Mark Reiter',NULL,'weekly','351 NE 831 Rd','MO',NULL,'Clinton','64735','US',-93.6029820,38.4111270,'Missouri',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:25',0,'men','2019-04-04 15:22:25','2019-04-07 15:22:25',NULL,'DETAILS:\r\n\r\nWHO:  Men, ages 18 and older, who want to go deeper into healing their hearts and exploring their masculine journeys with God.\r\n\r\nWHAT:  The Wild Heart Boot Camp is a four-day quest into the recovery of your masculine soul as outlined in the book, Wild at Heart, by John Eldredge. Video sessions feature team members from Wild at Heart Ministries.\r\n\r\nWHEN:  Thursday, April 4, 2019, at 6:00 PM until Sunday, April 7, 2019, at 12:00pm. Please prayerfully consider your application prior to submitting. By applying, you are agreeing to be present for the entire event.\r\n\r\nWHERE:  LifeChange Camp is 13 miles north-east of Clinton, MO – appx. 1.5 hour drive from Kansas City.\r\n\r\nCOST:  The cost for this event is $180. This includes lodging, meals (Thursday dinner – Sunday breakfast), and training materials.  Participants are responsible for getting to and from LifeChange Camp.  Limited scholarships are available.  You can begin the scholarship application process on the Boot Camp Scholarship page at https://e6ministries.org/scholar_request/\r\n\r\nThis event has limited space available.\r\n\r\nTO REGISTER FOR THIS BASIC BOOT CAMP goto https://e6ministries.org/register_camp/',13666,260103,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3733\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"351 NE 831 Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"LifeChange Camp and Retreat Center\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Clinton\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"64735\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"38.411127\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-93.602982\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Missouri\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-clinton-mo-us-mark-reiter-1',NULL,'2019-03-14 05:03:30','2024-04-10 15:22:25'),
	('9bc65c4f-a713-494b-8f1d-8563fc524165',2,1711,'WAH BASIC - Gore, WV, US | Quint Pitts',NULL,'weekly','1794 Back Creek Road','VA',NULL,'Gore','22637','US',-78.3745160,39.2320020,'Virginia',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:25',0,'men','2019-04-04 15:22:25','2019-04-07 15:22:25',NULL,'THIS EVENT IS SOLD OUT!  \r\nThis event is high in the Appalachian Mountains at Pine Creek Retreat Center with beautiful mountain views and babbling streams nearby.  You have options for this retreat! Price includes lodging for three nights, plus all meals, 11 soul stirring sessions and basic recreation. Additional adventure recreation such as zip lines and climbing wall will be available for an additional fee.  Linens and bedding are not provided with the registration so bring your own or you can rent linens and bedding from Pine Creek for an additional $10.   \r\n$235 single occupancy if registered before March 1.\r\n$196 double occupancy if registered before March 1.\r\n$181 triple occupancy if registered before March.',11815,311437,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3123\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"1794 Back Creek Road\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Gore\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"VA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"22637\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"39.232002\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-78.374516\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Virginia\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-gore-wv-us-quint-pitts',NULL,'2018-10-15 02:10:57','2024-04-10 15:22:25'),
	('9bc65c4f-c5ca-46c9-9f31-5748d100d90f',2,580,'WAH BASIC - Peshastin, WA, US | Steve Waltar',NULL,'weekly','Ingalls Creek Enrichment Center','WA',NULL,'Peshastin','98847','US',-120.6665860,47.4644990,'Washington',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:25',0,'men','2019-04-04 15:22:25','2019-04-07 15:22:25',NULL,'CANCELLED.  We didn\'t get enough people committed to attend.  \r\n\r\nPlease do contact Steve Waltar on my cell phone 206-714-1547 or at my work, Legacy Estate Planning, 425-455-6788 if you are interested in a FUTURE EVENT.  I would love to host an event in Washington.  I have 2-3 possible venues.  \r\n\r\nAt Ingalls Creek Enrichment Center, sleeping arrangements are bunk beds in the Lodge or if we don\'t have enough people for the lodge we\'ll be in a nice log cabin or homes surrounding the Ingalls Creek Enrichment Center Lodge.  So long as we get at least 8 people, we will conduct the Boot Camp.  We could host up to 30.  If we don\'t get enough people, we\'ll try again later in the year.  \r\n\r\nBring outdoor hiking, camping stuff.  We are very close to Ingalls Creek Trailhead - so you can hike up into snow easily.  There are also simple trails that lead to the creek.  There will be campfires, optional hikes, possible trip into Leavenworth, Washington.  You may want swimsuit for outdoor Jacuzzi.  Bring layers of clothing for indoor and outdoor activities.',13530,105445,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3598\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"Ingalls Creek Enrichment Center\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"12355 Ingalls Creek Rd.\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Peshastin\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"WA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"98847\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"47.464499\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-120.666586\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Washington\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-peshastin-wa-us-steve-waltar-0',NULL,'2019-02-15 12:02:33','2024-04-10 15:22:25'),
	('9bc65c4f-e43a-4838-88e6-f6102a8a5d37',2,2134,'WAH BASIC - Wilmore, KY, US | Matthew Elkins',NULL,'weekly','555 McCauley Rd','KY',NULL,'Wilmore','40390','US',-84.6631080,37.8935420,'Kentucky',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:25',0,'men','2019-04-01 15:22:25','2019-04-04 15:22:25',NULL,'Will be hosted primarily indoors for teaching(s), with access to outdoors several times during each day. We have several acres of privacy in a rural area to connect with each other, and God. Please being comfortable shoes, Bible, Pen, Hat/cap, and journal if desired.',13700,225867,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3771\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"555 McCauley Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Wilmore\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"KY\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"40390\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"37.893542\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-84.663108\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Kentucky\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-wilmore-ky-us-matthew-elkins',NULL,'2019-03-24 12:03:09','2024-04-10 15:22:25'),
