	('9bc65c50-5b31-4a22-9ef1-cea6e96322e6',2,57,'WAH BASIC - Worthing, GB | Vlad Velkov',NULL,'weekly','',NULL,NULL,'Worthing','','GB',-0.3728820,50.8178700,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:25',0,'men','2019-03-28 15:22:25','2019-03-31 15:22:25',NULL,'Hiking ,horse riding, campfire...',13457,411648,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3502\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Worthing\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"gb\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"50.817870\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-0.372882\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United Kingdom\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-worthing-gb-vlad-velkov',NULL,'2019-02-02 10:02:13','2024-04-10 15:22:26'),
	('9bc65c50-790f-4ad2-ae93-dccab396eb35',2,1784,'WAH BASIC - Cleveland, GA, US | Buz Mayo',NULL,'weekly','577 Horse Range Drive','GA',NULL,'Cleveland','30528','US',-83.7978430,34.6575620,'Georgia',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:26',0,'men','2019-03-28 15:22:26','2019-03-31 15:22:26',NULL,'You\'ll want to arrive before 5pm on Thursday. BASIC starts with dinner at 6pm and our 1st session is at 7pm . This Boot Camp location is full of things to do throughout the weekend. \r\n\r\nWe\'ll be packing a lot into 3 1/2 days. And we will also have ample free time on Friday and Saturday afternoons. You can try your hand at shooting those orange clay pigeons. Maybe you\'ll want to hike the beautiful acreage of Strong Rock and navigate the lakes and forests. There is a good chance that we\'ll have real Spring weather. \r\n\r\nBring clothing for comfort. Bring something you can move in and bear either warm Spring temperature or those colder Spring mornings. Hiking boots are recommended. Bring a few pens. You\'ll want to take notes in each of the 11 sessions. We\'ll enjoy at least one roaring bonfire on the weekend; maybe two.\r\n\r\nOur final day, Sunday morning, will be FULL and you will sense the richness of the weekend more fully on that morning as the weight of all of the previous sessions come into clearer focus. We\'ll wrap up at 12:00 noon\'ish and you\'ll want to be fully present through all of it.',13447,29243,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3488\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"577 Horse Range Drive\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Cleveland\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"GA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"30528\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"34.657562\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-83.797843\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Georgia\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-cleveland-ga-us-buz-mayo-0',NULL,'2019-01-30 03:01:49','2024-04-10 15:22:26'),
	('9bc65c50-970c-4f0d-89a2-2c9f474917d1',2,2136,'WAH BASIC - BASEHOR, KS, US | JASON BOETCHER',NULL,'weekly','15022 LAKEVIEW PL','KS',NULL,'BASEHOR','66007','US',-94.9304780,39.1198940,'Kansas',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:26',0,'men','2019-03-28 15:22:26','2019-03-31 15:22:26',NULL,'',13569,230768,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3647\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"15022 LAKEVIEW PL\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"Street Address 2\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"BASEHOR\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"KS\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"66007\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"39.119894\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-94.930478\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Kansas\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-basehor-ks-us-jason-boetcher',NULL,'2019-02-22 11:02:54','2024-04-10 15:22:26'),
	('9bc65c50-b485-4278-a2b4-020c7cc95385',2,2055,'WAH BASIC - Tucson, AZ, US | Kurt Koenig',NULL,'weekly','9033 E 33rd Pl','AZ',NULL,'Tucson','85710','US',0.0000000,0.0000000,'Arizona',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:26',0,'men','2019-03-27 15:22:26','2019-03-30 15:22:26',NULL,'The retreat will actually be in a cabin on Mt. Lemmon near Tucson, Arizona. On Wednesday, March 27, the first day of the retreat, we will car pool from the address given above to the cabin. The drive is about 1 hour. Please bring your own sleeping bags or bedding. The cost of the cabin and food is $150 per man. The cabin sleeps about 12. The retreat will end on Saturday but we will stay until Sunday at noon to process and decompress. Call me or email me for questions or details.',13433,42466,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3464\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"9033 E 33rd Pl\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Tucson\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"AZ\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"85710\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"0.000000\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"0.000000\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Arizona\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-tucson-az-us-kurt-koenig',NULL,'2019-01-20 08:01:08','2024-04-10 15:22:26'),
