	('9bc65c51-8478-4ca2-ad93-d678f9b2a7ea',2,1665,'WAH BASIC - Pioche, NV, US | Chris Ashworth',NULL,'weekly',' 25772 Hermitage Rd, # 277','NV',NULL,'Pioche','89043','US',-114.1066030,38.3050760,'Nevada',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:26',0,'men','2019-03-14 15:22:26','2019-03-17 15:22:26',NULL,'Looking for men who want to deepen their relationship with God. Bring a sleeping bag for the heated bunkhouse, mattresses are provided. Also plan clothing around snow weather.\r\n\r\nLots of activities available including a shooting range and archery range. Bring your own gun and ammo or rent for nominal fee.\r\n\r\n$175 for food and lodging, this covers our costs. Reduced fee available for those who want to attend but can\'t cover the cost.\r\n\r\nLocation:\r\nhttps://www.facebook.com/HermitageRanch/\r\nhttps://www.facebook.com/kidshuntingcamp/',13249,405815,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3247\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\" 25772 Hermitage Rd, # 277\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Pioche\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"NV\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"89043\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"38.305076\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-114.106603\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Nevada\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-pioche-nv-us-chris-ashworth',NULL,'2018-11-15 07:11:15','2024-04-10 15:22:26'),
