	('9bc65c52-1a20-4e42-bcb8-1bde1826c1e0',2,155,'WAH BASIC - Belzoni , MS, US | Steve Miller',NULL,'weekly','1380 Point Rd','MS',NULL,'Belzoni ','39038','US',-90.4357340,33.1136300,'Mississippi',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:27',0,'men','2019-03-07 15:22:27','2019-03-10 15:22:27',NULL,'This is a 1200 acre ranch and there are places for hiking and fishing and maybe skeet shooting',13362,117435,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3372\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"1380 Point Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Belzoni \\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MS\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"39038\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"33.113630\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-90.435734\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Mississippi\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-belzoni-ms-us-steve-miller',NULL,'2018-12-20 10:12:39','2024-04-10 15:22:27'),
	('9bc65c52-38ce-44a2-bb34-0ea1582f3578',2,2142,'WAH BASIC - Prattsville, NY, US | Ryan Dempsey',NULL,'weekly','251 Huntersfield Road','NY',NULL,'Prattsville','12468','US',-74.3666960,42.3619420,'New York',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:27',0,'men','2019-03-05 15:22:27','2019-03-08 15:22:27',NULL,'This Basic will be more of a course format, spanning several weeks.',13551,393200,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3625\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"251 Huntersfield Road\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Prattsville\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"NY\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"12468\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"42.361942\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-74.366696\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"New York\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-prattsville-ny-us-ryan-dempsey',NULL,'2019-02-19 12:02:32','2024-04-10 15:22:27'),
	('9bc65c52-572a-4110-9395-9beb277a1c65',2,1879,'WAH BASIC - Elijay, GA, US | Jared Stump',NULL,'weekly','','GA',NULL,'Elijay','','US',-84.4821500,34.6948080,'Georgia',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:27',0,'men','2019-02-28 15:22:27','2019-03-03 15:22:27',NULL,'Total Cost: $259 \r\n\r\nEvent Begins: 6:00pm on Thursday, February 28, 2019\r\nEvent Concludes: 12:00 noon on Sunday, March 3, 2019\r\n\r\nRegister now with a $50 deposit. \r\nFinal payment due by February 15, 2019.\r\n\r\nRegistration fee includes all program expenses, lodging (bunkhouse style), and meals. The event will be held at a campground in the mountains of Georgia with cooler weather expected.',13310,329227,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3324\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Elijay\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"GA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"34.694808\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-84.482150\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Georgia\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-elijay-ga-us-jared-stump',NULL,'2018-12-10 08:12:03','2024-04-10 15:22:27'),
	('9bc65c52-761b-4b15-bfe7-3451311c6ffb',2,2143,'WAH BASIC - Jim Thorpe , PA, US | Ed Reed',NULL,'weekly','','PA',NULL,'Jim Thorpe ','18229','US',0.0000000,0.0000000,'Pennsylvania',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:27',0,'men','2019-02-28 15:22:27','2019-03-03 15:22:27',NULL,'',13431,390833,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3461\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Jim Thorpe \\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"PA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"18229\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"0.000000\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"0.000000\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Pennsylvania\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-jim-thorpe-pa-us-ed-reed',NULL,'2019-01-20 04:01:09','2024-04-10 15:22:27'),
	('9bc65c52-94fc-4efa-9eb4-1ef69118f95b',2,2144,'WAH BASIC - Monaco | Nathaniel Davis',NULL,'weekly','','MC',NULL,'Sospel','96000','MC',0.0000000,0.0000000,'Monte-Carlo',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:27',0,'men','2019-02-25 15:22:27','2019-02-28 15:22:27',NULL,'What is Wild at Heart Basic? Many men say this is one of the most life-changing events they have ever been part of. Wild at Heart Basic four day, Autumn events are designed to take a man (age 18+) on the journey of rediscovering his heart and life through Jesus Christ.\r\n\r\nThese men’s events are held near Sospel as that’s where we can experience nature outside of the city of MONACO. \r\n\r\nWild at heart Basic is based on Wild at Heart, the best-selling book for men by John Eldredge. \r\n \r\nUPDATE:  This event is now OPEN TO ALL MEN (age 18+).\r\nDetails on our four day event based-on “Wild at Heart” are below.\r\n\r\nThere are seasons in the masculine journey that every man experiences – each one, unique. Having a road map is essential – knowing where to go, what to expect, how to break strongholds and navigate the many challenges faced along the way. \r\n\r\nTHAT’S WHAT THIS  EVENT IS ALL ABOUT\r\n\r\nTHE VENUE: This event will be held at a private Villa.\r\n\r\nHousing is fresh and comfortable.\r\n\r\nPAY WHAT YOU CAN: \r\nNo joke! We don’t want money to be an obstacle for anybody so we’ve made it so camp can run 100% on what men are able to pay. That said, many men ask about a “suggested amount” as a point of reference. For this camp that suggested registration is €200 – which helps cover the hard costs plus other expenses we incur. \r\n\r\nThis includes all meals.\r\n\r\nCHECK-IN &amp; CHECK-OUT: \r\n\r\nCheck-In: 4:00-5:30 pm on Monday, 25th February  2019\r\nConclusion: 12:00 noon on Thursday, 28th February  2019\r\n\r\n\r\nALL QUESTIONS? Email nathaniel@nathanieldavis or text/call  +33 6 07 93 75 78\r\n\r\nThings to Bring ; shoes for walking',11739,405383,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3023\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Sospel\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MC\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"96000\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"mc\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"0.000000\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"0.000000\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Monte-Carlo\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"Monaco\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-monaco-nathaniel-davis',NULL,'2018-09-25 05:09:22','2024-04-10 15:22:27'),
	('9bc65c52-b446-4da9-b436-cb3810456b14',2,2145,'WAH BASIC - Spring Lake, OH, US | Gary Borcherding',NULL,'weekly','101 Spring Avenue','NC',NULL,'Spring Lake','28390','US',-78.9746080,35.1679360,'North Carolina',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:27',0,'men','2019-02-23 15:22:27','2019-02-26 15:22:27',NULL,'',13549,223976,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3622\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"101 Spring Avenue\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Spring Lake\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"NC\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"28390\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"35.167936\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-78.974608\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"North Carolina\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-spring-lake-oh-us-gary-borcherding',NULL,'2019-02-19 07:02:49','2024-04-10 15:22:27'),
	('9bc65c52-d34d-4269-8b27-03c204e7f619',2,1925,'WAH BASIC - Xenia, OH, US | Rob Forino',NULL,'weekly','651 Hudson Taylor Dr','OH',NULL,'Xenia','45385','US',-83.9206200,39.6693990,'Ohio',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:27',0,'men','2019-02-21 15:22:27','2019-02-24 15:22:27',NULL,'Thank you for your interest in the Wild at Heart BASIC Men\'s Retreat! This event is hosted at the Athletes in Action Retreat Center in Xenia Ohio.  It\'s a beautiful sprawling campus with plenty of opportunity to enjoy historic architecture and beautiful grounds.  \r\n\r\nCost for the BASIC is $150 for ($170 if doing the optional ropes course).  Tuition includes all meals and lodging and video presentations / course materials.  \r\n\r\nBedding and towels are provided.  You\'ll have to bring your own toiletries etc.  The rooms are dorm style - 2 men to a room.  I\'d recommend bringing ear plugs for sleeping in case there are any folks who might snore/use CPAP etc..  Also, make sure to keep an eye on the weather forecast because there are some optional outdoor activities planned along with access to a bonfire pit each night so bring appropriate clothing for those activities.  That said, all of the Wild at Heart sessions take place indoors; casual / comfortable clothing is perfect all weekend.  Breakfast, Lunch, and Dinner are served, and dietary restrictions can be accommodated but I\'ll need to know in advance (i.e. Gluten allergy etc.).  You can let me know at the time of registration.  \r\n\r\nIf you are interested in signing up for this retreat, I must receive payment no later than 10 February.  There are enough spots for 10 guys in this retreat.  Once I know you are interested, I will send you an email to collect all of the required information and you can make your payment at that time.  Thanks guys and God bless!\r\n\r\n\r\nRob Forino',13489,401276,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3536\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"651 Hudson Taylor Dr\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Xenia\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"OH\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"45385\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"39.669399\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-83.920620\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Ohio\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-xenia-oh-us-rob-forino-2',NULL,'2019-02-04 08:02:31','2024-04-10 15:22:27'),
	('9bc65c52-f1e4-462a-aabf-da3458bcf3b7',2,580,'WAH BASIC - Peshastin, WA, US | Steve Waltar',NULL,'weekly','12355 Ingalls Creek Rd.','WA',NULL,'Peshastin','98847','US',-120.6665860,47.4644990,'Washington',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:27',0,'men','2019-02-21 15:22:27','2019-02-24 15:22:27',NULL,'This Basic is more of a TEST Basic to make sure the venue and leadership works well here.  My parents founded the Christian non-profit, 501(c)(3) over 25 years ago and now my Presbyterian Pastor brother, Doug Waltar, is director.  The retreat center is booked this weekend so we will stay either at Doug\'s house which is about a block from the retreat center or my parents home which is adjacent to the retreat center.  Both homes have capabilities to show the video series.',13526,105445,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3592\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"12355 Ingalls Creek Rd.\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"Ingalls Creek Enrichment Center\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Peshastin\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"WA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"98847\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"47.464499\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-120.666586\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Washington\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-peshastin-wa-us-steve-waltar',NULL,'2019-02-14 12:02:36','2024-04-10 15:22:27'),
	('9bc65c53-0fc8-4fe7-8134-9f43981ca64b',2,2086,'WAH BASIC - Marble Falls, TX, US | Joseph P Rollins',NULL,'weekly','6716 E FM 1431','TX',NULL,'Marble Falls','78654','US',-98.1794910,30.5899790,'Texas',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:27',0,'men','2019-02-21 15:22:27','2019-02-24 15:22:27',NULL,'Wild at Heart BASIC Boot Camp - February 21-24, 2019\r\nCamp Peniel, Marble Falls, Texas\r\n\r\n________________________________________\r\nAll the information you need prior to arrival at this event is included below.   If any changes are made, they will be posted here.  \r\n\r\nThis page was last updated January 13, 2019.\r\n\r\n________________________________________\r\nEvent Description\r\n\r\nWild at Heart Boot Camp is not just another men\'s retreat. That\'s the last thing any man needs. The reason most messages for men ultimately fail is simple:  they ignore what is deep and true to a man\'s heart and try to shape him up through pressure and various forms of compliance. \r\n\r\nNot this. This weekend is an honest, no bs trek into the deep passions and desires of a man\'s heart, into the healing of the wounds he\'s taken in this battle, into the realm of fatherhood and sex and God and calling – life as it was meant to be lived. Through the sessions, the times of quiet reflection, the movies, the adventures and the downtime, you will discover something profound about the heart of God and the heart he gave you as a man. Those who come say it is one of the greatest weekends of their entire life.\r\n\r\n________________________________________\r\nAudience\r\n\r\nDue to the intimate and personal nature of the content, the Wild at Heart BASIC Boot Camp cannot be viewed as a father/son event.  We strongly encourage fathers and sons to attend, but they will need to participate in different Boot Camps, at least for each of their first experiences of this Boot Camp.  \r\n\r\nDue to the nature and depth of the content and the experience, Wild at Heart BASIC Boot Camp is not designed for youth.  You must be at least eighteen years of age to attend.\r\n\r\n________________________________________\r\nTuition\r\n\r\nTuition for this event is $200.  It covers the costs of lodging, meals, video teaching and event supplies.  It does not include transportation to and from the event.\r\n\r\nUse this form to register for this Wild at Heart BASIC Boot Camp:\r\nhttp://heartsupport.com/wildatheart\r\n\r\nAnswer the questions on the registration form then follow the link on the form to pay for the event.  The https://www.paypal.me/tjbushnell link is under the question Have you paid for the retreat?\r\n\r\nThere are three payment options.\r\n\r\n- Pay the full amount of $200 which includes the $100 non-refundable deposit.\r\n- Pay the non-refundable deposit of $100, then pay the remaining amount of $100 by January 31, 2019.\r\n - Register without paying to temporarily hold your place for the event. Payment in full is due by January 31, 2019.\r\n\r\nYou can also use the https://www.paypal.me/tjbushnell link to make incremental and final payments totaling the $200 tuition.\r\n\r\nYou will receive confirmation emails when you register and when your payments are received.\r\n\r\n________________________________________\r\nWhen\r\n\r\nCheck-In:  4:30-5:30 pm, Thursday, February 21, 2019\r\n\r\nCheck-Out:  12:00 noon, Sunday, February 24, 2019\r\n\r\n________________________________________\r\nWhere\r\n\r\nCamp Peniel, Marble Falls, Texas  78654\r\n\r\nPlease do not contact the camp prior to the event.  If you have a pressing question that must be answered, see the e-mail addresses under the Emergencies &amp; Cancellations section at the bottom of this page. \r\n\r\nArea Map and Directions\r\nA map to Camp Peniel is available via this link:  https://www.camppeniel.org/contact\r\n\r\n________________________________________\r\nTravel and Transportation\r\n\r\nYou are responsible for your own transportation to and from Camp Peniel. \r\n\r\nA map to Camp Peniel is available via this link:  https://www.camppeniel.org/contact\r\n\r\nAustin Bergstrom Airport (AUS) is the closest major airline hub about 60 miles from Camp Peniel.  A map showing routes to/from Camp Peniel and Austin Bergstrom is available via this link:  https://goo.gl/maps/aTVgaBwJr1J2\r\n\r\nTravel time between Camp Peniel and Austin Bergstrom Airport is about 1 hour 15 minutes via US 71, depending on traffic.\r\n\r\n________________________________________\r\nGeneral Information\r\n\r\n•	Your registration fee covers your lodging, meals and all the teaching and materials by Wild at Heart for the duration of the weekend. It does not include travel arrangements to and from Camp Peniel. Optional recreational activities will be offered, weather permitting, for an additional charge. Details will be provided at the Boot Camp.\r\n\r\n•	Wild at Heart BASIC is a Wild at Heart Boot Camp led by John Eldredge and his team through video sessions.\r\n\r\n•	Cabins at Camp Peniel are equipped with bunk beds and are temperature controlled.\r\n\r\n•	Attendees must provide their own bedding, towels and shower supplies.\r\n\r\n•	Phones, laptops, notebooks and cameras ARE NOT PERMITTED during the sessions.  Our desire is to minimize all distractions during the sessions.\r\n\r\n________________________________________\r\nEmergency Contact Information\r\n\r\nPlease note: Cell phone access and internet access will not be available during Boot Camp. Phone access at Boot Camp will be for emergencies only. Please provide your family with the emergency phone numbers below and let them know you will be unavailable until 12:00 noon Sunday after the close of the Boot Camp.\r\n\r\n     Tim Bushnell\r\n     512.277.4872\r\n\r\n     or \r\n\r\n     Joseph Rollins\r\n     512.560.3603\r\n\r\nOnly use the Camp Peniel phone number if you are unable to reach the numbers above -  830.693.2182.\r\n\r\n________________________________________\r\nSpecial Needs\r\n\r\nIf you have special needs, please email tjb5146@gmail.com or jprollins48@gmail.com no later than Thursday, February 14.  Please note that special needs refer to medical conditions and medically restricted diets.  We are unable to accommodate special preferences.\r\n\r\n________________________________________\r\nSchedule\r\n\r\nCheck-in will occur between 4:30 pm and 5:30 pm on Thursday, February 21, followed by dinner and the evening session. \r\n\r\nYou DO NOT want to miss Thursday\'s evening session as it sets the pace for the entire experience. \r\n\r\nBoot Camp will conclude at 12:00 noon on Sunday.\r\n\r\n________________________________________\r\nWeather Conditions and Attire\r\n\r\nCamp Peniel (Marble Falls, TX) weather is available via this link:  \r\n\r\n    https://weather.com/weather/today/l/USTX0829:1:US\r\n\r\nBoot Camp attire is comfortable casual. Bring clothing layers, a warm sweater or sweatshirt, a waterproof jacket, hat and hiking boots or comfortable shoes. Dress comfortably and prepare for a wide range of weather.  \r\n\r\nWalking is required between the cabins, auditorium and dining hall.\r\n\r\nIf you are interested, Camp Peniel is a great launching point for hiking, fishing, zip line, etc. (depending on weather).  If you are interested in adventuring, make sure to bring appropriate layered clothes.  We will provide all the information you need when you arrive.\r\n\r\nAlthough recreation will be available, much of the time will be devoted to personal reflection on what God is revealing throughout the weekend.  \r\n\r\n________________________________________\r\nLate Arrival\r\n\r\nInformation to follow …\r\n\r\n________________________________________\r\nEmergencies and Cancellations\r\n\r\nIf you have a CANCELLATION or an EMERGENCY, please contact us at \r\n\r\n     Tim Bushnell\r\n     512.277.4872\r\n\r\n     or \r\n\r\n     Joseph Rollins\r\n     512.560.3603\r\n \r\n________________________________________\r\nCancellation Policies: \r\n\r\nCancellation by Registrant \r\nYou may cancel your registration until January 31, 2019 and forfeit your $100 non-refundable deposit. If you cancel your registration after January 31, 2019, you will forfeit the entire $200 registration fee. Regardless of when you cancel your registration, your registration is not transferable to another event, date, or person.\r\n\r\nCancellation by Isaiah 61 Search, Rescue and Restoration Team \r\nIf the event is made impossible by any act of God, war, earthquake, fire, strike, sickness, accident, epidemic, act of government, its agencies or officers, or any other legitimate cause beyond our control, we will cancel the event and will refund your full Wild at Heart Basic event registration fee to you.\r\n\r\n________________________________________\r\nPeniel: \r\n\r\nPeniel (the face of God) is mentioned in Jacob\'s story of wrestling with God until daybreak:\r\n\r\nJacob Wrestles\r\nSo Jacob was left alone, and a Man [came and] wrestled with him until daybreak. When the Man saw that He had not prevailed against Jacob, He touched his hip joint; and Jacob’s hip was dislocated as he wrestled with Him. Then He said, “Let Me go, for day is breaking.” But Jacob said, “I will not let You go unless You declare a blessing on me.” So He asked him, “What is your name?” And he said, “Jacob.” And He said, “Your name shall no longer be Jacob, but Israel; for you have struggled with God and with men and have prevailed.” Then Jacob asked Him, “Please tell me Your name.” But He said, “Why is it that you ask My name?” And He declared a blessing [of the covenant promises] on Jacob there. So Jacob named the place Peniel (the face of God), saying, “For I have seen God face to face, yet my life has not been snatched away.”  Genesis 32:24-30 Amplified Bible (AMP)\r\n\r\n\r\nWelcome to the weekend!',13241,231706,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3239\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"6716 E FM 1431\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Marble Falls\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"TX\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"78654\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"30.589979\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-98.179491\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Texas\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-marble-falls-tx-us-joseph-p-rollins',NULL,'2018-11-08 02:11:03','2024-04-10 15:22:27'),
	('9bc65c53-2dbd-4c7c-b356-ab7bdab241d2',2,394,'WAH BASIC - Oxford, MS, US | Daniel Lenard',NULL,'weekly','614 Grove Forest Wa','MS',NULL,'Oxford','38655','US',-89.6118610,34.3519760,'Mississippi',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:27',0,'men','2019-02-21 15:22:27','2019-02-24 15:22:27',NULL,'',13305,383510,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3318\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"614 Grove Forest Wa\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Oxford\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MS\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"38655\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"34.351976\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-89.611861\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Mississippi\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-oxford-ms-us-daniel-lenard-0',NULL,'2018-12-09 04:12:52','2024-04-10 15:22:27'),
	('9bc65c53-4d7d-47d3-acee-2f142d7ccac8',2,2146,'WAH BASIC - Wadi Rum, AQ, JO | Curtis Tyler',NULL,'weekly','','AQ',NULL,'Wadi Rum','','JO',35.4210370,29.5742990,'Al \'Aqabah',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:27',0,'men','2019-02-21 15:22:27','2019-02-24 15:22:27',NULL,'The event will take place in a bedouin camp in Wadi Rum, Jordan (https://vimeo.com/209106056).\r\n\r\nCost:  Cost for the camp site is JD 60 per night (USD 85) and includes lodging and meals\r\nTransportation:  Cost for transportation from/to the airport (Queen Alia International) and to Wadi Rum village varies.  We will try to arrange transportation for you if possible.\r\n\r\nWe will start on the 21st around 6:00 pm and wrap up around 12:00 pm on the 24th.  It takes at least 3 hours to travel from the airport to Wadi Rum village, so please plan your arrival and departure times accordingly if you\'re coming from outside of Jordan.\r\n\r\nThe event is limited to 20 participants, with priority going to men living in the Middle East.\r\n\r\nBring warm clothes, sleeping bag, hiking shoes, etc.  Tent accommodations are available, or you can pitch your own tent.\r\n\r\nOptional activities may include hiking, climbing and rappelling.\r\n\r\nContact Curt Tyler if you have any questions.',13217,411528,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3206\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Wadi Rum\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"AQ\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"jo\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"29.574299\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"35.421037\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Al \'Aqabah\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"Jordan\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-wadi-rum-aq-jo-curtis-tyler',NULL,'2018-11-03 07:11:07','2024-04-10 15:22:27'),
	('9bc65c53-6d29-44eb-bf36-ae34e9b471d2',2,2147,'WAH BASIC - Lake Santeetlah, NC, US | Rob Swartwood',NULL,'weekly','','NC',NULL,'Lake Santeetlah','','US',-83.8663280,35.3636110,'North Carolina',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:27',0,'men','2019-02-07 15:22:27','2019-02-10 15:22:27',NULL,'',13226,276990,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3218\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Lake Santeetlah\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"NC\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"35.363611\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-83.866328\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"North Carolina\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-lake-santeetlah-nc-us-rob-swartwood',NULL,'2018-11-05 01:11:39','2024-04-10 15:22:28'),
