	('9bc65c53-add8-428c-bb37-8a734b3ef68e',2,2148,'WAH BASIC - Sisters, OR, US | Steven Harpham',NULL,'weekly','500 Hwy 20','OR',NULL,'Sisters','97759','US',-121.5597920,44.2973330,'Oregon',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:28',0,'men','2019-02-07 15:22:28','2019-02-10 15:22:28',NULL,'It will be cold on the foothills of the Cascades.  \r\nBring clothes for outdoor adventure in the cold and snow.\r\nSwimsuit for the hot tub.',13303,377329,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3315\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"500 Hwy 20\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Sisters\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"OR\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"97759\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"44.297333\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-121.559792\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Oregon\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-sisters-or-us-steven-harpham-0',NULL,'2018-12-09 08:12:27','2024-04-10 15:22:28'),
	('9bc65c53-cc0b-44c5-baa3-6ec066415155',2,2149,'WAH BASIC - Bentonville , VA, US | Tom Edwards',NULL,'weekly','350 Daughter of Stars Dr.','VA',NULL,'Bentonville ','22610','US',-78.3073310,38.8490870,'Virginia',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:28',0,'men','2019-01-31 15:22:28','2019-02-03 15:22:28',NULL,'Boots and warm clothes',13301,412166,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3312\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"350 Daughter of Stars Dr.\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"Shenandoah River State Park\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Bentonville \\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"VA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"22610\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"38.849087\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-78.307331\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Virginia\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-bentonville-va-us-tom-edwards',NULL,'2018-12-06 05:12:12','2024-04-10 15:22:28'),
	('9bc65c53-e9ff-4893-8811-f18080d5699f',2,2037,'WAH BASIC - Coolville, OH, US | Rick Hastings',NULL,'weekly','25977 e. Hornsby Road','OH',NULL,'Coolville','45723','US',-81.8073690,39.1833500,'Ohio',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:28',0,'men','2019-01-24 15:22:28','2019-01-27 15:22:28',NULL,'This is a winter camp experience. Bring warm clothes, boots, socks, and sleeping bag. We will be in canvas wall tents with wood stoves and will be outside for the entire 4 days.',13340,408947,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3358\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"25977 e. Hornsby Road\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Coolville\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"OH\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"45723\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"39.183350\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-81.807369\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Ohio\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-coolville-oh-us-rick-hastings',NULL,'2018-12-15 08:12:29','2024-04-10 15:22:28'),
	('9bc65c54-0958-4baf-a8bb-7a26640c4509',2,1968,'WAH BASIC - West Columbia, SC, US | Roger Spires',NULL,'weekly','183 West Berry Road','SC',NULL,'West Columbia','29172','US',-81.1221380,33.9187300,'South Carolina',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:28',0,'men','2019-01-24 15:22:28','2019-01-27 15:22:28',NULL,'',13404,405199,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3424\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"183 West Berry Road\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"183 West Berry Road\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"West Columbia\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"SC\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"29172\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"33.918730\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-81.122138\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"South Carolina\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-west-columbia-sc-us-roger-spires-0',NULL,'2019-01-08 02:01:11','2024-04-10 15:22:28'),
	('9bc65c54-2730-4eda-b73f-a4430ccb37bb',2,1610,'WAH BASIC - Spring City, PA, US | Larry Si',NULL,'weekly','68 Bertolet School Road','PA',NULL,'Spring City','19475','US',-75.6518800,40.1584000,'Pennsylvania',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:28',0,'men','2019-01-24 15:22:28','2019-01-27 15:22:28',NULL,'Bring hiking boots and campfire clothes. It\'s winter time. So, for your bunk, bring sleeping bag or linens &amp; sheets, pillow, towel, blanket and toiletries. Don\'t forget your Bible and pen. Check-in is on Thursday between 5 pm and 6 pm. We will conclude around 12 noon on Sunday.\r\n\r\nClick on link to register -\r\nhttps://www.eventbrite.com/e/wild-at-heart-basic-philadelphia-tickets-49762017534?aff=es2',11615,17968,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"2918\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"68 Bertolet School Road\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Spring City\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"PA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"19475\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"40.158400\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-75.651880\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Pennsylvania\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-spring-city-pa-us-larry-si',NULL,'2018-08-31 08:08:43','2024-04-10 15:22:28'),
	('9bc65c54-4546-414f-bf71-d8e4690e39ba',2,2150,'WAH BASIC - Rock Hill, SC, US | Chris Bragg',NULL,'weekly','2659 Catawba Church Rd','SC',NULL,'Rock Hill','29730','US',-80.9640880,34.9061440,'South Carolina',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:28',0,'men','2019-01-24 15:22:28','2019-01-27 15:22:28',NULL,'Get to know more about the Wild at Heart message in a retreat format for men.  You will definitely be engaged and maybe so much more.    You will be on your own for meals and accommodations, but there are great restaurants and hotels in our area.   There is no charge for the event but you will need to register.    Starting January 24, sessions will occur Thursday evening, Friday evening, all day Saturday, and finish up Sunday morning by 10:30a.',11678,117892,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"2987\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"2659 Catawba Church Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Rock Hill\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"SC\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"29730\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"34.906144\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-80.964088\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"South Carolina\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-rock-hill-sc-us-chris-bragg',NULL,'2018-09-18 08:09:16','2024-04-10 15:22:28'),
	('9bc65c54-6380-4f5e-b0af-8478dde94d3d',2,2151,'WAH BASIC - Port Angeles, WA, US | Scott Highsmith',NULL,'weekly','3432 O Brien Road','WA',NULL,'Port Angeles','98362','US',-123.3078270,48.0527220,'Washington',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:28',0,'men','2019-01-23 15:22:28','2019-01-26 15:22:28',NULL,'Gentlemen:\r\n\r\nIm excited for us to dive deep into the heart of our masculine journey together. We owe this experience not only \r\nto ourselves and our own relationship with God but to the people around us as well. Our wives, our children, our friends, our families, co workers, people who look up to us, and the rest of society deserves to have our truest version of ourselves fighting for and alongside them. \r\n\r\nWe will be digging in together in a gorgeous log cabin in the Olympic mountains over by Port Angeles for 4 days (Wednesday, January 23rd  through  Sunday January 27th) where we will return home late afternoon to evening . There will be a hot tub and 20 acres of beautiful property to explore as well as an optional hike on the last day up to Hurricane Ridge and Klahane Ridge. \r\n\r\nBreakfast lunch and dinner will be provided as well as a steak dinner on our last evening together.\r\n\r\nI ask that you pay $100 to help offset the cost of travel, food, and the cabin rental space. \r\nAs there are not enough beds you will be sleeping in your sleeping bag on the floor, just like me. One bed is reserved for our chef, and there will be three others available for those who can bring a donation of 150. If you cannot afford $100 contact me and we can set up a sponsor program available for anybody willing to pay the way of another. I would rather that all go than anyone be left behind.\r\n\r\nIf you wish to attend, in preparation of our time together, I ask that you: \r\n\r\n1.) You purchase the book Wild at Heart by John Eldredge and read the whole book by the 23rd.\r\n2.) Pray each day leading to the event asking the Lord to soften your heart and to show you the areas in your life He wants you to release to Him.\r\n\r\nPlease contact me for additional questions!\r\n\r\nDO BRING\r\nSwim Shorts\r\nHiking Boots\r\nSnow Shoes\r\nCold Weather Clothes\r\nNotebook\r\nJournal\r\nPens \r\nBible\r\nWater Bottle\r\nHiking Clothes\r\nFavorite Snack \r\nSleeping Bag\r\nPillow\r\nWild At Heart Book\r\nYour Full Attention\r\nAn Open Mind and An Open Heart\r\n\r\nDO NOT BRING\r\nHeadphones\r\nTablets \r\nLaptops\r\nOr your Xbox\r\n\r\nAlso seriously consider bringing ear plugs and a sleeping mask for your eyes if noise and light bother you while dudes are taking turns showering and getting ready for bed each night. \r\n\r\nThere is a limited number of spots available, roughly 12,  so please let me know. First come first serve, if we go over we will pray about who will go.',13282,385200,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3291\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"3432 O Brien Road\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Port Angeles\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"WA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"98362\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"48.052722\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-123.307827\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Washington\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-port-angeles-wa-us-scott-highsmith',NULL,'2018-11-27 11:11:08','2024-04-10 15:22:28'),
