	('9bc65c56-7139-40c0-8897-f6f6aeccbec2',2,2083,'WAH BASIC - Rockbridge, OH, US | Tevis Austin',NULL,'weekly','20584 Buena Vista Road','OH',NULL,'Rockbridge','43149','US',-82.6459330,39.5529510,'Ohio',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:29',0,'men','2018-11-15 15:22:29','2018-11-18 15:22:29',NULL,'Wild at Heart Basic Boot Camp\r\nThursday, Nov 15 (6:00 pm) to Sunday, Nov 18 (12:30 pm)\r\nEagles Wings Lodge\r\n20584 Buena Vista Rd\r\nRockbridge, OH 43149\r\n\r\nStarts: Thursday, November 15\r\n(registration begins at 5pm and dinner is at 6pm)\r\n\r\nEnds: Sunday, November 18 (lunch at noon)\r\n\r\nLocation: Hocking Hills (directions given after you register)\r\n\r\nCost: $250 (if registered by October 14)\r\n- limited to 30 participants\r\n- includes food and lodging\r\n- bring $20 if you wish to participate in the shooting adventure)\r\n\r\n$275 after Oct. 14\r\n\r\nScholarships are available.  Contact Tevis Austin (tevisa@springhillschurch.org) or Jeff Houghton at (jeffh@springhillschurch.org)\r\n\r\nWe apologize but our registration has now reached capacity.  Register below to be added to our waiting list.  We will contact you when a cancelation occurs and we will inform you of the dates for our next Wild at Heart Basic. \r\n\r\nREGISTER HERE to be on our waiting list:   https://tinyurl.com/WildatHeartBasic-WaitingList',11608,249640,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"2906\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"20584 Buena Vista Road\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Rockbridge\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"OH\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"43149\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"39.552951\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-82.645933\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Ohio\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-rockbridge-oh-us-tevis-austin',NULL,'2018-08-29 07:08:38','2024-04-10 15:22:29'),
