	('9bc65c56-af8f-4a30-922d-d72400a4a3d8',2,2148,'WAH BASIC - Sisters, OR, US | Steven Harpham',NULL,'weekly','500 Hwy 20','OR',NULL,'Sisters','97759','US',-121.5597920,44.2973330,'Oregon',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:30',0,'men','2018-11-08 15:22:30','2018-11-11 15:22:30',NULL,'Possible activities:\r\nHiking; Mountain Bikes; ATVs; Target Practice; Campfire\r\n\r\nDefinite activities:\r\nFinding your place in the larger story!\r\nStepping into a new adventure with God!\r\nFinding brothers in Christ to share the adventure.\r\nExperiencing the beauty of God and His creation in Central Oregon.',11802,377329,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3103\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"500 Hwy 20\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"Ponderosa Lodge (Best Western) on the edge of the Sisters Wilderness outside of Bend, Oregon\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Sisters\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"OR\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"97759\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"44.297333\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-121.559792\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Oregon\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-sisters-or-us-steven-harpham',NULL,'2018-10-11 02:10:42','2024-04-10 15:22:30'),
	('9bc65c56-ce7f-402a-85e2-edde63f3e0e4',2,2042,'WAH BASIC - Hocking Hills, OH, US | Greg Adams',NULL,'weekly','','OH',NULL,'Hocking Hills','','US',-82.4070990,39.5400670,'Ohio',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:30',0,'men','2018-11-08 15:22:30','2018-11-11 15:22:30',NULL,'All men die, but few men really live! Battle, adventure and rescue are what make men come alive!  God calls us to more than just salvation - but also to freedom, to life, to sonship.  Join us at the spectacular Eagle Wings Lodge November 8-11, 2018 for a Boot Camp based on the book Wild At Heart. During the 4 days set in the majestic rolling landscape of Hocking Hills, you will participate in a multi-media experience and live presentations which will help you discover something profound about your own heart and the heart of God.\r\n\r\nThis isn’t your typical retreat.  You will not be asked to break into small groups and share your feelings.  Instead you will hear from other men living an intentional life in pursuit of the heart of God.  Bring your fishing gear for the stocked pond, your hiking boots for the trails, and your guns or bows for target shooting.\r\n\r\nIf you register by 10/8/18 the cost is $265.  After 10/8 the cost is $295.  Previous attendees have indicated that this weekend has been a transformational experience in their walk with God – don’t miss out.\r\n\r\nTo register, watch a video, download a brochure and get more information go to www.ualc.org/men\r\n\r\nYou may also email  bootcamp@ualc.org',11571,181564,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"2855\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"Eagle Wings Lodge\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Hocking Hills\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"OH\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"39.540067\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-82.407099\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Ohio\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-hocking-hills-oh-us-greg-adams',NULL,'2018-08-20 01:08:47','2024-04-10 15:22:30'),
	('9bc65c56-ee77-4c3b-a350-846d8f2ef1c3',2,2161,'WAH BASIC - Tellico Plains, TN, US | Jackie Mathis',NULL,'weekly','549 Shaw Mountain Rd.','TN',NULL,'Tellico Plains','37385','US',-84.1800670,35.3647650,'Tennessee',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:30',0,'men','2018-11-08 15:22:30','2018-11-11 15:22:30',NULL,'Attendees should bring clothes and shoes to possibly hike in.  It is also possible that there will be a campfire one or more nights depending on the weather.  Regular attire will be relaxed and comfortable.  We will be staying in a cabin hear the Cherohala Skyway.  Possible activities include driving on the Cherohala Skyway, hiking, walking around Tellico Plains, visiting a local fish hatchery, and any other relaxing thing we can think of.',11784,19658,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3082\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"549 Shaw Mountain Rd.\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Tellico Plains\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"TN\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"37385\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"35.364765\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-84.180067\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Tennessee\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-tellico-plains-tn-us-jackie-mathis',NULL,'2018-10-08 12:10:26','2024-04-10 15:22:30'),
	('9bc65c57-0b78-4ac5-bed4-ff929a1819c7',2,41,'WAH BASIC - EAST EARL, PA, US | John Martin',NULL,'weekly','16 Granite Dr','PA',NULL,'EAST EARL','17519','US',-76.0442170,40.1192750,'Pennsylvania',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:30',0,'men','2018-11-08 15:22:30','2018-11-11 15:22:30',NULL,'',11525,384438,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"2787\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"16 Granite Dr\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"EAST EARL\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"PA\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"17519\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"40.119275\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-76.044217\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Pennsylvania\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-east-earl-pa-us-john-martin',NULL,'2018-07-27 07:07:41','2024-04-10 15:22:30'),
	('9bc65c57-28f3-40c8-a1f4-93bc1833c78d',2,572,'WAH BASIC - Maineville, OH, US | Dwight Perry',NULL,'weekly','1179 Broadleaf Court','OH',NULL,'Maineville','45039','US',-84.2419770,39.3076930,'Ohio',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:30',0,'men','2018-11-08 15:22:30','2018-11-11 15:22:30',NULL,'This event will be held in the \"Man Cave\" at Dwight\'s residence, where our weekly Band of Brothers meet.  All meals will be home cooked and men will bunk 2-4 per room on comfortable, self inflating twin beds.  We will have fires in the Fire Pit in the evenings.  We have space for a maximum of 15 men.  \r\n\r\n  We are 5-15 minutes from four beautiful parks with walking trails.  5 minutes from the Little Miami Scenic Trail.  5 minutes from The Little Miami River.  And, 10 minutes from Historic Downtown Loveland.  There will be ample opportunuties to check these out during the free times if you wish to do so.  \r\n\r\n  Check in will be Thursday 6 P.M. and the weekend will run through Sunday at 12 noon.  12-1 P.M. Lunch will be served.  1-3 P.M. additional ministry will be available.\r\n\r\n  Tuition is $125 for the entire weekend and that includes all meals, snacks and lodging for the weekend (Breakfast, Lunch &amp; Dinner on Friday &amp; Saturday and Breakfast &amp; Lunch Sunday).  Please let us know if you have any special food requirements when you register so that we may accomodate you.\r\n\r\nAttendees should bring:\r\n\r\nSleeping bag or twin sheets and blankets.\r\nPillow.\r\nToiletries.\r\nTowel.\r\nClothing for inside and walking outside.\r\nFire Pit clothes.\r\nCigars for the fire pit.\r\nPersonal journal if you do so.\r\n\r\nCall or email Dwight for more info and to sign up!     513-505-3964',11598,100033,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"2885\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"1179 Broadleaf Court\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Maineville\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"OH\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"45039\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"39.307693\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-84.241977\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Ohio\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-maineville-oh-us-dwight-perry',NULL,'2018-08-24 05:08:06','2024-04-10 15:22:30'),
	('9bc65c57-46c2-4483-bec7-1ede4454a793',2,572,'WAH BASIC - Maineville, OH, US | Dwight Perry',NULL,'weekly','1179 Broadleaf Court','OH',NULL,'Maineville','45039','US',-84.2419770,39.3076930,'Ohio',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:30',0,'men','2018-11-08 15:22:30','2018-11-11 15:22:30',NULL,'For More Information and to Register Please Contact\r\nDwight Perry\r\n513-505-3964\r\nemailfordwight@gmail.com\r\nhttp://WakingtheHeart.org (Coming Soon)\r\nAdditional Information for this BASIC\r\nThis event will be held in the \"Man Cave\" at Dwight\'s residence, where our weekly Band of Brothers meet. All meals will be home cooked and men will bunk 2-4 per room on comfortable, self inflating twin beds. We will have fires in the Fire Pit in the evenings. We have space for a maximum of 15 men. \r\nWe are 5-15 minutes from four beautiful parks with walking trails. 5 minutes from the Little Miami Scenic Trail. 5 minutes from The Little Miami River. And, 10 minutes from Historic Downtown Loveland. There will be ample opportunuties to check these out during the free times if you wish to do so. \r\nCheck in will be Thursday at 6 P.M. and the weekend will run through Sunday at 12 noon. 12-1 P.M. Lunch will be served. 1-3 P.M. additional ministry will be available.\r\nTuition is $125 for the entire weekend and that includes all meals, snacks and lodging for the weekend (Breakfast, Lunch &amp; Dinner on Friday &amp; Saturday and Breakfast &amp; Lunch Sunday). Please let us know if you have any special food requirements when you register so that we may accomodate you.\r\nAttendees should bring:\r\nSleeping bag or twin sheets and blankets.\r\nPillow.\r\nToiletries.\r\nTowel.\r\nClothing for inside and walking outside.\r\nFire Pit clothes.\r\nCigars for the fire pit.\r\nPersonal journal if you do so.\r\nCall or email Dwight for more info and to sign up!',11798,100033,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"3097\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"1179 Broadleaf Court\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Maineville\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"OH\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"45039\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"39.307693\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-84.241977\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Ohio\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-maineville-oh-us-dwight-perry-0',NULL,'2018-10-10 12:10:42','2024-04-10 15:22:30'),
