	('9bc65c57-a0e1-4880-b90b-bc1645f02507',2,1925,'WAH BASIC - Xenia, OH, US | Rob Forino',NULL,'weekly','651 Taylor Dr','OH',NULL,'Xenia','45385','US',-83.9211550,39.6689570,'Ohio',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:30',0,'men','2018-11-01 15:22:30','2018-11-04 15:22:30',NULL,'Men, This Wild at Heart Basic course will be held at the Xenia, OH campus of the Athletes in Action Retreat &amp; Conference Center. \r\n\r\nOptional activities nearby include a Ropes / Leadership Training Course (Saturday) and a Hike in the local area on Friday (exact location TBD).  There are also places nearby to walk, fish, or bike ride (rails-to-trails). I recommend you bring appropriate clothing for any of those activities if you desire to participate in them. We will have the option of having a bonfire each evening too (weather permitting). \r\n\r\nWeather in Xenia this time of year can vary so I recommend you bring appropriate clothing for the forecast but all of the course material will be presented indoors. \r\n\r\nWe will be staying in dormitory style halls with bunk beds.  There will be some built-in \"down time\" for reflection on Friday and Saturday during which you may choose to participate in the optional activities mentioned above. \r\n\r\nTuition is $150 for the entire weekend  (not including ropes course/team-building).  Base tuition includes all meals and lodging for the weekend (Dinner-Thursday, Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner-Friday &amp; Saturday, Breakfast-Sunday). \r\n\r\nThe event will end Sunday at noon. \"Scholarships\" are available to help offset cost if required. \r\n\r\nIf you want to participate in the Ropes Course/Team-building, the cost is an additional $30 and must be paid along with tuition. \r\n\r\nRight now, spots are limited to 10 men so please contact me to register NLT October 15th. If there is enough interest, I can expand the group size.  Dietary restrictions can be accommodated but we need to know ahead of time so please let me know if you have special meal requirements when you register. Thank you and I look forward to meeting you all!',11412,401276,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"2671\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"651 Taylor Dr\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Xenia\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"OH\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"45385\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"39.668957\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-83.921155\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Ohio\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-xenia-oh-us-rob-forino-1',NULL,'2018-06-12 03:06:25','2024-04-10 15:22:30'),
	('9bc65c57-bfb4-4e61-8c55-cd407e95eed8',2,79,'WAH BASIC - Within 2 hours of the Twin Cities, MN, US | Joseph Godfrey',NULL,'weekly','105 Linden Ave.','MN',NULL,'Alexandria','56308','US',-95.3329130,45.8866640,'Minnesota',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:30',0,'men','2018-11-01 15:22:30','2018-11-04 15:22:30',NULL,'Our boot camp will be at the Sugar Bush Lodge (www.sugarbushlodge.com). The group will be capped at around 22 guys and the cost will be $250. We will begin at 6:30 on 11/1. In order to sign up go to:\r\n\r\nwww.rivervalley.org\r\n\r\nClick Next Steps &gt; Groups &gt; Join a Lifegroup\r\n\r\nSelect Shakopee campus, type: Men, then select Battle for the Heart. \r\n\r\nSigning up this way makes it easier for me to send out communications and collect the basic information from everyone. Once you sign up I’ll send an email with payment details and info on car pooling. Hope you can make it!',11444,218397,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"2692\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"105 Linden Ave.\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Alexandria\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MN\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"56308\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"45.886664\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-95.332913\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Minnesota\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-within-2-hours-twin-cities-mn-us-joseph-godfrey',NULL,'2018-06-27 12:06:44','2024-04-10 15:22:30'),
