	('9bc65c57-fb3a-4288-b799-71cdfdc37770',2,2059,'WAH BASIC - Ocklawaha, FL, US | Brandon Wolf',NULL,'weekly','18115 SE 95th street','FL',NULL,'Ocklawaha','32179','US',-81.8530120,29.0826980,'Florida',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:30',0,'men','2018-10-25 15:22:30','2018-10-28 15:22:30',NULL,'Bring trunks \r\nCarpool options available',11200,281746,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"2546\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"18115 SE 95th street\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Ocklawaha\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"FL\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"32179\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"29.082698\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-81.853012\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Florida\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-ocklawaha-fl-us-brandon-wolf',NULL,'2018-03-31 07:03:25','2024-04-10 15:22:30'),
	('9bc65c58-197c-4be3-8c24-c9a50d09af2d',2,1525,'WAH BASIC - Clinton, MO, US | Mark Reiter',NULL,'weekly',' 351 NE 831st Rd','MO',NULL,'Clinton','64735','US',-93.6018360,38.4110840,'Missouri',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:31',0,'men','2018-10-25 15:22:31','2018-10-28 15:22:31',NULL,'Twice a year, E6 Ministries organizes a Wild Heart Boot Camp, featuring the video teachings of Wild at Heart Ministries. Our Fall 2018 Basic Wild Heart Boot Camp will begin Thursday, October 25, 2018, at 6:00 PM and conclude on Sunday, October 28, 2018, at 12:00pm. \r\n\r\nBecause limited space is available, we ask that you prayerfully consider your application prior to submitting and commit and agree to be present for the entire event.\r\n\r\nThe cost for this event is $180. It includes all on-site expenses (food, lodging and materials) but does NOT include transportation to and from the event.\r\n\r\nLimited partial scholarships are available. Application for a partial scholarship can be made on the Payment Selection page which will appear as you complete the registration process at https://e6ministries.org/bootcamp\r\n\r\nThe event will take place at LifeChange Camp &amp; Retreat Center, east of Clinton, Missouri.\r\n\r\nABOUT E6 MINISTRIES:  E6 MINISTRIES is a band of brothers forged from the stories of their lives, who have discovered and been delivered into a life of freedom and healing through the Wild At Heart message by John Eldredge and Wild at Heart Ministries. E6 MINISTRIES is a registered 501(c)(3) non-profit organization consisting of a team of men who range from 35 to 62 years of age and who come from all walks of life and experiences. The mission of E6 Ministries is to help men discover life, freedom, and healing in walking with God daily along the masculine journey.  The leaders of E6 Ministries are dedicated to help men move forward in their masculine journey as they traverse through the Christian life.',11550,260103,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"2817\\\",\\\"name\\\"