	('9bc65c59-fa9b-4618-93aa-bcc21a807425',2,2170,'WAH BASIC - Grand Haven, MI, US | Buz Mayo',NULL,'weekly','12253 Lakeshore Dr','MI',NULL,'Grand Haven','49417','US',-86.2200580,42.9898170,'Michigan',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:32',0,'men','2018-09-27 15:22:32','2018-09-30 15:22:32',NULL,'On the shores of Lake Michigan in late September, Christian Reformed Conference Grounds is a beautiful site to experience the Wild at Heart BASIC Retreat. It will be cool at night and (we hope) gorgeous during the day. There is plenty of room to find your slice of God\'s creation.\r\n\r\nClose proximity to Grand Rapids, Detroit, Chicago, Toronto, Indianapolis and even Pontiac, IL (that\'s for you, Kevin). \r\n\r\nBasketball, pickleball, hiking, volleyball and disc golf are some of the things you can do during your free time. \r\n\r\nWe have room for 25 men in 5 lake-worthy cottages along with a great space to take in all 11 sessions of the WAH BASIC. You will have ample time to process some of your deepest questions with God in this magnificent setting.',11516,29243,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"2774\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"12253 Lakeshore Dr\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"On the Shores of Lake Michigan\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Grand Haven\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MI\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"49417\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"42.989817\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-86.220058\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Michigan\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-grand-haven-mi-us-buz-mayo',NULL,'2018-07-24 05:07:41','2024-04-10 15:22:32'),
