	('9bc65c5a-7112-4b0b-800a-49a1bbb77ae2',2,2173,'WAH BASIC - Brashear, MO, US | Christopher Miller',NULL,'weekly','21614 Lost Branch Way','MO',NULL,'Brashear','63533','US',-92.4543160,40.1716850,'Missouri',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:32',0,'men','2018-09-06 15:22:32','2018-09-09 15:22:32',NULL,'The details of this event are still in planning but we will communicate with all registered attendees when we have them finalized.',11166,325304,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"2498\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"21614 Lost Branch Way\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Brashear\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"63533\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"40.171685\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-92.454316\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Missouri\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-brashear-mo-us-christopher-miller',NULL,'2018-03-16 07:03:20','2024-04-10 15:22:32'),
	('9bc65c5a-8e92-4857-9d82-aca6a026d5d2',2,1843,'WAH BASIC - Rock Island Lake, TX, US | Nick Brandt',NULL,'weekly','Private Lake House','TN',NULL,'Rock Island Lake','78723','US',-96.5739600,29.5309830,'Tennessee',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:32',0,'men','2018-09-06 15:22:32','2018-09-09 15:22:32',NULL,'Sending separate e-mail to the guys with this info. This event is private and closed.',11584,392955,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"2869\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"Private Lake House\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Rock Island Lake\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"TN\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"78723\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"29.530983\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-96.573960\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Tennessee\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-rock-island-lake-tx-us-nick-brandt',NULL,'2018-08-21 08:08:36','2024-04-10 15:22:32'),
	('9bc65c5a-ac20-4f43-b98b-609dff339837',2,1925,'WAH BASIC - Xenia, OH, US | Rob Forino',NULL,'weekly','651 Taylor Dr','OH',NULL,'Xenia','45385','US',-83.9211550,39.6689570,'Ohio',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:32',0,'men','2018-09-06 15:22:32','2018-09-09 15:22:32',NULL,'Men, This Wild at Heart Basic course will be held at the Xenia, OH campus of the Athletes in Action Retreat Center. \r\n\r\nOptional activities nearby include a Low Ropes course/Leadership Training Course (Saturday) and a Canoe/Kayak Trip on the Little Miami River (Friday). There are also places nearby to walk, hike, fish, or bike ride (rails-to-trails). I recommend you bring appropriate clothing for any of those activities if you desire to participate in them. We will have the option of having a bonfire each evening too. \r\n\r\nWeather in Xenia this time of year can vary so I recommend you bring appropriate clothing for the forecast but all of the course material will be presented indoors. \r\n\r\nWe will be staying in dormitory style halls with bunk beds.  There will be some built-in \"down time\" for reflection on Friday and Saturday during which you may choose to participate in the optional activities mentioned. \r\n\r\nTuition is $150 for the entire weekend and that includes all meals and lodging for the weekend (Dinner-Thursday, Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner-Friday &amp; Saturday, Breakfast-Sunday). \r\n\r\nThe event will end Sunday at noon. \"Scholarships\" are available to help offset cost if required. \r\n\r\nIf you want to participate in the Low Ropes Course/Leadership Training, the cost is $20 and must be paid along with tuition.  If you want to participate in the Canoe/Kayak trip (Friday) the cost is $29 for a single person kayak and $41 for a two man canoe. The outfitters do take credit/debit cards and river trip costs can be paid in person the day of. \r\n\r\nRight now, spots are limited to 10 men so please contact me to register NLT August 15th. If there is enough interest, I can expand the group size.  Dietary restrictions can be accommodated but we need to know ahead of time so please let me know if you have special meal requirements when you register. Thank you and I look forward to meeting you all!',11396,401276,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"2654\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"651 Taylor Dr\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Xenia\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"OH\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"45385\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"39.668957\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-83.921155\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Ohio\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-xenia-oh-us-rob-forino-0',NULL,'2018-05-29 04:05:50','2024-04-10 15:22:32'),
	('9bc65c5a-c99d-4ed1-9ec9-c4257efcd1bc',2,1513,'WAH BASIC - Kansas City, MO, US | David Sholar',NULL,'weekly','10919 Cypress Avenue','MO',NULL,'Kansas City','64137','US',-94.5375240,38.9273700,'Missouri',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:32',0,'men','2018-08-31 15:22:32','2018-09-03 15:22:32',NULL,'Bring Food for potluck meals for 3 and 1/2 days.  Bring comfortable clothing, sleeping bag or bed roll, notebook and bible.',11556,284576,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"2827\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"10919 Cypress Avenue\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Kansas City\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"64137\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"38.927370\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-94.537524\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Missouri\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-kansas-city-mo-us-david-sholar',NULL,'2018-08-16 12:08:58','2024-04-10 15:22:32'),
	('9bc65c5a-e841-480e-870c-9f3a22d939b2',2,635,'WAH BASIC - Lakewood, WI, US | Chad Hendricks',NULL,'weekly','18495 PEEK RD','WI',NULL,'Lakewood','54138','US',-88.3904800,45.3449970,'Wisconsin',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:32',0,'men','2018-08-16 15:22:32','2018-08-19 15:22:32',NULL,'Location:\r\n\r\nOur location is an old 80 acre family farm in Lakewood, WI. This land is surrounded by the Nicolet National Forest. We will be camping outside with no running water or electricity. It will be an amazing experience of unplugging from the modern world.\r\n\r\nAccommodations:\r\n\r\nBring your own tents, campers and gear. If you don\'t own any of these items, please let me know and we will try to find a way to provide what we can.\r\n\r\nRegistration Fee:\r\n\r\nThe fees for this event is to help pay for fresh water and the port o potty for the event.\r\n\r\nOther Activities:\r\n\r\nThere is free time each day. Currently, we will be offering map and compass (orienteering) training and archery training as added activities.\r\n\r\nFOOD:\r\n\r\nYou can bring your own food, but you can also purchase food with the group. If you bring food, plan on keeping preparation time to a minimum. (I recommend bringing some snacks and letting the food prep to the professionals.) Food orders will be collected before the event and payment can be made when you arrive.\r\n\r\nTotal Food Costs: $105.00',11403,411000,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"2662\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"18495 PEEK RD\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Lakewood\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"WI\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"54138\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"45.344997\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-88.390480\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Wisconsin\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-lakewood-wi-us-chad-hendricks',NULL,'2018-06-02 04:06:41','2024-04-10 15:22:32'),
	('9bc65c5b-05bb-4968-a4c8-121de8c5b1ee',2,2174,'WAH BASIC - Montello, WI, US | Matt Kamla',NULL,'weekly','N4855 County Road Y ','WI',NULL,'Montello','53949','US',-89.3286840,43.7790640,'Wisconsin',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:32',0,'men','2018-08-09 15:22:32','2018-08-12 15:22:32',NULL,'Our event is held in a Log Retreat Lodge a short walk from a Family Campground.  There will be free time both Friday and Saturday afternoon for Backwoods hiking trails, Fishing, Archery, Disc Golf, Canoeing, Climbing Wall, Horseback Riding, Swimming Pool, \r\n\r\nFee includes lodging, and meals.\r\nBring your own bedding.\r\n\r\nWe are limiting the retreat to 8 men, plus the facilitators, and are hoping to provide scholarships to a few high school students.\r\nThe expenses for the lodge and meals will be shared. Registration is $80.  If you need a discount type \"DISCOUNT\" for the promotion code to save $20.',11446,126535,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"2695\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"N4855 County Road Y \\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"Sky Lodge Christian Campground\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Montello\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"WI\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"53949\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"43.779064\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-89.328684\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Wisconsin\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-montello-wi-us-matt-kamla',NULL,'2018-06-27 01:06:28','2024-04-10 15:22:32'),
