	('9bc65c5d-dc54-41b6-bef9-4bc86775fc8f',2,1130,'WAH BASIC - Cape Fair, MO, US | Michael Hogan',NULL,'weekly','10620 West State Hwy 76','MO',NULL,'Cape Fair (Branson Area)','65624','US',-93.5389290,36.7353610,'Missouri',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:34',0,'men','2002-09-19 15:22:34','2002-09-22 15:22:34',NULL,'This camp, hosted by Freedom14 Ministries at F14 Ranch, 75 acres in the heart of the Ozarks near Table Rock Lake and Branson, Missouri. \r\n\r\nWHAT TO BRING:\r\n\r\nBedding is provided entirely. Bring personal toiletries and a shower towel. Bring comfortable clothes and some good shoes for walking along the wooded trails. \r\n\r\nWHAT ARE THE SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS?\r\n\r\nF14 Ranch has a beautiful log cabin lodge with two extra large rooms. Each room is equipped with one king size bed and 8 twins. Each room has a fully equipped bathroom with shower. We also have a shower room in the meeting hall if you so desire. Each bed is equipped with an electrical outlet and a personal reading light.',31852,117732,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"9583\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"10620 West State Hwy 76\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Cape Fair (Branson Area)\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"MO\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"65624\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"36.735361\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-93.538929\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Missouri\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/wah-basic-cape-fair-mo-us-michael-hogan',NULL,'2024-01-09 10:01:28','2024-04-10 15:22:34'),
