	('9bc65c5e-17dd-4035-866d-18ad5a56b6f7',7,1754,'BECOMING A KING - Sioux Falls, SD, US | Casey Buller',NULL,'weekly','3211 S Shirley Ave','SD',NULL,'Sioux Falls','57106','US',-96.7749080,43.5166440,'South Dakota',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:34',0,'men','2020-07-22 15:22:34',NULL,NULL,'This is a group of guys that realize we imperfect and need Jesus desperately. So if you come as you are, imperfections and all, you\'ll fit right in. We value being real through honest conversations. We don\'t have the Bible memorized and often have more questions than answers, but we know that we are better together. So come when you can and know that we are here for you as a support, no matter what you\'re going through. \r\n\r\nProverbs 27:17 - Iron sharpens iron, and one man sharpens another.',16672,428677,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"6409\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"3211 S Shirley Ave\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Sioux Falls\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"SD\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"57106\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"43.516644\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-96.774908\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"South Dakota\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/allies/becoming-king-group/becoming-king-sioux-falls-sd-us-casey-buller-0',NULL,'2021-10-04 03:10:58','2024-04-10 15:22:35'),
