	('9bc65c5f-a77e-47f2-af8a-6f30b60d891c',7,120,'BECOMING A KING - Kailua, HI, US | Kevin Smith',NULL,'weekly','1936 Lawrence Rd','HI',NULL,'Kailua','96734','US',-157.7376380,21.4490630,'Hawaii',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'2024-04-10 15:22:35',0,'men','2023-06-29 15:22:36',NULL,NULL,'-This is a closed group.  I have prayerfully walked with the Father and He has placed five other men on my heart to walk through this journey with.  We will be meeting at my house on Marine Corps Base Hawaii around a small camp fire.  \r\n-The plan is to meet 1-2 times a month for the next 5 months to give the men time to explore the continent in between sessions and provide flexibility due to short deployments and training. \r\n-The intent is to be kind to their schedules and their time with the their families. We will meet Thursday evenings from 6 to 7:30 pm HST for the weeks that we meet up. \r\n-Finally, this is a closed group but I would be so grateful for the prayers of the Wild at Heart team as we journey through these waters.  Most of the men are new to the Wild at Heart and Becoming Good Soil message.',31332,88458,'\"{\\\"lid\\\":\\\"8979\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"street\\\":\\\"1936 Lawrence Rd\\\",\\\"additional\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Kailua\\\",\\\"province\\\":\\\"HI\\\",\\\"postal_code\\\":\\\"96734\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"us\\\",\\\"latitude\\\":\\\"21.449063\\\",\\\"longitude\\\":\\\"-157.737638\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"is_primary\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"province_name\\\":\\\"Hawaii\\\",\\\"country_name\\\":\\\"United States\\\"}\"','/allies/becoming-king-group/becoming-king-kailua-hi-us-kevin-smith-0',NULL,'2023-06-29 10:06:52','2024-04-10 15:22:36'),
